#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:56
msgid "Double-entry bookkeeping"
msgstr "Partida doble"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:58
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically creates all the underlying journal entries for all "
"accounting transactions (e.g., customer invoices, vendor bills, point-of-"
"sales orders, expenses, inventory valuations, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Odoo crea todos los asientos correspondientes para todas las transacciones "
"contables (por ejemplo, facturas de clientes y proveedores, órdenes de punto "
"de venta, gastos, valuaciones de inventario, etc.) de forma automática."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:61
msgid ""
"Odoo uses the double-entry bookkeeping system, whereby every entry needs a "
"corresponding and opposite counterpart in a different account, with one "
"account debited and the other credited. It ensures that all transactions are "
"recorded accurately and consistently and that the accounts always balance."
msgstr ""
"Odoo usa el método de partida doble. En este método cada asiento debe tener "
"una contraparte en una cuenta diferente, en una cuenta se debita y la otra "
"se acredita. Esto garantiza que el registro de las transacciones sea "
"correcto y que las cuentas siempre estén balanceadas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:67
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:297
msgid ":doc:`Accounting Cheat Sheet <accounting/get_started/cheat_sheet>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Hoja de referencia de contabilidad <accounting/get_started/"
"cheat_sheet>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:72
msgid "Accrual and cash basis"
msgstr "Devengo y efectivo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:74
msgid ""
"Both accrual and cash basis accounting are supported in Odoo. This allows "
"reporting income and expense either when the transaction occurs (accrual "
"basis) or when the payment is made or received (cash basis)."
msgstr ""
"Odoo es compatible con los principios de devengo y efectivo de contabilidad. "
"Esto permite reportar ingresos y gastos cuando ocurre una transacción "
"(principio de devengo) o al recibir un pago (principio de efectivo)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:79
msgid ":doc:`Cash basis <accounting/taxes/cash_basis>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Principio de efectivo <accounting/taxes/cash_basis>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:84
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/kenya.rst:183
msgid "Multi-company"
msgstr "Multiempresa"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:86
msgid ""
":doc:`Multiple companies <../general/companies/multi_company>` can be "
"managed within the same database. Each company has its own :doc:`chart of "
"accounts <accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts>`, but :ref:`accounts can "
"be shared <consolidation_account_mapping>`, which is useful when viewing "
"consolidation reports. Users can view records and reports from multiple "
"companies simultaneously but can only work on a single company's accounting "
"at a time."
msgstr ""
"Puedes gestionar :doc:`varias empresas <../general/companies/multi_company>` "
"dentro de la misma base de datos. Cada empresa tiene su propio :doc:`plan de "
"cuentas <accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts>`, pero :ref:`pueden "
"compartir cuentas <consolidation_account_mapping>`, lo cual es muy útil al "
"visualizar los reportes de conciliación. Los usuarios pueden ver los "
"registros y reportes de varias empresas al mismo tiempo, pero solo pueden "
"trabajar en la contabilidad de una empresa a la vez."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:94
msgid ":doc:`Multi-company </applications/general/companies/multi_company>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Multiempresa </applications/general/companies/multi_company>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:95
msgid ""
":ref:`Inter-company transactions <general/multi-company/inter-company-"
"transactions>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Transacciones entre empresas <general/multi-company/inter-company-"
"transactions>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:100
msgid "Multi-currency environment"
msgstr "Entorno multimoneda"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:102
msgid ""
"A :doc:`multi-currency <accounting/get_started/multi_currency>` environment "
"with an automated exchange rate to ease international transactions is "
"available in Odoo. Every transaction is recorded in the company's default "
"currency; for transactions occurring in another currency, Odoo stores both "
"the value in the company's currency and the transactions' currency value. "
"Odoo generates currency gains and losses after reconciling the journal items."
msgstr ""
"En Odoo está disponible un entorno :doc:`multimoneda <accounting/get_started/"
"multi_currency>` con una tasa de cambio automática para facilitar las "
"transacciones internacionales. Cada transacción se registra de forma "
"automática en la moneda de la empresa. Para las transacciones que se "
"realizan en otra moneda, Odoo registrará el valor en la moneda que se usa en "
"la empresa y en la moneda en la que se realizó la transacción. Además, Odoo "
"genera las ganancias y pérdidas de la moneda después de conciliar los "
"apuntes contables."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:109
msgid ""
":doc:`Manage a bank in a foreign currency <accounting/bank/foreign_currency>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Gestionar un banco en una moneda extranjera <accounting/bank/"
"foreign_currency>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:114
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/egypt.rst:130
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:178
msgid "Branches"
msgstr "Sucursales"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:116
msgid ""
"Parent :doc:`companies </applications/general/companies>` and "
"their :ref:`branches <general/companies/branches>` can be managed within a "
"single database, operating under shared accounting and reporting rules, "
"including the following:"
msgstr ""
"Las :doc:`empresas </applications/general/companies>` matrices y "
"sus :ref:`sucursales <general/companies/branches>` se pueden gestionar "
"dentro una misma base de datos y pueden operar bajo las mismas reglas de "
"contabilidad y reportes, incluyendo:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:120
msgid ""
"The parent company’s :doc:`chart of accounts <accounting/get_started/"
"chart_of_accounts>`, :doc:`main currency <accounting/get_started/"
"multi_currency>`, and :doc:`taxes <accounting/taxes>` apply to all branches."
msgstr ""
"El :doc:`plan de cuentas <accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts>`, "
"la :doc:`moneda principal <accounting/get_started/multi_currency>` y "
"los :doc:`impuestos <accounting/taxes>` de la empresa matriz aplican a todas "
"las sucursales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:123
msgid "Branches can manage their own dedicated journals and related records."
msgstr ""
"Las sucursales pueden gestionar sus propios diarios y registros relacionados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:124
msgid ""
"The parent company manages a common :ref:`fiscal period <accounting/year-end/"
"fiscal-years>`, so its :ref:`lock and closing dates <accounting/year-end/"
"lock-everything-date>` apply across all branches. However, branches may set "
"earlier lock dates if needed."
msgstr ""
"La empresa matriz gestiona un mismo :ref:`periodo fiscal <accounting/year-"
"end/fiscal-years>`, por lo que sus :ref:`fechas de bloqueo y cierre "
"<accounting/year-end/lock-everything-date>` aplican a todas las sucursales. "
"Sin embargo, si es necesario, las sucursales pueden configurar fechas de "
"bloqueo anteriores."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:127
msgid ""
"The parent company can access all :doc:`reports <accounting/"
"reporting>`, :doc:`invoices <accounting/customer_invoices>`, :doc:`bills "
"<accounting/vendor_bills>`, etc., from its branches, while each branch can "
"only view its own data."
msgstr ""
"La empresa matriz puede acceder a todos los :doc:`reportes <accounting/"
"reporting>`, :doc:`facturas de clientes <accounting/"
"customer_invoices>`, :doc:`facturas de proveedores <accounting/"
"vendor_bills>`, etc. de sus sucursales, pero las sucursales solo pueden ver "
"su propios datos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:132
msgid ""
"The :doc:`Fiscal localization <fiscal_localizations>` package is set on the "
"parent company."
msgstr ""
"El paquete de :doc:`localización fiscal <fiscal_localizations>` se configura "
"en la empresa matriz."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:135
msgid ""
"Adding a branch to a company enables :doc:`multi-company functions <../"
"general/companies/multi_company>`."
msgstr ""
"Al agregar una sucursal a una empresa se activan las :doc:`funciones "
"multiempresa <../general/companies/multi_company>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:138
msgid ""
"For more information, refer to `Odoo's pricing page <https://www.odoo.com/"
"pricing-plan>`_ or contact your Odoo account manager."
msgstr ""
"Consulta la página de `precios de Odoo <https://www.odoo.com/pricing-plan>`_ "
"o contacta a tu gerente de cuenta para obtener más información."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:146
msgid ""
"The parent company consolidates accounting operations from all branches, "
"providing a centralized view of :doc:`financial reports <accounting/"
"reporting>`, such as profit and loss or balance sheets."
msgstr ""
"La empresa matriz consolida las operaciones de contabilidad de todas las "
"sucursales, lo cual te permite contar con una visualización centralizada de "
"los :doc:`reportes fiscales <accounting/reporting>`, como el estado de "
"resultados y el balance general."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:152
msgid "VAT"
msgstr "Número de identificación fiscal"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:154
msgid ""
"Each company and branch must be configured with its own legal information, "
"including a VAT number when applicable. Depending on the structure, branches "
"may share the parent company's VAT number or have their own, resulting in a "
"common or separate :doc:`VAT return <accounting/reporting/tax_returns>`."
msgstr ""
"Cada empresa y sucursal debe configurarse con su propia información legal, "
"incluyendo un número de identificación fiscal, cuando aplique. Dependiendo "
"de la estructura, es posible que las sucursales compartan el número de "
"identificación fiscal de la empresa o pueden tener el propio, lo cual "
"resultará en una :doc:`declaración fiscal <accounting/reporting/"
"tax_returns>` común o separada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:159
msgid ""
"This flexible setup allows users to generate individual reports and tax "
"returns for each entity if needed."
msgstr ""
"Esta configuración flexible permite que los usuarios generen reportes y "
"declaraciones fiscales individuales para cada entidad si es necesario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:165
msgid "International standards"
msgstr "Estándares internacionales"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:167
msgid ""
"Odoo Accounting supports over 100 countries and provides standardized "
"features and mechanisms applicable across all regions. Country-specific "
"modules are included to comply with local accounting "
"regulations. :doc:`Fiscal localizations <fiscal_localizations>` handle "
"regional requirements, such as charts of accounts, taxes, or any other legal "
"obligations."
msgstr ""
"Contabilidad de Odoo es compatible con más de 100 países y ofrece funciones "
"estandarizadas y mecanismos que se pueden aplicar en todas las regiones. Los "
"módulos específicos de cada país se incluyen para cumplir con las "
"regulaciones contables locales. Las :doc:`localizaciones fiscales "
"<fiscal_localizations>` gestionan requisitos regionales, como plan de "
"cuentas, impuestos o cualquier otra obligación legal."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:175
msgid "Accounts receivable and payable"
msgstr "Cuentas por cobrar y cuentas por pagar"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:177
msgid ""
"By default, one account is designated for accounts receivable entries and "
"another for accounts payable entries. As transactions are linked to "
"**contacts**, it is possible to run a report per customer, vendor, or "
"supplier."
msgstr ""
"De forma predeterminada, se designa una cuenta para los asientos de cuentas "
"por cobrar y otra para los asientos de cuentas por pagar. Como las "
"transacciones se vinculan a **contactos**, es posible ejecutar un reporte "
"por cliente, proveedor o distribuidor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:181
msgid ""
"The **Partner Ledger** report displays the balance of customers and "
"suppliers. To access it, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> "
"Partner Ledger`."
msgstr ""
"El **libro mayor de la empresa** muestra el balance de clientes y "
"proveedores. Para abrirlo, vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Reportes "
"--> Libro mayor de la empresa`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:189
msgid ""
"The following financial :doc:`reports <accounting/reporting>` are available "
"and updated in real-time:"
msgstr ""
