#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:256
msgid ""
"In the :ref:`Tax return <accounting/tax-returns/report>`, Odoo computes all "
"accounting transactions for the specific tax period and uses these totals to "
"calculate the tax obligation."
msgstr ""
"En la :ref:`declaración de impuestos <accounting/tax-returns/report>` Odoo "
"calcula todas las transacciones contables para un periodo fiscal específico "
"y usa estos totales para calcular la obligación de impuestos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:260
msgid ""
"Depending on the country's localization, an XML version of the tax report "
"can be generated to be uploaded to the VAT platform of the relevant taxation "
"authority."
msgstr ""
"Dependiendo del paquete de localización fiscal del país, puede generar una "
"versión XML del reporte fiscal para subirlo a la plataforma de impuestos de "
"la autoridad fiscal correspondiente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:266
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:5
msgid "Bank synchronization"
msgstr "Sincronización bancaria"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:268
msgid ""
"The bank synchronization system directly connects with banking institutions "
"to automatically import all transactions into the database. It gives an "
"overview of the cash flow without logging into an online banking system or "
"waiting for paper bank statements."
msgstr ""
"El sistema de sincronización bancaria se conecta directamente a las "
"instituciones bancarias para importar todas las transacciones de forma "
"automática directamente a tu base de datos. Podrás obtener un resumen de tu "
"flujo de efectivo sin tener que iniciar sesión en tu sistema de banca en "
"línea y sin tener que esperar a que te entreguen tus estados de cuenta "
"físicos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:273
msgid ":doc:`Bank synchronization <accounting/bank/bank_synchronization>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Sincronización bancaria <accounting/bank/bank_synchronization>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:278
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:3
msgid "Inventory valuation"
msgstr "Valuación de inventario"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:280
msgid ""
"Both periodic (manual) and perpetual (automated) inventory valuations are "
"supported in Odoo. The available methods are Standard Price, Average Cost "
"(AVCO), and First In First Out (FIFO)."
msgstr ""
"Odoo es compatible con la valuación de inventario periódica (manual) y "
"perpetua (automatizada). Los métodos disponibles son Precio estándar, Costo "
"promedio (AVCO, por sus siglas en inglés) y Primeras entradas, primeras "
"salidas (PEPS)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:284
msgid ""
":doc:`Inventory valuation <accounting/get_started/"
"inventory_valuation>` :doc:`../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Valuación de inventario <accounting/get_started/"
"inventory_valuation>` :doc:`../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:290
msgid "Retained earnings"
msgstr "Ganancias acumuladas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:292
msgid ""
"Retained earnings are the portion of income retained by a business. Odoo "
"calculates current year earnings in real-time, so no year-end journal or "
"rollover is required. The profit and loss balance is automatically reported "
"on the balance sheet report."
msgstr ""
"Las ganancias acumuladas son la porción de los ingresos que una empresa "
"retiene. Odoo calcula las ganancias del año en curso en tiempo real, así que "
"no se necesita un diario de fin de año ni renovación. El estado de "
"resultados se reporta de manera automática en el balance general."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:302
msgid "Fiduciaries"
msgstr "Empresas de contabilidad"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:304
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Accounting Firms` mode can be activated by going "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`. When enabled:"
msgstr ""
"El modo de :guilabel:`empresas de contabilidad` se puede activar "
"desde :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Ajustes`. Cuando lo "
"active:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:307
msgid "The document's sequence becomes editable on all documents;"
msgstr "Podrá editar la secuencia del documento en cada uno de ellos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:308
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Total (tax incl.)` field appears to speed up and control the "
"encoding by automating line creation with the right account and tax;"
msgstr ""
"Aparecerá un nuevo campo llamado :guilabel:`Total (impuestos incluidos)` con "
"el que será posible acelerar y controlar la codificación, ya que las líneas "
"se crearán de inmediato con la cuenta y el impuesto correctos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:310
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Invoice Date` and :guilabel:`Bill Date` are pre-filled when "
"encoding a transaction."
msgstr ""
"Al registrar una transacción, el campo :guilabel:`Fecha de la factura` se "
"llenará de manera predeterminada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:311
msgid ""
"A :guilabel:`Quick encoding` option is available for customer invoices and "
"vendor bills."
msgstr ""
"Tendrá la opción :guilabel:`Codificación rápida` disponible en sus facturas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:316
msgid "Share invoices with external accountants"
msgstr "Compartir facturas con contadores externos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:318
msgid ""
"Odoo offers multiple ways to share invoices and bills with an external "
"accountant, including the abilities to :ref:`grant access rights <accounting/"
"accountant-access-rights>` to your database, to :ref:`automatically send "
"copies of a journal's invoices or bills <accounting/send-copy>` to a "
"specified email address, and to :ref:`download ZIP files <accounting/zip>` "
"containing all invoices and all bills."
msgstr ""
"Odoo cuenta con varias formas de compartir facturas y cuentas con un "
"contador externo. Puedes :ref:`otorgar permisos de acceso <accounting/"
"accountant-access-rights>` a tu base de datos, :ref:`enviar copias de "
"facturas o cuentas de un diario de forma automática <accounting/send-copy>` "
"a una dirección de correo específica y :ref:`descargar archivos ZIP "
"<accounting/zip>` que incluyen todas las facturas de clientes y de "
"proveedores."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:327
msgid "Accountant access rights"
msgstr "Permisos de acceso de contador"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:329
msgid ""
"To grant access to the company's accountant, :ref:`add the accountant as a "
"new user <users/add-individual>` and configure the appropriate :doc:`access "
"rights <../general/users/access_rights>` in the :guilabel:`Accounting` "
"section to enable access to the company's financial data:"
msgstr ""
"Para otorgar acceso al contador de la empresa, :ref:`agrega al contador como "
"usuario nuevo <users/add-individual>` y configura los :doc:`permisos de "
"acceso <../general/users/access_rights>` apropiados en la "
"sección :guilabel:`Contabilidad` para permitir el acceso a los datos "
"fiscales de la empresa:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:334
msgid ":guilabel:`Accounting`: Select :guilabel:`Administrator`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Contabilidad`: Selecciona :guilabel:`Administrador`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:335
msgid ":guilabel:`Bank`: Allow bank account validation."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Banco`: Permite la validación de la cuenta bancaria."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:338
msgid ""
"Adding an accountant as a new user in :doc:`Odoo Online <../../"
"administration/odoo_online>` is free if the accountant has an Odoo account "
"registered with the same email address as the one listed for the company "
"user. However, :doc:`Odoo.sh <../../administration/odoo_sh>` and :doc:`Odoo "
"On-premise <../../administration/on_premise>` may involve extra charges for "
"each additional user. For more pricing information, see `Odoo's pricing "
"<https://www.odoo.com/pricing-plan>`_."
msgstr ""
"Agregar a un contador como nuevo usuario en :doc:`Odoo en línea <../../"
"administration/odoo_online>` es gratis si el contador tiene una cuenta de "
"Odoo registrada con el mismo correo electrónico que el usuario de la "
"empresa. Sin embargo, en :doc:`Odoo.sh <../../administration/odoo_sh>` "
"y :doc:`Odoo local <../../administration/on_premise>`, agregar usuarios "
"puede implicar cargos por cada usuario adicional. Para obtener más "
"información sobre esto, consulta `los precios de Odoo <https://www.odoo.com/"
"es/pricing-plan>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:345
msgid ""
"For a multi-company environment, set the appropriate :ref:`access <users/"
"multi-companies>`."
msgstr ""
"En un entorno multiempresa debes configurar los :ref:`permisos de acceso "
"<users/multi-companies>` apropiados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:350
msgid "Send copies of a journal's invoices or bills"
msgstr "Enviar copias de facturas de clientes o de proveedores de un diario"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:352
msgid ""
"Sales and purchase type journals can be used to send all of their invoices "
"and bills to external email addresses. These records are sent in XML format."
msgstr ""
"Los diarios de tipo ventas y compras te permiten enviar todas las facturas a "
"direcciones de correo externas. El sistema envía estos registros en formato "
"XML."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:355
msgid ""
"To configure a journal to automatically send its records to a specified "
"email address, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"Sigue estos pasos para configurar un diario que envíe los registros de forma "
"automática a una dirección de correo específica:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:358
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:230
msgid "Navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Journals`."
msgstr "Ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Diarios`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:359
msgid "Open the desired journal."
msgstr "Abre el diario que quieras."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:360
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Advanced Settings` tab, enter an email address in "
"the :guilabel:`Send Copy To` field."
msgstr ""
"Escribe una dirección de correo en el campo :guilabel:`Enviar copia a` de la "
"pestaña :guilabel:`Ajustes avanzados`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:364
msgid ""
"Multiple email addresses can be entered. Separate them with `;` without a "
"space (i.e.: `sample1@example.com;sample2@example.com`)."
msgstr ""
"Puedes ingresar varias direcciones de correo. Sepáralas con `;` sin espacio "
"(por ejemplo, `prueba1@ejemplo.com;prueba2@ejemplo.com`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:370
msgid "ZIP file export"
msgstr "Exportación de archivos ZIP"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:372
msgid ""
"Groups of invoices and bills can be exported in ZIP files. To export "
"invoices or bills in ZIP files, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"Puedes exportar grupos de facturas en archivos ZIP. Sigue estos pasos para "
"hacerlo:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:375
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Invoices` "
"or :menuselection:`Accounting --> Vendors --> Bills`."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Clientes --> Facturas` "
"o :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Proveedores --> Facturas`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:377
msgid "Select the invoices or bills to be included in the ZIP file."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona las facturas de clientes o de proveedores que incluirás en el "
"archivo ZIP."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:378
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-print` :guilabel:`Print` menu, and click :guilabel:`Export "
"ZIP`."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en el menú :icon:`fa-print` :guilabel:`Imprimir` y luego haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Exportar ZIP`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:380
msgid ""
"Once the ZIP file is exported, it can be sent to an external accountant to "
"provide them with all the information of your invoices and bills."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que exportes el archivo ZIP, puedes enviarlo a un contador externo "
"para proporcionarle toda la información de tus facturas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank.rst:7
msgid ""
"You can manage as many bank or cash accounts as needed on your database. "
"Configuring them correctly allows you to have all your banking data up-to-"
"date and ready for :doc:`reconciliation <bank/reconciliation>` with your "
"journal entries."
msgstr ""
"En su base de datos puede administrar todas las cuentas de banco o de "
"efectivo que necesite. Si las configura de la manera correcta, podrá tener "
"toda su información bancaria al día y lista para la :doc:`conciliación <bank/"
"reconciliation>` con sus asientos contables."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank.rst:11
msgid ""
"In Odoo Accounting, each bank account has a dedicated journal set to post "
"all entries in a dedicated account. Both the journal and the account are "
"automatically created and configured whenever you add a bank account."
msgstr ""
"En Contabilidad de Odoo cada cuenta bancaria tiene un diario exclusivo para "
"registrar todas las entradas en una cuenta específica. Tanto el diario como "
"la cuenta se crean y configuran de forma automática cuando se agrega una "
"cuenta bancaria."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank.rst:16
msgid ""
":ref:`Cash journals <accounting/journals/cash>` and accounts must be "
"configured manually."
msgstr ""
"Debes configurar los :ref:`diarios de efectivo <accounting/journals/cash>` y "
"las cuentas de forma manual."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank.rst:18
msgid ""
"Bank journals are displayed by default on the :guilabel:`Accounting "
"Dashboard` in the form of cards which include action buttons."
msgstr ""
"Los diarios de banco se muestran de manera predeterminada en forma de "
"tarjetas con botones de acción en el :guilabel:`tablero de Contabilidad`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank.rst:21
msgid ""
"Bank journals are displayed on the Accounting Dashboard and contain action "
"buttons"
msgstr ""
"Captura de pantalla en la que se muestra un diario de banco en el tablero de "
"Contabilidad con botones de acción."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank.rst:27
msgid "Manage bank and cash accounts"
msgstr "Gestionar cuentas de banco y efectivo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank.rst:30
msgid "Connect a bank for automatic synchronization"
msgstr "Conectar un banco para la sincronización automática"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank.rst:32
msgid ""
"To connect your bank account to your database, go to "
"the :guilabel:`Accounting Dashboard` and on the kanban card of an "
"unconnected bank, click :guilabel:`Search over 26000 banks`. Select your "
"bank from the list, click on :guilabel:`Connect`, and follow the "
"instructions."
msgstr ""
"Para conectar tu cuenta bancaria a tu base de datos, ve "
"al :guilabel:`tablero de Contabilidad` y, en la tarjeta de kanban de un "
"banco que no esté conectado, haz clic en :guilabel:`Buscar en más de 26,000 "
"bancos`. Selecciona tu banco de la lista, haz clic en :guilabel:`Conectar` y "
"sigue las instrucciones."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank.rst:37
msgid ":doc:`bank/bank_synchronization`"
msgstr ":doc:`bank/bank_synchronization`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank.rst:42
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/batch.rst:164
msgid "Create a bank account"
msgstr "Crear una cuenta de banco"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank.rst:44
msgid ""
"If your banking institution is not available in Odoo, or if you don't want "
"to connect your bank account to your database, you can configure your bank "
"account manually."
msgstr ""
"Si su institución bancaria no está disponible en Odoo, o si no desea "
"conectar su cuenta bancaria a su base de datos, puede configurar su cuenta "
"bancaria de forma manual."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank.rst:47
msgid ""
"To manually add a bank account, go to the :guilabel:`Accounting Dashboard` "
"and on the kanban card of an unconnected bank, click :guilabel:`Search over "
"26000 banks`. Then, click on :guilabel:`Record transactions manually` (at "
"the bottom right), fill out the bank information, and "
"click :guilabel:`Create`."
msgstr ""
"Para agregar una cuenta bancaria de forma, ve al :guilabel:`tablero de "
"Contabilidad` y, en la tarjeta de kanban de un banco que no esté conectado, "
"haz clic en :guilabel:`Buscar en más de 26,000 bancos`. Después, haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Registrar transacciones de forma manual` (abajo a la derecha), "
"completa la información del banco y haz clic en :guilabel:`Crear`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank.rst:53
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically detects the bank account type (e.g., IBAN) and enables "
"some features accordingly."
msgstr ""
"Odoo detecta en automático el tipo de cuenta bancaria (por ejemplo, IBAN) y, "
"por consiguiente, habilita algunas funciones."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank.rst:55
msgid ""
"A default :ref:`bank journal <accounting/journals/bank>` is available and "
"can be used to configure your bank account by going "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Accounting: Journals --> "
"Bank`. Open it and edit the different fields to match your bank account "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Odoo cuenta con un :ref:`diario bancario <accounting/journals/bank>` "
"predeterminado que puedes usar para configurar tu cuenta bancaria. Ve "
"a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Contabilidad: Diarios --"
"> Banco`, ábrelo y edita los campos para que coincidan con la información de "
"tu cuenta bancaria."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:7
msgid ""
"Odoo synchronizes directly with your bank institution to automatically "
"import all bank transactions into the database. It supports over 26,000 "
"financial institutions worldwide and relies on multiple :ref:`third-party "
"providers <accounting/bank-synchronization/third-party-providers>` to "
"connect with banks."
msgstr ""
"Odoo se sincroniza directo con tu institución bancaria para importar todas "
"las transacciones bancarias a la base de datos de forma automática. Es "
"compatible con más de 26,000 instituciones financieras a nivel mundial y usa "
"varios :ref:`proveedores externos <accounting/bank-synchronization/third-"
"party-providers>` para conectarse con los bancos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:13
msgid "To use this service, a valid Odoo Enterprise subscription is required."
msgstr ""
"Para usar este servicio necesitas contar con una suscripción válida a Odoo "
"Enterprise."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:16
msgid ""
"To check if your bank is compatible with Odoo, go to `Odoo Accounting "
"Features <https://www.odoo.com/app/accounting-features#part_5>`_, and "
"click :guilabel:`See list of supported institutions` in the :guilabel:`Bank "
"& Cash` section."
msgstr ""
"Para revisar si tu banco es compatible con Odoo, ve a las `funciones de "
"Contabilidad de Odoo <https://www.odoo.com/app/accounting-features#part_5>`_ "
"y haz clic en el enlace :guilabel:`Consulta la lista de instituciones "
"compatibles` ubicado en la sección :guilabel:`Banco y efectivo`."

