#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:183
msgid "Synchronization errors or disconnections"
msgstr "Errores de sincronización o desconexiones"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:185
msgid ""
"To report a connection error to `Odoo support <https://www.odoo.com/help>`_, "
"activate the :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Online Synchronization`, "
"select the failed connection, and copy the error description and the "
"reference."
msgstr ""
"Para reportar un error de conexión al `equipo de soporte de Odoo <https://"
"www.odoo.com/help>`_, activa el :ref:`modo de desarrollador <developer-"
"mode>`, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> "
"Sincronización en línea`, selecciona la conexión que falló y copia la "
"descripción del error con su referencia."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:190
msgid ""
"If the connection with the proxy is lost and reconnection using "
"the :guilabel:`Reconnect` option isn't successful, contact `support <https://"
"www.odoo.com/help>`_ directly. Provide the client ID or the error reference "
"from the chatter."
msgstr ""
"Comunícate con el `equipo de soporte <https://www.odoo.com/help>`_ si "
"pierdes la conexión con el proxy y no logras volver a conectarte con la "
"opción :guilabel:`Reconectar`. Menciona el ID del cliente o la referencia "
"del error que aparece en el chatter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:197
msgid "Why is the synchronization not working in real-time?"
msgstr "¿Por qué la sincronización no funciona en tiempo real?"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:199
msgid ""
"Synchronization is not designed to work in real time, as third-party "
"providers synchronize accounts at different intervals. To manually trigger "
"synchronization and retrieve bank transactions, go to "
"the :guilabel:`Accounting Dashboard`, and click :guilabel:`Fetch "
"Transactions`."
msgstr ""
"La sincronización no está diseñada para funcionar en tiempo real, ya que los "
"proveedores externos sincronizan las cuentas en distintos intervalos. Ve "
"al :guilabel:`tablero de Contabilidad` y haz clic en :guilabel:`Obtener "
"transacciones` para activar la sincronización y obtener las transacciones "
"bancarias de forma manual."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:203
msgid ""
"Alternatively, to synchronize and fetch transactions, activate "
"the :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>` and go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Online Synchronization`."
msgstr ""
"Como alternativa para sincronizar y obtener las transacciones, activa "
"el :ref:`modo de desarrollador <developer-mode>` y ve "
"a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Sincronización en "
"línea`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:207
msgid ""
"Some providers restrict refreshes to once per day. If transactions have "
"already been fetched, clicking :guilabel:`Fetch Transactions` again may not "
"retrieve the latest data."
msgstr ""
"Algunos proveedores limitan las actualizaciones a una vez al día. Si ya "
"obtuviste las transacciones, es posible que cuando vuelvas a hacer clic "
"en :guilabel:`Obtener transacciones` no recuperes los datos más recientes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:210
msgid ""
"Transactions may appear on a bank account, but cannot be fetched if they "
"have a :guilabel:`Pending` status; only transactions with "
"a :guilabel:`Posted` status are retrieved."
msgstr ""
"Las transacciones pueden aparecer en una cuenta bancaria, pero el sistema no "
"podrá obtenerlas si su estado es :guilabel:`Pendiente`, ya que solo puede "
"recuperarlas si su estado es :guilabel:`Registrado`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:216
msgid "Why do my transactions only synchronize when I refresh manually?"
msgstr ""
"¿Por qué mis transacciones solo se sincronizan cuando las actualizo de forma "
"manual?"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:218
msgid ""
"Some banks implement additional security measures and require extra steps, "
"such as an SMS or email authentication code, or another type of :abbr:`MFA "
"(multi-factor authentication)`. As a result, the third-party provider cannot "
"retrieve transactions until the security code is provided."
msgstr ""
"Algunos bancos aplican medidas de seguridad adicionales que requieren pasos "
"extra, como el envío de un código de autenticación por SMS o correo, u otro "
"tipo de :abbr:`MFA (autenticación multifactor)`. El proveedor externo no "
"podrá obtener las transacciones hasta que proporciones el código de "
"seguridad."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:225
msgid "Why are no transactions visible?"
msgstr "¿Por qué no hay ninguna transacción visible?"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:227
msgid "There are a few possible reasons for this issue:"
msgstr "Hay varios motivos por los que puede pasar esto:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:229
msgid ""
"No bank accounts were synchronized during the :ref:`first synchronization "
"<accounting/bank-synchronization/first-synchronization>`."
msgstr ""
"Ninguna cuenta bancaria se sincronizó durante la :ref:`primera "
"sincronización <accounting/bank-synchronization/first-synchronization>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:231
msgid "There may be no new transactions available to fetch."
msgstr "Es posible que no haya ninguna transacción nueva a obtener."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:233
msgid ""
"If the bank account is correctly linked to a journal, but posted "
"transactions still aren't visible in the database, contact `support <https://"
"www.odoo.com/help>`_."
msgstr ""
"Comunícate con el `equipo de soporte <https://www.odoo.com/help>`_ si las "
"transacciones registradas no aparecen en la base de datos aunque la cuenta "
"bancaria está vinculada de forma correcta a un diario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:239
msgid "Why are no accounts shown after synchronization?"
msgstr "¿Por qué no aparecen las cuentas después de la sincronización?"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:241
msgid ""
"During the synchronization process, a bank institution was selected, but no "
"bank accounts from this institution were authorized during the :ref:`first "
"synchronization <accounting/bank-synchronization/first-synchronization>`."
msgstr ""
"Seleccionaste una institución bancaria durante el proceso de sincronización, "
"pero no autorizaste ninguna de las cuentas bancarias de esa institución "
"durante la :ref:`primera sincronización <accounting/bank-synchronization/"
"first-synchronization>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:248
msgid "Saltedge troubleshooting"
msgstr "Solución de problemas de Salt Edge"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:253
msgid "Why is there an error when deleting a synchronization in Odoo?"
msgstr "¿Por qué aparece un error al eliminar una sincronización en Odoo?"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:255
msgid ""
"Odoo can't permanently delete the connection established with the banking "
"institution. However, it revokes consent, which prevents Odoo from accessing "
"the account. The error message indicates that the consent has been revoked, "
"but the record could not be deleted as it remains in Salt Edge."
msgstr ""
"Odoo no puede eliminar la conexión con la institución bancaria de forma "
"permanente, pero sí puede revocar el consentimiento, lo que impide que Odoo "
"acceda a la cuenta. El mensaje de error indica que el sistema revocó el "
"consentimiento, pero que no fue posible eliminar el registro porque sigue "
"disponible en Salt Edge."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:259
msgid ""
"To delete the connection, connect to the `Salt Edge account <https://"
"www.saltedge.com/dashboard>`_ and manually remove the synchronization. Once "
"this is done, the record can be deleted in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Para eliminar la conexión, ve a la `cuenta de Salt Edge <https://"
"www.saltedge.com/dashboard>`_ y elimina la sincronización de forma manual. "
"Después de esto podrás eliminar el registro en Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:265
msgid "I have an error saying that this account has already been synchronized"
msgstr "El error dice que esta cuenta ya está sincronizada"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:267
msgid ""
"The bank account has already been synchronized with Salt Edge. Access the "
"Salt Edge `dashboard <https://www.saltedge.com/dashboard>`_ to check if a "
"connection with the same credentials exists. There are two options:"
msgstr ""
"La cuenta bancaria ya está sincronizada con Salt Edge. Accede al `tablero "
"<https://www.saltedge.com/dashboard>`_ de Salt Edge para revisar si existe "
"una conexión con las mismas credenciales. Hay dos opciones:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:271
msgid ""
"If a connection with the same credentials exists in Salt Edge but has not "
"been synchronized with Odoo, delete the existing connection and create a new "
"one from the Odoo database."
msgstr ""
"Si ya existe una conexión con las mismas credenciales en Salt Edge pero no "
"se ha sincronizado con Odoo, elimina la conexión existente y crea una nueva "
"desde la base de datos de Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:273
msgid ""
"If a connection with the same credentials exists in Salt Edge and has "
"already been synchronized with Odoo, :ref:`update the synchronization "
"credentials <accounting/bank-synchronization/update-credentials>` to "
"reactivate the connection."
msgstr ""
"Si existe una conexión con las mismas credenciales en Salt Edge y ya está "
"sincronizada con Odoo, :ref:`actualiza las credenciales de la sincronización "
"<accounting/bank-synchronization/update-credentials>` para reactivar la "
"conexión."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:3
msgid "Basiq"
msgstr "Basiq"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:5
msgid ""
"`Basiq <https://www.basiq.io/home.html>`_ is a third-party service that "
"enables companies and professionals to connect multiple bank accounts to a "
"single platform. It provides a unified view of all transactions within a "
"single interface. When integrated with Odoo, it automatically synchronizes "
"bank transactions directly into its database."
msgstr ""
"`Basiq <https://www.basiq.io/home.html>`_ es un servicio de terceros que "
"permite a las empresas y profesionales conectar múltiples cuentas bancarias "
"a una única plataforma. Proporciona una vista unificada de todas las "
"transacciones dentro de una única interfaz. Cuando se integra con Odoo, "
"sincroniza automáticamente las transacciones bancarias directamente en su "
"base de datos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:11
msgid "Basiq bank synchronization is free for Odoo users."
msgstr ""
"La sincronización bancaria de Basiq es gratuita para los usuarios de Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:12
msgid "This service is currently only available in Australia."
msgstr "Este servicio está disponible actualmente solo en Australia."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:15
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/ponto.rst:14
msgid ":doc:`../bank_synchronization`"
msgstr ":doc:`../bank_synchronization`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:16
msgid ""
"`Financial institutions available on Basiq <https://www.basiq.io/resources/"
"supported-insitutions.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Instituciones financieras disponibles en Basiq <https://www.basiq.io/"
"resources/supported-insitutions.html>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:24
msgid "Basiq account"
msgstr "Cuenta de Basiq"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:26
msgid ""
"A Basiq account is not required to synchronize your bank accounts with Odoo. "
"Simply follow the connection :ref:`steps <bank-synchronization/basiq/odoo-"
"connection>` to start the synchronization."
msgstr ""
"No necesitas una cuenta de Basiq para sincronizar tus cuentas bancarias con "
"Odoo. Solo sigue los :ref:`pasos <bank-synchronization/basiq/odoo-"
"connection>` de conexión para iniciar la sincronización."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:32
msgid "Business banking data sharing"
msgstr "Compartir datos bancarios empresariales"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:34
msgid ""
"Under Australia's Consumer Data Right (CDR) regime, sharing business banking "
"data requires an explicit **opt-in**. You can ask your bank to enable this "
"opt-in, but the steps vary by bank. Refer to Basiq's `CDR documentation "
"<https://api.basiq.io/docs/connecting-business-accounts-via-cdr>`_ for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Según el régimen de Derecho a la Información del Consumidor (CDR) de "
"Australia, compartir los datos bancarios de una empresa requiere una "
"**autorización** explícita. Puedes pedirle a tu banco que active esta "
"autorización, pero los pasos cambian según cada banco. Consulta la "
"`documentación de CDR de Basiq <https://api.basiq.io/docs/connecting-"
"business-accounts-via-cdr>`_ para obtener más información."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:40
msgid ""
"To see how Odoo manages your financial data and how to access, update, or "
"delete it, read the `Odoo finance privacy policy page <https://"
"production.odoofin.com/privacy#basiq>`_."
msgstr ""
"Para ver cómo Odoo gestiona tus datos financieros y cómo acceder, actualizar "
"o eliminarlos, lee la `página de política de privacidad financiera de Odoo "
"<https://production.odoofin.com/privacy#basiq>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:44
msgid "`CDR compliance <https://api.basiq.io/docs/cdr-compliance>`_"
msgstr "`Cumplimiento de CDR <https://api.basiq.io/docs/cdr-compliance>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:49
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/ponto.rst:53
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:579
msgid "Connection with Odoo"
msgstr "Conexión con Odoo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:51
msgid ""
"When :ref:`connecting a bank to Odoo <accounting/bank-synchronization/first-"
"synchronization>` using Basiq as the third-party provider, follow these "
"steps:"
msgstr ""
"Al :ref:`conectar un banco a Odoo <accounting/bank-synchronization/first-"
"synchronization>` usando Basiq como proveedor externo, sigue estos pasos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:54
msgid ""
"When connecting to the desired bank, make sure Basiq is selected as the "
"third-party :guilabel:`Provider`."
msgstr ""
"Al conectarte al banco deseado, asegúrate de que Basiq esté seleccionado "
"como :guilabel:`Proveedor` externo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:56
msgid "Select the :guilabel:`Type of account` and click :guilabel:`Connect`."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona el :guilabel:`Tipo de cuenta` y haz clic en :guilabel:`Conectar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:57
msgid ""
"Fill out the additional information when prompted, and :guilabel:`Continue`."
msgstr ""
"Completa la información adicional cuando se te solicite y haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Continuar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:58
msgid ""
"Agree to share data by declaring that you are using this service for "
"business purposes, and then :guilabel:`Approve`."
msgstr ""
"Acepta compartir datos declarando que estás usando este servicio con fines "
"empresariales y luego haz clic en :guilabel:`Aprobar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:60
msgid ""
"In the pop-up window, log in to Basiq using your **Basiq credentials**. Upon "
"a successful connection, you will be redirected to the Odoo "
"Accounting :guilabel:`Dashboard`."
msgstr ""
"En la ventana emergente, inicia sesión en Basiq usando tus **credenciales de "
"Basiq**. Una vez que la conexión sea exitosa, serás redirigido "
"al :guilabel:`Tablero` de Contabilidad de Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:62
msgid ""
"Select the specific bank account to connect to, and click :guilabel:`Connect "
"Bank`."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona la cuenta bancaria específica que deseas conectar y haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Conectar banco`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:63
msgid ""
"Access your **Bank Reconciliation** dashboard by clicking your **Bank** "
"journal to verify if the synchronization was successful."
msgstr ""
"Accede a tu tablero de **Conciliación bancaria** haciendo clic en tu diario "
"**Banco** para verificar si la sincronización fue exitosa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:67
msgid ""
"Repeat the process for all banking institutions and accounts that need to be "
"synchronized with your database."
msgstr ""
"Repite el proceso para todas las instituciones bancarias y cuentas que "
"necesiten sincronizarse con tu base de datos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:71
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/ponto.rst:71
msgid ""
":ref:`Update synchronization credentials <accounting/bank-synchronization/"
