#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/ponto.rst:112
msgid ""
"Every six months (180 days), the connection between a bank account and Ponto "
"must be re-authorized via the `Ponto website <https://myponto.com>`_. "
"Failure to do so will result in synchronization stopping for those accounts."
msgstr ""
"Cada seis meses (180 días) debes volver a autorizar la conexión entre una "
"cuenta bancaria y Ponto en el `sitio web de Ponto <https://myponto.com>`_. "
"Si no lo haces, la sincronización de esas cuentas se detendrá."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/foreign_currency.rst:3
