"Para configurar una cuenta bancaria en moneda extranjera, primero :ref:`crea "
"un nuevo diario bancario <accounting/journals/bank>` mediante "
":menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Diarios`. Establece la "
"moneda del diario en la moneda extranjera y luego crea una nueva cuenta "
"bancaria:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/foreign_currency.rst:44
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Bank Account` field of the journal, enter the name as it "
"should appear in the chart of accounts."
msgstr ""
"En el campo :guilabel:`Cuenta bancaria` del diario, ingresa el nombre tal "
"como debe aparecer en el plan de cuentas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/foreign_currency.rst:46
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Create and edit`."
msgstr "Haz clic en :guilabel:`Crear y editar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/foreign_currency.rst:47
msgid ""
"In the resulting :guilabel:`Create Default Account` window, :ref:`configure "
"the account <chart-of-account/create>`."
msgstr ""
"En la ventana resultante :guilabel:`Crear cuenta predeterminada`, "
":ref:`configura la cuenta <chart-of-account/create>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/foreign_currency.rst:49
msgid ""
"Optionally, set the :guilabel:`Currency` on the bank account to the desired "
"foreign currency."
msgstr ""
"De forma opcional, establece la :guilabel:`Moneda` de la cuenta bancaria en "
"la moneda extranjera deseada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/foreign_currency.rst:51
msgid ""
"Setting a currency on an account in the chart of accounts restricts the "
"journal items targeting the account to the selected currency."
msgstr ""
"Configurar una moneda en una cuenta del plan de cuentas restringe los "
"apuntes contables dirigidos a esa cuenta a la moneda seleccionada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/foreign_currency.rst:53
msgid ""
"Leaving the :guilabel:`Currency` field blank on an account in the chart of "
"accounts allows journal items of any currency to target that account. In "
"this case, journal items in the foreign currency bank journal are limited to "
"the currency specified on the journal itself. To allow increased "
"flexibility, leaving the :guilabel:`Currency` field blank is recommended."
msgstr ""
"Dejar en blanco el campo :guilabel:`Moneda` en una cuenta del plan de "
"cuentas permite que los apuntes contables de cualquier moneda se dirijan a "
"esa cuenta. En este caso, los apuntes contables en el diario bancario en "
"moneda extranjera se limitan a la moneda especificada en el propio diario. "
"Para tener una mayor flexibilidad, se recomienda dejar el campo "
":guilabel:`Moneda` en blanco."

