msgstr "Conciliar transacciones"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:120
msgid ""
"When possible, Odoo automatically reconciles transactions based on their "
"fields."
msgstr ""
"Cuando es posible, Odoo concilia transacciones de forma automática según sus "
"campos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:122
msgid ""
"If no partner is set on the transaction, the transaction's :guilabel:`Label` "
"is compared with the :guilabel:`Number`, :guilabel:`Customer "
"Reference`, :guilabel:`Bill Reference`, and :guilabel:`Payment Reference` of "
