msgid ""
"If a preferred :guilabel:`Invoice sending` method was set in the contact "
"form, it is selected by default. Select another one if needed."
msgstr ""
"El método preferido de :guilabel:`envío de facturas` seleccionado en el "
"formulario de contacto se usará de forma predeterminada. Seleccione otro si "
"es necesario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:127
msgid ""
"If no preferred :guilabel:`Invoice sending` method was set in the contact "
"form, select the method to use for sending the invoice to the customer."
msgstr ""
"Si no seleccionó el método preferido de :guilabel:`envío de facturas` en el "
"formulario de contacto, seleccione el que usará para enviarle la factura al "
"cliente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:130
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Send` if the :guilabel:`by Email` option is selected, or "
"click :guilabel:`Download`."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Enviar` si seleccionaste la opción :guilabel:`Por "
"correo electrónico` o haz clic en :guilabel:`Descargar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:136
msgid "Sending multiple invoices"
msgstr "Enviar varias facturas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:138
msgid ""
"To send multiple invoices, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --"
"> Invoices`, select them in the :guilabel:`Invoices` list view and "
"click :guilabel:`Send`. The :guilabel:`Send` window displays the number of "
"selected invoice to send by email."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Clientes --> Facturas` para enviar e "
"imprimir varias facturas. Selecciónalas en la vista de lista "
"de :guilabel:`facturas` y haz clic en :guilabel:`Enviar`. La "
"ventana :guilabel:`Enviar` muestra el número de facturas seleccionadas para "
"enviarlas por correo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:142
msgid ""
"After clicking :guilabel:`Send`, a banner is added to the selected invoices "
"to indicate they are part of an ongoing send batch. This helps prevent the "
"process from being triggered manually again, as it may take some time to "
"complete for exceptionally large batches."
msgstr ""
"Después de hacer clic en :guilabel:`Enviar`, aparecerá un cuadro en las "
"facturas que hayas seleccionado para indicar que están dentro de un lote de "
"envío activo. Esto es útil para evitar que el proceso se vuelva a activar de "
"forma manual, ya que es posible que la acción tarde más tiempo en "
"completarse si los lotes son muy grandes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:146
msgid ""
"To check all invoices that have not yet been sent, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Invoices`. In "
"the :guilabel:`Invoices` list view, click into the search bar and filter "
"on :guilabel:`Not Sent`."
msgstr ""
"Vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Clientes --> Facturas` para revisar "
"todas las facturas pendientes de envío. En la vista de lista "
"de :guilabel:`facturas`, haga clic en la barra de búsqueda y use el "
"filtro :guilabel:`Sin enviar`."

