#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:165
msgid "Payment follow-up"
msgstr "Seguimiento de los pagos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:167
msgid ""
"Odoo's :doc:`follow-up actions <payments/follow_up>` help companies follow "
"up on customer invoices. Different actions can be set up to remind customers "
"to pay their outstanding invoices, depending on how much the customer is "
"overdue. These actions are bundled into follow-up levels that trigger when "
"an invoice is overdue by a certain number of days. If there are multiple "
"overdue invoices for the same customer, the actions are performed on the "
"most overdue invoice."
msgstr ""
"Las :doc:`acciones de seguimiento <payments/follow_up>` de Odoo ayudan a que "
"las empresas lleven seguimiento de las facturas. Es posible configurar "
"distintas acciones para recordarle a los clientes que paguen según el tiempo "
"que sus facturas lleven vencidas. Estas acciones se agrupan en niveles de "
"seguimiento que se activan cuando una factura está vencida por un número "
"determinado de días. Si el mismo cliente tiene varias de ellas, las acciones "
"se realizan sobre la que esté más atrasada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:181
msgid "Partner reports"
msgstr "Reportes del contacto"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:186
msgid "Partner Ledger"
msgstr "Libro mayor de la empresa"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:188
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Partner Ledger` report shows the balance of customers and "
"suppliers. To access it, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> "
"Partner Ledger`."
msgstr ""
"El reporte del :guilabel:`libro mayor de la empresa` muestra el balance de "
"sus clientes y proveedores. Para consultarlo, vaya "
"a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Reportes --> Libro mayor de la empresa`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:194
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:106
msgid "Aged Receivable"
msgstr "Cuentas por cobrar vencidas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:196
msgid ""
"To review outstanding customer invoices and their related due dates, use "
"the :ref:`Aged Receivable <accounting/reporting/aged-receivable>` report. To "
"access it, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Aged "
"Receivable`."
msgstr ""
"Use el reporte de :ref:`cuentas por cobrar vencidas <accounting/reporting/"
"aged-receivable>` para revisar las facturas pendientes de los clientes y sus "
"respectivas fechas de vencimiento. Para consultarlo, vaya "
"a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Reportes --> Cuentas por cobrar vencidas`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:203
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:114
msgid "Aged Payable"
msgstr "Cuentas por pagar vencidas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:205
msgid ""
"To review outstanding vendor bills and their related due dates, use "
"the :ref:`Aged Payable <accounting/reporting/aged-payable>` report. To "
"access it, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Aged Payable`."
msgstr ""
"Use el reporte de :ref:`cuentas por pagar vencidas <accounting/reporting/"
"aged-payable>` para revisar las facturas de proveedores pendientes y sus "
"respectivas fechas de vencimiento. Para consultarlo, vaya "
"a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Reportes --> Cuenta por pagar vencida`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:212
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:52
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1399
msgid "Profit and Loss"
msgstr "Estado de resultados"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:214
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Profit and Loss <accounting/reporting/profit-and-loss>` statement "
"shows details of income and expenses."
msgstr ""
"El :ref:`estado de resultados <accounting/reporting/profit-and-loss>` "
"muestra detalles de los ingresos y los gastos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:222
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Balance Sheet <accounting/reporting/balance-sheet>` summarizes the "
"company's assets, liabilities, and equity at a specific time."
msgstr ""
"El :ref:`balance general <accounting/reporting/balance-sheet>` resume los "
"activos, los pasivos y el capital de la empresa en una fecha determinada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:3
msgid "Cash discounts and tax reduction"
msgstr "Descuentos por pronto pago y reducción de impuestos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:5
msgid ""
"**Cash discounts** are reductions in the amount a customer must pay for "
"goods or services offered as an incentive for paying their invoice promptly. "
"These discounts are typically a percentage of the total invoice amount and "
"are applied if the customer pays within a specified time. Cash discounts can "
"help a company maintain a steady cash flow."
msgstr ""
"Los **descuentos por pronto pago** son reducciones al monto que un cliente "
"debe pagar por un bien o servicio. Por lo general, estos se ofrecen para "
"incentivar al cliente a pagar una factura de inmediato, suelen ser un "
"porcentaje del importe total de la factura y se aplican solo si el cliente "
"paga dentro de un plazo específico. Los descuentos por pronto pago ayudan a "
"que las empresas mantengan un flujo constante de efectivo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:11
msgid ""
"You issue a €100 invoice on the 1st of January. The full payment is due "
"within 30 days, and you also offer a 2% discount if your customer pays you "
"within seven days."
msgstr ""
"Crea una factura por $100 el primero de enero. Es necesario hacer el pago "
"completo dentro de los siguientes 30 días, pero ofrece un descuento del 2% "
"si el cliente paga dentro de los primeros 7 días."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:14
msgid ""
"The customer can pay €98 up to the 8th of January. After that date, they "
"would have to pay €100 by the 31st of January."
msgstr ""
"El cliente puede pagar $98 hasta el 8 de enero, pero después de esta fecha "
"tendrá que pagar $100 antes del 31 de enero."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:17
msgid ""
"A :ref:`tax reduction <cash-discounts/tax-reductions>` can also be applied "
"depending on the country or region."
msgstr ""
"También es posible aplicar una :ref:`reducción de impuestos <cash-discounts/"
"tax-reductions>` dependiendo del país o la región."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:21
msgid ":doc:`payment_terms`"
msgstr ":doc:`payment_terms`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:22
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/batch.rst:23
msgid ":doc:`../payments`"
msgstr ":doc:`../payments`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:29
msgid ""
"To grant cash discounts to customers, you must first verify the :ref:`gain "
"and loss accounts <cash-discounts/gain-loss-accounts>`. Then, "
"configure :ref:`payment terms <cash-discounts/payment-terms>` and add a cash "
"discount by checking the :guilabel:`Early Discount` checkbox and filling in "
"the discount percentage, discount days, and :ref:`tax reduction <cash-"
"discounts/tax-reductions>` fields."
msgstr ""
"Primero debe verificar las :ref:`cuentas de ganancia y de pérdida <cash-"
"discounts/gain-loss-accounts>` para poder otorgar descuentos por pronto pago "
"a los clientes. Después, configure los :ref:`términos de pago <cash-"
"discounts/payment-terms>` y agregue un descuento por pronto pago. Seleccione "
"la casilla :guilabel:`Descuento por anticipo` y complete los campos "
"porcentaje de descuento, días de descuento y :ref:`reducción de impuestos "
"<cash-discounts/tax-reductions>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:38
msgid "Cash discount gain/loss accounts"
msgstr "Cuentas de ganancias o pérdidas por descuentos por pronto pago"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:40
msgid ""
"With a cash discount, the amount you earn depends on whether the customer "
"benefits from the cash discount or not. This inevitably leads to gains and "
"losses, which are recorded on default accounts."
msgstr ""
"Con el descuento por pronto pago, la cantidad que gana depende de si el "
"cliente aprovecha el descuento o no. Esto siempre ocasiona pérdidas o "
"ganancias que estarán registradas en las cuentas predeterminadas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:43
msgid ""
"To modify these accounts, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration "
"--> Settings`, and, in the :guilabel:`Default Accounts` section, select the "
"accounts you want to use for the :guilabel:`Cash Discount Gain account` "
"and :guilabel:`Cash Discount Loss account`."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Ajustes` para "
"modificar estas cuentas. En la sección :guilabel:`Cuentas predeterminadas` "
"elija las cuentas que desea usar para la :guilabel:`cuenta de ganancia por "
"pronto pago` y la :guilabel:`cuenta de pérdida por pronto pago`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:50
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:194
msgid "Payment terms"
msgstr "Términos de pago"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:52
msgid ""
"Cash discounts are defined on :doc:`payment terms <payment_terms>`. "
"Configure them to your liking by going to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Payment Terms`, and make sure to fill out the discount "
"percentage, discount days, and :ref:`tax reduction <cash-discounts/tax-"
"reductions>` fields."
msgstr ""
"Defina los descuentos por pronto pago en los :doc:`términos de pago "
"<payment_terms>`. Para configurarlos de acuerdo a sus necesidades, vaya "
"a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Términos de pago` y "
"asegúrese de completar los campos de porcentaje de descuento, días de "
"descuento y :ref:`reducción de impuestos <cash-discounts/tax-reductions>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:57
msgid ""
"Configuration of payment terms named \"2/7 Net 30\". The field \"Description "
"on Invoices\"\n"
"reads: \"Payment terms: 30 Days, 2% Early Payment Discount under 7 days\"."
msgstr ""
"Captura de pantalla de la configuración de los términos de pago llamados "
"\"2/7 neto 30\". En el campo campo \"Descripción en las facturas\"\n"
"se puede leer: \"Términos de pago: 30 días, 2% de descuento por pago "
"anticipado antes de 7 días\"."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:64
msgid "Tax reductions"
msgstr "Reducción de impuestos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:66
msgid ""
"Depending on the country or region, the base amount used to compute the tax "
"can vary, which can lead to a **tax reduction**. Since tax reductions are "
"set on individual payment terms, each term can use a specific tax reduction."
msgstr ""
"El importe base que se utiliza para calcular el impuesto puede variar según "
"el país o región, así que esto puede ocasionar una **reducción de "
"impuestos**. Las reducciones de impuestos están configuradas en cada término "
"de pago, así que cada uno puede utilizar una reducción específica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:70
msgid ""
"To configure how the tax reduction is applied, go to a payment term with "
"the :guilabel:`Early Discount` checkbox enabled, and select one of the three "
"following options:"
msgstr ""
"Para configurar cómo se aplica la reducción de impuestos, vaya a un término "
"de pago que tenga la casilla :guilabel:`Descuento anticipado` seleccionada y "
"elija una de las tres opciones siguientes:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:73
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:94
msgid "Always (upon invoice)"
msgstr "Siempre (en la factura)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:74
msgid ""
"The tax is always reduced. The base amount used to compute the tax is the "
"discounted amount, whether the customer benefits from the discount or not."
msgstr ""
"El impuesto siempre se reduce. El importe base que se utiliza para calcular "
"el impuesto es el importe descontado, no importa si el cliente se beneficia "
"o no del descuento."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:77
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:109
msgid "On early payment"
msgstr "Con pago anticipado"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:78
msgid ""
"The tax is reduced only if the customer pays early. The base amount used to "
"compute the tax is the same as the sale: if the customer benefits from the "
"reduction, then the tax is reduced. This means that, depending on the "
"customer, the tax amount can vary after the invoice is issued."
msgstr ""
"El impuesto se reduce solo si el cliente paga antes. El importe base que se "
"utiliza para calcular el impuesto es el mismo que el de la venta: si el "
"cliente se beneficia de la reducción, entonces el impuesto se reduce. Esto "
"significa que, dependiendo del cliente, el importe del impuesto puede variar "
"después de la emisión de la factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:82
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:124
msgid "Never"
msgstr "Nunca"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:83
msgid ""
"The tax is never reduced. The base amount used to compute the tax is the "
"full amount, whether the customer benefits from the discount or not."
msgstr ""
"El impuesto no se reduce. El importe base que se utiliza para calcular el "
"impuesto es el monto total, no importa si el cliente se beneficia o no del "
"descuento."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:88
msgid ""
"You issue a €100 invoice (tax-excluded) on the 1st of January, with a 21% "
"tax rate. The full payment is due within 30 days, and you also offer a 2% "
"discount if your customer pays you within seven days."
msgstr ""
"Crea una factura por $100 (sin impuestos) el primero de enero con una tasa "
"impositiva del 21%. Es necesario hacer el pago completo dentro de los "
"siguientes 30 días, pero ofrece un descuento del 2% si el cliente paga "
"dentro de los primeros 7 días."

