msgstr "Código QR en una factura para el cliente"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/epc_qr_code.rst:61
msgid ""
"If you want to issue an invoice without an EPC QR code, remove the IBAN "
"indicated in the :guilabel:`Recipient Bank` field, under "
