"distintos. Ambos tendrán su propia fecha límite."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:3
msgid "Invoice sequence"
msgstr "Secuencia de facturación"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:5
msgid ""
"When confirming an invoice, Odoo generates a unique invoice reference "
"number. By default, it uses the sequence format `INV/year/incrementing-"
"number` (e.g., `INV/2025/00001`), which restarts from `00001` each year."
msgstr ""
"Al confirmar una factura Odoo genera un número de referencia único. Se "
"utiliza el formato de secuencia `FACT/año/número-incremental` (por ejemplo, "
"`INV/2025/00001`) de forma predeterminada, que cada año vuelve a comenzar "
"con `00001`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:9
msgid ""
"However, it is possible to :ref:`change the sequence format <accounting/"
"invoice/resequencing>` and its periodicity, and to :ref:`mass-resequence "
"invoices <accounting/invoice/mass-resequencing>`."
msgstr ""
"También puede :ref:`cambiar el formato de secuencia <accounting/invoice/"
"resequencing>` y su periodicidad, así como :ref:`resecuenciar facturas en "
"lote <accounting/invoice/mass-resequencing>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:13
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/sequence.rst:14
msgid "Changes made to reference numbers are logged in the chatter."
msgstr "El chatter registra los cambios que haga a los números de referencia."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:18
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/sequence.rst:19
msgid "Changing the default sequence"
msgstr "Cambiar la secuencia predeterminada"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:20
msgid ""
"To customize the default sequence, open the last confirmed invoice, "
"click :guilabel:`Reset to Draft`, and edit the invoice's reference number."
msgstr ""
"Para personalizar la secuencia predeterminada, abra la última factura "
"confirmada, haga clic en :guilabel:`Restablecer a borrador` y edite el "
"número de referencia de la factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:23
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:30
msgid "Editing the reference number of an invoice."
msgstr "Editar el número de referencia de una factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:26
msgid ""
"Odoo then explains how the detected format will be applied to all future "
"invoices. For example, if the current invoice's month is added, the "
"sequence's periodicity will change to every month instead of every year."
msgstr ""
"Odoo le mostrará un mensaje en el que explica cómo se aplicará el formato "
"detectado a las siguientes facturas. Por ejemplo, si agrega el mes de la "
"factura actual, la periodicidad de la secuencia cambiará a cada mes en lugar "
"de cada año."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:34
msgid ""
"The sequence format can be edited directly when creating the first invoice "
"of a given sequence period."
msgstr ""
"Puede editar el formato de secuencia al crear la primera factura de un "
"periodo de secuencia en específico."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:40
msgid "Mass-resequencing invoices"
msgstr "Resecuenciar facturas en lote"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:42
msgid ""
"It can be helpful to resequence multiple invoice numbers. For example, when "
"importing invoices from another invoicing or accounting system and the "
"reference originates from the previous software, continuity for the current "
"year must be maintained without restarting from the beginning."
msgstr ""
"Puede ser útil resecuenciar varios números de factura, por ejemplo, si al "
"importarlas de otro sistema de facturación o contabilidad su referencia "
"proviene del software anterior y es necesario mantener la continuidad para "
"el año en curso sin que el número inicie desde el principio."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:47
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/sequence.rst:48
msgid ""
"This feature is only available to users with administrator or advisor access."
msgstr ""
"Esta función solo está disponible para los usuarios con acceso de "
"administrador o asesor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:49
msgid "Follow these steps to resequence invoice numbers:"
msgstr "Siga estos pasos para resecuenciar el número de las facturas:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:51
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:104
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/sequence.rst:52
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:613
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:325
msgid "Activate the :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`."
msgstr "Active el :ref:`modo de desarrollador <developer-mode>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:52
msgid ""
"From the :guilabel:`Accounting Dashboard`, open the :guilabel:`Customer "
"Invoices` journal."
msgstr ""
"Abra el diario de :guilabel:`Facturas de cliente` del :guilabel:`tablero de "
"Contabilidad`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:53
msgid "Select the invoices that need a new sequence."
msgstr "Seleccione las facturas que necesitan una nueva secuencia."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:54
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/sequence.rst:54
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions` menu and "
"select :guilabel:`Resequence`."
msgstr ""
"Haga clic en el menú :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Acciones` y "
"seleccione :guilabel:`Resecuenciar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:55
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/sequence.rst:55
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Ordering` field, choose to"
msgstr "En el campo :guilabel:`Orden` elija entre las siguientes opciones:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:57
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/sequence.rst:57
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Keep current order`: The order of the numbers remains the same."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Mantener el orden actual`: El orden de los números permanece "
"igual."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:58
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/sequence.rst:58
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Reorder by accounting date`: The number is reordered by "
"accounting date."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Reordenar por fecha contable`: El número se reordena según la "
"fecha contable."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:60
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/sequence.rst:60
msgid "Set the :guilabel:`First New Sequence`."
msgstr "Establezca la :guilabel:`primera secuencia nueva`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:61
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/sequence.rst:61
msgid ":guilabel:`Preview Modifications` and click :guilabel:`Confirm`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Previsualice las modificaciones` y haga clic "
"en :guilabel:`Confirmar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:63
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/sequence.rst:63
msgid "Resequence options window"
msgstr "Ventana de opciones de resecuenciación."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:67
msgid ""
"To indicate where the sequence change began, the first invoice in the new "
"sequence is highlighted in red in the :guilabel:`Customer Invoices` list. "
"This visual marker is permanent and purely informational."
msgstr ""
"Para indicar dónde comenzó el cambio de secuencia, la primera factura en la "
"nueva secuencia se resaltará en rojo en la lista :guilabel:`Facturas de "
"clientes`. Este marcador visual es permanente y solo para información."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:70
msgid ""
"If there are any irregularities in the new sequence, such as gaps, "
"cancelled, or deleted entries within the open period, a :guilabel:`Gaps in "
"the sequence` message appears in the :guilabel:`Customer Invoices` journal "
"on the Accounting dashboard. To view more details about the related "
"invoice(s), click :guilabel:`Gaps in the sequence`. This visual marker is "
"temporary and will disappear once the entry's accounting date is on or after "
"the lock date."
msgstr ""
"Si hay irregularidades en la nueva secuencia, como espacios o asientos "
"cancelados o eliminados dentro del periodo abierto, en el tablero de "
"Contabilidad aparecerá el mensaje :guilabel:`Espacios en la secuencia` en el "
"diario :guilabel:`Facturas del cliente`. Para ver más detalles sobre la o "
"las facturas relacionadas, haga clic en :guilabel:`Espacios en la "
"secuencia`. Este marcador visual es temporal y desparecerá una vez que la "
"fecha contable del asiento sea igual o posterior a la fecha de bloqueo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:77
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/sequence.rst:77
msgid "Resequencing is not possible:"
msgstr "No es posible resecuenciar:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:79
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/sequence.rst:79
msgid "When entries are before a lock date."
msgstr "Cuando los asientos están antes de una fecha de bloqueo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:80
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/sequence.rst:80
msgid "When the sequence leads to a duplicate."
msgstr "Cuando la secuencia provoca a un duplicado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:81
msgid ""
"When the range is invalid. For example, if the :guilabel:`Invoice Date` "
"doesn't align with the date in the new sequence, such as using a 2024 "
"sequence (INV/2024/XXXXX) for an invoice dated in 2025."
msgstr ""
"Cuando el rango no es válido. Por ejemplo, si la :guilabel:`fecha de la "
"factura` no coincide con la fecha en la nueva secuencia; es decir, si se usa "
"una secuencia de 2024 (INV/2024/XXXXX) para una factura con fecha de 2025."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/sequence.rst:85
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/sequence.rst:85
msgid "In these cases, a :guilabel:`Validation Error` message appears."
msgstr ""
"En estos casos aparecerá un mensaje de :guilabel:`error de validación`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/snailmail.rst:5
msgid "Snailmail"
msgstr "Correo postal"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/snailmail.rst:7
msgid ""
"Sending direct mail can be an effective strategy for grabbing people's "
"attention, especially when their email inboxes are overflowing. With Odoo, "
"you have the ability to send invoices and follow-up reports through postal "
"mail worldwide, all from within your database."
msgstr ""
"Enviar correspondencia postal puede ser una estrategia eficaz para llamar la "
"atención de otras personas, sobre todo si suelen recibir muchos correos en "
"sus bandejas de entrada. Odoo le permite enviar facturas y reportes de "
"seguimiento a través de correo postal a todo el mundo, todo desde su base de "
"datos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/snailmail.rst:14
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings` and scroll "
"down to the :guilabel:`Customer Invoices` section to "
"activate :guilabel:`Snailmail`."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Ajustes` y dirígete "
"a la sección :guilabel:`Facturas de cliente` para activar la "
"función :guilabel:`Correo postal`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/snailmail.rst:18
msgid ""
"Set a preferred :ref:`invoice sending <accounting/invoice/sending>` method "
"in the :guilabel:`Accounting` tab of a contact to use it by default."
msgstr ""
"Define un método preferido de :ref:`envío de facturas <accounting/invoice/"
"sending>` en la pestaña :guilabel:`Contabilidad` de un contacto para usarlo "
"de forma predeterminada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/snailmail.rst:22
msgid "Sending invoices by post"
msgstr "Enviar facturas por correo postal"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/snailmail.rst:24
msgid ""
"In the invoice form view, ensure the :guilabel:`Customer` address is correct "
"and has the country set. Click :guilabel:`Send`, select :guilabel:`by Post`, "
"then :guilabel:`Send` the letter."
msgstr ""
"En la vista de formulario de la factura, asegúrate de que la dirección "
"del :guilabel:`cliente` sea correcta y tenga un país definido. Haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Enviar`, selecciona :guilabel:`por correo postal` y "
"luego :guilabel:`envía` la carta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/snailmail.rst:28
msgid "Documents sent via snailmail must respect the following rules:"
msgstr "Los documentos enviados por correo postal deben cumplir estas reglas:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/snailmail.rst:30
msgid "The paper format must be **A4**."
msgstr "El formato del papel debe ser **A4**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/snailmail.rst:31
msgid ""
"Margins must be at least **5 mm** on all sides. To configure margins, "
"activate the :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>` and go "
"to :menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> Paper Format`."
msgstr ""
"Los márgenes deben medir al menos **5 mm** en todos los lados. Para "
"configurar los márgenes, activa el :ref:`modo de desarrollador <developer-"
"mode>` y ve a :menuselection:`Ajustes --> Técnico --> Formato de papel`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/snailmail.rst:34
msgid ""
"A square of **15mm by 15mm** on the bottom left corner must remain clear."
msgstr ""
"En la esquina inferior izquierda debe quedar vacío un cuadrado de **15 mm "
"por 15 mm**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/snailmail.rst:35
msgid ""
"Odoo fills these areas with white before sending the letter; any overflowing "
"content will be cut."
msgstr ""
"Odoo completa estas áreas con blanco antes de enviar la carta y corta "
"cualquier contenido que salga del margen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/snailmail.rst:37
msgid ""
"The **postage area** must remain clear (download the :download:`snailmail "
"PDF template <snailmail/snailmail-template.pdf>` for details)."
msgstr ""
"El **área de franqueo** debe quedar libre. Descarga la :download:`plantilla "
"PDF de correo postal <snailmail/snailmail-template.pdf>` para consultar más "
"detalles."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/snailmail.rst:39
msgid ""
"Pingen (Odoo's snailmail service provider) scans the **address area** to "
"obtain the address. Any text outside the address area is not considered part "
"of the address."
msgstr ""
"Pingen (el proveedor de servicios de correo postal de Odoo) escanea el "
"**área de dirección** para obtener la dirección. Cualquier texto que esté "
"fuera de esta área no se considerará como parte de la misma."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/snailmail.rst:41
msgid "The document must not contain more than 8 physical pages."
msgstr "El documento no debe contener más de 8 páginas físicas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/snailmail.rst:44
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/invoice_digitization.rst:170
msgid "Pricing"
msgstr "Precio"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/snailmail.rst:46
msgid ""
"Snailmail is an :doc:`/applications/essentials/in_app_purchase` service that "
"requires prepaid stamps (credits) to work. Sending one document consumes one "
"stamp."
msgstr ""
"El correo postal es un servicio de :doc:`/applications/essentials/"
"in_app_purchase` que necesita de timbres prepagados (es decir, créditos) "
"para funcionar. Enviar un documento consume un timbre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/snailmail.rst:49
msgid ""
"To buy stamps, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`Snailmail` section, and "
"click :guilabel:`Buy credits`."
msgstr ""
"Para comprar timbres, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --"
"> Ajustes`, dirígete a la sección :guilabel:`Correo postal` y haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Comprar créditos`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/snailmail.rst:54
msgid "`Odoo's IAP Privacy Policy <https://iap.odoo.com/privacy#header_4>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Política de privacidad de compras dentro de la aplicación de Odoo <https://"
"iap.odoo.com/privacy#header_4>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/snailmail.rst:55
msgid ""
"`Pingen's layout requirements <https://help.pingen.com/en/templates-and-"
"postal-requirements/ letter-standards>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Requisitos de diseño de Pingen <https://help.pingen.com/en/templates-and-"
"postal-requirements/ letter-standards>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/terms_conditions.rst:3
msgid "Default terms and conditions (T&C)"
msgstr "Términos y condiciones predeterminados"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/terms_conditions.rst:5
msgid ""
"Specifying terms and conditions is essential to establish important "
"contractual points, such as return and refunds, warranty, and after-sale "
"services."
msgstr ""
"Es esencial que especifique los términos y condiciones para que pueda "
"establecer puntos contractuales que son muy importantes, como las "
"devoluciones o reembolsos, las garantías y los servicios posventa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/terms_conditions.rst:8
msgid ""
"You can add default terms and conditions at the bottom of all customer "
"invoices, sales orders, and quotations, either as text or a link to a web "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Puede agregar términos y condiciones al final de todas las facturas, órdenes "
"de venta y cotizaciones, ya sea como un texto o un enlace a una página web."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/terms_conditions.rst:12
msgid ""
"`Odoo Tutorial: Terms & Conditions <https://www.odoo.com/slides/slide/"
"payment-terms-terms-and-conditions-6852>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Tutorial de Odoo: Términos y condiciones <https://www.odoo.com/slides/slide/"
"payment-terms-terms-and-conditions-6852>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/terms_conditions.rst:17
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`. Under "
"the :guilabel:`Customer Invoices` section, enable :guilabel:`Default Terms & "
"Conditions`. By default, the :guilabel:`Add a Note` option is selected, and "
"the terms and conditions are displayed at the bottom of the document. Enter "
"the terms and conditions in the text box below."
msgstr ""
