#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:150
msgid ""
"Standard :doc:`journals <get_started/journals>` such as a sales journal, a "
"purchase journal, a bank journal, and more are created by default, but "
"additional journals can be created to manage different situations, including:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo crea :doc:`diarios <get_started/journals>` estándar de forma "
"predeterminada, como un diario de ventas, un diario de compras, un diario "
"bancario, entre otros, pero puedes crear diarios adicionales para gestionar "
"distintas situaciones, como:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:154
msgid "tracking income through multiple sales journals"
msgstr "registrar ingresos mediante varios diarios de ventas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:155
msgid "having multiple bank accounts, each with its own journal"
msgstr "tener varias cuentas bancarias, cada una con su propio diario"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:156
msgid ""
"managing loans, tax returns, payroll, and more with miscellaneous journals"
msgstr ""
"gestionar préstamos, declaraciones fiscales, nóminas y otros movimientos con "
"diarios varios"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:158
msgid ""
"Recording payments in bank, cash, and credit card journals can create "
"journal entries or not, depending on the journal's configuration. By "
"default, no journal entries are created for payments. To configure a journal "
"to create payments, set :ref:`outstanding payments accounts <accounting/"
"journals/outstanding-accounts>` on the journal's payment methods."
msgstr ""
"Registrar pagos en diarios bancarios, de efectivo y de tarjetas de crédito "
"puede crear asientos contables o no, según la configuración del diario. De "
"forma predeterminada, Odoo no crea asientos contables para los pagos. Para "
"configurar un diario para que cree asientos contables al registrar pagos, "
"define las :ref:`cuentas de pagos pendientes <accounting/journals/"
"outstanding-accounts>` en los métodos de pago del diario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:164
msgid ""
"To get started with electronic invoicing, follow the two setup links on "
"the :guilabel:`Sales` journal card located on the :guilabel:`Accounting` "
"dashboard: configuring your company data and activating the e-invoicing "
"system. Note that specific requirements may vary depending on "
"your :doc:`fiscal localization <../fiscal_localizations>`."
msgstr ""
"Para empezar con la facturación electrónica, sigue los dos enlaces de "
"configuración en la tarjeta del diario de :guilabel:`Ventas` ubicada en el "
"tablero de :guilabel:`Contabilidad`: configura los datos de tu empresa y "
"activa el sistema de facturación electrónica. Ten en cuenta que los "
"requisitos específicos pueden variar según tu :doc:`localización fiscal <../"
"fiscal_localizations>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:172
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:520
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:277
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:152
msgid "Fiscal positions"
msgstr "Posiciones fiscales"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:174
msgid ""
":doc:`Fiscal positions <taxes/fiscal_positions>` allow you to configure "
"products to use different income/expense accounts and apply "
"different :doc:`taxes <taxes>` depending on the customer or vendor "
"purchasing or selling them. They can also be configured to apply "
"automatically based on the customer's or vendor's location. Default fiscal "
"positions are included when installing a :doc:`fiscal localization package "
"<../fiscal_localizations>`, but existing fiscal positions can be adjusted, "
"and new fiscal positions can be created manually."
msgstr ""
"Las :doc:`posiciones fiscales <taxes/fiscal_positions>` te permiten "
"configurar productos para que usen distintas cuentas de ingresos y gastos y "
"apliquen distintos :doc:`impuestos <taxes>` según el cliente o proveedor que "
"los compre o venda. También puedes configurarlas para que se apliquen de "
"forma automática según la ubicación del cliente o proveedor. Odoo incluye "
"posiciones fiscales predeterminadas al instalar un :doc:`paquete de "
"localización fiscal <../fiscal_localizations>`, pero puedes ajustar las "
"posiciones fiscales existentes y crear nuevas de forma manual."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:186
msgid ""
":doc:`taxes` interact with many different aspects of accounting, "
"including :doc:`fiscal positions <taxes/fiscal_positions>`, :ref:`accounts "
"<taxes/definition-tab>`, and products. Default taxes are included when "
"installing a :doc:`fiscal localization package <../fiscal_localizations>`, "
"but existing taxes can be adjusted, and new taxes can be created manually."
msgstr ""
"Los :doc:`taxes` interactúan con distintos aspectos de la contabilidad, "
"incluidas las :doc:`posiciones fiscales <taxes/fiscal_positions>`, "
"las :ref:`cuentas <taxes/definition-tab>` y los productos. Odoo incluye "
"impuestos predeterminados al instalar un :doc:`paquete de localización "
"fiscal <../fiscal_localizations>`, pero puedes ajustar los impuestos "
"existentes y crear nuevos de forma manual."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:196
msgid ""
":doc:`Payment terms <customer_invoices/payment_terms>` detail the conditions "
"of payment for records such as sales and purchase orders, customer invoices, "
"and vendor bills. Payment terms also allow you to define installment plans "
"for when one record's payments should be made in multiple installments."
msgstr ""
"Los :doc:`términos de pago <customer_invoices/payment_terms>` detallan las "
"condiciones de pago de registros como órdenes de venta y compra, facturas de "
"cliente y facturas de proveedor. También te permiten definir planes de pagos "
"a plazos para definir cuándo deben realizarse los pagos de un registro en "
"varias mensualidades."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:200
msgid ""
"As they are both used to dictate when payment is due, payment terms and due "
"dates are mutually exclusive: a record can only have one or the other."
msgstr ""
"Como ambos se usan para indicar cuándo vence un pago, los términos de pago y "
"las fechas de vencimiento son excluyentes: un registro solo puede tener uno "
"de los dos."

