#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:3
msgid "Consolidation"
msgstr "Consolidación"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:5
msgid ""
"Consolidation allows combining financial data from **multiple separate "
"companies**, each with its own books, into a unified view, providing a "
"\"fair image\" of the entire group's financial health."
msgstr ""
"La consolidación permite combinar los datos financieros de **varias empresas "
"distintas**, cada una con sus propios libros mayores, en una sola sola vista "
"para poder conocer con claridad la salud financiera de todo ese grupo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:8
msgid ""
"It helps create a clear, comprehensive view of the group's financial "
"performance by combining data from multiple companies."
msgstr ""
"Ayuda a obtener una visión clara y completa del desempeño financiero del "
"grupo al integrar los datos de varias empresas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:12
msgid ""
"Consolidating companies involves **legally separate entities**, "
"whereas :ref:`branches <general/branches>` are **subdivisions** of a single "
"legal entity which often share the head office's resources (journals, taxes, "
"accounts, fiscal positions) and are not consolidated in the same way."
msgstr ""
"Consolidar empresas implica contar con **entidades jurídicas separadas**, "
"mientras que las :ref:`sucursales <general/branches>` son **subdivisiones** "
"de una sola entidad jurídica que suelen compartir los recursos de la oficina "
"central (asientos, impuestos, cuentas, posiciones fiscales) y no se "
"consolidan de la misma manera."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:20
msgid "Consolidation tools"
msgstr "Herramientas de consolidación"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Several tools** combined together will contribute to the construction of "
"the financial consolidation:"
msgstr ""
"**Varias herramientas** combinadas contribuirán a la creación de la "
"consolidación financiera:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:27
msgid ""
"**Account Mapping:** Similar accounts from different companies can be mapped "
"together. This allows Odoo to combine them correctly in consolidated "
"reports. To map accounts, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration "
"--> Chart of Accounts`.  Click :guilabel:`View` on the account line. In "
"the :guilabel:`Mapping` tab, enter a code in the corresponding "
"company :guilabel:`Code` column to map the account."
msgstr ""
"**Mapeo de cuentas:** Es posible asignar cuentas similares de diferentes "
"empresas para que Odoo las combine de forma correcta en los reportes "
"consolidados. Para ello, vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> "
"Configuración --> Plan de cuentas` y haga clic en :guilabel:`Ver` en la "
"línea de la cuenta. Abra la pestaña :guilabel:`Mapeo` e ingrese un código en "
"la columna :guilabel:`Código` de la empresa correspondiente para mapear la "
"cuenta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:33
msgid "Mapping different codes to different companies."
msgstr "Mapeo de distintos códigos a distintas empresas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:36
msgid ""
":ref:`Import mapping <consolidation_import_account_mapping>` or merge "
"existing accounts using the :ref:`merging tool <consolidation_merge_tool>` "
"can simplify the process."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Importar el mapeo <consolidation_import_account_mapping>` o fusionar "
"las cuentas existentes con la :ref:`herramienta de fusión "
"<consolidation_merge_tool>` puede simplificar el proceso."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:39
msgid ""
"When multiple accounts from one company are mapped to a single account in "
"another, it is then possible to group the multiple accounts into a single "
"line in the other company's reporting by :ref:`grouping by <customize-"
"reports/lines-group-by>` the *account code* (`account_code`) rather than the "
"*account ID* (`account_id`)."
msgstr ""
"Si asignas varias cuentas de una empresa a una sola cuenta en otra, podrás "
"agruparlas en una sola línea en el reporte de la otra empresa con la "
"función :ref:`Agrupar por <customize-reports/lines-group-by>` con el *código "
"de cuenta* (`account_code`) en lugar del *ID de cuenta* (`account_id`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:45
msgid ""
"Some reports, such as the :ref:`profit and loss <accounting/reporting/profit-"
"and-loss>`, split the lines into different sections by account type. When "
"these reports are grouped by account code, the section splits are "
"maintained, but within each section, line grouping by account code is "
"respected."
msgstr ""
"Algunos reportes, como el :ref:`estado de resultados <accounting/reporting/"
"profit-and-loss>`, dividen las líneas en secciones según el tipo de cuenta. "
"Al agrupar estos reportes por código de cuenta, las divisiones por sección "
"se mantienen, pero dentro de cada sección se respeta el agrupamiento por "
"código de cuenta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:51
msgid ""
"Belgian Company is a parent company with a subsidiary, American Company. "
"American Company has five income accounts:"
msgstr ""
"Mi Empresa de Bélgica es la empresa matriz y tiene una filial, Mi Empresa "
"Americana. Mi Empresa Americana tiene cinco cuentas de ingresos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:54
msgid "400000 Product Sales - Domestic"
msgstr "400000 Venta de productos - Nacional"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:55
msgid "400100 Product Sales - International"
msgstr "400100 Venta de productos - Internacional"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:56
msgid "410000 Service Revenue - Consulting"
msgstr "410000 Ingresos por servicios - Consultoría"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:57
msgid "420000 Subscription Revenue"
msgstr "420000 Ingresos por suscripciones"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:58
msgid "430000 Freight & Handling Revenue"
msgstr "430000 Ingresos por fletes y gestión"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:60
msgid ""
"All five of the US income accounts correspond to one single income account "
"(700000 Income) in the Belgian Company."
msgstr ""
"Las cinco cuentas de ingresos de EE. UU. corresponden a una sola cuenta de "
"ingresos (700000 Ingresos) en Mi Empresa de Bélgica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:63
msgid ""
"For the Belgian Company's profit and loss report to show one line for all of "
"the American Company's combined income accounts related to the Belgian "
"Company's single income account, all five income accounts from the American "
"Company must be mapped to The Belgian Company's 700000 Income account, and "
"the report's lines must be :ref:`grouped by <customize-reports/lines-group-"
"by>` the account code."
msgstr ""
"Para que el estado de resultados de Mi Empresa de Bélgica muestre una sola "
"línea para todas las cuentas de ingresos combinadas de Mi Empresa Americana "
"relacionadas con la cuenta única de Mi Empresa de Bélgica, las cinco cuentas "
"de ingresos de Mi Empresa Americana deben estar vinculadas a la cuenta "
"700000 Ingresos de Mi Empresa de Bélgica, y las líneas del reporte deben "
"estar :ref:`agrupadas por <customize-reports/lines-group-by>` el código de "
"cuenta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:71
msgid ""
"**Multi-Ledgers:** Ledgers are fundamental to the process of consolidation. "
"They are either:"
msgstr ""
"**Multilibros:** Los libros son fundamentales para el proceso de "
"consolidación. Pueden ser:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:73
msgid ""
"*Regular Ledgers:* Each company in the consolidation scope has its own "
"standard accounting ledger where all the regular day-to-day transactions are "
"recorded. It excludes the company's consolidation adjustment journals."
msgstr ""
"*Libros regulares:* Cada empresa dentro del alcance de la consolidación "
"tiene su propio libro contable estándar y este registra todas las "
"transacciones diarias habituales. No incluye los asientos de ajuste de "
"consolidación de la empresa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:77
msgid ""
"*Multi-Ledger for Consolidation:* The company doing the actual consolidation "
"also has a special multi-ledger. This one includes all the other companies' "
"consolidation adjustments journals (the ones excluded from their own "
"ledgers). This allows for viewing the total impact of all the adjustments."
msgstr ""
"*Multilibro para consolidación:* La empresa que realiza la consolidación "
"también tiene un multilibro especial. Este incluye todos los asientos de "
"ajuste de consolidación de las demás empresas (los que no están incluidos en "
"sus propios libros). Esto permite visualizar el impacto total de todos los "
"ajustes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:82
msgid ""
"To create a new ledger, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --"
"> Multi-Ledgers` and hit the :guilabel:`New` button. Enter a name, pick the "
"company the ledger is linked to and most importantly, determine which "
"journals are to be excluded from the ledger."
msgstr ""
"Para crear un nuevo libro mayor, vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> "
"Configuración --> Multilibros` y haga clic en el botón :guilabel:`Nuevo`. "
"Proporciónele un nombre, seleccione la empresa a la que está vinculado y, "
"sobre todo, determine los diarios a excluir del libro mayor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:88
msgid ""
"**Multi-Company Selector:** The consolidated view can be accessed using the "
"multi-company"
msgstr ""
"**Selector multiempresa:** Es posible acceder a la vista consolidada "
"mediante el selector multiempresa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:89
msgid ""
"selector. Selecting the consolidating company as the current company and "
"making the other companies visible in the selector, all the journal items "
"are displayed from the consolidating company's perspective."
msgstr ""
"Al seleccionar la empresa que consolida como la empresa actual y mostrar el "
"resto en el selector, aparecen todos los apuntes contables desde la "
"perspectiva de la empresa que realiza la consolidación."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:93
msgid "Selecting the main company and activating others."
msgstr "Seleccionar la empresa principal y activar otras."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:98
msgid ""
"**Horizontal Groups:** Odoo's reporting tools allow for combining multi-"
"ledgers and using"
msgstr ""
"Grupos horizontales: Las herramientas de creación de reportes de Odoo "
"permiten combinar varios libros"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:99
msgid ""
"horizontal groups to view the consolidated Balance Sheet or P&L. They also "
"show how much each company contributes to the overall consolidated figures."
msgstr ""
"y utilizar grupos horizontales para ver el balance general o el estado de "
"resultados consolidado. También muestran cuánto contribuye cada empresa a "
"las cifras consolidadas generales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:102
msgid "Follow these steps to create an :guilabel:`Horizontal Group`:"
msgstr "Siga estos pasos para crear un :guilabel:`grupo horizontal`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:105
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Horizontal Groups` "
"and click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"Vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Grupos "
"horizontales` y haga clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:107
msgid ""
"Add a :guilabel:`Group Name` and select the :guilabel:`Reports` where the "
"horizontal group can be used."
msgstr ""
"Agregue el :guilabel:`nombre del grupo` y seleccione "
"los :guilabel:`reportes` en los que es posible utilizar el grupo horizontal."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:109
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Field` column, click :guilabel:`Add a line`."
msgstr ""
"Haga clic en :guilabel:`Agregar una línea` en la columna :guilabel:`Campo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:110
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Create rules` window, add a :guilabel:`Field` and create a "
"new :guilabel:`Domain` rule if needed. Then, click :guilabel:`Save & Close`."
msgstr ""
"En la ventana :guilabel:`Crear reglas`, agregue un :guilabel:`campo` y cree "
"una nueva regla de :guilabel:`dominio` en caso de que sea necesario, después "
"haga clic en :guilabel:`Guardar y cerrar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:113
msgid "Using horizontal groups to see each company's contribution."
msgstr "Usar grupos horizontales para ver la contribución de cada empresa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:117
msgid ""
"When opened, financial reports usually default to a statutory view, using "
"the company's regular ledger (including its consolidation adjustment). To "
"see the full consolidation picture, **make sure to select the multi-ledger** "
"that includes all the consolidation adjustments."
msgstr ""
"Al abrir los reportes financieros, estos suelen mostrar una vista normativa "
"de forma predeterminada, con el libro mayor regular de la empresa "
"(incluyendo su ajuste de consolidación). Para ver la consolidación completa, "
"**asegúrese de seleccionar el multilibro** que incluye todos los ajustes de "
"consolidación."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:123
msgid ""
"**Cumulative Translation Adjustments:** When consolidating companies with "
"different currencies, Odoo handles the translation."
msgstr ""
"**Ajustes acumulados por diferencia de conversión:** Odoo gestiona la "
"conversión al consolidar empresas con diferentes monedas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:126
msgid "Equity accounts: Use the historical exchange rate."
msgstr "Cuentas de capital: Usan el tipo de cambio histórico."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:128
msgid ""
"Profit and loss (P&L) accounts (including :ref:`appropriation accounts "
"<accounting/year-end/appropriation>`): Use the weighted average exchange "
"rate."
msgstr ""
"Cuentas de resultados (incluidas las :ref:`cuentas de asignación <accounting/"
"year-end/appropriation>`): Usan la tasa de cambio promedio ponderada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:131
msgid ""
"Balance sheet accounts (excluding equity): Use the closing exchange rate."
msgstr ""
"Cuentas de balance general (sin incluir el capital): Usan el tipo de cambio "
"de cierre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:134
msgid "The rates used are those of the company currently selected."
msgstr "Las tasas utilizadas son las de la empresa seleccionada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:139
msgid "Account merging"
msgstr "Fusión de cuentas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:141
msgid ""
"Accounts can be merged to reduce the number of accounts and standardize them "
"across companies. This is optional; consolidation works without it."
msgstr ""
"Es posible fusionar las cuentas para reducir el número de cuentas y "
"homologarlas entre empresas. Esto es opcional, ya que la consolidación "
"funciona incluso si no las fusiona."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:144
msgid ""
"To use the merge tool, select all the companies with an account that needs "
"to be merged in the company selector in the top right corner of the screen."
msgstr ""
"Para usar la herramienta de fusión, seleccione todas las empresas que tienen "
"cuentas que deben ser fusionadas en el selector de empresas que se encuentra "
"en la esquina superior derecha de la pantalla."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:147
msgid "Selecting all companies that have accounts to be merged."
msgstr "Selección de todas las cuentas que tienen cuentas por fusionar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:150
msgid ""
"Then, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Chart of "
"Accounts` and select the accounts to merge. Click the :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`Actions` menu and select :guilabel:`Merge accounts`."
msgstr ""
"Luego, vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Plan de "
"cuentas` y seleccione las cuentas a fusionar. Haga clic en el menú :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`Acciones` y seleccione :guilabel:`Fusionar cuentas`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:154
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Merge accounts` window, enable the :guilabel:`Group by "
"name?` option if needed and click :guilabel:`Merge`."
msgstr ""
"En la ventana :guilabel:`Fusionar cuentas` seleccione la "
"opción :guilabel:`¿Agrupar por nombre?` si es necesario y haga clic "
"en :guilabel:`Fusionar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:157
msgid ""
"The selected accounts are then merged into a single shared account, "
"accessible by all the chosen companies, just as if the account had been "
"directly created to be shared."
msgstr ""
"Esta acción fusionará las cuentas seleccionadas en una sola cuenta "
"compartida, a la que todas las empresas elegidas podrán acceder, como si la "
"cuenta hubiera sido creada directamente para ser compartida."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:163
msgid "Account unmerging"
msgstr "Desagrupar cuentas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:165
msgid "Accounts can also be unmerged if needed."
msgstr "También puede separar las cuentas en caso de que sea necesario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:169
msgid ""
"Note that unmerging accounts **will not unmerge the chatters** of the "
"accounts. Once merged, the changes' histories are permanently merged."
msgstr ""
"Tome en cuenta que separar las cuentas **no anulará la fusión del chatter** "
"de las cuentas. Los historiales de cambios se fusionan de forma permanente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:172
msgid ""
"To unmerge accounts, select a company with a shared account in the company "
"selector at the top right corner of the screen. Then, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Chart of Accounts` and "
"select the account to unmerge. Click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions` "
"menu and select :guilabel:`Unmerge accounts`."
msgstr ""
"Para anular la fusión de cuentas, seleccione una empresa con una cuenta "
"compartida en el selector de empresa que se encuentra en la esquina superior "
"derecha de la pantalla. Vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> "
"Configuración --> Plan de cuentas` y seleccione la cuenta a separar. Haga "
"clic en el menú :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Acciones` y "
"seleccione :guilabel:`Separar cuentas`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:177
msgid ""
"An :guilabel:`Odoo Warning` confirmation pop-up window will appear, listing "
"how the accounts will be split."
msgstr ""
"Aparecerá una ventana emergente de confirmación con "
"una :guilabel:`advertencia de Odoo`. Esta le indicará cómo se separarán las "
"cuentas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:180
msgid ""
"Confirmation wizard for the Unmerge Tool of the shared accounts feature."
msgstr ""
"Asistente de confirmación de la herramienta de separación para la función de "
"cuentas compartidas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:183
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Unmerge`. A new account linked to each company will be "
"created for the previously shared account."
msgstr ""
"Haga clic en :guilabel:`Separar`. Esta acción creará una nueva cuenta "
"vinculada a cada empresa para la cuenta que antes estaba compartida."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:189
msgid "Import a mapping"
msgstr "Importar un mapeo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:191
msgid ""
"To **import an account mapping**, select all the related companies in the "
"company selector at the top right corner of the screen and go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Chart of Accounts`."
msgstr ""
"Para **importar un mapeo de cuentas**, seleccione todas las empresas "
"relacionadas en el selector de empresas que se encuentra en la esquina "
"superior derecha de la pantalla y vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> "
"Configuración --> Plan de cuentas`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:195
msgid ""
"First, to choose the fields to export, select the accounts, click "
"the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions` button and select :guilabel:`Export`. "
"Then, in the :guilabel:`Export data` window, add the :guilabel:`Code mapping/"
"Code`, :guilabel:`Code Mapping/Company` and :guilabel:`External ID` fields "
"using the :icon:`fa-plus` icon and click :guilabel:`Export`. No other field "
"is required."
msgstr ""
"Primero, para elegir los campos a exportar, seleccione las cuentas, haga "
"clic en el botón :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Acciones` y "
"seleccione :guilabel:`Exportar`. Luego, en la ventana :guilabel:`Exportar "
"datos`, agregue los campos :guilabel:`Mapeo de código/"
"Código`, :guilabel:`Mapeo de código/Empresa` y :guilabel:`ID externo` con el "
"icono :icon:`fa-plus` y haga clic en :guilabel:`Exportar`. No es necesario "
"que agregue ningún otro campo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:201
msgid ""
"Second, rework it in a spreadsheet adding the desired code for each company "
"on desired accounts."
msgstr ""
"Después, trabaje en una hoja de cálculo y agregue el código deseado para "
"cada empresa en las cuentas correspondientes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:203
msgid ""
"Third, to reimport the file (xlsx or csv format) in Odoo, "
"click :guilabel:`Import` and, in the :guilabel:`Import Chart of Accounts` "
"section, click :guilabel:`Import CoA`. In the :guilabel:`Accounting Import "
"Guide`, drop or click :guilabel:`Upload Data File` to import the file. Then, "
"click :guilabel:`Import`."
msgstr ""
"Para volver a importar el archivo (en formato XLSX o CSV) en Odoo, haga clic "
"en :guilabel:`Importar` y, en la sección :guilabel:`Importar plan de "
"cuentas`, haga clic en :guilabel:`Importar plan de cuentas`. En "
"la :guilabel:`Guía de importación contable`, arrastre o haga clic "
"en :guilabel:`Subir archivo de datos` para importar el archivo y luego haz "
"clic en :guilabel:`Importar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/consolidation.rst:208
msgid ""
"Finally, the codes now take into account the mapping company per company."
msgstr ""
"Por último, los códigos ahora toman en cuenta la empresa mapeada para cada "
"empresa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:7
msgid ""
"A company's inventory valuation should include all stock on hand. Accurately "
"recording this value in the accounting records ensures a true representation "
"of the company's current asset value."
msgstr ""
"La valuación de inventario de una empresa debe incluir todas las existencias "
"a la mano. Registrar este valor de forma precisa en los registros contables "
"garantiza una representación fiel del valor actual de los activos de la "
"empresa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:10
msgid ""
"The :doc:`Inventory <../../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory>` app maintains "
"real-time stock valuation based on physical item movement. In contrast, the "
"Accounting app updates accounting inventory valuation only when specifically "
"requested, most often for closing or (when using perpetual accounting) when "
"vendor bills or customer invoices are posted."
msgstr ""
"La aplicación :doc:`Inventario <../../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory>` "
"mantiene la valuación de inventario en tiempo real según el movimiento "
"físico de los artículos. En cambio, la aplicación Contabilidad actualiza la "
"valuación contable del inventario solo al solicitarlo de forma específica, "
"por lo general, al cierre o, cuando se usa la contabilidad perpetua, cuando "
"se contabilizan las facturas de proveedor o las facturas de cliente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:16
msgid ""
"Use the :doc:`../../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/"
"cheat_sheet` for guidance."
msgstr ""
"Usa la :doc:`../../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/"
"cheat_sheet` como referencia."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:21
msgid "Accounting standards"
msgstr "Normas contables"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:23
msgid ""
"In accounting, the timing of inventory expense recognition and its impact "
"on :ref:`journal entries <accounting-entries>` differ based on the "
"accounting standard used:"
msgstr ""
"En contabilidad, el momento en que se reconoce el gasto de inventario y su "
"impacto en los :ref:`asientos contables <accounting-entries>` varían según "
"la norma contable utilizada:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:26
msgid ""
"**Continental** accounting: the cost of goods is recorded as an expense when "
"the vendor bill is posted, typically upon receipt into stock, regardless of "
"when the goods are sold."
msgstr ""
"Contabilidad **continental**: El costo de los bienes se registra como gasto "
"al registrar la factura de proveedor, por lo general, al recibir los "
"productos en el inventario, sin importar cuándo se venden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Anglo-Saxon** accounting: the cost of goods sold (COGS) is recognized as "
"an expense when the customer invoice is posted, typically when products are "
"sold."
msgstr ""
"Contabilidad **anglosajona**: El costo de los bienes vendidos (COGS) se "
"reconoce como gasto al registrar la factura de cliente, por lo general, "
"cuando se venden los productos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:36
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`, then "
"scroll to the :guilabel:`Inventory Valuation` section to set the following "
"company-level options:"
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Ajustes` y dirígete "
"a la sección :guilabel:`Valuación de inventario` para configurar las "
"siguientes opciones a nivel de empresa:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:39
msgid ""
":ref:`Inventory Valuation <accounting/inventory-valuation/valuation-"
"method>`: Set the valuation method as :guilabel:`Perpetual (at invoicing)` "
"or :guilabel:`Periodic (at closing)`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Valuación de inventario <accounting/inventory-valuation/valuation-"
"method>`: Selecciona el método de valuación :guilabel:`perpetuo (al "
"facturar)` o :guilabel:`periódico (al cierre)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:41
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Periodic Valuation`: Set the :ref:`closing entry <accounting/"
"inventory-valuation/closing-entry>` process "
"to :guilabel:`Manual`, :guilabel:`Daily`, or :guilabel:`Monthly` to automate "
"it, if needed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Valuación periódica`: Configura el proceso de :ref:`asiento de "
"cierre <accounting/inventory-valuation/closing-entry>` "
"como :guilabel:`manual`, :guilabel:`diario` o :guilabel:`mensual` para "
"automatizarlo si es necesario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:44
msgid ""
":ref:`Inventory Cost Method <costing-methods>`: Choose :guilabel:`Standard "
"Price`, :guilabel:`First in First Out (FIFO)`, or :guilabel:`Average Cost "
"(AVCO)`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Método de costo del inventario <costing-methods>`: "
"Selecciona :guilabel:`Precio estándar`, :guilabel:`Primeras entradas, "
"primeras salidas (PEPS)` o :guilabel:`Costo promedio (AVCO)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:46
msgid ""
":ref:`Valuation Account <accounting/inventory-valuation/valuation-account>`: "
"Set the asset account used to record the financial value of physical stock. "
"Then, click the :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`(internal link)` next to "
"the :guilabel:`Valuation Account` field to open the :guilabel:`Stock "
"Valuation` account and update the :ref:`Variation Account <accounting/"
"inventory-valuation/variation-account>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Cuenta de valuación <accounting/inventory-valuation/valuation-"
"account>`: Selecciona la cuenta de activos que se usa para registrar el "
"valor financiero del inventario físico. Luego, haz clic en el "
"icono :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`(enlace interno)` junto al "
"campo :guilabel:`Cuenta de valuación` para abrir la cuenta "
"de :guilabel:`valuación de inventario` y actualizar la :ref:`cuenta de "
"variación <accounting/inventory-valuation/variation-account>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:51
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Journal`: Set the journal to post inventory valuation entries in."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Diario`: Selecciona el diario en el que se registran los asientos "
"de valuación de inventario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:52
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Other accounts can be defined on \"Inventory Loss\" and "
"\"Production\" on dedicated locations`: If needed, "
"click :guilabel:`locations` and set the :ref:`Inventory Loss <accounting/"
"inventory-valuation/inventory-loss>` or the :ref:`Cost of Production "
"<accounting/inventory-valuation/cost-of-production>` accounts."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Se pueden definir otras cuentas en \"Pérdida de inventario\" y "
"\"Producción\" para ubicaciones específicas`: Si es necesario, haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Ubicaciones` y configura las cuentas de :ref:`pérdida de "
"inventario <accounting/inventory-valuation/inventory-loss>` o :ref:`costo de "
"producción <accounting/inventory-valuation/cost-of-production>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:58
msgid ""
"Default accounts, inventory valuation methods, and costing methods can be "
"overridden by setting them on the product category form."
msgstr ""
"Puedes sustituir las cuentas, los métodos de valuación de inventario y los "
"métodos de costo predeterminados al configurarlos en el formulario de la "
"categoría de producto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:64
msgid "Valuation methods"
msgstr "Métodos de valuación"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:66
msgid ""
"The timing and manner of maintaining inventory records vary based on the "
"inventory valuation method:"
msgstr ""
"El momento y la forma de mantener los registros de inventario varían según "
"el método de valuación:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:68
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Periodic (at closing)`: Inventory valuation is updated only when "
"generating entries during the :ref:`stock closing process <accounting/"
"inventory-valuation/closing-entry>`. While inventory movements are tracked "
"physically via the :doc:`Inventory Stock <../../../inventory_and_mrp/"
"inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock>` report, they are not "
"automatically synchronized with financial records. When using "
"the :guilabel:`Periodic` inventory valuation method, the expense account is "
"debited when vendor bills are posted."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Periódico (al cierre)`: La valuación de inventario se actualiza "
"solo al generar asientos durante el :ref:`proceso de cierre de inventario "
"<accounting/inventory-valuation/closing-entry>`. Aunque los movimientos de "
"inventario se registran de forma física mediante el reporte "
"de :doc:`existencias de inventario <../../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/reporting/stock>`, no se sincronizan de forma automática "
"con los registros financieros. Al usar el método :guilabel:`periódico` de "
"valuación de inventario, la cuenta de gastos se carga al registrar las "
"facturas de proveedor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:74
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Perpetual (at invoicing)`: Inventory valuation is updated when "
"bills or invoices are posted. The expense account (:abbr:`COGS (Cost of "
"goods sold)`) is debited when invoices are posted. Combined with "
"the :ref:`stock closing process <accounting/inventory-valuation/closing-"
"entry>`, :guilabel:`Perpetual (at invoicing)` inventory valuation is updated "
"for deliveries and receipts, even if there is no invoice or vendor bill yet."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Perpetuo (al facturar)`: La valuación de inventario se actualiza "
"al registrar las facturas de cliente o de proveedor. La cuenta de gastos "
"(:abbr:`COGS (Costo de los bienes vendidos)`) se carga al registrar las "
"facturas. Junto con el :ref:`proceso de cierre de inventario <accounting/"
"inventory-valuation/closing-entry>`, la valuación de "
"inventario :guilabel:`perpetuo (al facturar)` se actualiza para las entregas "
"y recepciones, incluso si todavía no existe una factura de cliente o de "
"proveedor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:81
msgid ""
"The periodic valuation method is often associated with Continental "
"standards, while the perpetual method is commonly used with Anglo-Saxon "
"standards. However, companies may choose a different inventory valuation "
"method based on their specific needs."
msgstr ""
"El método periódico de valuación suele asociarse con las normas contables "
"continentales, mientras que el método perpetuo se usa con frecuencia con las "
"normas anglosajonas. Sin embargo, las empresas pueden elegir otro método de "
"valuación de inventario según sus necesidades."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:84
msgid ""
"In :guilabel:`Perpetual` valuation, it is more common to set "
"the :guilabel:`Periodic Valuation` to :guilabel:`Manual` and generate "
"closing entries only when a fiscal period closes, or when accounting reports "
"require synchronization with inventory stock, unless an automatic update of "
"accounting inventory value is needed."
msgstr ""
"En la valuación :guilabel:`perpetua`, es más común configurar "
"la :guilabel:`valuación periódica` como :guilabel:`Manual` y generar "
"asientos de cierre solo cuando termina un periodo fiscal o cuando los "
"reportes contables requieren sincronizarse con las existencias del "
"inventario, a menos que necesites actualizar el valor contable del "
"inventario de forma automática."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:90
msgid ""
"When using the :guilabel:`Perpetual (at invoicing)` valuation method with "
"the :guilabel:`Standard Price` costing method, a :guilabel:`Price Difference "
"Account` can be set for the :guilabel:`Product Category`. This account "
"records the difference between the product's standard price, as specified on "
"the product form, and the actual billed price, helping track pricing "
"fluctuations."
msgstr ""
"Al usar el método :guilabel:`perpetuo (al facturar)` de valuación con el "
"método de costo :guilabel:`Precio estándar`, puedes configurar "
"una :guilabel:`cuenta de diferencia de precio` para la :guilabel:`categoría "
"de producto`. Esta cuenta registra la diferencia entre el precio estándar "
"del producto, especificado en el formulario del producto, y el precio "
"facturado real, lo que ayuda a llevar un control de las variaciones del "
"precio."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:99
msgid "Valuation account"
msgstr "Cuenta de valuación"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:101
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Valuation account` records the inventory value listed as a "
"current asset on the balance sheet. The :guilabel:`Valuation Account` tracks "
"inventory asset value differently depending on the selected :ref:`valuation "
"method <accounting/inventory-valuation/valuation-method>`."
msgstr ""
"La :guilabel:`cuenta de valuación` registra el valor del inventario como un "
"activo circulante en el balance general. La :guilabel:`Cuenta de valuación` "
"registra el valor de los activos del inventario de forma distinta según "
"el :ref:`método de valuación <accounting/inventory-valuation/valuation-"
"method>` seleccionado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:108
msgid "Variation account"
msgstr "Cuenta de variación"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:110
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Variation account` is used to record inventory variations for "
"the period covered by the :ref:`stock closing process <accounting/inventory-"
"valuation/closing-entry>` and can be updated during :ref:`configuration "
"<accounting/inventory-valuation/configuration>`:"
msgstr ""
"La :guilabel:`cuenta de variación` se usa para registrar las variaciones del "
"inventario durante el periodo que abarca el :ref:`proceso de cierre de "
"inventario <accounting/inventory-valuation/closing-entry>` y puedes "
"actualizarla desde la :ref:`configuración <accounting/inventory-valuation/"
"configuration>`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:114
msgid ""
"Continental :guilabel:`Periodic (at closing)`: Expense account, which is a "
"localization-specific account used to record inventory variations during the "
"stock closing process."
msgstr ""
"Continental :guilabel:`Periódico (al cierre)`: cuenta de gastos, que es una "
"cuenta específica de la localización utilizada para registrar las "
"variaciones de inventario durante el proceso de cierre de existencias."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:116
msgid "Anglo-Saxon :guilabel:`Perpetual (at invoicing)`:"
msgstr "Anglosajón :guilabel:`Perpetuo (al facturar)`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:118
msgid ""
"Current asset account type: Provides interim tracking of inventory value "
"changes throughout the fiscal period. Inventory movements become immediately "
"visible on the Balance Sheet once the closing entry is generated."
msgstr ""
"Tipo de cuenta de activo circulante: proporciona un seguimiento provisional "
"de los cambios en el valor del inventario a lo largo del periodo fiscal. Los "
"movimientos de inventario se vuelven visibles de inmediato en el balance "
"general una vez que se genera el asiento de cierre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:121
msgid ""
"Expense account type: Offers simpler configuration with fewer interim "
"accounting entries. Recommended if interim tracking is not required and a "
"simpler period-end closing process is preferred."
msgstr ""
"Tipo de cuenta de gastos: ofrece una configuración más simple con menos "
"asientos contables provisionales. Se recomienda si no necesitas un "
"seguimiento provisional y prefieres un proceso de cierre de fin de periodo "
"más sencillo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:126
msgid ""
"Stock variations resulting from product receipts and deliveries are "
"displayed in the :guilabel:`Stock Variation` section of the :ref:`Inventory "
"Valuation report <accounting/inventory-valuation/inventory-valuation-"
"report>`."
msgstr ""
"Las variaciones de existencias que resultan de las recepciones y entregas de "
"productos aparecen en la sección :guilabel:`Variación de existencias` "
"del :ref:`reporte de valuación del inventario <accounting/inventory-"
"valuation/inventory-valuation-report>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:129
msgid ""
"When using the :guilabel:`Perpetual (at invoicing)` inventory valuation, if "
"no bill or invoice has been posted for these moves yet, it allows their "
"impact on inventory value to be recorded in the accounting. "
"The :guilabel:`Variation account` serves as a buffer account until "
"the :ref:`accrual entries <accounting/inventory-valuation/accrual-entries>` "
"are recorded."
msgstr ""
"Al usar la valuación de inventario :guilabel:`perpetua (al facturar)`, si "
"todavía no se ha registrado ninguna factura de proveedor o de cliente para "
"estos movimientos, puedes registrar su impacto en el valor del inventario en "
"la contabilidad. La :guilabel:`cuenta de variación` sirve como cuenta puente "
"hasta que se registran los :ref:`asientos de devengo <accounting/inventory-"
"valuation/accrual-entries>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:138
msgid "Other accounts"
msgstr "Otras cuentas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:143
msgid "Inventory Loss"
msgstr "Pérdida de inventario"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:145
msgid ""
"To exclude :doc:`inventory adjustments <../../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/inventory_management/count_products>` from "
"the :guilabel:`Variation account` at closing, configure "
"an :guilabel:`Inventory Adjustment` location account (:guilabel:`Inventory "
"Loss` location type) appropriately:"
msgstr ""
"Para excluir los :doc:`ajustes de inventario <../../../inventory_and_mrp/"
"inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/count_products>` de "
"la :guilabel:`cuenta de variación` al cierre, configura de forma adecuada "
"una cuenta para la ubicación :guilabel:`Ajuste de inventario` (tipo de "
"ubicación :guilabel:`Pérdida de inventario`):"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:150
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:177
msgid ""
"In the :ref:`Inventory Valuation section of the Accounting settings "
"<accounting/inventory-valuation/configuration>`, click :guilabel:`locations` "
"in :guilabel:`Other accounts can be defined on \"Inventory Loss\" and "
"\"Production\" on dedicated locations`."
msgstr ""
"En la :ref:`sección Valuación del inventario de los ajustes de Contabilidad "
"<accounting/inventory-valuation/configuration>`, haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Ubicaciones` en :guilabel:`Se pueden definir otras cuentas en "
"\"Pérdida de inventario\" y \"Producción\" para ubicaciones específicas`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:154
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Locations` list view, open any locations with "
"the :guilabel:`Inventory Loss` location type."
msgstr ""
"En la vista de lista de :guilabel:`Ubicaciones`, abre cualquier ubicación "
"con el tipo de ubicación :guilabel:`Pérdida de inventario`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:156
msgid ""
"Set the :guilabel:`Loss Account` in the :guilabel:`Accounting` information "
"section."
msgstr ""
"Configura la :guilabel:`cuenta de pérdidas` en la sección de información "
"de :guilabel:`Contabilidad`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:159
msgid ""
"When using the Continental accounting standard in combination with "
"the :guilabel:`Periodic (at closing)` valuation method, the update is "
"displayed in the :guilabel:`Inventory Loss` section of the :ref:`Inventory "
"Valuation report <accounting/inventory-valuation/inventory-valuation-"
"report>`."
msgstr ""
"Al usar la norma contable continental junto con el método de "
"valuación :guilabel:`Periódica (al cierre)`, la actualización aparece en la "
"sección :guilabel:`Pérdida de inventario` del :ref:`reporte de valuación del "
"inventario <accounting/inventory-valuation/inventory-valuation-report>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:163
msgid ""
"When using the Anglo-Saxon accounting standard in combination with "
"the :guilabel:`Perpetual (at invoicing)` valuation method, "
"the :ref:`valuation account <accounting/inventory-valuation/valuation-"
"account>` updates immediately in real time once the move is completed."
msgstr ""
"Al usar la norma contable anglosajona junto con el método de "
"valuación :guilabel:`perpetua (al facturar)`, la :ref:`cuenta de valuación "
"<accounting/inventory-valuation/valuation-account>` se actualiza de "
"inmediato en tiempo real al completar el movimiento."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:171
msgid "Cost of Production"
msgstr "Costo de producción"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:173
msgid ""
"To record production costs for both the finished product and the components "
"in an account other than the default :guilabel:`Variation Account`, set up "
"a :guilabel:`Production` location account (:guilabel:`Production` location "
"type):"
msgstr ""
"Para registrar los costos de producción tanto del producto terminado como de "
"sus componentes en una cuenta distinta de la :guilabel:`cuenta de variación` "
"predeterminada, configura una cuenta para la "
"ubicación :guilabel:`Producción` (tipo de ubicación :guilabel:`Producción`):"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:180
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Locations` list view, open any locations with "
"the :guilabel:`Production` location types."
msgstr ""
"En la vista de lista :guilabel:`Ubicaciones`, abre cualquier ubicación con "
"el tipo de ubicación :guilabel:`Producción`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:182
msgid ""
"Set the :guilabel:`Cost of Production` in the :guilabel:`Accounting` "
"information section."
msgstr ""
"Configura el :guilabel:`costo de producción` en la sección de información "
"de :guilabel:`Contabilidad`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:185
msgid ""
"When using the Anglo-Saxon accounting standard in combination with "
"the :guilabel:`Perpetual (at invoicing)` inventory valuation, "
"the :guilabel:`Valuation account` for finished products and components is "
"updated when a manufacturing order is validated, and the :guilabel:`Cost of "
"Production` account serves as the counterpart account for both."
msgstr ""
"Al usar la norma contable anglosajona junto con la valuación de "
"inventario :guilabel:`perpetua (al facturar)`, la :guilabel:`cuenta de "
"valuación` de los productos terminados y los componentes se actualiza al "
"validar una orden de fabricación, y la cuenta :guilabel:`costo de "
"producción` sirve como cuenta contrapartida para ambos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:189
msgid ""
"When using the Continental accounting standard in combination with "
"the :guilabel:`Periodic (at closing)` inventory valuation, inventory "
"variations from production (for both finished products and components) are "
"recorded separately from general inventory variations recorded at closing, "
"isolating production-related changes from receipts and deliveries. However, "
"this account is not commonly used when combining the Continental accounting "
"standard with the :guilabel:`Periodic (at closing)` inventory valuation."
msgstr ""
"Al usar la norma contable continental junto con la valuación de "
"inventario :guilabel:`periódica (al cierre)`, las variaciones de inventario "
"de la producción (tanto de los productos terminados como de los componentes) "
"se registran por separado de las variaciones generales de inventario "
"registradas al cierre, lo que permite aislar los cambios relacionados con la "
"producción de las recepciones y entregas. Sin embargo, esta cuenta no suele "
"usarse al combinar la norma contable continental con la valuación de "
"inventario :guilabel:`periódica (al cierre)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:199
msgid "Inventory valuation report"
msgstr "Reporte de valuación de inventario"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:201
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Inventory Valuation` report provides an accurate valuation of "
"inventory. To access it, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Review --> "
"Inventory Valuation`. The report includes the following sections:"
msgstr ""
"El reporte de :guilabel:`valuación del inventario` proporciona una valuación "
"precisa del inventario. Para acceder a él, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad "
"--> Revisión --> Valuación de inventario`. El reporte incluye las siguientes "
"secciones:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:205
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Initial Balance`: Current accounting inventory value. "
"Click :guilabel:`Initial Balance` to display the stock valuation journal "
"entries."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Balance inicial`: El valor contable actual del inventario. Haz "
"clic en :guilabel:`Balance inicial` para mostrar los asientos de valuación "
"del inventario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:207
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Inventory Loss` (:guilabel:`Periodic (at closing)` only): Only if "
"the :ref:`Loss Account <accounting/inventory-valuation/inventory-loss>` was "
"filled in during configuration."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Pérdida de inventario` (solo :guilabel:`Periódica (al cierre)`): "
"Esta aparece solo si configuraste la :ref:`cuenta de pérdidas <accounting/"
"inventory-valuation/inventory-loss>` durante la configuración."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:209
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Cost of Production` (:guilabel:`Periodic (at closing)` only, even "
"if using this account is not common for this valuation method): Only if "
"the :ref:`Cost of Production <accounting/inventory-valuation/cost-of-"
"production>` account was entered during configuration."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Costo de producción` (solo :guilabel:`Periódica (al cierre)`, "
"aunque esta cuenta no suele usarse con este método de valuación): Aparece "
"solo si configuraste la cuenta de :ref:`costo de producción <accounting/"
"inventory-valuation/cost-of-production>` durante la configuración."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:212
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Stock Variation` displays the difference between the posted "
"inventory value and the stock valuation recorded in the Inventory app (i.e., "
"the remaining quantity in stock moves)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Variación de existencias`: Muestra la diferencia entre el valor "
"de inventario registrado y la valuación de existencias registrada en la "
"aplicación Inventario (es decir, la cantidad restante en los movimientos de "
"inventario)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:214
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Ending Stock`: Future accounting inventory value when "
"the :ref:`closing entry <accounting/inventory-valuation/closing-entry>` is "
"completed. Click :guilabel:`Ending Stock` to access the :doc:`Inventory "
"Stock <../../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/"
"stock>` report."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Existencias finales`: El valor contable futuro del inventario una "
"vez completado el :ref:`asiento de cierre <accounting/inventory-valuation/"
"closing-entry>`. Haz clic en :guilabel:`Existencias finales` para acceder al "
"reporte de :doc:`existencias de inventario <../../../inventory_and_mrp/"
"inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:220
msgid ""
"Stock variation is automatically recorded with a stock closing entry at the "
"end of the period set during :ref:`configuration <accounting/inventory-"
"valuation/configuration>`, or manually when :ref:`generating an entry "
"<accounting/inventory-valuation/closing-entry>`."
msgstr ""
"La variación de existencias se registra de forma automática con un asiento "
"de cierre de inventario al final del periodo establecido durante "
"la :ref:`configuración <accounting/inventory-valuation/configuration>` o de "
"forma manual al :ref:`generar un asiento <accounting/inventory-valuation/"
"closing-entry>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:227
msgid "Stock closing entry"
msgstr "Asiento de cierre de inventario"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:229
msgid ""
"To create an inventory valuation entry that synchronizes accounting records "
"with stock value, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"Sigue estos pasos para crear un asiento de valuación del inventario que "
"sincronice los registros contables con el valor de las existencias:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:232
msgid ""
"Open the :ref:`Inventory Valuation <accounting/inventory-valuation/inventory-"
"valuation-report>` report."
msgstr ""
"Abre el reporte de :ref:`valuación del inventario <accounting/inventory-"
"valuation/inventory-valuation-report>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:234
msgid ""
"By default, the closing date is set to the end of the fiscal period. If "
"needed, click :icon:`fa-calendar` :guilabel:`As of` to select a different "
"inventory valuation date."
msgstr ""
"De forma predeterminada, la fecha de cierre corresponde al final del periodo "
"fiscal. Si es necesario, haz clic en :icon:`fa-calendar` :guilabel:`A partir "
"del` para seleccionar una fecha de valuación del inventario distinta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:236
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Generate Entry`."
msgstr "Haz clic en :guilabel:`Generar asiento`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:237
msgid ""
"Review the draft :guilabel:`Stock Closing` entry if needed, and "
"click :guilabel:`Post`."
msgstr ""
"Revisa el asiento de :guilabel:`cierre de existencias` en borrador si es "
"necesario y haz clic en :guilabel:`Registrar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:240
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Stock Valuation` and :guilabel:`Stock Variation` accounts are "
"then updated in the :ref:`general ledger <accounting/reporting/general-"
"ledger>`."
msgstr ""
"Las cuentas :guilabel:`Valuación de existencias` y :guilabel:`Variación de "
"existencias` se actualizan en el :ref:`libro mayor <accounting/reporting/"
"general-ledger>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:246
msgid "Accrual entries"
msgstr "Asientos de devengo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:248
msgid ""
"Revenue and expenses are recognized when goods or services are delivered or "
"received, not when invoiced. Accrual entries are required when the delivery "
"timing differs from invoicing, especially when a closing is needed."
msgstr ""
"Los ingresos y gastos se reconocen al entregar o recibir los bienes o "
"servicios, no al facturarlos. Los asientos de devengo son necesarios cuando "
"el momento de la entrega difiere del de la facturación, sobre todo cuando "
"necesitas hacer un cierre contable."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:252
msgid "To check for pending transactions requiring accrual entries:"
msgstr ""
"Para verificar si hay transacciones pendientes que requieran asientos de "
"devengo:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:254
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Review` and select the relevant "
"report: :guilabel:`Bill To Receive`, :guilabel:`Invoices To Be "
"Issued`, :guilabel:`Billed Not Received`, and :guilabel:`Invoiced Not "
"Delivered`."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Revisión` y selecciona el reporte "
"correspondiente: :guilabel:`Facturas de proveedor por "
"recibir`, :guilabel:`Facturas por emitir`, :guilabel:`Facturado pero no "
"recibido` o :guilabel:`Facturado y no entregado`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:257
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-calendar` :guilabel:`As of` to change the date, if needed."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :icon:`fa-calendar` :guilabel:`A partir del` para cambiar la "
"fecha si es necesario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:258
msgid "Select the relevant lines and click :guilabel:`Create Accrual Entries`."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona las líneas correspondientes y haz clic en :guilabel:`Crear "
"asientos de devengo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:259
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Accrued Revenue/Expense Entry` popup, set "
"the :guilabel:`Accrual Account` and review the :guilabel:`Reversal Date`, if "
"needed. Then, click :guilabel:`Create Entry`."
msgstr ""
"En la ventana emergente :guilabel:`Asiento de ingresos/gastos devengados`, "
"configura la :guilabel:`cuenta de devengo` y revisa la :guilabel:`fecha de "
"reversión` si es necesario. Después, haz clic en :guilabel:`Crear asiento`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:263
msgid ""
"Both valuation methods (periodic and perpetual) use accrual entries to "
"update revenues and expenses. However, when using the Anglo-Saxon accounting "
"standard in combination with the :guilabel:`Perpetual (at invoicing)` "
"inventory valuation, these entries also take value from the "
"buffer :guilabel:`Variation account` and allocate it to the appropriate "
"accounts, such as Bill to Receive or |GRNI|."
msgstr ""
"Ambos métodos de valuación (periódica y perpetua) usan asientos de devengo "
"para actualizar los ingresos y gastos. Sin embargo, al usar la norma "
"contable anglosajona junto con la valuación de "
"inventario :guilabel:`perpetua (al facturar)`, estos asientos también toman "
"el valor de la :guilabel:`cuenta de variación` puente y lo asignan a las "
"cuentas correspondientes, como Facturas de proveedor por recibir o Bienes "
"recibidos sin facturar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:272
msgid "Upgrade process for Anglo-Saxon Perpetual"
msgstr ""
"Proceso de actualización para contabilidad anglosajona con el método perpetuo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:274
msgid ""
"In Odoo 19, the stock input/output accounts are no longer used. Any non-zero "
"balances in stock interim accounts must be transferred to the :ref:`stock "
"valuation account <accounting/inventory-valuation/valuation-account>` via "
"journal entry to maintain accurate inventory values after migration. This "
"rebalancing can be performed :ref:`before <accounting/inventory-valuation/"
"upgrade-process-server-action>` or :ref:`after <accounting/inventory-"
"valuation/upgrade-process-manual>` upgrading to Odoo 19."
msgstr ""
"En Odoo 19, las cuentas de entrada y salida de existencias ya no se usan. "
"Cualquier saldo distinto de cero en las cuentas provisionales de existencias "
"debe transferirse a la :ref:`cuenta de valuación de existencias <accounting/"
"inventory-valuation/valuation-account>` mediante un asiento contable para "
"mantener valores de inventario precisos después de la migración. Puedes "
"realizar este ajuste :ref:`antes <accounting/inventory-valuation/upgrade-"
"process-server-action>` o :ref:`después <accounting/inventory-valuation/"
"upgrade-process-manual>` de actualizar a Odoo 19."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:281
msgid ""
"Before upgrading, review received purchase or sales orders that are not yet "
"linked to vendor bills or invoices, and post any existing draft bills/"
"invoices to reduce the open balance."
msgstr ""
"Antes de actualizar, revisa las órdenes de compra o venta recibidas que "
"todavía no estén vinculadas a facturas de proveedor o de cliente y "
"contabiliza las facturas en borrador que ya existan para reducir el saldo "
"pendiente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:285
msgid ""
"It is recommended to implement the change **after** upgrading to Odoo 19, "
"because a server action identifies the open balance in the :guilabel:`Stock "
"Interim` accounts and automatically applies the change."
msgstr ""
"Te recomendamos realizar el cambio **después** de actualizar a Odoo 19, ya "
"que una acción de servidor identifica el saldo pendiente en las "
"cuentas :guilabel:`provisionales de existencias` y aplica el cambio de forma "
"automática."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:290
msgid ""
"Account structures and valuation scenarios differ across companies. Review "
"these steps with an accountant or an Odoo inventory valuation expert to "
"ensure the setup aligns with the company's specific setup."
msgstr ""
"Las estructuras de cuentas y los casos de valuación varían según la empresa. "
"Revisa estos pasos con tu contador o con un experto en valuación de "
"inventario de Odoo para confirmar que la configuración se ajuste a las "
"necesidades de tu empresa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:297
msgid "Option 1: Server action journal entry"
msgstr "Opción 1: Asiento contable mediante una acción de servidor"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:300
msgid ""
"Use a test database created during the upgrade process first, and verify "
"the :doc:`Stock report <../../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/reporting/stock>`, accounts, and :ref:`Inventory "
"Valuation report <accounting/inventory-valuation/inventory-valuation-"
"report>` to ensure accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Primero usa una base de datos de prueba creada durante el proceso de "
"actualización y verifica el :doc:`reporte de existencias <../../../"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock>`, las "
"cuentas y el :ref:`reporte de valuación del inventario <accounting/inventory-"
"valuation/inventory-valuation-report>` para confirmar que los datos sean "
"precisos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:305
msgid ""
"After upgrading to Odoo 19, the server action must be applied to each "
"company to balance any non-zero :guilabel:`Stock Interim` accounts:"
msgstr ""
"Después de actualizar a Odoo 19, debes aplicar la acción de servidor a cada "
"empresa para saldar cualquier cuenta :guilabel:`provisional de existencias` "
"con un saldo distinto de cero:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:308
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Users & Companies --> Companies` and "
"click the relevant company."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Ajustes --> Usuarios y empresas --> Empresas` y haz "
"clic en la empresa correspondiente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:310
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` icon and select :guilabel:`Stock "
"Valuation rebalance interim Accounts`. A draft journal entry is "
"automatically generated to balance the open amount."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en el icono :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(engranaje)` y "
"selecciona :guilabel:`Volver a saldar cuentas provisionales de valuación de "
"existencias`. Luego, el sistema genera de forma automática un asiento "
"contable en borrador para saldar el importe pendiente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:312
msgid ""
"Review the draft journal entry amounts, edit them if necessary, then "
"click :guilabel:`Post`."
msgstr ""
"Revisa los importes del asiento contable en borrador y edítalos si es "
"necesario. Luego, haz clic en :guilabel:`Registrar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:313
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:346
msgid ""
"Check the General Ledger to confirm that the :guilabel:`Stock Interim` "
"accounts are balanced to zero and that the remaining amount is recorded in "
"the :guilabel:`Stock valuation` account."
msgstr ""
"Revisa el libro mayor para confirmar que las "
"cuentas :guilabel:`provisionales de existencias` tengan un saldo de cero y "
"que el importe restante se haya registrado en la cuenta "
"de :guilabel:`valuación de existencias`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:315
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Review --> Inventory Valuation` "
"and :ref:`generate an inventory variation entry <accounting/inventory-"
"valuation/closing-entry>`. The increased value on the :ref:`Valuation "
"account <accounting/inventory-valuation/valuation-account>` is then "
"transferred to the :ref:`Variation account <accounting/inventory-valuation/"
"variation-account>`, which is a new type of interim account."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Revisión --> Valuación de inventario` "
"y :ref:`genera un asiento de variación de inventario <accounting/inventory-"
"valuation/closing-entry>`. El aumento del valor en la :ref:`cuenta de "
"valuación <accounting/inventory-valuation/valuation-account>` se transfiere "
"a la :ref:`cuenta de variación <accounting/inventory-valuation/variation-"
"account>`, que es un nuevo tipo de cuenta provisional."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:320
msgid ""
"Optionally, generate :ref:`accrual entries <accounting/inventory-valuation/"
"accrual-entries>` if an accounting closing is required and the Bill to "
"Receive or |GRNI| account, etc., needs updating."
msgstr ""
"De forma opcional, genera :ref:`asientos de devengo <accounting/inventory-"
"valuation/accrual-entries>` si necesitas realizar un cierre contable y "
"actualizar la cuenta de facturas de proveedor por recibir, bienes recibidos "
"no facturados u otra cuenta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:325
msgid ""
"Journal entries can also be created manually if needed, using the same "
"process for balancing :guilabel:`Stock Interim` accounts :ref:`before "
"upgrading to Odoo 19 <accounting/inventory-valuation/upgrade-process-"
"manual>`."
msgstr ""
"También puedes crear los asientos contables de forma manual si es necesario, "
"con el mismo proceso para saldar las cuentas :guilabel:`provisionales de "
"existencias` :ref:`antes de actualizar a Odoo 19 <accounting/inventory-"
"valuation/upgrade-process-manual>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:332
msgid "Option 2: Manual journal entry"
msgstr "Opción 2: Asiento contable manual"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:334
msgid "To create the manual journal entry, follow these steps:"
msgstr "Sigue estos pasos para crear el asiento contable manual:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:336
msgid ""
"If all vendor bills or invoices can't be created for all the received "
"purchase/sales orders before the upgrade, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"Si no puedes crear todas las facturas de proveedor o de cliente "
"correspondientes a las órdenes de compra o venta recibidas antes de la "
"actualización, sigue estos pasos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:339
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> General Ledger`."
msgstr "Ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Reportes --> Libro mayor`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:340
msgid ""
"Identify the open balance in the :guilabel:`Stock Interim` accounts and "
"create a journal entry that debits/credits:"
msgstr ""
"Identifica el saldo pendiente en las cuentas :guilabel:`provisionales de "
"existencias` y crea un asiento contable que cargue/abone:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:343
msgid "The :guilabel:`Stock Interim` account(s) containing the open balance"
msgstr ""
"Las cuentas :guilabel:`provisionales de existencias` con saldo pendiente"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:344
msgid "The :guilabel:`Stock Valuation` account"
msgstr "La cuenta de :guilabel:`valuación de existencias`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:349
msgid ""
"After upgrading to Odoo 19, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Review --> "
"Inventory Valuation` and :ref:`generate an inventory variation entry "
"<accounting/inventory-valuation/closing-entry>`. The increased value on "
"the :ref:`Valuation account <accounting/inventory-valuation/valuation-"
"account>` is then transferred to the :ref:`Variation account <accounting/"
"inventory-valuation/variation-account>`, which is a new type of interim "
"account."
msgstr ""
"Después de actualizar a Odoo 19, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> "
"Revisión --> Valuación de inventario` y :ref:`genera un asiento de variación "
"de inventario <accounting/inventory-valuation/closing-entry>`. El aumento "
"del valor en la :ref:`cuenta de valuación <accounting/inventory-valuation/"
"valuation-account>` se transfiere a la :ref:`cuenta de variación <accounting/"
"inventory-valuation/variation-account>`, que es un nuevo tipo de cuenta "
"provisional."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:355
msgid ""
"Optionally, generate :ref:`accrual entries <accounting/inventory-valuation/"
"accrual-entries>` if an accounting closing is needed and the Bill to Receive "
"or |GRNI| account, etc., must be up to date."
msgstr ""
"De forma opcional, genera :ref:`asientos de devengo <accounting/inventory-"
"valuation/accrual-entries>` si necesitas realizar un cierre contable y "
"mantener actualizada la cuenta de Facturas de proveedor por recibir, Bienes "
"recibidos no facturados u otra cuenta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:5
msgid ""
"Journal entries are recorded in different **journals** to maintain an "
"organized record of a company's financial transactions. Odoo uses six "
"different types of journals to organize accounting records:"
msgstr ""
"Registra los apuntes contables en diferentes **diarios** para mantener un "
"registro organizado de las transacciones financieras de la empresa. Odoo usa "
"seis tipos de diarios distintos para organizar los registros contables:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:9
msgid ":ref:`Bank <accounting/journals/bank>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Banco <accounting/journals/bank>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:10
msgid ":ref:`Cash <accounting/journals/cash>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Efectivo <accounting/journals/cash>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:11
msgid ":ref:`Credit Card <accounting/journals/credit>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Tarjeta de crédito <accounting/journals/credit>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:12
msgid ":ref:`Sales <accounting/journals/sales>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Ventas <accounting/journals/sales>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:13
msgid ":ref:`Purchase <accounting/journals/purchase>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Compras <accounting/journals/purchase>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:14
msgid ":ref:`Miscellaneous <accounting/journals/misc>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Misceláneos <accounting/journals/misc>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:17
msgid ""
"It is possible to have multiple journals of the same type, such as two "
"separate bank journals, each for a unique bank account, or two separate "
"sales journals to track :abbr:`B2B (business to business)` versus :abbr:`B2C "
"(business to customer)` income."
msgstr ""
"Puedes tener varios diarios del mismo tipo, como dos diarios bancarios "
"separados, cada uno para una cuenta bancaria única, o dos diarios de ventas "
"separados para monitorear los ingresos :abbr:`B2B (empresa a empresa)` y los "
"ingresos :abbr:`B2C (empresa a cliente)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:21
msgid ""
"Each card on the :guilabel:`Accounting Dashboard` represents a journal. To "
"edit the configuration of a journal, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-"
"v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` on the journal card, then "
"click :guilabel:`Configuration`. Alternatively, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Journals` to select and "
"edit an existing journal or to create a new one."
msgstr ""
"Cada tarjeta en el :guilabel:`tablero de Contabilidad` representa un diario. "
"Para editar la configuración de un diario, haz clic en el :icon:`fa-ellipsis-"
"v` :guilabel:`(tres puntos verticales)` de la tarjeta del diario y luego "
"en :guilabel:`Configuración`. Como alternativa, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Diarios` para "
"seleccionar y editar un diario existente o crear uno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:26
msgid ""
"While different journal types have slightly different fields to configure, "
"some fields are consistent across all the journal types:"
msgstr ""
"Aunque los diferentes tipos de diarios tienen campos ligeramente distintos, "
"algunos campos son iguales en todos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:29
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sequence Prefix`: Each journal must have a unique code (from 1 to "
"5 characters long). The short code is used as the prefix for all journal "
"entries belonging to this journal."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Prefijo de secuencia`: cada diario debe tener un código único (de "
"1 a 5 caracteres). El código corto se utiliza como prefijo para todos los "
"asientos de diario que pertenecen a este diario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:31
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Currency`: If no currency is selected, journal items of any "
"currency can target this account. Selecting a currency restricts the journal "
"items targeting the account to that currency, regardless of the currency "
"used on the original invoice or payment request."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Moneda`: si no se selecciona ninguna moneda, los apuntes "
"contables de cualquier moneda pueden afectar a esta cuenta. Seleccionar una "
"moneda restringe los apuntes contables que afectan a la cuenta a dicha "
"moneda, independientemente de la moneda utilizada en la factura original o "
"en la solicitud de pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:35
msgid "The :guilabel:`Advanced Settings` tab contains more technical options:"
msgstr ""
"La pestaña :guilabel:`Ajustes avanzados` incluye opciones más técnicas:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:37
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Allowed accounts`: Limit which accounts are available when "
"recording journal entries in this journal. Leave this field blank to allow "
"all accounts."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cuentas permitidas`: Limita qué cuentas están disponibles al "
"registrar apuntes en este diario. Deja este campo vacío para permitir todas "
"las cuentas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:39
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Email Alias`: Set an email address to create journal entries by "
"digitizing PDFs sent to this address. This is most commonly used to "
"create :ref:`customer invoices and vendor bills <accounting/bill-"
"digitization/email-alias>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Alias de correo`: Configura un correo para crear apuntes "
"contables al digitalizar los PDFs que lleguen a esta dirección. Un uso común "
"para esta función es la creación de :ref:`facturas de cliente y de proveedor "
"<accounting/bill-digitization/email-alias>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:42
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Secure Posted Entries with Hash`: Restrict the :doc:`alterability "
"<../reporting/data_inalterability>` of this journal's entries to comply with "
"tax authorities in certain countries."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Proteger asientos registrados con hash`: Restringe "
"la :doc:`modificación <../reporting/data_inalterability>` de los asientos de "
"este diario para cumplir con las autoridades fiscales en ciertos países."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:47
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Secure Posted Entries with Hash` option cannot be removed "
"from a journal once the journal has a posted journal entry."
msgstr ""
"No puedes desactivar la opción :guilabel:`Proteger asientos registrados con "
"hash` de un diario una vez que tiene asientos registrados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:51
msgid ""
"Bank and cash journals do not have the :guilabel:`Secure Posted Entries with "
"Hash` or :guilabel:`Email Alias` fields."
msgstr ""
"Los diarios de banco y efectivo no tienen los campos :guilabel:`Proteger "
"asientos registrados con hash` ni :guilabel:`Alias de correo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:53
msgid ""
"If an :ref:`alias domain <email-inbound-custom-domain>` has not yet been "
"configured, a link to :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Configure Alias "
"Domain` is displayed instead of the :guilabel:`Email Alias` field."
msgstr ""
"Si aún no configuras un :ref:`dominio de alias <email-inbound-custom-"
"domain>`, el sistema muestra el enlace :icon:`fa-arrow-"
"right` :guilabel:`Configurar dominio de alias` en lugar del "
"campo :guilabel:`Alias de correo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:60
msgid "Bank, cash, and credit card journals"
msgstr "Diarios de banco, efectivo y tarjeta de crédito"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:62
msgid "Bank, cash, and credit card journals share the following features:"
msgstr ""
"Los diarios de banco, efectivo y tarjeta de crédito comparten lo siguiente:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:64
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Suspense Account`: :doc:`../bank/transactions` on this journal "
"are posted on this account until they are reconciled, at which point this "
"account is replaced with the account the transaction was reconciled against. "
"At any moment, the suspense account's balance in the general ledger shows "
"the balance of transactions that have not yet been reconciled."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cuenta transitoria`: Las :doc:`../bank/transactions` de este "
"diario quedan registradas en esta cuenta hasta su conciliación. Después, el "
"sistema reemplaza esta cuenta con la cuenta contra la que se concilió la "
"transacción. En cualquier momento, el saldo de la cuenta transitoria en el "
"libro mayor refleja el saldo de las transacciones sin conciliar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:70
msgid ""
"When a bank transaction is reconciled, the journal entry is modified to "
"replace the bank suspense account with the account of the journal item it is "
"reconciled with. This account is usually either:"
msgstr ""
"Al conciliar una transacción bancaria, el sistema modifica el apunte "
"contable para reemplazar la cuenta transitoria bancaria con la cuenta del "
"apunte con el que se concilió. Esta cuenta suele ser:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:74
msgid ""
"the :ref:`outstanding receipts or payments account <accounting/journals/"
"outstanding-accounts>` if reconciling with a registered payment; or"
msgstr ""
"la :ref:`cuenta de cobros o pagos pendientes <accounting/journals/"
"outstanding-accounts>` si se concilia con un pago registrado;"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:76
msgid ""
"the account receivable or payable if reconciling with an invoice or bill "
"directly."
msgstr ""
"o la cuenta por cobrar o por pagar si se concilia directamente con una "
"factura de cliente o de proveedor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:78
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Dedicated Payment Sequence`: Tick this field to use separate "
"sequences for payments and transactions posted on this journal."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Secuencia de pago dedicada`: Selecciona esta casilla para usar "
"secuencias separadas para los pagos y las transacciones registradas en este "
"diario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:82
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Dedicated Payment Sequence` field is ticked, payments that "
"use an :ref:`outstanding account <accounting/journals/outstanding-accounts>` "
"will have references that add :guilabel:`P` before the journal's short code. "
"Otherwise, the references will begin with :guilabel:`PAY`."
msgstr ""
"Si seleccionas la opción :guilabel:`Secuencia de pago dedicada`, los pagos "
"que usen una :ref:`cuenta pendiente <accounting/journals/outstanding-"
"accounts>` tendrán referencias que agregan :guilabel:`P` antes del código "
"corto del diario. De lo contrario, las referencias comienzan "
"con :guilabel:`PAY`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:87
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Incoming Payments` and :guilabel:`Outgoing Payments` tabs "
"contain the :ref:`payment methods <accounting/payments/payment-methods>` of "
"this journal. Different payment methods are available depending on the "
"journal type. If desired, set :ref:`outstanding accounts <accounting/"
"journals/outstanding-accounts>` on the payment methods."
msgstr ""
"Las pestañas :guilabel:`Pagos entrantes` y :guilabel:`Pagos salientes` "
"muestran los :ref:`métodos de pago <accounting/payments/payment-methods>` "
"disponibles en este diario. Según el tipo de diario, puedes configurar "
"cuentas pendientes en los métodos de pago. Si lo deseas, "
"configura :ref:`cuentas pendientes <accounting/journals/outstanding-"
"accounts>` en los métodos de pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:94
msgid ":doc:`multi_currency`"
msgstr ":doc:`multi_currency`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:95
msgid ":doc:`../bank/transactions`"
msgstr ":doc:`../bank/transactions`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:96
msgid "`Bank configuration <https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tVhhXw-VnGE>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Configuración bancaria <https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tVhhXw-VnGE>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:101
msgid "Outstanding accounts"
msgstr "Cuentas pendientes"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:103
msgid ""
"By default, payments in Odoo do not create journal entries, but they can be "
"configured to create journal entries by using **outstanding accounts** "
"on :ref:`bank <accounting/journals/bank>` and :ref:`cash <accounting/"
"journals/cash>` journals."
msgstr ""
"De forma predeterminada, los pagos en Odoo no crean apuntes contables, pero "
"puedes configurarlos para que los generen a través de las **cuentas "
"pendientes** en los diarios de :ref:`banco <accounting/journals/bank>` "
"y :ref:`efectivo <accounting/journals/cash>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:107
msgid ""
"An **outstanding receipts account** is where incoming payments are posted "
"until they are linked with incoming bank transactions."
msgstr ""
"Una **cuenta de cobros pendientes** es donde se registran los pagos "
"entrantes hasta que se vinculen con transacciones entrantes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:109
msgid ""
"An **outstanding payments account** is where outgoing payments are posted "
"until they are linked with outgoing bank transactions."
msgstr ""
"Una **cuenta de pagos pendientes** es donde se registran los pagos entrantes "
"hasta que se vinculen con transacciones salientes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:112
msgid ""
"These accounts are usually of :ref:`type <chart-of-account/"
"type>` :guilabel:`Current Assets` and :guilabel:`Current Liabilities`."
msgstr ""
"Estas cuentas normalmente son del :ref:`tipo <chart-of-account/"
"type>` :guilabel:`Activos corrientes` y :guilabel:`Pasivos corrientes`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:115
msgid ""
"Payments that are registered in Odoo are posted to the outstanding receipts "
"and outstanding payments accounts until they are reconciled. At any moment, "
"the outstanding receipts account's balance in the general ledger shows the "
"balance of registered incoming payments that have not yet been reconciled, "
"and the outstanding payments account's balance in the general ledger shows "
"the balance of registered outgoing payments that have not yet been "
"reconciled."
msgstr ""
"Los pagos registrados en Odoo se contabilizan en las cuentas de recibos "
"pendientes y pagos pendientes hasta que se concilian. En cualquier momento, "
"el saldo de la cuenta de recibos pendientes en el libro mayor muestra los "
"pagos entrantes registrados que aún no se han conciliado, y el saldo de la "
"cuenta de pagos pendientes muestra los pagos salientes registrados que "
"todavía no se han conciliado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:124
msgid ""
"To configure outstanding accounts, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Journals` and select or create a bank or cash journal. In "
"the :guilabel:`Incoming Payments` and :guilabel:`Outgoing Payments` tabs, "
"set :guilabel:`Outstanding Receipts accounts` and :guilabel:`Outstanding "
"Payments accounts` for each payment method that you want to create journal "
"entries."
msgstr ""
"Para configurar las cuentas pendientes, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --"
"> Configuración --> Diarios`, selecciona o crea un diario bancario o de "
"efectivo y, en las pestañas :guilabel:`Pagos entrantes` y :guilabel:`Pagos "
"salientes`, asigna las :guilabel:`cuentas de cobros pendientes` "
"y :guilabel:`cuentas de pagos pendientes` para cada método de pago que "
"quieras que genere apuntes contables."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:131
msgid ""
"If the main bank account of the journal is added as an outstanding receipts "
"account or outstanding payments account, when a payment is registered, the "
"invoice or bill's status is directly set to :guilabel:`Paid`."
msgstr ""
"Si la cuenta bancaria principal del diario se agrega como una cuenta de "
"cobros pendientes o una cuenta de pagos pendientes, cuando se registra un "
"pago el estado de la factura o el recibo se establece "
"como :guilabel:`Pagado` de inmediato."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:134
msgid ""
"If the outstanding receipts or outstanding payments account for a payment "
"method is left blank, registering a payment with that payment method will "
"not create any journal entry."
msgstr ""
"Si la cuenta de recibos o pagos pendientes para un método de pago se deja en "
"blanco, registrar un pago con ese método de pago no creará un asiento de "
"diario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:142
msgid ""
"Bank journals are used to record journal entries related to :doc:`bank "
"transactions <../bank/transactions>` and incoming and "
"outgoing :doc:`payments <../payments>`. The following fields are specific to "
"bank journals:"
msgstr ""
"Los diarios bancarios sirven para registrar apuntes contables relacionados "
"con :doc:`transacciones bancarias <../bank/transactions>` y :doc:`pagos <../"
"payments>` entrantes y salientes. Además, tienen los siguientes campos "
"específicos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:146
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bank Account`: This :guilabel:`Bank and Cash` type account is the "
"default account for this bank journal."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cuenta bancaria`: Es una cuenta de tipo :guilabel:`Banco y "
"efectivo` utilizada de forma predeterminada en este diario bancario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:148
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Account Number`: The bank account's number is used when "
"registering payments and is required for generating outgoing payment files, "
"such as :doc:`SEPA <../payments/sepa_payments>` or :ref:`NACHA <l10n_us/"
"nacha>`. To edit the bank account details, click on the :icon:`oi-arrow-"
"right` :guilabel:`(Internal link)` button next to the :guilabel:`Account "
"Number` and update the account information accordingly."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Número de Cuenta`: El número de cuenta bancaria se utiliza al "
"registrar pagos y es necesario para generar archivos de pago salientes, "
"como :doc:`SEPA <../payments/sepa_payments>` o :ref:`NACHA <l10n_us/nacha>`. "
"Para editar los detalles de la cuenta bancaria, haz clic en el "
"botón :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`(Enlace interno)` junto "
"al :guilabel:`Número de Cuenta` y actualiza la información de la cuenta "
"según corresponda."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:153
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bank`: The bank name is used when registering payments and is "
"required for generating outgoing payment files. To edit the bank account "
"details, click on the :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`(Internal link)` "
"button next to the :guilabel:`Bank` name and update the account information "
"accordingly."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Banco`: El nombre del banco se utiliza al registrar pagos y es "
"obligatorio para generar los archivos de pago saliente. Haz clic "
"en :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`(enlace interno)` junto a este campo "
"para actualizar la información."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:157
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bank Feeds`: Define the method of creating "
"bank :doc:`transactions <../bank/transactions>`, whether :guilabel:`Manual` "
"or via :doc:`Online Synchronization <../bank/bank_synchronization>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Conexiones bancarias`: Define si las :doc:`transacciones <../bank/"
"transactions>` bancarias se crean de forma :guilabel:`manual` o "
"mediante :doc:`sincronización en línea <../bank/bank_synchronization>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:160
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Split Transactions`: Split collective payments for CODA files."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Dividir transacciones`: Divide pagos colectivos para archivos "
"CODA."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:162
msgid ""
"Multiple payment methods are available for bank journals, as are "
"configurations for generating outgoing payment files, such as :doc:`SEPA <../"
"payments/sepa_payments>` or :ref:`NACHA <l10n_us/nacha>`."
msgstr ""
"Están disponibles múltiples métodos de pago para los diarios bancarios, así "
"como configuraciones para generar archivos de pago salientes, "
"como :doc:`SEPA <../payments/sepa_payments>` o :ref:`NACHA <l10n_us/nacha>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:169
msgid "Cash"
msgstr "Efectivo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:171
msgid ""
"Cash journals are used to record journal entries related to "
"cash :doc:`transactions <../bank/transactions>`. The following fields are "
"specific to cash journals:"
msgstr ""
"Los diarios de efectivo registran los apuntes contables relacionados "
"con :doc:`transacciones <../bank/transactions>` en efectivo y cuentan con "
"los siguientes campos específicos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:174
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Cash Account`: This :guilabel:`Bank and Cash` type account is the "
"default account for this cash journal."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cuenta de efectivo`: Es una cuenta de tipo :guilabel:`Banco y "
"efectivo` utilizada de forma predeterminada en este diario de efectivo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:176
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Profit Account`: This :guilabel:`Income` or :guilabel:`Other "
"Income` type account is used to register a profit when the ending balance of "
"a cash register is greater than expected."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cuenta de ganancias`: Una cuenta de tipo :guilabel:`Ingresos` "
"u :guilabel:`Otros ingresos` usada para registrar ganancias cuando el saldo "
"final de la caja registradora es mayor al esperado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:178
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Loss Account`: This :guilabel:`Expenses` type account is used to "
"register a loss when the ending balance of a cash register is less than "
"expected."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cuenta de pérdidas`: Una cuenta de tipo :guilabel:`Gastos` usada "
"para registrar pérdidas cuando el saldo final de la caja registradora es "
"menor al esperado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:181
msgid "Only manual payment methods are available for cash journals."
msgstr "Solo puedes usar métodos de pago manuales en los diarios de efectivo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:186
msgid "Credit card"
msgstr "Tarjeta de crédito"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:188
msgid ""
"Credit card journals are used to record journal entries related to credit "
"cards. The following fields are specific to credit card journals:"
msgstr ""
"Los diarios de tarjeta de crédito registran los apuntes contables "
"relacionados con las tarjetas de crédito y cuentan con los siguientes campos "
"específicos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:191
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Journal Account`: This :guilabel:`Credit Card` type account is "
"the default account for this credit card journal."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cuenta del diario`: Una cuenta de tipo :guilabel:`Tarjeta de "
"crédito` usada de forma predeterminada en este diario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:193
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bank Feeds`: Define the method of creating credit card "
"transactions, whether manual or via :doc:`Online Synchronization <../bank/"
"bank_synchronization>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Conexiones bancarias`: Define si las transacciones se crean de "
"forma manual o mediante una :doc:`sincronización en línea <../bank/"
"bank_synchronization>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:196
msgid "Only manual payment methods are available for credit card journals."
msgstr ""
"Solo puedes usar métodos de pago manuales en los diarios de tarjeta de "
"crédito."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:201
msgid "Sales, purchase, and miscellaneous journals"
msgstr "Diarios de ventas, compras y misceláneos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:208
msgid ""
"Sales journals, also known as income journals, are used to record journal "
"entries related to :doc:`customer invoices <../customer_invoices>`. The "
"following fields are specific to customer invoice journals:"
msgstr ""
"Los diarios de ventas, también conocidos como diarios de ingresos, registran "
"apuntes contables relacionados con las :doc:`facturas de cliente <../"
"customer_invoices>` y cuentan con los siguientes campos específicos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:212
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Default Income Account`: Invoices in this journal use "
"this :guilabel:`Income` or :guilabel:`Other Income` type account unless "
"overwritten by another income account set on the product category, product, "
"or invoice line itself."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cuenta de ingresos predeterminada`: Las facturas usan esta cuenta "
"de tipo :guilabel:`Ingresos` o :guilabel:`Otros ingresos` a menos que "
"definas otra cuenta de ingresos en la categoría del producto, el producto o "
"la línea de la factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:215
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Dedicated Credit Note Sequence`: Check this box to use a separate "
"sequence for the reference of credit notes that increments separately from "
"the main invoice sequence and adds an `R` to the reference before the "
"journal's short code."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Secuencia de notas de crédito dedicada`: Selecciona esta casilla "
"para usar una secuencia separada para la referencia de las notas de crédito "
"que se incrementa de manera independiente a la secuencia principal de "
"facturas y agrega una `R` a la referencia antes del código corto del diario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:218
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:247
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Dedicated Debit Note Sequence`: Check this box to use a separate "
"sequence for the reference of credit notes that increments separately from "
"the main invoice sequence and adds a `D` before the journal's short code."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Secuencia de notas de débito dedicada`: Selecciona esta casilla "
"para usar una secuencia separada para la referencia de las notas de débito "
"que se incrementa de manera independiente a la secuencia principal de "
"facturas y agrega una `D` antes del código corto del diario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:222
msgid ""
"Sales journals have additional fields in the :guilabel:`Advanced Settings` "
"tab that allow you to set the default communication format that will appear "
"on customer invoices so that the customer can refer to that particular "
"invoice when making a payment:"
msgstr ""
"Los diarios de ventas tienen campos adicionales en la "
"pestaña :guilabel:`Configuración avanzada` que permiten definir el formato "
"de referencia o comunicación predeterminado que aparecerá en las facturas de "
"los clientes, para que puedan referirse a esa factura al realizar un pago:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:226
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Communication Type`: Choose if the format of the payment "
"reference communicated to the customer should be based on the invoice number "
"or the customer's number."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tipo de comunicación`: Elige si el formato de la referencia de "
"pago que se comunica al cliente debe estar basado en el número de factura o "
"en el número del cliente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:228
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Communication Standard`: Choose the format of the payment "
"reference itself that is communicated to the customer."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Estándar de comunicación`: Elige el formato de la referencia de "
"pago que se comunica al cliente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:234
msgid "Purchase"
msgstr "Compras"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:236
msgid ""
"Purchase journals are used to record journal entries related to :doc:`vendor "
"bills <../vendor_bills>`. The following fields are specific to purchase "
"journals:"
msgstr ""
"Los diarios de compras se usan para registrar asientos contables "
"relacionados con las :doc:`facturas de proveedor <../vendor_bills>` y "
"cuentan con los siguientes campos específicos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:239
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Default Expense Account`: Vendor bills in this journal use "
"this :guilabel:`Expense` type account unless overwritten by another expense "
"account set on the product category, product, or expense."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cuenta de gastos predeterminada`: Las facturas de proveedor en "
"este diario usan esta cuenta de tipo :guilabel:`Gastos`, a menos que otra "
"cuenta de gastos se establezca en la categoría del producto, el producto o "
"el gasto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:242
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Private Part Account`: Select the account to be used to register "
"the private part of mixed expenses."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cuenta de parte privada`: Selecciona la cuenta que se usará para "
"registrar la parte privada de los gastos mixtos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:244
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Dedicated Credit Note Sequence`: Check this box to use a separate "
"sequence for the reference of credit notes that increments separately from "
"the main vendor bill sequence and adds an `R` to the reference before the "
"journal's short code."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Secuencia de notas de crédito dedicada`: Selecciona esta casilla "
"para usar una secuencia separada para la referencia de notas de crédito que "
"se incrementa de manera independiente a la secuencia principal de facturas "
"de proveedor y agrega una `R` a la referencia antes del código corto del "
"diario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:256
msgid ""
"Miscellaneous journals are used to record journal entries that are not "
"related to any of the other journal types such as tax closing journal "
"entries."
msgstr ""
"Los diarios misceláneos se usan para registrar asientos contables que no "
"están relacionados con otros tipos de diarios, como los asientos contables "
"del cierre fiscal."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:260
msgid ""
"`Tax return eLearning <https://www.odoo.com/slides/slide/tax-return-10564>`_"
msgstr ""
"`eLearning sobre declaración de impuestos <https://www.odoo.com/slides/slide/"
"tax-return-10564>`_"

