#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:199
msgid "The :guilabel:`Amount Due` is not updated."
msgstr "El :guilabel:`importe adeudado` no se actualiza."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:121
msgid ""
"After the invoice/bill is :doc:`reconciled <bank/reconciliation>` with a "
"bank transaction, the invoice/bill is marked as :guilabel:`Paid`."
msgstr ""
"Después de :doc:`conciliar <bank/reconciliation>` la factura de cliente o de "
"proveedor con una transacción bancaria, la factura aparece "
"como :guilabel:`pagada`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:124
msgid ""
"More payment information is accessible by clicking the :guilabel:`Payments` "
"smart button."
msgstr ""
"Para acceder a más información sobre el pago, haz clic en el botón "
"inteligente :guilabel:`Pagos`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:128
msgid ""
"If a bank transaction is reconciled in a different currency, a journal entry "
"is automatically created to post the currency exchange gains/loss amount."
msgstr ""
"Si concilia una transacción bancaria en una moneda distinta, Odoo crea un "
"asiento contable de forma automática para registrar la ganancia o pérdida "
"ocasionada por el cambio de divisa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:130
msgid ""
"When a bank transaction is reconciled with an invoice with cash-basis, a "
"journal entry is automatically created to post the cash-basis tax amount."
msgstr ""
"Si una transacción bancaria está conciliada con una factura sobre base de "
"efectivo, entonces se crea un asiento contable de forma automática para "
"registrar el importe del impuesto con base en efectivo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:133
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:203
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:236
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:270
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:296
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:327
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:376
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:426
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:452
msgid "Using outstanding accounts"
