#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:135
msgid ""
"If :ref:`outstanding accounts <accounting/journals/outstanding-accounts>` "
"are configured:"
msgstr ""
"Si configuraste :ref:`cuentas pendientes <accounting/journals/outstanding-"
"accounts>`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:137
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:208
msgid "A journal entry is created."
msgstr "Se crea un asiento contable."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:138
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:209
msgid ""
"The counterpart is reflected in an :ref:`outstanding receipts or payments "
"account <accounting/journals/outstanding-accounts>`."
msgstr ""
"La contrapartida se refleja en una :ref:`cuenta de cobros o pagos pendientes "
"<accounting/journals/outstanding-accounts>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:140
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:211
msgid "The :guilabel:`Amount Due` is reduced based on the payment amount."
msgstr "El :guilabel:`importe adeudado` disminuye según el importe del pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:141
msgid ""
"After the payment is :doc:`reconciled <bank/reconciliation>` with a bank "
"transaction, the invoice/bill is marked as :guilabel:`Paid`."
msgstr ""
"Después de :doc:`conciliar <bank/reconciliation>` el pago con una "
"transacción bancaria, la factura de cliente o de proveedor aparece "
"como :guilabel:`pagada`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:144
msgid ""
"More payment information is also accessible by clicking the :icon:`fa-info-"
"circle` :guilabel:`(information icon)` and clicking :guilabel:`view`."
msgstr ""
"También puedes acceder a más información sobre el pago al hacer clic en el "
"icono :icon:`fa-info-circle` (:guilabel:`icono de información`) y "
"seleccionar :guilabel:`Ver`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:148
msgid ""
"If the main bank account is set as the outstanding account on the bank "
"journal's payment method, registering the full payment on an invoice or bill "
"moves the invoice/bill directly to the :guilabel:`Paid` status without "
"requiring bank reconciliation."
msgstr ""
"Si configura la cuenta bancaria principal como la cuenta pendiente en el "
"método de pago del diario bancario, al registrar el pago total en una "
"factura de cliente o proveedor, el sistema la mueve directo al "
"estado :guilabel:`Pagado` sin necesidad de realizar la conciliación bancaria."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:154
msgid ""
"Unreconciling a payment unlinks it from the invoice or bill but does not "
"delete the payment."
msgstr ""
"Desconciliar un pago lo desvincula de la factura de cliente o proveedor, "
"pero no elimina el pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:156
msgid ""
"If a payment is (un)reconciled in a different currency, a journal entry is "
"automatically created to post the currency exchange gains/losses (reversal) "
"amount."
msgstr ""
"Si un pago está conciliado (o sin conciliar) en una moneda distinta, se crea "
"un asiento contable de forma automática para registrar el importe de las "
"ganancias o pérdidas ocasionado por el cambio de divisa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:158
msgid ""
"If a payment is (un)reconciled on an invoice with cash-basis taxes, a "
"journal entry is automatically created to post the cash-basis tax (reversal) "
"amount."
msgstr ""
"Si se concilia (o desconcilia) un pago en una factura con impuestos con base "
"de efectivo, el sistema crea un asiento contable de forma automática para "
"registrar el importe del impuesto con base de efectivo (o su anulación)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:164
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:793
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:5
msgid "Online payments"
msgstr "Pagos en línea"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:166
msgid ""
"To make invoice payment more convenient, the :guilabel:`Invoice Online "
"Payment` feature can be enabled, adding a :guilabel:`Pay Now` button to the "
"customer portal. This allows customers to view invoices online and pay "
"directly using their preferred payment method, simplifying the payment "
"process."
msgstr ""
"Para facilitar el pago de facturas, puedes activar la "
"función :guilabel:`Pago de facturas en línea`, que agrega el "
"botón :guilabel:`Pagar ahora` al portal del cliente. Así, tus clientes "
"pueden consultar sus facturas en línea y pagar con el método de pago que "
"prefieran."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:171
msgid ""
"To activate the online payment, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`Customer "
"Payments` section to enable :guilabel:`Invoice Online Payment`, and "
"click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Para activar el pago en línea, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> "
"Configuración --> Ajustes`, dirígete a la sección :guilabel:`Pagos de "
"clientes`, activa :guilabel:`Pago de facturas en línea` y haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Guardar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:175
msgid ""
"After creating the invoice, click :guilabel:`Send` to email it to the "
"customer, who receives an email with a link to view the invoice on their "
"customer portal. From there, they can click :guilabel:`Pay Now` to select "
"a :ref:`Payment Provider <payment_providers/online_providers>`."
msgstr ""
"Después de crear la factura, haz clic en :guilabel:`Enviar` para enviarla "
"por correo electrónico al cliente. El cliente recibe un correo con un enlace "
"para consultar la factura en su portal. Desde ahí, puede hacer clic "
"en :guilabel:`Pagar ahora` y seleccionar un :ref:`proveedor de pagos "
"<payment_providers/online_providers>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:180
msgid ""
"Make sure :ref:`payment providers <payment_providers/supported_providers>` "
"are configured correctly."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de que los :ref:`proveedores de pagos <payment_providers/"
"supported_providers>` estén bien configurados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:182
msgid ""
"By default, :ref:`Wire Transfer <payment_providers/bank_payments/"
"wire_transfer>` is the only enabled payment provider, but payment details "
"must still be entered."
msgstr ""
"De forma predeterminada, :ref:`Transferencia bancaria <payment_providers/"
"bank_payments/wire_transfer>` es el único proveedor de pagos habilitado, "
"pero aún debes ingresar los datos de pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:186
msgid ":doc:`/applications/finance/payment_providers`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/finance/payment_providers`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:188
msgid ""
"As soon as the customer has paid, a payment for the invoice is registered, "
"and the invoice is marked as :guilabel:`In payment`."
msgstr ""
"En cuanto el cliente paga, se registra un pago para la factura y esta "
"aparece como :guilabel:`En proceso de pago`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:195
msgid ""
"If the payment method configured in the payment provider has "
"no :ref:`outstanding accounts <accounting/journals/outstanding-accounts>`:"
msgstr ""
"Si el método de pago configurado en el proveedor de pagos no "
"tiene :ref:`cuentas pendientes <accounting/journals/outstanding-accounts>`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:198
msgid "No journal entry created."
msgstr "No se crea ningún asiento contable."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:200
msgid ""
"After the invoice is :doc:`reconciled <bank/reconciliation>` with a bank "
"transaction, the invoice is marked as :guilabel:`Paid`."
msgstr ""
"Después de :doc:`conciliar <bank/reconciliation>` la factura con una "
"transacción bancaria, la factura aparece como :guilabel:`pagada`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:205
msgid ""
"If the payment method configured in the payment provider "
"has :ref:`outstanding accounts <accounting/journals/outstanding-accounts>`:"
msgstr ""
"Si el método de pago configurado en el proveedor de pagos "
"tiene :ref:`cuentas pendientes <accounting/journals/outstanding-accounts>`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:212
msgid ""
"After :doc:`reconciliation <bank/reconciliation>` between the payment and "
"the bank transaction, the invoice is marked as :guilabel:`Paid`."
msgstr ""
"Después de la :doc:`conciliación <bank/reconciliation>` entre el pago y la "
"transacción bancaria, la factura aparece como :guilabel:`pagada`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:218
msgid "Registering payments not tied to an invoice or bill"
msgstr "Registrar pagos que no están ligados a una factura"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:220
msgid ""
"When a new payment is registered via :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Customers --> Payments` or :menuselection:`Accounting --> Vendor --> "
"Payments`, it is not directly linked to an invoice or bill."
msgstr ""
"Cuando registras un nuevo pago desde :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> "
"Clientes --> Pagos` o :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Proveedor --> Pagos`, "
"este no queda vinculado de forma directa a una factura de cliente o de "
"proveedor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:228
msgid ""
"Stand-alone payments should not be registered without "
"using :ref:`outstanding accounts <accounting/journals/outstanding-accounts>` "
"as:"
msgstr ""
"No debes registrar pagos independientes sin usar :ref:`cuentas pendientes "
"<accounting/journals/outstanding-accounts>`, ya que:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:231
msgid "No journal entries are created."
msgstr "No se crean asientos contables."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:232
msgid "The payment cannot be linked to the invoice/bill."
msgstr "No puedes vincular el pago a la factura de cliente o de proveedor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:233
msgid "The amount paid or received is not reflected in the accounting."
msgstr "El importe pagado o recibido no se refleja en la contabilidad."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:234
msgid "The :guilabel:`Amount Due` is not updated based on the payment amount."
msgstr ""
"El :guilabel:`importe adeudado` no se actualiza según el importe del pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:237
msgid ""
"For stand-alone payments using :ref:`outstanding accounts <accounting/"
"journals/outstanding-accounts>`:"
msgstr ""
"Para los pagos independientes que usan :ref:`cuentas pendientes <accounting/"
"journals/outstanding-accounts>`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:240
msgid "A journal entry is created for the payment"
msgstr "Se crea un asiento contable para el pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:241
msgid ""
"The payment's journal entry matches the :ref:`outstanding accounts "
"<accounting/journals/outstanding-accounts>` with the account receivable or "
"the account payable until the payment is manually matched with its related "
"invoice or bill."
msgstr ""
"El asiento contable del pago concilia las :ref:`cuentas pendientes "
"<accounting/journals/outstanding-accounts>` con la cuenta por cobrar o la "
"cuenta por pagar hasta que concilies el pago con su factura de cliente o de "
"proveedor correspondiente de forma manual."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:245
msgid ""
"Then, :ref:`reconciling <accounting/reconciliation/access>` the payment with "
"the bank transaction completes the payment workflow."
msgstr ""
"Después, la :ref:`conciliación <accounting/reconciliation/access>` del pago "
"con la transacción bancaria completa el flujo de pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:251
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:397
msgid "Payments matching"
msgstr "Conciliación de pagos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:254
msgid ""
"During the :doc:`bank reconciliation <bank/reconciliation>` process, a "
"remaining balance is identified if the total debits and credits do not match "
"when records are compared with bank transactions. This balance must either "
"be reconciled later or written off immediately."
msgstr ""
"Durante el proceso de :doc:`conciliación bancaria <bank/reconciliation>`, se "
"identifica un saldo restante si los débitos y créditos totales no coinciden "
"al comparar los registros con las transacciones bancarias. Es necesario que "
"concilie este saldo después o que lo anule de inmediato."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:261
msgid "For a single invoice or bill"
msgstr "Para una sola factura de cliente o de proveedor"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:267
msgid ""
"By default, payments in Odoo do not create journal entries. As a result, "
"there is no payment to match."
msgstr ""
"Los pagos en Odoo no crean asientos contables de forma predeterminada. Como "
"resultado, no hay ningún pago que conciliar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:272
msgid ""
"A blue banner appears on top of the invoice/bill when validating it, and an "
"outstanding payment exists for this specific customer or vendor. To match it "
"with the invoice or bill, click :guilabel:`Add` under :guilabel:`Outstanding "
"Credits` or :guilabel:`Outstanding Debits`."
msgstr ""
"Al validar una factura de cliente o de proveedor, aparece un mensaje azul en "
"la parte superior si existe un pago pendiente para ese cliente o proveedor. "
"Para vincularlo con la factura, haz clic en :guilabel:`Agregar` abajo "
"de :guilabel:`Créditos pendientes` o :guilabel:`Débitos pendientes`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:277
msgid "Shows the Add option to reconcile an invoice or a bill with a payment."
msgstr "Muestra la opción Agregar para conciliar una factura con un pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:280
msgid ""
"The invoice or bill is then marked as :guilabel:`In payment` until the "
"payment is :doc:`reconciled <bank/reconciliation>` with its "
"corresponding :doc:`bank transaction(s) <bank/transactions>`."
msgstr ""
"La factura de cliente o de proveedor se marca como :guilabel:`En proceso de "
"pago` hasta que el pago se :doc:`concilia <bank/reconciliation>` con "
"las :doc:`transacciones bancarias <bank/transactions>` correspondientes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:287
msgid "For multiple invoices or bills"
msgstr "Para varias facturas de cliente o de proveedor"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:293
msgid ""
"By default, payments in Odoo do not create journal entries. As a result, "
"there is no payment to match, but this feature can still be used to match "
"miscellaneous journal items."
msgstr ""
"Los pagos en Odoo no crean asientos contables de forma predeterminada. Como "
"resultado, no hay ningún pago que conciliar, pero puede usar esta función "
"para conciliar apuntes contables misceláneos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:298
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Payments matching` or :guilabel:`Auto-reconcile` tool allows "
"reconciling journal items with each other (i.e., payments with customer "
"invoices or vendor bills) either individually or in batches:"
msgstr ""
"La herramienta :guilabel:`Conciliación de pagos` o :guilabel:`Conciliación "
"automática` permite conciliar apuntes contables entre sí (es decir, pagos "
"con facturas de clientes o facturas de proveedores), de forma individual o "
"por lotes:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:302
msgid "Access the :guilabel:`Accounting Dashboard`."
msgstr "Accede al :guilabel:`tablero de Contabilidad`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:303
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`ellipsis`) button from "
"the :guilabel:`Customer Invoices` or :guilabel:`Vendor Bills` journals, and "
"select :guilabel:`Payments Matching`."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en el botón :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`tres puntos "
"verticales`) de los diarios :guilabel:`Facturas de cliente` "
"o :guilabel:`Facturas de proveedor` y selecciona :guilabel:`Conciliación de "
"pagos`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:306
msgid ""
"Alternatively, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Accounting --> "
"Reconcile`."
msgstr ""
"Como alternativa, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Contabilidad --> "
"Conciliar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:308
msgid ""
"To manually :guilabel:`Reconcile` journal items, select the individual items "
"from the list view and click :guilabel:`Reconcile`."
msgstr ""
"Para conciliar los apuntes contables de forma manual, selecciónelos de la "
"vista de lista y haga clic en :guilabel:`Conciliar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:314
msgid "Auto-Reconcile Feature"
msgstr "Función de conciliación automática"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:320
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:329
msgid "To use the :guilabel:`Auto-Reconcile` feature, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
