#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:322
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:331
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Journal Items to reconcile` list view, "
"click :guilabel:`Auto-Reconcile` next to the receivable or payable account "
"(or a specific contact's group of journal items in that account)."
msgstr ""
"En la vista de lista de :guilabel:`apuntes contables por conciliar`, haga "
"clic en :guilabel:`Conciliación automática` junto a la cuenta por cobrar o "
"por pagar (o un grupo específico de apuntes contables de un contacto en esa "
"cuenta)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:325
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Reconcile automatically` window, "
"click :guilabel:`Reconcile`."
msgstr ""
"En la ventana :guilabel:`Conciliar de forma automática`, haga clic "
"en :guilabel:`Conciliar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:334
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Reconcile Automatically` window, set "
"the :guilabel:`Reconcile` field depending on how you want to match journal "
"items:"
msgstr ""
"En la ventana :guilabel:`Conciliar de forma automática`, configure el "
"campo :guilabel:`Conciliar` de acuerdo a la manera en la que desee conciliar "
"los apuntes contables:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:337
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Perfect Match`: Each debit journal item will be matched with the "
"corresponding credit journal item of the same value."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Coincidencia perfecta`: Cada apunte contable de débito se "
"conciliará con el apunte contable de crédito correspondiente del mismo valor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:339
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Clear Accounts`: All reconciled journal items will have the same "
"matching number, as they are selected from the same account."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cuentas de compensación`: Todos los apuntes contables conciliados "
"tendrán el mismo número de conciliación, ya que se seleccionan de la misma "
"cuenta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:344
msgid ""
"Invoices and bills are automatically matched to their corresponding payments "
"and marked as :guilabel:`In payment` until they are :doc:`reconciled <bank/"
"reconciliation>` with their corresponding :doc:`bank transactions <bank/"
"transactions>`."
msgstr ""
"Las facturas de cliente y de proveedor se concilian de forma automática con "
"sus pagos correspondientes y se marcan como :guilabel:`En proceso de pago` "
"hasta que se :doc:`concilien <bank/reconciliation>` con "
"las :doc:`transacciones bancarias <bank/transactions>` correspondientes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:351
msgid ""
"Registering payments on multiple invoices/credit notes or bills/refunds "
"(group payments)"
msgstr ""
"Registrar pagos en varias facturas de cliente, notas de crédito, facturas de "
"proveedor o reembolsos (pagos por grupo)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:353
msgid ""
"To register payments on multiple invoices/credit notes or bills/refunds, "
"follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
