"de crédito, facturas de proveedor o reembolsos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:355
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Invoices/Credit Notes` "
"or :menuselection:`Accounting --> Vendors --> Bills/Refunds`."
msgstr ""
"Vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Clientes --> Facturas/Notas de "
"crédito` o a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Proveedores --> Facturas/"
"Reembolsos`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:357
msgid ""
"In the list view, click into the search bar, group by :guilabel:`Payment "
"Method`, select the relevant invoices/credit notes or bills/refunds and "
"click :guilabel:`Pay`."
msgstr ""
"En la vista de lista, haga clic en la barra de búsqueda, agrupe "
"por :guilabel:`método de pago`, seleccione las facturas de cliente, notas de "
"crédito, facturas de proveedor o reembolsos correspondientes y haga clic "
"en :guilabel:`Pagar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:359
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Pay` window, select the :guilabel:`Journal` and "
"the :guilabel:`Payment Date`."
msgstr ""
"Seleccione el :guilabel:`diario` y la :guilabel:`fecha de pago` en la "
"ventana :guilabel:`Pagar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:360
msgid ""
"If previously set, the contact's preferred :guilabel:`Payment Method` is "
"automatically selected by default but can be updated if necessary."
msgstr ""
"Si configuró el :guilabel:`método de pago` preferido del contacto con "
"anterioridad, el sistema lo seleccionará de forma predeterminada. Puede "
"actualizarlo si es necesario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:365
msgid ""
"To combine all payments from the same contact into a single payment, enable "
"the :guilabel:`Group Payments` option, or leave it unchecked to create "
"separate payments."
msgstr ""
"Active la opción :guilabel:`Agrupar pagos` para combinar todos los pagos del "
"mismo contacto en uno solo o déjela desactivada para crear pagos separados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:367
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Create payment`."
msgstr "Haga clic en :guilabel:`Crear pago`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:373
msgid ""
"The invoices or bills are then marked as :guilabel:`In payment` until they "
"are :doc:`reconciled <bank/reconciliation>` with the bank transactions."
msgstr ""
"Las facturas de cliente o de proveedor se marcan como :guilabel:`En proceso "
"de pago` hasta que quedan :doc:`conciliadas <bank/reconciliation>` con sus "
"transacciones bancarias."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:378
msgid ""
"The invoices or bills are then marked as :guilabel:`In payment` until the "
"bank transactions are :doc:`reconciled <bank/reconciliation>` with the "
"payments."
msgstr ""
"Las facturas de cliente o de proveedor se marcan como :guilabel:`En proceso "
"de pago` hasta las transacciones bancarias están :doc:`conciliadas <bank/"
"reconciliation>` con sus pagos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:384
msgid ""
"Registering a single payment for multiple customers or vendors (batch "
"payments)"
msgstr ""
"Registrar un solo pago para varios clientes o proveedores (pagos por lote)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:386
msgid ""
"Batch payments allow grouping payments from multiple customers to "
"ease :doc:`reconciliation <bank/reconciliation>`. They are also useful when "
"depositing :doc:`checks <payments/pay_checks>` or cash payments to the bank "
"or for generating bank payment files such as :doc:`SEPA <payments/"
"sepa_payments>` or :ref:`NACHA <l10n_us/nacha>`."
msgstr ""
"Los pagos por lotes permiten agrupar pagos de múltiples clientes para "
"facilitar la :doc:`conciliación <bank/reconciliation>`. También son útiles "
"al depositar :doc:`cheques <payments/pay_checks>` o pagos en efectivo en el "
"banco o para generar archivos de pago bancarios como :doc:`SEPA <payments/"
"sepa_payments>` o :ref:`NACHA <l10n_us/nacha>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:392
msgid ":doc:`payments/batch`"
msgstr ":doc:`payments/batch`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:399
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Payments matching` tool opens all unreconciled journal items "
"and allows them to be processed individually, matching all payments and "
"journal items. Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Accounting --> "
"Reconcile` or go to the :guilabel:`Accounting Dashboard`, click "
"the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`ellipsis`) button from "
"the :guilabel:`Sales` or :guilabel:`Purchases` journals, and "
"select :guilabel:`Payments Matching`."
msgstr ""
"La herramienta :guilabel:`Conciliación de pagos` abre todos los apuntes "
"contables que aún no se han conciliado y te permite procesarlos uno por uno "
"para conciliar todos los pagos y apuntes contables. Ve "
"a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Contabilidad --> Conciliar` o accede "
"al :guilabel:`tablero de Contabilidad`, haz clic en el botón :icon:`fa-"
"ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`tres puntos verticales`) de los "
"diarios :guilabel:`Ventas` o :guilabel:`Compras` y "
"selecciona :guilabel:`Conciliación de pagos`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:407
msgid ""
"During the :doc:`reconciliation <bank/reconciliation>`, if the sum of the "
"debits and credits does not match, there is a remaining balance. This either "
"needs to be reconciled at a later date or written off directly."
msgstr ""
