#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/follow_up.rst:130
msgid "Customer statement"
msgstr "Estado de cuenta del cliente"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/follow_up.rst:132
msgid ""
"To get a comprehensive overview of a customer's account status, click "
"the :guilabel:`Customer Statement` smart button on the customer's form. This "
"statement corresponds to the :ref:`Partner Ledger <accounting/invoices/"
"partner-ledger>` report's portion specific to that customer."
msgstr ""
"Haga clic en el botón inteligente :guilabel:`Estado de cuenta de cliente` en "
"el formulario del cliente para obtener una visión completa del estado de "
"cuenta. Este estado corresponde a la sección específica de ese cliente en el "
"reporte de :ref:`libro mayor de la empresa <accounting/invoices/partner-"
"ledger>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/follow_up.rst:136
msgid ""
"To send it to the customer, click :guilabel:`Send`, change "
"the :guilabel:`Email Template` if needed, and click :guilabel:`Print & Send`."
msgstr ""
"Para enviárselo al cliente, haga clic en :guilabel:`Enviar`, cambie "
"la :guilabel:`plantilla de correo electrónico` si es necesario y haga clic "
"en :guilabel:`Imprimir y enviar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/follow_up.rst:139
msgid ""
"To view the customer statements for multiple customers at once, select the "
"customers from the :guilabel:`Customers` list view, click :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)`, and select :guilabel:`Open Customer Statements`."
msgstr ""
"Para ver los estados de cuenta de varios clientes a la vez, seleccione los "
"clientes desde la vista de lista de :guilabel:`clientes`, haga clic "
"en :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Acciones)` y seleccione :guilabel:`Abrir "
"estados de cuenta del cliente`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/follow_up.rst:143
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/follow_up.rst:159
