#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:323
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`PDF` or :guilabel:`XLSX` to generate a PDF or XLSX file, "
"respectively."
msgstr ""
"Haga clic en :guilabel:`PDF` o en :guilabel:`XLSX` ´para generar el archivo "
"con la extensión correspondiente al nombre de la opción."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/follow_up.rst:148
msgid "Follow-up report"
msgstr "Reporte se seguimiento"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/follow_up.rst:150
msgid ""
"To get a complete overview of a customer's due invoices, separating those "
"that are due from those that are overdue, click the :ref:`Customer Statement "
"<accounting/follow_up/customer-statement>` smart button on the customer's "
"form. Then, click :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`Report: Customer Statement` and "
"select :guilabel:`Follow-Up Report`."
msgstr ""
"Para obtener un resumen completo de las facturas que el cliente no ha pagado "
"y separar aquellas que debe pagar en el futuro de aquellas de las que ya "
"pasó su fecha de pago, haga clic en el botón inteligente :ref:`Estado de "
"cuenta del cliente <accounting/follow_up/customer-statement>` que aparece en "
"el formulario del cliente. Después, haga clic en :icon:`fa-"
"book` :guilabel:`Reportes: estado de cuenta del cliente` y "
"seleccione :guilabel:`Reporte de seguimiento`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/follow_up.rst:155
msgid ""
"To view the follow-up report for all customers at once, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Partner Ledger`. Then, "
"click :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`Report:` and select :guilabel:`Follow-Up "
"Report`."
msgstr ""
"Para ver el reporte de seguimiento de todos los clientes al mismo tiempo, "
"vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Reportes --> Libro mayor de la "
"empresa`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:3
msgid "Pay by checks"
msgstr "Pagos con cheques"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:5
msgid ""
"When paying a vendor bill, checks can be selected as a payment method and "
"can be printed. Then the check and bank statement can be reconciled."
msgstr ""
"Al pagar una factura de proveedor, puedes seleccionar los cheques como "
"método de pago e imprimirlos. Después, puedes conciliar el cheque y el "
"extracto bancario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:13
msgid ""
"To activate the checks payment method, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`Vendor Payments` "
"section, enable :guilabel:`Checks`, then click :guilabel:`Save`. Next, "
"select a :guilabel:`Check Layout`, then :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Para activar el método de pago con cheque, ve a "
":menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Ajustes`, desplázate "
"hacia abajo hasta la sección :guilabel:`Pagos a proveedores`, habilita "
":guilabel:`Cheques` y haz clic en :guilabel:`Guardar`. Luego, selecciona un "
":guilabel:`Diseño de cheque` y haz clic en :guilabel:`Guardar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:18
msgid ""
"Some countries use specific check layouts, which sometimes require "
"installing a dedicated module."
msgstr ""
"Algunos países utilizan diseños de cheque específicos, lo que en ocasiones "
"requiere instalar un módulo específico."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:20
msgid "Several configuration options are available:"
msgstr "Hay varias opciones de configuración disponibles:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:22
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Multi-Pages Check Stub`: enable the check stub to span multiple "
"pages when the number of invoices or payments associated with a single check "
"exceeds the available space on a single page."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Talón de cheque de varias páginas`: habilita que el talón del "
"cheque abarque varias páginas cuando el número de facturas o pagos asociados "
"a un solo cheque supere el espacio disponible en una sola página."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:25
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Check Top Margin`: define the top margin used when printing "
"checks."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Margen superior del cheque`: define el margen superior que se "
"utiliza al imprimir cheques."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:26
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Check Left Margin`: define the left margin used when printing "
"checks."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Margen izquierdo del cheque`: define el margen izquierdo que se "
"utiliza al imprimir cheques."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:29
msgid ""
"Once activated, the :guilabel:`Checks` payment method is automatically set "
"up in the :guilabel:`Outgoing Payments` tab of bank journals."
msgstr ""
"Una vez activado, el método de pago :guilabel:`Cheques` se configura de "
"forma automática en la pestaña :guilabel:`Pagos salientes` de los diarios "
"bancarios."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:31
msgid ""
"Some localizations have blank paper formats. They can be used to print the "
"information on the check as needed. This requires the use of "
"both :abbr:`MICR (Magnetic Ink Character Recognition)` ink or toner that "
"complies with check-printing standards and check-quality paper. Other "
"information, such as the company name, bank account, and check number, is "
"printed when creating the blank check."
msgstr ""
"Algunas localizaciones cuentan con formatos de papel en blanco. Se pueden "
"utilizar para imprimir la información en el cheque según sea necesario. Para "
"esto se necesita tanto tinta o tóner :abbr:`MICR (reconocimiento de "
"caracteres de tinta magnética)` que cumpla con los estándares de impresión "
"de cheques como papel de calidad para cheques. Otra información, como el "
"nombre de la empresa, la cuenta bancaria y el número de cheque, se imprime "
"al crear el cheque en blanco."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:36
msgid ""
"Pre-printed check formats (non-blank checks) require pre-printed paper from "
"a third-party vendor."
msgstr ""
"Los formatos de cheques preimpresos (cheques que no están en blanco) "
"requieren papel preimpreso de un proveedor externo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:42
msgid "Pay a vendor bill"
msgstr "Pagar una factura de proveedor"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:44
msgid "To pay a vendor bill with a check, follow these steps:"
msgstr "Para pagar una factura de proveedor con un cheque, sigue estos pasos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:46
msgid ""
"Register the payment by going to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Vendors --> "
"Bills` and opening the relevant vendor bill. Once it is confirmed, "
"click :guilabel:`Pay`, set the :guilabel:`Payment Method` "
"to :guilabel:`Checks`, and click :guilabel:`Create Payment`."
msgstr ""
"Registra el pago en :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Proveedores --> "
"Facturas` y abre la factura de proveedor correspondiente. Una vez "
"confirmada, haz clic en :guilabel:`Pagar`, establece el :guilabel:`Método de "
"pago` en :guilabel:`Cheques` y haz clic en :guilabel:`Crear pago`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:49
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Payments` smart button to access the check payment, and "
"click :guilabel:`Print Check`. In the pop-up, specify the pre-printed check "
"number to ensure the corresponding check number is recorded on the payment."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en el botón inteligente :guilabel:`Pagos` para acceder al pago con "
"cheque y haz clic en :guilabel:`Imprimir cheque`. En la ventana emergente, "
"especifica el número de cheque preimpreso para asegurarte de que el número "
"de cheque correspondiente quede registrado en el pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:52
msgid ""
"Create a transaction in the bank journal, and :ref:`reconcile <accounting/"
"reconciliation/reconcile>` it with the related vendor bill or related check "
"to mark the vendor bill as :guilabel:`Paid`."
msgstr ""
"Crea una transacción en el diario bancario y :ref:`concíliala <accounting/"
"reconciliation/reconcile>` con la factura de proveedor o el cheque "
"relacionado para marcar la factura de proveedor como :guilabel:`Pagado`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:57
msgid "Once printed, several options are available:"
msgstr "Una vez impreso, hay varias opciones disponibles:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:59
msgid ":guilabel:`Void Check`: click to cancel the check payment."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Anular cheque`: haz clic para cancelar el pago con cheque."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:60
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Reject`: click if the check was rejected. The payment status is "
"then set to :guilabel:`Rejected`, and the related bill is no longer marked "
"as :guilabel:`Paid`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Rechazar`: haz clic si el cheque fue rechazado. El estado del "
"pago cambiará a :guilabel:`Rechazado` y la factura relacionada ya no estará "
"marcada como :guilabel:`Pagado`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:64
msgid ""
"Alternatively, from the :guilabel:`Accounting Dashboard`, "
"click :guilabel:`Checks to print` under the :guilabel:`Bank` journal card. "
"Then, open the relevant check and click :guilabel:`Print Check`."
msgstr ""
"De forma alternativa, desde el :guilabel:`Tablero de Contabilidad`, haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Cheques por imprimir` en la tarjeta del diario de "
":guilabel:`Banco`. Después, abre el cheque correspondiente y haz clic en "
":guilabel:`Imprimir cheque`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:67
msgid ""
"To print multiple checks in batch, select the check payments from the list "
"view, click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon and "
"click :guilabel:`Print`."
msgstr ""
"Para imprimir varios cheques en lote, selecciona los pagos con cheque desde "
"la vista de lista, haz clic en el icono :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Acciones)"
"` y haz clic en :guilabel:`Imprimir`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:71
msgid ""
":ref:`Registering payments from an invoice or bill <accounting/payments/from-"
"invoice-bill>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Registrar pagos desde una factura de cliente o de proveedor "
"<accounting/payments/from-invoice-bill>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:3
msgid "SEPA payments"
msgstr "Pagos SEPA"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:5
msgid ""
":abbr:`SEPA (Single Euro Payments Area)` is a payment integration initiative "
"of the European Union that facilitates standardized, simplified electronic "
"payments in **euro** across SEPA countries."
msgstr ""
":abbr:`SEPA (Área Única de Pagos en Euros)` es una iniciativa de integración "
"de pagos de la Unión Europea que facilita pagos electrónicos estandarizados "
"y simplificados en **euros** en los países SEPA."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:8
msgid ""
"With :ref:`SEPA Direct Debit (SDD) <accounting/sepa_payments/sdd>`, "
"customers sign a mandate that authorizes you to collect future payments from "
"their bank accounts. This is particularly useful for "
"recurring :doc:`subscription <../../../sales/subscriptions>` payments. You "
"can keep records of these mandates in Odoo and :ref:`generate XML files "
"<accounting/sepa_payments/XML>` indicating to the bank which payments to "
"collect from customers."
msgstr ""
"Con :ref:`Débito Directo SEPA (SDD) <accounting/sepa_payments/sdd>`, los "
"clientes firman un mandato que te autoriza a cobrar futuros pagos desde sus "
"cuentas bancarias. Esto es particularmente útil para pagos recurrentes "
"de :doc:`suscripciones <../../../sales/subscriptions>`. Puedes mantener "
"registros de estos mandatos en Odoo y :ref:`generar archivos XML <accounting/"
"sepa_payments/XML>` que indiquen al banco qué pagos cobrar de los clientes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:14
msgid ""
"Unlike :abbr:`SDD (SEPA Direct Debit)`, :ref:`SEPA Credit Transfer (SCT) "
"<accounting/sepa_payments/sct>` is an outgoing payment method where you "
"\"push\" funds to a recipient. It is the standard for handling vendor bills, "
"employee salaries, and one-off transfers. These payments can also be grouped "
"into a :ref:`single XML file <accounting/sepa_payments/XML>` to upload to "
"your bank."
msgstr ""
"A diferencia del :abbr:`SDD (Débito Directo SEPA)`, la :ref:`Transferencia "
"de Crédito SEPA (SCT) <accounting/sepa_payments/sct>` es un método de pago "
"saliente donde \"empujas\" fondos a un destinatario. Es el estándar para "
"manejar facturas de proveedores, salarios de empleados y transferencias "
"únicas. Estos pagos también pueden agruparse en un :ref:`único archivo XML "
"<accounting/sepa_payments/XML>` para subir a tu banco."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:21
msgid ""
"`List of all SEPA countries <https://www.europeanpaymentscouncil.eu/document-"
"library/other/epc-list-sepa-scheme-countries>`_."
msgstr ""
"`Lista de todos los países SEPA <https://www.europeanpaymentscouncil.eu/"
"document-library/other/epc-list-sepa-scheme-countries>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:23
msgid ""
"Depending on the localization package installed, the **SEPA Direct Debit** "
"and **SEPA Credit Transfer / ISO20022** modules may be installed by default. "
"If not, they need to be :ref:`installed <general/install>`."
msgstr ""
"Dependiendo del paquete de localización instalado, los módulos **Débito "
"Directo SEPA** y **Transferencia de Crédito SEPA / ISO20022** pueden estar "
"instalados por defecto. Si no, deben :ref:`instalarse <general/install>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:28
msgid ""
"SDD and SCT payment methods are **only valid for transactions in EUR "
"currency**. If your company is located in the :abbr:`EFTA (European Free "
"Trade Assocation)` region, a :abbr:`non-EEA (non-European Economic Area)` "
"SEPA country, or a :abbr:`non-EEA (non-European Economic Area)` SEPA "
"territory, consult the :ref:`ISO 20022 <accounting/sepa_payments/iso20022>` "
"section."
msgstr ""
"Los métodos de pago SDD y SCT son **válidos únicamente para transacciones en "
"moneda EUR**. Si tu empresa está ubicada en la región :abbr:`AELC "
"(Asociación Europea de Libre Comercio)`, un país SEPA :abbr:`no EEE (no "
"perteneciente al Espacio Económico Europeo)`, o un territorio SEPA :abbr:`no "
"EEE (no perteneciente al Espacio Económico Europeo)`, consulta la "
"sección :ref:`ISO 20022 <accounting/sepa_payments/iso20022>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:34
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:155
