#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:46
msgid ""
"To enable SDD for customer payments, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, scroll to the :guilabel:`Customer Payments` "
"section, enable :guilabel:`SEPA Direct Debit (SDD)`, and "
"click :guilabel:`Save`. Then, scroll to the :guilabel:`Customer Payments` "
"section again, set the company's :guilabel:`Creditor Identifier`, and "
"click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Para habilitar SDD para pagos de clientes, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad "
"--> Configuración --> Ajustes`, desplázate hasta la sección :guilabel:`Pagos "
"de clientes`, habilita :guilabel:`Débito Directo SEPA (SDD)` y haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Guardar`. Luego, desplázate nuevamente hasta la "
"sección :guilabel:`Pagos de clientes`, establece el :guilabel:`Identificador "
"de acreedor` de la empresa y haz clic en :guilabel:`Guardar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:52
msgid ""
"The creditor identifier is provided by your bank or the authority "
"responsible for delivering it in your country. For testing purposes, you can "
"use the test creditor identifier `DE98ZZZ09999999999`."
msgstr ""
"El identificador de acreedor es proporcionado por tu banco o por la "
"autoridad responsable de entregarlo en tu país. Para fines de prueba, puedes "
"usar el identificador de acreedor de prueba `DE98ZZZ09999999999`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:59
msgid "Mandates"
msgstr "Mandatos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:61
msgid ""
"An SDD mandate is a legal document authorizing a company to debit funds from "
"a customer's bank account. It includes key information, such as the "
"customer's name and IBAN, the mandate's start and end date, and the "
"mandate's unique identifier. The mandate form must be filled in and signed "
"by the customer."
msgstr ""
"Un mandato SDD es un documento legal que autoriza a una empresa a debitar "
"fondos de la cuenta bancaria de un cliente. Incluye información clave, como "
"el nombre del cliente y su IBAN, la fecha de inicio y fin del mandato, y el "
"identificador único del mandato. El formulario del mandato debe ser "
"completado y firmado por el cliente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:67
msgid "Creating mandates"
msgstr "Crear mandatos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:70
msgid ""
":abbr:`SDD (SEPA Direct Debit)` mandates are created automatically as "
"a :guilabel:`Draft` for sales orders paid online using the :ref:`SEPA Direct "
"Debit payment method <payment_providers/bank_payments/sdd>`. The mandate is "
"validated once an initial payment (made via wire transfer) is received and "
"the :doc:`bank transaction <../bank/transactions>` is matched with the "
"payment transaction."
msgstr ""
":abbr:`Los mandatos SDD (Débito directo SEPA)` se crean automáticamente como "
"un :guilabel:`Borrador` para las órdenes de venta pagadas en línea usando el "
":ref:`método de pago Débito directo SEPA <payment_providers/bank_payments/"
"sdd>`. El mandato se valida una vez que se recibe un pago inicial (realizado "
"mediante transferencia bancaria) y se concilia la :doc:`transacción bancaria "
"<../bank/transactions>` con la transacción de pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:76
msgid "To create an SDD mandate manually, follow these steps:"
msgstr "Para crear un mandato SDD de forma manual, sigue estos pasos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:78
msgid ""
"Ensure a valid IBAN is defined for the :doc:`bank journal <../bank>` used to "
"receive SDD payments for the mandate."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de que se haya definido un IBAN válido para el :doc:`diario de "
"banco <../bank>` que se utilizará para recibir los pagos SDD del mandato."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:80
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Direct Debit Mandates` "
"and click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Clientes --> Mandatos de débito "
"directo` y haz clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:82
msgid "Select or create the relevant :guilabel:`Customer`."
msgstr "Selecciona o crea el :guilabel:`Cliente` pertinente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:83
msgid ""
"Enter the customer's :guilabel:`IBAN`, i.e., the account from which payments "
"are collected."
msgstr ""
"Ingresa el :guilabel:`IBAN` del cliente, es decir, la cuenta desde la que se "
"cobrarán los pagos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:84
msgid ""
"Select the :guilabel:`SDD Scheme`, depending on the type of "
"customer: :guilabel:`CORE` for B2C customers or :guilabel:`B2B` for B2B "
"customers."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona el :guilabel:`Esquema SDD`, dependiendo del tipo de cliente: "
":guilabel:`CORE` para clientes B2C o :guilabel:`B2B` para clientes B2B."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:88
msgid ""
"The B2B scheme is an optional scheme, offered exclusively to business "
"payers. Some banks or businesses might not accept B2B SDD."
msgstr ""
"El esquema B2B es un esquema opcional, ofrecido exclusivamente a pagadores "
"empresariales. Algunos bancos o empresas pueden no aceptar SDD B2B."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:91
msgid ""
"Select the date after which the mandate is closed automatically in "
"the :guilabel:`Validity` field. If left empty, the mandate remains active "
"until it is closed or revoked."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona la fecha a partir de la cual el mandato se cerrará "
"automáticamente en el campo :guilabel:`Validez`. Si lo dejas vacío, el "
"mandato seguirá activo hasta que se cierre o revoque."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:93
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Send & Print` to generate a PDF of the mandate form, then "
"send it to the customer for signature."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Enviar e imprimir` para generar un PDF del formulario "
"del mandato y luego enviarlo al cliente para su firma."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:95
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Validate` to activate the mandate."
msgstr "Haga clic en :guilabel:`Validar` para activar el mandato."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:98
msgid ""
"To print the mandate form after the mandate has been validated, click "
"the :icon:`fa-cog` (:guilabel:`Actions`) icon, then select :icon:`fa-"
"print` :guilabel:`Mandate form`."
msgstr ""
"Para imprimir el formulario de mandato después de que se haya validado, haz "
"clic en el icono :icon:`fa-cog` (:guilabel:`Acciones`), luego selecciona "
":icon:`fa-print` :guilabel:`Formulario de mandato`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:101
msgid ""
"Once an SDD mandate is active, subsequent SDD payments can be made via Odoo "
"and collected by :ref:`uploading them to your online banking interface "
"<accounting/sepa_payments/XML>`."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que un mandato SDD está activo, los pagos SDD posteriores se pueden "
"realizar a través de Odoo y cobrar :ref:`subiéndolos a tu interfaz bancaria "
"en línea <accounting/sepa_payments/XML>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:107
msgid "Closing or revoking a mandate"
msgstr "Cerrar o revocar un mandato"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:109
msgid ""
"To close or revoke a mandate, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers "
"--> Direct Debit Mandates`, select the relevant mandate, and "
"click :guilabel:`Close` or :guilabel:`Revoke`."
msgstr ""
"Para cerrar o revocar un mandato, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> "
"Clientes --> Mandatos de débito directo`, selecciona el mandato "
"correspondiente y haz clic en :guilabel:`Cerrar` o :guilabel:`Revocar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:112
msgid ""
"**Closing** a mandate updates the mandate's end day to the current day. "
"Invoices issued after the present day will not be processed with an SDD "
"payment. **Revoking** a mandate immediately disables it. No SDD payment can "
"be registered anymore, regardless of the invoice's date. However, payments "
"that have already been registered are still included in the next :ref:`SDD "
"XML file <accounting/sepa_payments/XML>`."
msgstr ""
"**Cerrar** un mandato actualiza la fecha de finalización del mandato al día "
"actual. Las facturas emitidas después del día presente no se procesarán con "
"un pago SDD. **Revocar** un mandato lo desactiva de inmediato. No se puede "
"registrar ningún pago SDD más, independientemente de la fecha de la factura. "
"Sin embargo, los pagos que ya han sido registrados aún se incluyen en el "
"siguiente :ref:`archivo XML SDD <accounting/sepa_payments/XML>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:119
msgid ""
"Mandates are automatically closed 36 months after the date of the last "
"collection."
msgstr ""
"Los mandatos se cierran de forma automática 36 meses después de la fecha del "
"último cobro."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:120
msgid "Closed or revoked mandates cannot be reactivated."
msgstr "Los mandatos cerrados o revocados no pueden volver a abrirse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:125
msgid "Processing SDD payments"
msgstr "Procesamiento de pagos SDD"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:127
msgid ""
"All registered SDD payments can be processed at once by uploading an XML "
"file containing a batch of all posted SDD payments to your online banking "
"interface. To do so, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"Todos los pagos SDD registrados se pueden procesar de una vez cargando un "
"archivo XML que contiene un lote de todos los pagos SDD publicados en tu "
"interfaz de banca en línea. Para hacerlo, sigue estos pasos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:130
msgid ""
":ref:`Create a batch payment <accounting/batch/creation>` and include the "
"SDD payments to collect."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Crea un pago por lotes <accounting/batch/creation>` e incluye los "
"pagos de domiciliación bancaria que deseas cobrar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:134
msgid ""
"You can filter payments by SDD scheme using the :guilabel:`SDD CORE` "
"and :guilabel:`SDD B2B` filters."
msgstr ""
"Puede filtrar los pagos por esquema de domiciliación bancaria SEPA usando "
"los filtros :guilabel:`SDD CORE` y :guilabel:`SDD B2B`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:137
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Validate` the batch payment. The XML file is generated "
"automatically and available for download in the chatter."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Valide` el pago por lote. El archivo XML se genera de forma "
"automática y estará disponible para descargar desde el chatter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:139
msgid ""
"Download the XML file and upload it to your online banking interface to "
"process the payments."
msgstr ""
"Descargue el archivo XML y súbalo a su interfaz de banca en línea para "
"procesar los pagos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:140
msgid ""
"Once the SDD batch payment has been received, :doc:`reconcile the "
"transaction <../bank/reconciliation>` with the batch payment to mark the "
"related invoices as :guilabel:`Paid`."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que se haya recibido el pago por lotes de domiciliación "
"bancaria, :doc:`concilia la transacción <../bank/reconciliation>` con el "
"pago por lotes para marcar las facturas relacionadas "
"como :guilabel:`Pagadas`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:145
msgid ""
"To view the payments and invoices linked to a specific SDD mandate, click "
"the :guilabel:`Collections` and :guilabel:`Invoices Paid` smart button on "
"the :ref:`Direct Debit Mandate <accounting/sepa_payments/sdd>` form."
msgstr ""
"Para ver los pagos y facturas vinculados a un mandato de domiciliación "
"bancaria específico, haz clic en los botones inteligentes :guilabel:`Cobros` "
"y :guilabel:`Facturas pagadas` en el formulario :ref:`Mandato de "
"domiciliación bancaria <accounting/sepa_payments/sdd>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:150
msgid ""
"The files generated by Odoo comply with the SDD **PAIN.008.001.02** "
"specifications, as required by the SEPA customer-to-bank `implementation "
"guidelines <https://www.europeanpaymentscouncil.eu/document-library/"
"implementation-guidelines/sepa-credit-transfer-customer-psp-"
"implementation>`_, which ensures compatibility with banks."
msgstr ""
"Los archivos generados por Odoo cumplen con las especificaciones "
"**PAIN.008.001.02** de domiciliación bancaria, según lo requerido por las "
"`directrices de implementación cliente-banco <https://"
"www.europeanpaymentscouncil.eu/document-library/implementation-guidelines/"
"sepa-credit-transfer-customer-psp-implementation>`_ de SEPA, lo que "
"garantiza la compatibilidad con los bancos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:156
msgid ":doc:`SEPA Direct Debit for online payments <../../payment_providers>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Domiciliación bancaria SEPA para pagos en línea <../../"
"payment_providers>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:159
msgid "SDD rejections"
msgstr "Rechazos de domiciliación bancaria"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:161
msgid ""
"SDD rejections can occur for several reasons, the most common being "
"insufficient funds in the customer's account. With SDD, the recipient's "
"account is credited before the funds are actually debited from the "
"customer's account. As a result, if an SDD payment is later rejected, the "
"bank automatically withdraws the amount of that payment from the recipient's "
"account, and a new transaction for a negative amount is created to reflect "
"the SDD rejection."
msgstr ""
"Los rechazos de domiciliación bancaria pueden ocurrir por varias razones, "
"siendo la más común la falta de fondos en la cuenta del cliente. Con la "
"domiciliación bancaria, la cuenta del destinatario se acredita antes de que "
"los fondos se debiten realmente de la cuenta del cliente. Como resultado, si "
"un pago por domiciliación bancaria es rechazado posteriormente, el banco "
"retira automáticamente el monto de ese pago de la cuenta del destinatario y "
"se crea una nueva transacción por un monto negativo para reflejar el rechazo "
"de la domiciliación bancaria."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:167
msgid ""
"In this case, you must reverse the journal entry associated with the "
"rejected payment and reconcile the reversal of the journal entry with the "
"transaction for the SDD rejection. To do so, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"En este caso, debes revertir el asiento contable asociado con el pago "
"rechazado y conciliar la reversión del asiento contable con la transacción "
"del rechazo de la domiciliación bancaria. Para hacerlo, sigue estos pasos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:171
msgid "Access the invoice linked to the rejected SDD payment."
msgstr ""
"Accede a la factura vinculada al pago de domiciliación bancaria rechazado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:172
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-info-circle` :guilabel:`(information)` icon in the "
"footer of the :guilabel:`Invoice Lines` tab, then click :guilabel:`View` to "
"access the payment associated with the invoice."
msgstr ""
"Haga clic en el icono :icon:`fa-info-circle` :guilabel:`(información)` en el "
"pie de página de la pestaña :guilabel:`Líneas de la orden` y después haga "
"clic en :guilabel:`Ver` para acceder al pago asociado a la factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:175
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Journal entry` smart button to access the related "
"journal entry."
msgstr ""
"Haga clic en el botón inteligente :guilabel:`Asiento de diario` para acceder "
"al asiento relacionado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:176
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Reverse entry`, optionally edit the fields in the popup, "
"then click :guilabel:`Reverse`. A reversal entry is created with "
"a :guilabel:`Reference` mentioning the initial journal entry. As a result, "
"the invoice is marked as :guilabel:`Not paid`."
msgstr ""
"Haga clic en :guilabel:`Revertir asiento`, edite los campos en la ventana "
"emergente si es necesario, y después haga clic en :guilabel:`Revertir`. Esta "
"acción creará un asiento de reversión y la :guilabel:`referencia` mencionará "
"el asiento contable inicial. Como resultado, la factura se marcará "
"como :guilabel:`Sin pagar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:179
msgid ""
":ref:`Access the bank journal's reconciliation view <accounting/"
"reconciliation/access>` and :ref:`reconcile <accounting/reconciliation/"
"reconcile>` the transaction created for the SDD rejection with the reversal "
"of the entry related to the payment."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Accede a la vista de conciliación del diario bancario <accounting/"
"reconciliation/access>` y :ref:`concilia <accounting/reconciliation/"
"reconcile>` la transacción creada para el rechazo de la domiciliación "
"bancaria con la reversión del asiento relacionado con el pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:186
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:177
msgid "SEPA Credit Transfer"
msgstr "Transferencia de crédito SEPA"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:193
msgid ""
"To pay suppliers with SCT, from the **Accounting** app, go "
"to :menuselection:`Configuration --> Settings`. Under :guilabel:`Vendor "
"Payments`, activate :guilabel:`SEPA Credit Transfer (SCT)`. Next, fill out "
"your company data:"
msgstr ""
"Para pagar a proveedores con transferencia de crédito SEPA, desde la "
"aplicación **Contabilidad**, ve a :menuselection:`Configuración --> "
"Ajustes`. En :guilabel:`Pagos a proveedores`, "
"activa :guilabel:`Transferencia de crédito SEPA (SCT)`. Luego, completa los "
"datos de tu empresa:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:197
msgid ":guilabel:`Your Company`: The name of the company to use SCT."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tu empresa`: El nombre de la empresa que usará la transferencia "
"de crédito SEPA."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:198
msgid ":guilabel:`Name Identification`: The tax ID of the related company."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Identificación del nombre`: El número de identificación fiscal de "
"la empresa relacionada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:199
msgid ":guilabel:`Issuer`: The name of the entity that issued the tax ID."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Emisor`: El nombre de la entidad que emitió el número de "
"identificación fiscal."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:201
msgid ""
"After activating SEPA, go to :menuselection:`Configuration --> Journals` and "
"open your :guilabel:`Bank` journal. Under :guilabel:`Outgoing Payments`, "
"add :guilabel:`SEPA Credit Transfer` as a :guilabel:`Payment Method` if it's "
"not there. This allows Odoo to use this bank account to generate XML payment "
"files."
msgstr ""
"Después de activar SEPA, ve a :menuselection:`Configuración --> Diarios` y "
"abre tu diario :guilabel:`Bancario`. En :guilabel:`Pagos salientes`, "
"añade :guilabel:`Transferencia de crédito SEPA` como :guilabel:`Método de "
"pago` si no está allí. Esto permite que Odoo use esta cuenta bancaria para "
"generar archivos de pago XML."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:207
msgid "Registering payments"
msgstr "Registro de pagos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:209
msgid ""
"To register vendor payments made with SCT, first verify that "
"an :guilabel:`Account Number` and :guilabel:`Bank` are indicated on the "
"vendor's :doc:`contact form <../../../essentials/contacts>`, under "
"the :guilabel:`Accounting` tab. Odoo automatically verifies if the IBAN "
"format is respected."
msgstr ""
"Para registrar pagos a proveedores realizados con transferencia de crédito "
"SEPA, primero verifica que se indique un :guilabel:`Número de cuenta` y "
"un :guilabel:`Banco` en el :doc:`formulario de contacto <../../../essentials/"
"contacts>` del proveedor, en la pestaña :guilabel:`Contabilidad`. Odoo "
"verifica automáticamente si se respeta el formato IBAN."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:213
msgid ""
"Then, go to :menuselection:`Vendors --> Payments`, and "
"click :guilabel:`New`. When creating your payment, select :guilabel:`SEPA "
"Credit Transfer` as the :guilabel:`Payment Method`. The :guilabel:`Vendor "
"Bank Account` is automatically populated based on the :guilabel:`Vendor` "
"selected. For future payments to this vendor, Odoo will automatically "
"suggest the bank account, but it remains possible to select a new one from "
"the dropdown menu by clicking the :guilabel:`Vendor Bank Account` field."
msgstr ""
"Luego, ve a :menuselection:`Proveedores --> Pagos` y haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Nuevo`. Al crear tu pago, selecciona :guilabel:`Transferencia "
"de crédito SEPA` como :guilabel:`Método de pago`. La :guilabel:`Cuenta "
"bancaria del proveedor` se completa automáticamente según "
"el :guilabel:`Proveedor` seleccionado. Para futuros pagos a este proveedor, "
"Odoo sugerirá automáticamente la cuenta bancaria, pero sigue siendo posible "
"seleccionar una nueva del menú desplegable haciendo clic en el "
"campo :guilabel:`Cuenta bancaria del proveedor`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:220
msgid ""
"Once your payment is registered, do not forget to confirm it. You can also "
"pay vendor bills from the bill directly using the :guilabel:`Register "
"Payment` button at the top of a vendor bill. The form is the same, but the "
"payment is directly linked to the bill and will be automatically reconciled "
"with it."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que registre su pago, no se le olvide confirmarlo. Para pagar las "
"facturas de proveedor solo tiene que hacer clic en el "
"botón :guilabel:`Registrar pago` que se encuentra en la parte superior de la "
"factura. El formulario es el mismo, pero el pago está ligado a la factura y "
"se conciliará de manera automática."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:228
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:818
msgid "ISO 20022"
msgstr "ISO 20022"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:231
msgid ""
"The **SEPA Credit Transfer / ISO20022** Odoo module acts as the underlying "
"engine for all ISO 20022 transactions. Make sure it is :ref:`installed "
"<general/install>`."
msgstr ""
"El módulo de Odoo **Transferencia de crédito SEPA / ISO20022** actúa como el "
"motor subyacente para todas las transacciones ISO 20022. Asegúrate de que "
"esté :ref:`instalado <general/install>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:233
msgid ""
"Some countries and regions require localized, country-specific versions of "
"ISO 20022. These are provided by default with your :doc:`fiscal localization "
"<../../../finance/fiscal_localizations>`."
msgstr ""
"Algunos países y regiones requieren versiones localizadas específicas del "
"país de ISO 20022. Estas se proporcionan de forma predeterminada con "
"tu :doc:`localización fiscal <../../../finance/fiscal_localizations>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:237
msgid ""
"ISO 20022 is a global standard for exchanging financial messaging data "
"between banks. It uses a structured format that bundles payment details and "
"related documents into a single package. This allows computers to "
"automatically read embedded information like invoice numbers, tax details, "
"and sender identification. Unlike SEPA, the ISO 20022 standard supports any "
"currency worldwide."
msgstr ""
"ISO 20022 es un estándar global para el intercambio de datos de mensajería "
"financiera entre bancos. Utiliza un formato estructurado que agrupa detalles "
"de pago y documentos relacionados en un solo paquete. Esto permite que las "
"computadoras lean automáticamente información incrustada como números de "
"factura, detalles fiscales e identificación del remitente. A diferencia de "
"SEPA, el estándar ISO 20022 admite cualquier moneda en todo el mundo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:242
msgid ""
"To use a specific ISO 20022 version in Odoo, open the **Accounting** app, "
"navigate to :menuselection:`Configuration --> Journals`, and select your "
"**bank** journal. Click the :guilabel:`Outgoing Payments` tab, "
"click :guilabel:`Add a line`, and select the required ISO 20022 version from "
"the dropdown menu."
msgstr ""
"Para usar una versión específica de ISO 20022 en Odoo, abre la aplicación "
"**Contabilidad**, navega a :menuselection:`Configuración --> Diarios`, y "
"selecciona tu diario **bancario**. Haz clic en la pestaña :guilabel:`Pagos "
"salientes`, haz clic en :guilabel:`Agregar una línea`, y selecciona la "
"versión de ISO 20022 requerida del menú desplegable."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:250
msgid "PAIN version"
msgstr "Versión PAIN"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:253
msgid ""
":abbr:`PAIN (PAyment INitiation)` is the specific financial message protocol "
"within ISO 20022 or SEPA used to send transfer instructions from Odoo to "
"your bank."
msgstr ""
":abbr:`PAIN (Iniciación de Pago)` es el protocolo específico de mensajes "
"financieros dentro de ISO 20022 o SEPA utilizado para enviar instrucciones "
"de transferencia desde Odoo a tu banco."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:255
msgid ""
"To enable a country-specific PAIN version, check that the "
"corresponding :doc:`fiscal localization <../../../finance/"
"fiscal_localizations>` for your country is installed in your database."
msgstr ""
"Para habilitar una versión PAIN específica de un país, verifica que "
"la :doc:`localización fiscal <../../../finance/fiscal_localizations>` "
"correspondiente para tu país esté instalada en tu base de datos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:260
msgid ""
"ISO 20022 **PAIN.001.001.03** is being deprecated in November 2026. Make "
"sure to switch to the newer **PAIN.001.001.09** version or the version "
"explicitly required by your country for *outgoing payments* ."
msgstr ""
"ISO 20022 **PAIN.001.001.03** está siendo descontinuado en noviembre de "
"2026. Asegúrate de cambiar a la versión más reciente **PAIN.001.001.09** o a "
"la versión explícitamente requerida por tu país para *pagos salientes*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:264
msgid ""
"To select a specific PAIN version, open the **Accounting** app, go "
"to :menuselection:`Configuration --> Journals`, and open "
"your :guilabel:`Bank` journal. Depending on your configuration needs:"
msgstr ""
"Para seleccionar una versión PAIN específica, abre la aplicación "
"**Contabilidad**, ve a :menuselection:`Configuración --> Diarios`, y abre tu "
"diario :guilabel:`Banco`. Dependiendo de tus necesidades de configuración:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:267
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Incoming Payments` tab, and select a version in "
"the :guilabel:`SEPA Pain Version` field."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en la pestaña :guilabel:`Pagos entrantes`, y selecciona una versión "
"en el campo :guilabel:`Versión SEPA Pain`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:269
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Outgoing Payments` tab and select a version in "
"the :guilabel:`XML Format` field."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en la pestaña :guilabel:`Pagos salientes` y selecciona una versión "
"en el campo :guilabel:`Formato XML`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:275
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/switzerland.rst:93
msgid "Export XML files"
