#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:277
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/switzerland.rst:99
msgid ""
"To generate the daily XML payment files required by your online banking "
"portal, :ref:`create a batch payment <accounting/batch/creation>`. Odoo "
"attaches the generated XML file directly to the chatter, where you can "
"download it for submission to your bank."
msgstr ""
"Para generar los archivos XML de pago diarios requeridos por tu portal de "
"banca en línea, :ref:`crea un pago por lotes <accounting/batch/creation>`. "
"Odoo adjunta el archivo XML generado directamente en el chatter, donde "
"puedes descargarlo para enviarlo a tu banco."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:281
msgid ""
"By default, the :ref:`SEPA-compliant XML files <accounting/sepa_payments/"
"XML>` generated by Odoo use the **PAIN.001.001.09** format. If your "
"workflows require a different format, refer to the :ref:`PAIN <accounting/"
"sepa_payments/pain>` section above."
msgstr ""
"De forma predeterminada, los :ref:`archivos XML compatibles con SEPA "
"<accounting/sepa_payments/XML>` generados por Odoo utilizan el formato "
"**PAIN.001.001.09**. Si tus flujos de trabajo requieren un formato "
"diferente, consulta la sección :ref:`PAIN <accounting/sepa_payments/pain>` "
"anterior."

