#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:23
msgid ""
"To expand the lines of a report and view its details, click the :icon:`fa-"
"caret-right` (:guilabel:`right arrow`) on the left. Then click the :icon:`fa-"
"caret-down` (:guilabel:`down arrow`) to the right of the account, journal "
"entry, payment, invoice, etc. to :guilabel:`Annotate` and view the details."
msgstr ""
"Para abrir las líneas de un reporte y ver sus detalles, haga clic en "
"la :guilabel:`flecha derecha` (:icon:`fa-caret-right`) que se encuentra a la "
"izquierda, después haga clic en la :guilabel:`flecha hacia abajo` (:icon:`fa-"
"caret-down`) ubicada a la derecha de la cuenta, asiento contable, pago, "
"factura, etc. para :guilabel:`anotar` y ver sus detalles."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:28
msgid "Annotate reports."
msgstr "Captura de pantalla con la opción Anotar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:31
msgid ""
"To export reports in PDF or XLSX format, click :guilabel:`PDF` at the top or "
"click the :icon:`fa-caret-down` (:guilabel:`down arrow`) icon next to "
"the :guilabel:`PDF` button and select :guilabel:`XLSX`."
msgstr ""
"Para exportar reportes en formato PDF o XLSX, haga clic en el "
"botón :guilabel:`PDF` ubicado en la parte superior o haga clic en el "
"icono :icon:`fa-caret-down` (:guilabel:`flecha hacia abajo`) que se "
"encuentra junto al botón :guilabel:`PDF` y seleccione :guilabel:`XLSX`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:35
msgid ""
"To compare values across periods, click the :guilabel:`Comparison` menu and "
"select the periods you want to compare."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en el menú :guilabel:`Comparación` para comparar valores entre "
"periodos y seleccione los periodos correspondientes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:38
msgid "Comparison menu to compare time periods."
msgstr "Captura de pantalla del menú de comparación para comparar periodos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:46
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Balance Sheet` shows a snapshot of your organization's "
"assets, liabilities, and equity at a particular date."
msgstr ""
"El :guilabel:`balance general` muestra un resumen de los activos, pasivos y "
"el capital de su empresa en una fecha determinada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:54
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Profit and Loss` report (or **Income Statement**) shows your "
"company's net income by deducting expenses from revenue for the reporting "
"period."
msgstr ""
"El reporte de :guilabel:`estado de resultados` (o **estado de cuenta de "
"resultados**) muestra los ingresos netos de su empresa al deducir los gastos "
"de los ingresos correspondientes al periodo del reporte."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:60
msgid "Executive Summary"
msgstr "Resumen ejecutivo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:62
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Executive Summary` provides an overview of all the important "
"figures for overseeing your company's performance."
msgstr ""
"El :guilabel:`resumen ejecutivo` le permite consultar todas las cifras "
"importantes para que conozca el rendimiento de su empresa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:65
msgid "It includes the following items:"
msgstr "Incluye los siguientes elementos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:67
msgid ":guilabel:`Performance`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Rendimiento`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:68
msgid ":guilabel:`Gross profit margin`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Margen de ganancia bruta`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:69
msgid ""
"The contribution of all sales your business makes **minus** any direct costs "
"needed to make those sales (labor, materials, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"La contribución de todas las ventas que realiza su empresa **menos** los "
"costos directos necesarios para realizarlas (como la mano de obra, los "
"materiales, etc.)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:71
msgid ":guilabel:`Net profit margin`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Margen de ganancias netas`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:72
msgid ""
"The contribution of all sales made by your business **minus** any direct "
"costs needed to make those sales *and* fixed overheads your company has "
"(electricity, rent, taxes to be paid as a result of those sales, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"La contribución de todas las ventas que realiza su empresa **menos** los "
"costos directos necesarios para realizarlas **y** los gastos generales fijos "
"de su empresa (por ejemplo, electricidad, alquiler, impuestos a pagar como "
"resultado de esas ventas, entre otras cosas)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:75
msgid ":guilabel:`Return on investment (per annum)`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Retorno de la inversión (por año)`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:76
msgid ""
"The ratio of the net profit to the amount of assets the company used to make "
"those profits."
msgstr ""
"La proporción entre la ganancia neta y el importe de los activos que la "
"empresa utilizó para obtenerla."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:77
msgid ":guilabel:`Position`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Posición`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:78
msgid ":guilabel:`Average debtors days`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Periodo promedio de cobro`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:79
msgid ""
"The average number of days it takes your customers to (fully) pay you across "
"all your customer invoices."
msgstr ""
"El número promedio de días que sus clientes tardan en pagarle (por completo) "
"en todas sus facturas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:81
msgid ":guilabel:`Average creditors days`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Periodo promedio de pago`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:82
msgid ""
"The average number of days it takes you to (fully) pay your suppliers across "
"all your bills."
msgstr ""
"El número promedio de días que le toma pagarle (por completo) a sus "
"proveedores en todas sus facturas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:83
msgid ":guilabel:`Short-term cash forecast`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Pronóstico de flujo de efectivo a corto plazo`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:84
msgid ""
"How much cash is expected in or out of your business in the next month, "
"i.e., the balance of your **Sales account** for the month **minus** the "
"balance of your **Purchases account** for the month."
msgstr ""
"La cantidad de efectivo que se espera que entre o salga de su empresa en el "
"próximo mes, es decir, el saldo de su **cuenta de ventas** del mes **menos** "
"el saldo de su **cuenta de compras** del mes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:87
msgid ":guilabel:`Current assets to liabilities`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Activos circulantes frente a pasivos`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:88
msgid ""
"Also referred to as the **current ratio**, this is the ratio of current "
"assets (:dfn:`assets that could be turned into cash within a year`) to the "
"current liabilities (:dfn:`liabilities that will be due in the next year`). "
"It is typically used to measure a company's ability to service its debt."
msgstr ""
"También se le conoce como **razón circulante** y es la relación de activos "
"circulantes (:dfn:`activos que podrían convertirse en efectivo dentro de un "
"año`) con respecto a los pasivos circulantes (:dfn:`pasivos que vencen el "
"próximo año`). Por lo general se utiliza para medir la capacidad de una "
"empresa para pagar su deuda."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:96
msgid "General Ledger"
msgstr "Libro mayor"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:98
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`General Ledger` report shows all transactions from all "
"accounts for a selected date range. The initial summary report shows the "
"totals for each account. To expand an account and view its details, click "
"the :icon:`fa-caret-right` (:guilabel:`right arrow`) on the left. This "
"report is useful for reviewing each transaction that occurred during a "
"specific period."
msgstr ""
"El reporte de :guilabel:`libro mayor` muestra todas las transacciones de "
"todas las cuentas durante el intervalo de fechas seleccionado y el resumen "
"del reporte inicial muestra los totales de cada cuenta. Haz clic en "
"la :guilabel:`flecha derecha` (:icon:`fa-caret-right`) ubicada a la "
"izquierda para visualizar los detalles de una cuenta. Este reporte le ayuda "
"a revisar cada transacción que ocurrió durante un periodo específico."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:108
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Aged Receivable` report shows the sales invoices awaiting "
"payment during a selected month and several months prior."
msgstr ""
"El reporte de :guilabel:`cuentas por cobrar vencidas` muestra las facturas "
"de ventas pendientes de pago durante el mes seleccionado y varios meses "
"anteriores."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:116
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Aged Payable` report displays information on individual "
"bills, credit notes, and overpayments you owe and how long these have gone "
"unpaid."
msgstr ""
"El reporte de :guilabel:`cuentas por pagar vencidas` muestra la información "
"sobre las facturas, notas de crédito y sobrepagos específicos que debe, así "
"como el tiempo que lleva sin pagarlos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:122
msgid "Cash Flow Statement"
msgstr "Estado de flujo de efectivo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:124
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Cash Flow Statement` shows how changes in balance sheet "
"accounts and income affect cash and cash equivalents and breaks the analysis "
"down to operating, investing, and financing activities."
msgstr ""
"El :guilabel:`estado de cuenta de flujo de efectivo` muestra cómo los "
"cambios en el balance general y los ingresos influyen en el efectivo y en "
"los equivalentes de efectivo. También analiza las actividades de operación, "
"de inversión y de financiación."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:131
msgid "Tax Report"
msgstr "Reporte fiscal"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:133
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Tax Report` shows the :guilabel:`NET` and :guilabel:`TAX` "
"amounts for all the taxes grouped by type "
"(:guilabel:`Sales`/:guilabel:`Purchases`)."
msgstr ""
"El :guilabel:`reporte fiscal` muestra los montos :guilabel:`NETOS` y "
"de :guilabel:`IMPUESTOS` de todos los impuestos agrupados por tipo "
"(:guilabel:`ventas` y :guilabel:`compras`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:153
msgid "Audit Trail"
msgstr "Pista de auditoría"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:155
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Audit Trail` report tracks changes made to fields that have "
"an impact on accounting and includes the date and time of the changes, the "
"user who made the changes, the type of change, the previous value, and the "
"updated value."
msgstr ""
"El reporte de :guilabel:`pista de auditoría` rastrea los cambios que se "
"realizan en los campos que tienen impacto en la contabilidad e incluye la "
"fecha y hora de los cambios, el usuario que realizó los cambios, el tipo de "
"cambio, el valor anterior y el valor actualizado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:159
msgid ""
"In addition to being recorded in the :doc:`chatter </applications/"
"productivity/discuss/chatter>`, changes to records are also tracked in the "
"audit trail, providing users a dedicated and detailed audit trail report. "
"The audit trail report is available for audit checks, satisfying the "
"requirements of the financial authorities and auditors of various countries."
msgstr ""
"Además de registrarse en el :doc:`chatter </applications/productivity/"
"discuss/chatter>`, los cambios en los registros también se rastrean en la "
"pista de auditoría, lo que proporciona a los usuarios un reporte de pista de "
"auditoría detallado y específico. El reporte de pista de auditoría está "
"disponible para las verificaciones de auditoría y cumple con los requisitos "
"de las autoridades financieras y los auditores de varios países."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:164
msgid ""
"To access the audit trail, navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Review "
"--> Audit Trail`."
msgstr ""
"Para acceder a la pista de auditoría, navega a :menuselection:`Contabilidad "
"--> Revisar --> Pista de auditoría`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:166
msgid ""
"An optional restrictive mode prevents tracked records from being deleted for "
"more controlled immutability. Instead of being deleted, these records can "
"only be cancelled or archived. To enable this restrictive mode, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Settings --> Configuration`, scroll down "
"to the :guilabel:`Reporting` section, and tick the checkbox "
"beside :guilabel:`Restrictive Audit Trail`."
msgstr ""
"Un modo restrictivo opcional evita que los registros rastreados sean "
"eliminados para una inmutabilidad más controlada. En lugar de ser "
"eliminados, estos registros solo pueden ser cancelados o archivados. Para "
"habilitar este modo restrictivo, navega a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> "
"Ajustes --> Configuración`, desplázate hacia abajo hasta la "
"sección :guilabel:`Reportes` y marca la casilla junto a :guilabel:`Pista de "
"auditoría restrictiva`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:175
msgid "Bank Reconciliation Summary"
msgstr "Resumen de conciliación bancaria"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:177
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Bank Reconciliation Summary` report provides a detailed "
"overview of reconciled and unreconciled transactions, including transaction "
"details and the calculations behind each reported balance."
msgstr ""
"El informe de :guilabel:`Resumen de conciliación bancaria` proporciona una "
"visión detallada de las transacciones conciliadas y no conciliadas, "
"incluidos los detalles de la transacción y los cálculos detrás de cada saldo "
"reportado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:181
msgid ""
"Designed for review and audit purposes, the report provides a complete "
"reconciliation trail as of a selected end date. It reflects balances and "
"reconciliation statuses as they existed at that point in time, rather than "
"their current live status."
msgstr ""
"Diseñado para fines de revisión y auditoría, el informe proporciona un "
"registro completo de conciliación a una fecha de finalización seleccionada. "
"Refleja los saldos y estados de conciliación tal como existían en ese "
"momento, en lugar de su estado actual."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:185
msgid ""
"To access the report, open the **Accounting** dashboard, click the :icon:`oi-"
"ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` on the :guilabel:`Bank` journal, "
"and then :guilabel:`Report`."
msgstr ""
"Para acceder al informe, abre el tablero de **Contabilidad**, haz clic en "
":icon:`oi-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(puntos suspensivos verticales)` en el "
"diario de :guilabel:`Banco` y luego en :guilabel:`Informe`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:191
msgid "Report filters and options"
msgstr "Filtros y opciones de los reportes"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:193
msgid ""
"Reporting filters and options vary on a per-report basis. The following "
"buttons and options are common to most reports and are located in the top "
"bar of the report:"
msgstr ""
"Los filtros y las opciones varían según los reportes. Los siguientes botones "
"y opciones son comunes en la mayoría de los reportes y se encuentran en la "
"barra superior del reporte:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:196
msgid ""
"A *date* filter, indicated by the :icon:`fa-calendar` :guilabel:`(calendar)` "
"icon that precedes a date in the local format. Use this filter to select a "
"specific date or date range for the report."
msgstr ""
"Un filtro de *fecha*, indicado por el icono :icon:`fa-"
"calendar` :guilabel:`(calendario)` que precede a una fecha en el formato "
"local. Usa este filtro para seleccionar una fecha o un rango de fechas "
"específico para el reporte."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:198
msgid ""
"A :guilabel:`% Comparison` filter, to compare reporting periods against each "
"other."
msgstr ""
"Un filtro de :guilabel:`% de comparación` para comparar periodos del reporte "
"entre ellos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:199
msgid ""
"A *journal* filter, indicated by the :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`(book)` icon "
"and a default setting, such as :guilabel:`All Journals`. Use this filter to "
"specify which journals should be included in the report."
msgstr ""
"Un filtro de *diario*, indicado por el icono :icon:`fa-"
"book` :guilabel:`(libro)` y ajustes predeterminados, como :guilabel:`Todos "
"los diarios`. Usa este filtro para especificar qué diarios se deben incluir "
"en el reporte."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:202
msgid ""
"An *analytic* filter, indicated by the :icon:`oi-group` :guilabel:`(group)` "
"icon. Use this filter to only include analytic accounts and plans in the "
"report."
msgstr ""
"Un filtro *analítico*, indicado por el icono :icon:`oi-"
"group` :guilabel:`(grupo)`. Usa este filtro para incluir solo las cuentas y "
"los planes analíticos en el reporte."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:204
msgid ""
"An *entries type* filter, indicated by the :icon:`fa-"
"sliders` :guilabel:`(filter)` icon and a default setting, such "
"as :guilabel:`Posted Entries Only, Accrual Basis`. Use this filter to "
"determine which type of journal entries should be included in the report "
"(e.g. posted or draft), along with the type of accounting method (e.g., "
"accrual or :ref:`cash basis <accounting/cash-basis/report-filter>`)."
msgstr ""
"Un filtro de *tipo de asiento*, indicado por el icono :icon:`fa-"
"sliders` :guilabel:`(filtro)` y ajustes predeterminados, "
"como :guilabel:`Solo asientos registrados, base devengada`. Usa este filtro "
"para determinar qué tipo de asientos contables se deben incluir en el "
"reporte (por ejemplo, registrados o en borrador), junto con el tipo de "
"método contable (por ejemplo, base devengada o :ref:`base de efectivo "
"<accounting/cash-basis/report-filter>`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:210
msgid ""
"This filter also includes display options, such as :guilabel:`Hide lines at "
"0`, which removes zero-value lines from the report, or :guilabel:`Split "
"Horizontally`, which keeps the report within the screen's fold and "
"eliminates the need to scroll."
msgstr ""
"Este filtro también incluye opciones de visualización, "
"como :guilabel:`Ocultar líneas en 0`, que elimina del reporte las líneas con "
"valor cero, o :guilabel:`Dividir de forma horizontal`, que mantiene el "
"reporte dentro de la parte visible de la pantalla y evita tener que "
"desplazarse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:214
msgid ""
"A *decimal* option, which includes figures with cents by default, as "
"indicated by your local currency icon (e.g., :guilabel:`In .$`). Use the "
"other options in the drop-down menu to format figures in the report as whole "
"numbers (e.g., :guilabel:`In $`), thousands (e.g., :guilabel:`In K$`), or "
"millions (e.g., :guilabel:`In M$`)."
msgstr ""
"Una opción *decimal*, que incluye centavos de forma predeterminada, como lo "
"indica el icono de tu moneda local (por ejemplo, :guilabel:`En .$`). Usa las "
"otras opciones del menú desplegable para mostrar las cifras como números "
"enteros (por ejemplo, :guilabel:`En $`), en miles (por "
"ejemplo, :guilabel:`En K$`) o en millones (por ejemplo, :guilabel:`En M$`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:219
msgid "Reporting filters."
msgstr "Filtros de reportes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:223
msgid ""
"With :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>` enabled, a :doc:`report "
"customization <reporting/customize>` option, indicated by the :icon:`fa-"
"cogs` :guilabel:`(cogs)` icon is available in the top bar. It allows, for "
"example, to add the :ref:`Cash Basis Method filter <accounting/cash-basis/"
"report-filter>`."
msgstr ""
"Con el :ref:`modo de desarrollador <developer-mode>` activado, hay una "
"opción de :doc:`personalización del reporte <reporting/customize>` "
"disponible en la barra superior, indicada por el icono :icon:`fa-"
"cogs` :guilabel:`(engranajes)`. Esta opción permite, por ejemplo, agregar "
"el :ref:`filtro Método de base de efectivo <accounting/cash-basis/report-"
"filter>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:3
msgid "Analytic accounting"
msgstr "Contabilidad analítica"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:5
msgid ""
"Analytic accounting helps track costs and revenues and analyze a project's "
"or service's profitability. When creating journal entries, costs can "
"be :ref:`distributed <accounting/analytic_accounting/analytic-distribution>` "
"across one or more analytic accounts."
msgstr ""
"Con la contabilidad analítica es posible rastrear costos e ingresos y "
"analizar la rentabilidad de un proyecto o servicio. Al crear asientos de "
"diario, los costos pueden :ref:`distribuirse <accounting/analytic_accounting/"
"analytic-distribution>` a lo largo de iuna o más cuentas analíticas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:9
msgid ""
"To activate this feature, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration "
"--> Settings` and enable :guilabel:`Analytic Accounting` in "
"the :guilabel:`Analytics` section."
msgstr ""
"Para activar esta función, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> "
"Configuración --> Ajustes` y habilita la :guilabel:`Contabilidad analítica` "
"en la sección :guilabel:`Analítica`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:13
msgid ":doc:`Analytic budget <budget>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Presupuesto analítico <budget>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:18
msgid "Analytic accounts"
msgstr "Cuentas analíticas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:20
msgid "Analytic accounts give an overview of costs and revenue."
msgstr ""
"Con las cuentas analíticas obtendrás una visualización general de los costos "
"y los ingresos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:22
msgid ""
"To access analytic accounts, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Analytic Accounts`. To create a new analytic account, "
"click :guilabel:`New` and fill in the following information:"
msgstr ""
"Para acceder a las cuentas analíticas, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> "
"Configuración --> Cuentas analíticas`. Para crear una nueva cuenta "
"analítica, haz clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo` y llena la información a "
"continuación:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:26
msgid ":guilabel:`Analytic Account`: Assign the name of the analytic account."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cuenta analítica`: Ingresa el nombre de la cuenta analítica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:27
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Customer`: Select the customer linked to the project, if "
"applicable."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cliente`: Selecciona al cliente vinculado al proyecto, si aplica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:28
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Reference`: Include a reference to make the account easier to "
"find if needed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Referencia`: Incluye una referencia para que sea más fácil de "
"encontrar la cuenta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:29
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Plan`: Link the :guilabel:`Analytic Account` to an :ref:`analytic "
"plan <accounting/analytic_accounting/analytic_plans>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Plan`: Vincula la :guilabel:`cuenta anlítica` a un :ref:`plan "
"analítico <accounting/analytic_accounting/analytic_plans>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:31
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: In a :doc:`multi-company </applications/general/"
"companies/multi_company>` environment, select the company using the analytic "
"account. To make the analytic account accessible to all companies, leave the "
"field empty."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Empresa`: En un entorno :doc:`multiempresa </applications/general/"
"companies/multi_company>` debes seleccionar a la empresa que usa la cuenta "
"analítica. Para que todas las empresas puedan acceder a la cuenta analítica, "
"deja el campo en blanco."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Currency`: Update the currency of the analytic account if needed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Moneda`: Actualiza la moneda de la cuenta analítica si es "
"necesario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:36
msgid "Then, the :doc:`budget <budget>` information can be filled in."
msgstr "Después podrá agregar la información del :doc:`presupuesto <budget>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:41
msgid "Analytic plans"
msgstr "Planes analíticos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:43
msgid ""
"Analytic plans group :ref:`analytic accounts <accounting/analytic_accounting/"
"analytic_accounts>`, allowing the company to analyze its accounting, such as "
"tracking costs and revenues by project or department."
msgstr ""
"Los planes analíticos agrupan las :ref:`cuentas analíticas <accounting/"
"analytic_accounting/analytic_accounts>` para que la empresa pueda analizar "
"su contabilidad, como rastrear los costos e ingresos por proyecto o "
"departamento."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:47
msgid ""
"To access analytic plans, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration "
"--> Analytic Plans`. Click :guilabel:`New` to create a new plan, add a name, "
"and fill in the following information:"
msgstr ""
"Para acceder a los planes analíticos, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> "
"Configuración --> Cuentas analíticas`. Para crear un plan nuevo, haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Nuevo` y llena la información a continuación:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:50
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Parent`: Link the plan to another analytic plan if a hierarchy "
"between plans must be built."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Principal`: Vincula el plan a otro plan analítico si debe crar "
"una jerarquía entre los planes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:52
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Default Applicability`: Define how the plan is applied when "
"creating a new journal entry:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Aplicabilidad predeterminada`: Decide el comportamiento de tu "
"plan al crear un nuevo asiento en el diario:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:55
msgid ":guilabel:`Optional`: Adding the analytic plan is not mandatory."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Opcional`: No es obligatorio agregar un plan analítico."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:56
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Mandatory`: The entry cannot be confirmed if no analytic account "
"is selected."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Mandatorio`: El asiento no se puede confirmar si no se selecciona "
"una cuenta analítica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:57
msgid ":guilabel:`Unavailable`: The plan is not available."
msgstr ":guilabel:`No disponible`: El plan no está disponible."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:59
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Color`: Set a color for the tag related to this specific plan."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Color`: Establece un color para la etiqueta relacionada a este "
"plan específico."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:61
msgid ""
"To fine-tune a plan's applicability, create a new line in "
"the :guilabel:`Applicability` tab and set the following fields:"
msgstr ""
"Para configurar mejor la aplicabilidad del plan, crea una línea nueva en la "
"pestaña :guilabel:`Aplicabilidad` y configura los campos a continuación:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:64
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Domain`: Choose the accounting documents to which the plan "
"applies."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Dominio`: Elija los documentos contables a los que se aplicará "
"este plan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:65
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Financial Accounts Prefixes`: Enter the prefix(es) of the "
"account(s) to which the plan applies."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Prefijos de cuentas financieras`: Ingresa el o los prefijos de la "
"o las cuentas a las que aplicará el plan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:67
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Product Category`: Choose the product category to which the plan "
"applies."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Categoría de producto`: Selecciona la categoría del producto al "
"que aplicará este plan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:68
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Applicability`: Define how the plan is applied when creating a "
"new journal entry. The applicability set here always overrides the default "
"applicability."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Aplicabilidad`: Define cómo se aplicará el plan al crear un nuevo "
"asiento de diario. La aplicabilidad que establezca aquí siempre "
"sobreescribirá la aplicabilidad predeterminada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:70
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: In a :doc:`multi-company </applications/general/"
"companies/multi_company>` environment, select the company using the plan. To "
"make the analytic plan accessible to all companies, leave the field empty."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Empresa`: En un entorno :doc:`multiempresa </applications/general/"
"companies/multi_company>`, debes seleccionar la empresa que usará el plan. "
"Para que todas las empresas puedan acceder al plan analítico, debes dejar "
"este campo en blanco."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:74
msgid "Two smart buttons are available:"
msgstr "Hay dos botones inteligentes disponibles:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:76
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Subplans`: To have a more complex analytic structure. Click the "
"smart button, then click :guilabel:`New` to add a subplan. This creates a "
"parent-child relationship between the two plans, and the :guilabel:`Parent` "
"field of the subplan is automatically populated with the original plan."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Subplanes`: Para tener una cuenta analítica más compleja, haz "
"clic en el botón inteligente y luego en :guilabel:`Nuevo` para agregar un "
"subplan. Esto creará una relación de subordinación entre los dos planes y el "
"campo :guilabel:`Principal` del subplan se llenará en automático con el plan "
"original."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:80
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Analytic Accounts`: To access the :ref:`analytic accounts "
"<accounting/analytic_accounting/analytic_accounts>` linked to the plan."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cuentas analíticas`: Para acceder a las cuentas "
"analíticas :ref:`analytic accounts <accounting/analytic_accounting/"
"analytic_accounts>` vinculadas al plan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:84
msgid "Each analytic plan must have at least one analytic account."
msgstr "Cada plan analítico debe contar con al menos una cuenta analítica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:89
msgid "Analytic distribution"
msgstr "Distribución analítica"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:91
msgid ""
"The distribution of costs in one or more analytic accounts can be set in "
"each :ref:`invoice/bill <accounting/analytic_accounting/distribution-"
"invoices-bills>` or :ref:`en masse <accounting/analytic_accounting/"
"distribution-mass>`."
msgstr ""
"La distribución de costos en una o más cuentas analíticas se puede "
"establecer en cada :ref:`factura de cliente o de provedor <accounting/"
"analytic_accounting/distribution-invoices-bills>` o :ref:`en masa "
"<accounting/analytic_accounting/distribution-mass>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:96
msgid ""
"The analytic distribution is prefilled based on the applicability and "
"the :ref:`analytic distribution models <accounting/"
"analytic_distribution_models>`."
msgstr ""
"La distribución analítica se llena según la aplicabilidad y "
"los :ref:`modelos de distribución analítica <accounting/"
"analytic_distribution_models>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:102
msgid "Analytic distribution on invoices or bills"
msgstr "Distribución analítica en las facturas de cliente o de proveedor"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:104
msgid ""
"To add analytic distribution, click the :guilabel:`Analytic Distribution` "
"column when creating an :ref:`invoice <accounting/invoice/creation>` "
"or :ref:`bill <accounting/vendor_bills/creation>`."
msgstr ""
"Para agregar una distribución analítica, haz clic en la "
"columna :guilabel:`Distribución analítica` al crear una :ref:`factura de "
"cliente <accounting/invoice/creation>` o :ref:`de proveedor <accounting/"
"vendor_bills/creation>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:108
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Analytic Distribution` field is mandatory only if "
"the :ref:`analytic plan <accounting/analytic_accounting/analytic_plans>` has "
"been set as :guilabel:`Mandatory` in either the :guilabel:`Default "
"Applicability` field on an analytic plan or the :guilabel:`Applicability` "
"field on an analytic plan line."
msgstr ""
"El campo de :guilabel:`Distribución analítica` es obligatorio solo "
"si :ref:`el plan analítico <accounting/analytic_accounting/analytic_plans>` "
"se estableció como :guilabel:`Mandatorio` ya sea en el "
"campo :guilabel:`Aplicabilidad predeterminada` en un plan analítico o en el "
"campo  :guilabel:`Aplicabilidad` en la línea de un plan analítico."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:113
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Analytic` window, select the desired :guilabel:`Analytic "
"Accounts` in the different :guilabel:`Analytic Plans` displayed in columns. "
"Then, split the costs between the accounts by modifying the percentage."
msgstr ""
"En la ventana :guilabel:`Analítica` selecciona las :guilabel:`Cuentas "
"analíticas` que quiera en los diferentes :guilabel:`Planes analíticos` que "
"se muestran en columnas. Después, para dividir los costos entre las cuentas, "
"debe modificar el porcentaje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:117
msgid "create a distribution template"
msgstr "crear una plantilla de distribución"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:123
msgid "Analytic distribution en masse"
msgstr "Distribución analítica en masa"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:125
msgid ""
"To mass-edit analytic accounts in several entries simultaneously, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Review --> Journal items`, and select the "
"ones that need to be updated. Click the :guilabel:`Analytic Distribution` "
"column and add the required distribution in the :guilabel:`Analytic` column, "
"then click the :icon:`oi-close` :guilabel:`(cross)` and :guilabel:`Update`. "
"The analytic distribution is then added to the selected journal items."
msgstr ""
"Para editar cuentas analíticas en lote en varios asientos al mismo tiempo, "
"ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Revisión --> Apuntes contables` y "
"selecciona los que quieras actualizar. Haz clic en la "
"columna :guilabel:`Distribución analítica` y agrega la distribución "
"necesaria en la columna :guilabel:`Analítica`, luego haz clic en el "
"icono :icon:`oi-close` :guilabel:`(cruz)` y en :guilabel:`Actualizar`. La "
"distribución analítica se agregará a los asientos seleccionados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:132
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Analytic Distribution` column is not displayed, use "
"the :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` :guilabel:`(settings adjust)` icon, and "
"tick :guilabel:`Analytic Distribution`."
msgstr ""
"Si la columna :guilabel:`Distribución analítica` no aparece, usa el "
"icono :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` :guilabel:`(ajustes)` y "
"elige :guilabel:`Distribución analítica`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:139
msgid "Analytic distribution models"
msgstr "Modelos de distribución analítica"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:141
msgid ""
"Analytic distribution models automatically apply a specific distribution "
"based on defined criteria."
msgstr ""
"Los modelos de distribución analítica aplican, de forma automática, una "
"distribución específica según criterios definidos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:143
msgid ""
"To create a new analytic distribution model, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Analytic Distribution "
"Models`, click :guilabel:`New`, and set the conditions the model has to meet "
"to apply automatically:"
msgstr ""
"Para crear un modelo de distribución analítica nuevo, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Modelos de distribución "
"analítica`, haz clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo` y establece las condiciones que el "
"modelo tiene que cumplir para que se apliquen de forma automática:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:148
msgid ""
"All specified conditions of an analytic distribution model must be met for "
"the model to be applied. To apply an analytic distribution model based on "
"individual conditions, create separate analytic distribution models for each "
"condition."
msgstr ""
"Todas las condiciones que se especifiquen de un modelo de distribución "
"analítica deben cumplirse para que se aplique el modelo. Para aplicar un "
"modelo de distribución según condiciones individuales, crea modelos de "
"distribución analítica diferentes para cada condición."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:151
msgid ""
"Analytic distribution models can be combined and sequenced, allowing "
"distribution across multiple models if linked to different :ref:`analytic "
"plans <accounting/analytic_accounting/analytic_plans>`. To adjust the order, "
"drag and drop the models using the :icon:`oi-"
"draggable` :guilabel:`(draggable)` icon."
msgstr ""
"Los modelos de distribución analítica se pueden combinar y secuenciar para "
"así permitir la distribución a lo largo de varios modelos si están "
"vinculados a diferentes :ref:`planes analíticos <accounting/"
"analytic_accounting/analytic_plans>`. Para ajustar el orden, arrastra y "
"suelta los modelos usando el icono :icon:`oi-"
"draggable` :guilabel:`(arrastrable)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:156
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Accounts Prefixes`: Apply the distribution model only to journal "
"items involving accounts that begin with specific prefixes."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Prefijos en cuentas`: Aplica el modelo de distribución solo a los "
"asientos contables que involucren cuentas que comiencen con prefijos "
"específicos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:158
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Partner`: Apply the distribution model only to journal items "
"involving a specific partner."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Contacto`: Aplica el modelo de distribución solo a los asientos "
"contables que involucren a un contacto específico."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:160
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Product`: Apply the distribution model only to journal items "
"involving a specific product."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Producto`: Aplica el modelo de distribución solo a los asientos "
"contables que involucren a un producto específico."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:162
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: In a :doc:`multi-company </applications/general/"
"companies/multi_company>` environment, apply the distribution model only to "
"journal items involving a specific company. To apply it across all "
"companies, leave the field empty."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Empresa`: En un entorno :doc:`multiempresa </applications/general/"
"companies/multi_company>`, el modelo de distribución se aplica solo a los "
"asientos contables que sean de una empresa específica. Para aplicarlo a "
"todas las empresas, deja el campo en blanco."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:165
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Analytic Distribution`: :ref:`Analytic distribution <accounting/"
"analytic_accounting/analytic-distribution>` that will be applied when the "
"above conditions are met."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Distribución analítica`: :ref:`Distribución analítica <accounting/"
"analytic_accounting/analytic-distribution>` que se aplicará cuando se "
"cumplan con las condiciones anteriores."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:170
msgid ""
"Any time a journal item is posted to the :guilabel:`Utilities (601000)` "
"account, it should be automatically distributed in "
"the :guilabel:`Departments` analytic plan as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Siempre que se publique un asiento de dierio en la "
"cuenta :guilabel:`Utilidades (601000)`, se debe distribuir de forma "
"automática en el plan analítico de los :guilabel:`Departmentos` como se "
"muestra a continuación:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:173
msgid "60% to the :guilabel:`Manufacturing` analytic account"
msgstr "60% a la cuenta analítica :guilabel:`Manufactura`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:174
msgid "30% to the :guilabel:`Marketing` analytic account"
msgstr "30% a la cuenta analítica :guilabel:`Marketing`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:175
msgid "10% to the :guilabel:`Admin` analytic account"
msgstr "10% a la cuenta analítica :guilabel:`Admin`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:177
msgid ""
"To automate this distribution, the :guilabel:`Accounts Prefix` can be set to "
"`601`, as :guilabel:`Utilities (601000)` is the only account in the chart of "
"accounts that begins with `601`."
msgstr ""
"Para automaitzar esta distribución, el :guilabel:`prefijo analítico` puede "
"establecerse como `601`, ya que la cuenta :guilabel:`Utilidades (601000)` es "
"la única cuenta en el plan de cuentas que empieza con `601`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:181
msgid ""
"If additional accounts such as :guilabel:`Electricity (601100)` "
"or :guilabel:`Gas (601200)` are available in the chart of accounts, the "
"distribution will also apply to both since they share the same prefix."
msgstr ""
"Si hay cuentas adicionales, como :guilabel:`Electricidad (601100)` "
"o :guilabel:`Gas (601200)`, disponibles en el plan de cuentas, la "
"distribución también se aplicará a ambas ya que comparten el mismo prefijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:185
msgid ""
"To define more criteria, use the :icon:`oi-settings-"
"adjust` :guilabel:`(adjust settings)` icon to reveal more columns or "
"click :guilabel:`View` on an individual analytic distribution model."
msgstr ""
"Para definir más criterios, usa el icono :icon:`oi-settings-"
"adjust` :guilabel:`(ajustes)` para mostrar más columnas, o haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Ver` en un modelo de distribución analítica individual."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:188
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Partner Category`: Apply this distribution model only to journal "
"items involving a partner in a specific category."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Categoría de contacto`: Aplica este modelo de distribución solo "
"al diario que tenga apuntes con un contacto o categoría específica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:190
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Product Category`: Apply this distribution model to journal items "
"involving a product in a specific category."
msgstr ""
