#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:198
msgid ""
":guilabel:`No negative amount in VAT report`: Some countries only allow "
"positive values in tax returns, as a negative amount could indicate "
"misconfigurations."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Sin importes negativos en el reporte de IVA`: Algunos países solo "
"permiten que haya valores positivos en las declaraciones fiscales porque un "
"importe negativo puede indicar que hay configuraciones incorrectas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:200
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Taxes and countries matching`: Taxes applied on invoices and "
"bills must match the customer’s country."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Coincidencia de impuestos y países`: Los impuestos aplicados en "
"las facturas de clientes y proveedores deben coincidir con el país del "
"cliente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:203
msgid ""
"Each check card is either highlighted in green (Reviewed or Supervised), red "
"(Anomaly) or grey (To review). If a check fails, there are two options:"
msgstr ""
"Cada tarjeta de revisión aparece en verde (Revisada o Supervisado), rojo "
"(Anomalía) o gris (Por revisar). Si una revisión falla, hay dos opciones:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:206
msgid "Click on the failed check's card to fix the issue."
msgstr "Haz clic en la tarjeta para corregir el problema."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:207
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:326
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Anomaly` and select :guilabel:`Reviewed` "
"or :guilabel:`Supervised` to pass the check without fixing the issue."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Anomalía` y selecciona :guilabel:`Revisada` "
"o :guilabel:`Supervisada` para aprobar la revisión sin corregirla."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:210
msgid ""
"Once all checks have passed, click :guilabel:`Validate`. Then, depending on "
"the :doc:`fiscal localization <../../fiscal_localizations>`, "
"click :guilabel:`Lock` in the :guilabel:`Lock` window."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Validar` cuando todas las revisiones pasen. Luego, "
"según la :doc:`localización fiscal <../../fiscal_localizations>`, haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Bloquear` en la ventana :guilabel:`Bloquear`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:213
msgid ""
"On validating the tax return, the :ref:`Lock Tax Return <accounting/tax-"
"returns/lock-date>` date is automatically updated, and the closing journal "
"entry is posted in the :guilabel:`Tax Returns` journal."
msgstr ""
"Al validar la declaración fiscal, el sistema actualiza la fecha "
"de :ref:`bloqueo de declaración fiscal <accounting/tax-returns/lock-date>` "
"de forma automática y registra el asiento de cierre en el diario "
"de :guilabel:`declaraciones fiscales`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:218
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:334
msgid ""
"To add customized checks, activate :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`, "
"and go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Check`. Then, "
"click :guilabel:`New` and complete the necessary fields."
msgstr ""
"Para agregar revisiones personalizadas, activa el :ref:`modo de "
"desarrollador <developer-mode>`, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> "
"Configuración --> Revisión`, haz clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo` y luego completa "
"los campos necesarios."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:221
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:337
msgid "All check status changes are logged in the chatter."
msgstr ""
"El sistema registra todos los cambios en el estado de las revisiones en el "
"chatter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:224
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Lock Tax Return` date is not locked before reviewing the "
"tax return, the fiscal period is automatically locked on the same date as "
"the accounting date of the closing journal entry. While this feature helps "
"prevent certain fiscal errors, it is recommended to set the :ref:`Lock Tax "
"Return date <accounting/tax-returns/lock-date>` manually beforehand."
msgstr ""
"Si no bloqueas la fecha de :guilabel:`bloqueo de declaración fiscal` antes "
"de revisarla, el sistema bloquea el periodo fiscal de forma automática con "
"la misma fecha del asiento de cierre. Esta función evita ciertos errores "
"fiscales, aunque es mejor definir la :ref:`fecha de bloqueo de forma manual "
"<accounting/tax-returns/lock-date>` de forma manual."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:230
msgid ""
"After the tax report for a period has been posted, that period is locked to "
"prevent new VAT-related journal entries from being created. Corrections to "
"customer invoices or vendor bills must be recorded in the following period."
msgstr ""
"Después de registrar la declaración fiscal de un periodo, el sistema bloquea "
"ese periodo para evitar la creación de nuevos asientos relacionados con el "
"IVA. Es necesario que registres cualquier corrección a las facturas de "
"clientes o proveedores en el siguiente periodo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:237
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:342
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:148
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:220
msgid "Submit"
msgstr "Enviar"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:239
msgid ""
"Once a tax return has completed the :ref:`Review <accounting/tax-returns/vat-"
"return-review>` step, proceed as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Sigue estos pasos después de completar el paso :ref:`Revisar <accounting/tax-"
"returns/vat-return-review>`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:242
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Tax Return` view, click the local VAT report button "
"(e.g., :guilabel:`VAT Return (BE)` or :guilabel:`Tax Report (US)`, depending "
"on the :doc:`fiscal localization <../../fiscal_localizations>`) or "
"the :guilabel:`Generic Tax report` button on the relevant tax return line to "
"preview the tax return report."
msgstr ""
"En la vista de :guilabel:`declaración fiscal`, haz clic en el botón "
"correspondiente a la declaración local (por ejemplo, :guilabel:`Declaración "
"de IVA (BE)` o :guilabel:`Reporte fiscal (EE. UU.)`, según "
"la :doc:`localización fiscal <../../fiscal_localizations>`) o "
"en :guilabel:`Reporte fiscal genérico` en la línea de la declaración "
"correspondiente para previsualizarla."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:246
msgid ""
"Once the tax return report has been verified, go back to the :guilabel:`Tax "
"Return` view and click :guilabel:`Submit`."
msgstr ""
"Después de verificar la declaración, regresa a la vista "
"de :guilabel:`declaración fiscal` y haz clic en :guilabel:`Enviar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:248
msgid ""
"If a :guilabel:`Submission Instructions` pop-up window appears, follow the "
"local :guilabel:`Instructions`, and click :guilabel:`Mark as Submitted` "
"or :ref:`Mark Paid <accounting/tax-returns/vat-return-pay>`."
msgstr ""
"Si aparece la ventana emergente :guilabel:`Instrucciones de envío`, sigue "
"las :guilabel:`instrucciones` locales y haz clic en :guilabel:`Marcar como "
"enviada` o :ref:`Marcar como pagada <accounting/tax-returns/vat-return-pay>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:252
msgid ""
"The submitted tax return contains all the values tax authorities need, and "
"the amount to be paid or refunded."
msgstr ""
"La declaración enviada incluye todos los valores que solicitan las "
"autoridades fiscales y el importe a pagar o a reembolsar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:256
msgid ""
"To display all posted closing journal entries, click the :guilabel:`Tax "
"Returns` journal in the Accounting dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Para ver todos los asientos de cierre registrados, haz clic en el diario "
"de :guilabel:`declaraciones fiscales` en el tablero de Contabilidad."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:258
msgid ""
"To display the tax return entry posted, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-"
"v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` icon and select :guilabel:`View Entry`. "
"The following options are available if needed:"
msgstr ""
"Para ver el asiento registrado de la declaración fiscal, haz clic en el "
"icono :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(tres puntos verticales)` y "
"selecciona :guilabel:`Ver asiento`. Las opciones disponibles son las "
"siguientes:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:262
msgid ":guilabel:`Reverse Entry`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Revertir asiento`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:263
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Reset to Draft`: The :guilabel:`Lock Tax Return` date must be "
"manually removed using a :ref:`lock date exception <accounting/year-end/lock-"
"date-exception>` to reset a tax return entry to draft."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Restablecer a borrador`: Debes eliminar la fecha "
"de :guilabel:`bloqueo de declaración fiscal` de forma manual mediante "
"una :ref:`excepción de flecha bloqueo <accounting/year-end/lock-date-"
"exception>` para restablecer un asiento de declaración a borrador."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:270
msgid "Pay"
msgstr "Pagar"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:272
msgid ""
"Once a tax return is submitted, a :guilabel:`Payment` window appears if a "
"tax payment is required. It displays all necessary payment details to "
"complete the transaction, including a QR code for the banking app, if "
"available for the country's :doc:`fiscal localization <../../"
"fiscal_localizations>` package. There are three options:"
msgstr ""
"Luego de enviar una declaración fiscal, la ventana de :guilabel:`pago` "
"aparece si es necesario pagar impuestos. Esta muestra todos los datos de "
"pago necesarios para completar la operación, incluido un código QR para la "
"aplicación bancaria si el paquete de :doc:`localización fiscal <../../"
"fiscal_localizations>` del país lo permite. Hay tres opciones:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:277
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Mark Paid` after completing the payment: the corresponding "
"tax return line disappears from the :guilabel:`Tax Return` view."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Marcar como pagada` después de completar el pago. La "
"línea desaparecerá de la vista de :guilabel:`declaración fiscal`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:279
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Send` to email all payment information. Once sent, the tax "
"return completes the :guilabel:`Pay` step, and its corresponding line "
"disappears from the :guilabel:`Tax Return` view."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Enviar` para enviar toda la información de pago por "
"correo. Al enviarla, la declaración completa el paso :guilabel:`Pagar` y la "
"línea desaparece de la vista de :guilabel:`declaración fiscal`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:281
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Discard`: the corresponding tax return line remains visible "
"in the :guilabel:`Tax Return` view, indicating the amount due. Click "
"the :icon:`fa-paperclip` :guilabel:`(paperclip)` icon to access the PDF and "
"XLSX files of the submitted tax return."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Descartar`: la línea de la declaración de impuestos "
"correspondiente seguirá visible en la vista de :guilabel:`declaración "
"fiscal` y mostrará el importe pendiente. Haz clic en el icono :icon:`fa-"
"paperclip` :guilabel:`(clip)` para abrir los archivos PDF y XLSX de la "
"declaración de impuestos que ya enviaste."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:285
msgid "view when tax return is submitted"
msgstr "Vista al enviar la declaración fiscal."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:291
msgid "Advance tax payments"
msgstr "Pago anticipado de impuestos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:294
msgid ""
"Advance tax payments are specific to local :doc:`fiscal localizations <../../"
"fiscal_localizations>` and the requirements of certain countries' tax "
"systems."
msgstr ""
"Los pagos anticipados de impuestos dependen de las :doc:`localizaciones "
"fiscales <../../fiscal_localizations>` y de los requisitos de los sistemas "
"fiscales de algunos países."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:297
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Tax Return` view, click :guilabel:`Pay` on the relevant "
"advance tax payment line that needs to be processed."
msgstr ""
"En la vista de :guilabel:`declaración fiscal`, haz clic en :guilabel:`Pagar` "
"en la línea del pago anticipado de impuestos a procesar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:300
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Advance Payment` window, follow the local recommendations, "
"fill in the required local fields, and use the provided payment details to "
"finalize the transaction. Two options are available:"
msgstr ""
"Una vez en la ventana :guilabel:`Pago anticipado`, sigue las recomendaciones "
"locales, completa los campos locales necesarios y usa los datos de pago "
"proporcionados para finalizar la operación. Hay dos opciones disponibles:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:304
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Mark Paid` once the payment is processed: The corresponding "
"advance tax payment line disappears from the :guilabel:`Tax Return` view."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Marcar como pagada` después de procesar el pago. La "
"línea correspondiente del pago anticipado de impuestos desaparecerá de la "
"vista de :guilabel:`declaración fiscal`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:306
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Send` to email all payment information. Once sent, the "
"advance tax payment completes the :guilabel:`Pay` step, and its "
"corresponding line disappears from the :guilabel:`Tax Return` view."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Enviar` para enviar toda la información del pago por "
"correo. Después de enviarla, el pago anticipado completa el "
"paso :guilabel:`Pagar` y su línea desaparecerá de la vista "
"de :guilabel:`declaración fiscal`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:309
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Discard`: The corresponding advance tax payment line "
"remains visible in the :guilabel:`Tax Return` view."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Descartar` y la línea correspondiente del pago "
"anticipado de impuestos seguirá visible en la vista "
"de :guilabel:`declaración fiscal`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:313
msgid ""
"To mark a tax payment that has already been completed, click the :icon:`fa-"
"ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` icon and select :guilabel:`Mark "
"as Completed`."
msgstr ""
"Para marcar un pago de impuestos que ya completaste, haz clic en el "
"icono :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(tres puntos verticales)` y "
"selecciona :guilabel:`Marcar como completado`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:3
msgid "Year-end closing"
msgstr "Cierre del ejercicio"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:5
msgid ""
"Year-end closing is essential for maintaining financial accuracy, complying "
"with regulations, making informed decisions, and ensuring transparency in "
"reporting."
msgstr ""
"El cierre del ejercicio es indispensable para mantener precisión financiera, "
"cumplir con las normas y regulaciones, tomar decisiones informadas y "
"garantizar que haya transparencia en los reportes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:9
msgid ":doc:`Tax return <tax_returns>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Declaración de impuestos <tax_returns>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:14
msgid "Fiscal years"
msgstr "Ejercicios fiscales"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:16
msgid ""
"By default, the fiscal year is set to last 12 months and ends on December "
"31st. However, its duration and end date can vary due to cultural, "
"administrative, and economic considerations."
msgstr ""
"El ejercicio fiscal está configurado para durar 12 meses y terminar el 31 de "
"diciembre de forma predeterminada, pero su duración y fecha de finalización "
"pueden variar por motivos culturales, administrativos o económicos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:19
msgid ""
"To modify these values, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --"
"> Settings`. Under the :guilabel:`Fiscal Periods` section, change "
"the :guilabel:`Last Day` field if necessary."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Ajustes` para "
"modificar estos valores. Diríjase a la sección :guilabel:`Periodos fiscales` "
"y modifique el campo :guilabel:`Último día` si es necesario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:22
msgid ""
"If the period lasts *more* than or *less* than 12 months, "
"enable :guilabel:`Fiscal Years` and :guilabel:`Save`. Go back to "
"the :guilabel:`Fiscal Periods` section and click :icon:`oi-arrow-"
"right` :guilabel:`Fiscal Years`. Then, click :guilabel:`New`, give it "
"a :guilabel:`Name` and both a :guilabel:`Start Date` and :guilabel:`End "
"Date`."
msgstr ""
"Si el periodo dura *más* o *menos* de 12 meses, habilita la "
"función :guilabel:`Años fiscales` y haz clic en :guilabel:`Guardar`. Regresa "
"a la sección :guilabel:`Periodos fiscales` y haz clic en :icon:`oi-arrow-"
"right` :guilabel:`Años fiscales`. Después, haz clic en :guilabel:`Crear`, "
"asígnale un :guilabel:`nombre` y define las fechas de :guilabel:`inicio` y "
"de :guilabel:`finalización`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:28
msgid ""
"Once the set fiscal period is over, Odoo automatically reverts to the "
"default periodicity, considering the value specified in the :guilabel:`Last "
"Day` field."
msgstr ""
"Cuando el periodo fiscal definido termine, Odoo volverá a utilizar la "
"periodicidad predeterminada de manera automática y tomará en cuenta el valor "
"configurado en el campo :guilabel:`Último día`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:34
msgid "Year-end checklist"
msgstr "Tareas a realizar antes del cierre del ejercicio fiscal"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:39
msgid "Before closure"
msgstr "Antes del cierre"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:41
msgid ""
"Before closing a fiscal year, ensure that everything is accurate and up-to-"
"date:"
msgstr ""
"Antes de cerrar el ejercicio asegúrate de que todo esté correcto y "
"actualizado:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:43
msgid ""
"Make sure all bank accounts are fully :doc:`reconciled <../bank/"
"reconciliation>` up to year-end and confirm that the ending book balances "
"match the bank statement balances."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de que todas las cuentas bancarias estén :doc:`conciliadas <../"
"bank/reconciliation>` por completo hasta el cierre del ejercicio y confirma "
"que los balances finales de los libros coincidan con los correspondientes a "
"los de los estados de cuenta bancarios."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:45
msgid ""
"Confirm that all :doc:`customer invoices <../customer_invoices>` "
"and :doc:`vendor bills <../vendor_bills>` have been created and all draft "
"entries have been either confirmed or cancelled, as needed."
msgstr ""
"Confirma que todas las :doc:`facturas de clientes <../customer_invoices>` y "
"todas las :doc:`facturas de proveedores <../vendor_bills>` ya están creadas "
"y que todos los asientos en borrador ya estén confirmados o cancelados según "
"corresponda."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:48
msgid ""
"Ensure the accuracy of all :doc:`expenses <../../expenses>` and validate "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de que todos los :doc:`gastos <../../expenses>` sean correctos y "
"valídalos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:49
msgid ""
"Check that all :doc:`received payments <../payments>` have been encoded and "
"confirmed."
msgstr ""
"Revisa que todos los :doc:`pagos recibidos <../payments>` estén codificados "
"y se hayan confirmado correctamente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:50
msgid "Close all :ref:`suspense accounts <accounting/journals/bank-cash-cc>`."
msgstr ""
"Cierra todas las :ref:`cuentas transitorias <accounting/journals/bank-cash-"
"cc>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:51
msgid ""
"Ensure :doc:`loans <../bank/loans>` are properly registered for automatic "
"amortization calculations."
msgstr ""
"Revisa que los :doc:`préstamos <../bank/loans>` estén registrados de forma "
"correcta para que Odoo calcule la amortización de forma automática."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:53
msgid ""
"Review overdue payables and receivables aged over 60 days, and assess "
"whether a provision for uncertain liabilities or an allowance for doubtful "
"accounts is required."
msgstr ""
"Revisa las cuentas por pagar y por cobrar vencidas con más de 60 días y "
"decide si necesitas crear una provisión por pasivos inciertos o una "
"estimación por cuentas incobrables."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:55
msgid ""
"Book all :doc:`depreciation <../vendor_bills/assets>` and :doc:`deferred "
"revenue <../customer_invoices/deferred_revenues>` entries."
msgstr ""
"Registre todos los asientos de :doc:`depreciación <../vendor_bills/assets>` "
"e :doc:`ingresos diferidos <../customer_invoices/deferred_revenues>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:61
msgid "Closing a fiscal year"
msgstr "Cierre del ejercicio fiscal"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:63
msgid "Then, to close the fiscal year:"
msgstr "Lo siguiente es cerrar el ejercicio:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:65
msgid ""
"Run a :ref:`tax report <accounting/reporting/tax-report>`, and verify that "
"all tax information is correct."
msgstr ""
"Cree un :ref:`reporte fiscal <accounting/reporting/tax-report>` y verifique "
"que toda la información sea correcta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:67
msgid ""
"Reconcile all accounts on the :ref:`balance sheet <accounting/reporting/"
"balance-sheet>`:"
msgstr ""
"Concilie todas las cuentas en el :ref:`balance general <accounting/reporting/"
"balance-sheet>`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:69
msgid ""
"Update the bank balances in Odoo to reflect the actual balances as per the "
"bank statements."
msgstr ""
"Actualiza los saldos bancarios en Odoo para que coincidan con los saldos "
"reales del estado de cuenta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:70
msgid ""
"Reconcile all transactions in the cash and bank accounts by running "
"the :ref:`aged receivables <accounting/reporting/aged-receivable>` "
"and :ref:`aged payables <accounting/reporting/aged-payable>` reports."
msgstr ""
"Concilie las transacciones de las cuentas bancarias y de efectivo con los "
"reportes de :ref:`cuentas por cobrar vencidas <accounting/reporting/aged-"
"receivable>` y :ref:`cuentas por pagar vencidas <accounting/reporting/aged-"
"payable>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:73
msgid ""
"Audit all accounts, fully understanding all transactions and their nature, "
"including :doc:`loans <../bank/loans>` and :doc:`fixed assets <../"
"vendor_bills/assets>`."
msgstr ""
