"*Avalara Included* es un servicio de cálculo de impuestos asequible dentro "
"de la aplicación, diseñado para pequeñas y medianas empresas con necesidades "
"esenciales de cumplimiento fiscal. Está desarrollado sobre la plataforma "
"*AvaTax de Avalara* y se integra con Odoo para proporcionar cálculos de "
"impuestos específicos de la región y en tiempo real para ventas, compras y "
"facturas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:131
msgid ""
"*Avalara Included* is available for databases/companies with locations in "
"the United States and Canada."
msgstr ""
"*Avalara Included* está disponible para bases de datos/empresas con "
"ubicaciones en Estados Unidos y Canadá."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:135
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:287
msgid ""
"`Avalara's support documents <https://community.avalara.com/support/s/"
"resources?language=en_US>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Documentos de soporte de Avalara <https://community.avalara.com/support/s/"
"resources?language=en_US>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:139
msgid ""
"Businesses that exceed 5,000 transactions annually must instead use "
"an :ref:`accounting/avalara/direct` plan to ensure uninterrupted service at "
"higher transaction volumes. To migrate from *Avalara Included* to *Avalara "
"Direct*, speak with your account manager."
msgstr ""
"Las empresas que superan las 5,000 transacciones anuales deben utilizar un "
"plan :ref:`accounting/avalara/direct` para garantizar un servicio "
"ininterrumpido con volúmenes de transacciones más altos. Para migrar de "
"*Avalara Included* a *Avalara Direct*, habla con tu gerente de cuenta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:143
msgid ""
"In :doc:`multicompany environments <../../../general/companies/"
"multi_company>`, *Avalara Included* credentials cannot be shared between "
"companies. Instead, :ref:`create a unique Avalara Included account "
"<accounting/avalara/included-create>` with a unique email address for each "
"individual company in the database."
msgstr ""
"En :doc:`entornos multiempresa <../../../general/companies/multi_company>`, "
"las credenciales de *Avalara Included* no se pueden compartir entre "
"empresas. En su lugar, :ref:`crea una cuenta única de Avalara Included "
"<accounting/avalara/included-create>` con una dirección de correo "
"electrónico única para cada empresa individual en la base de datos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:151
msgid "In-App purchase credits"
msgstr "Créditos de compra en la aplicación"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:153
msgid ""
"*Avalara Included* requires users to purchase credits on the `Odoo IAP page "
"<https://iap.odoo.com/iap/in-app-services/865>`_."
msgstr ""
"*Avalara Included* requiere que los usuarios compren créditos en la `página "
"de IAP de Odoo <https://iap.odoo.com/iap/in-app-services/865>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:156
msgid ""
"One credit is consumed every time an invoice or credit note is posted with "
"an Avatax fiscal position. Select the package that best fits the demand, "
"based on the estimated number of transactions."
msgstr ""
"Se consume un crédito cada vez que se registra una factura o una nota de "
"crédito con una posición fiscal de AvaTax. Selecciona el paquete que mejor "
"se adapte a la demanda, según el número estimado de transacciones."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:165
msgid ""
"*Avalara Included* is available both for Odoo users who do not yet have an "
"Avalara account and need to :ref:`create <accounting/avalara/included-"
"create>` one and for Odoo users with an existing Avalara account that they "
"would like to :ref:`migrate <accounting/avalara/included-migrate>` to the "
"*Avalara Included* plan."
msgstr ""
"*Avalara Included* está disponible tanto para usuarios de Odoo que aún no "
"tienen una cuenta de Avalara y necesitan :ref:`crear <accounting/avalara/"
"included-create>` una, como para usuarios de Odoo con una cuenta de Avalara "
"existente que deseen :ref:`migrar <accounting/avalara/included-migrate>` al "
"plan *Avalara Included*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:173
