msgstr "Crear una cuenta de Avalara Included"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:176
msgid ""
"The Avalara account activation **must** be done on the production database. "
"If the account is created from a test database that does not have an "
"associated valid enterprise account, an error message may appear indicating "
"that no valid enterprise contract was found."
msgstr ""
