#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara/avalara_portal.rst:101
msgid ""
"Additional columns can be added by clicking the :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`Customize columns`. On the resulting popover window, click "
"the drop-down menu for the :guilabel:`column` that should be changed."
