#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:70
msgid "Bill completion"
msgstr "Finalización de la factura"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:72
msgid ""
"Whether the bill is created manually or automatically, make sure the "
"following fields are appropriately completed:"
msgstr ""
"Aunque la factura se cree de forma manual o automática, debe asegurarse de "
"que los siguientes campos se hayan completado correctamente:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:75
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Vendor`: Odoo automatically fills in some information based on "
"the information on the vendor's contact record as well as previous purchase "
"orders and bills."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Proveedor`: Odoo completa en automático cierta información según "
"la información que encuentre en el registro del contacto del proveedor, así "
"como órdenes de compra o facturas antiguas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:77
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bill Reference`: Add the sales order reference provided by the "
"vendor. This field is used to :ref:`match <accounting/payments/payments-"
"matching>` the products when they are received."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Referencia de la factura`: Agregue la referencia de la orden de "
"venta proporcionada por el proveedor. Este campo se usa para realizar "
"la :ref:`conciliación <accounting/payments/payments-matching>` de los "
"productos cuando se reciban."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:79
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Auto-Complete`: Select a past bill/purchase order to complete the "
"document automatically. The :guilabel:`Vendor` field should be completed "
"before completing this field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Autocompletar`: Seleccione una factura u orden de compra para que "
"el documento se complete de forma automática. Debe haber completado el campo "
"de :guilabel:`proveedor` antes de este campo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:81
msgid ":guilabel:`Bill Date`: Select the document's issuance date."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Fecha de factura`: Selecciona la fecha de emisión del documento."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:82
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Accounting Date`: Update the document's accounting registration "
"date if needed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Fecha contable`: Actualiza la fecha en la que se registró el "
"documento en contabilidad si es necesario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:83
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Payment Reference`: The :guilabel:`Memo` field automatically "
"includes the payment reference once the payment is registered."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Referencia de pago`: El campo :guilabel:`Memorando` incluye en "
"automático la referencia de pago una vez que el pago se haya registrado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:85
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Recipient Bank`: Indicates the account number to which the "
"payment will be made. This field is required when paying via batch payment "
"files (such as :ref:`NACHA <l10n_us/ach-electronic-transfers>` "
"and :doc:`SEPA Direct Debit <payments/sepa_payments>`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Banco destinatario`: Indica el número de cuenta al cual se "
"realizará el pago. Este campo es obligatorio cuando se paga mediante "
"archivos de pago por lotes (como :ref:`NACHA <l10n_us/ach-electronic-"
"transfers>` y :doc:`Domiciliación bancaria SEPA <payments/sepa_payments>`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:88
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Due Date` or :guilabel:`Payment Terms` must be specified for the "
"bill payment."
msgstr ""
"La :guilabel:`Fecha de vencimiento` o los :guilabel:`Términos de pago` se "
"deben especificar para la factura del pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:89
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Journal`: Select which journal should record the bill and in "
"which :doc:`currency <get_started/multi_currency>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Diario`: Seleccione en qué diario se debe registrar la factura y "
"en qué :doc:`moneda <get_started/multi_currency>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:94
msgid ""
"To access the product catalog, click :doc:`Catalog </applications/essentials/"
"product_catalog>`."
msgstr ""
"Para acceder al catálogo de productos, haz clic en :doc:`Catálogo </"
"applications/essentials/product_catalog>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:95
msgid ""
"Select the products and quantities, then click :guilabel:`Back to Bill` to "
"return to the vendor bill; the selected catalog items will appear in the "
"vendor bill lines."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona los productos y cantidades, luego haz clic en :guilabel:`Volver a "
"la factura` para regresar a la factura de proveedor. Los productos "
"seleccionados aparecerán en las líneas de la factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:97
msgid ""
"Update the :guilabel:`Quantity`, :guilabel:`Price`, and :doc:`Taxes <taxes>` "
"fields if needed."
msgstr ""
"Actualiza los campos :guilabel:`Cantidad`, :guilabel:`Precio` "
"e :doc:`Impuestos <taxes>` si es necesario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:100
msgid ""
"If the bill line does not correspond to an existing product in the database, "
"click :guilabel:`Add a line` and enter a description for the bill line "
"without linking it to a product."
msgstr ""
"Si la línea de la factura no corresponde a un producto existente en la base "
"de datos, haz clic en :guilabel:`Agregar una línea` y escribe una "
"descripción para la línea de factura sin vincularla a un producto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:104
msgid ""
"Multiple bills for the same purchase order may be issued if the vendor is on "
"back-order and sends invoices as products are shipped or if the vendor sends "
"partial bills or requests a deposit. In this case, multiple bills may have "
"the same :guilabel:`Bill Reference`."
msgstr ""
"Es posible que se emitan varias facturas para la misma orden si el proveedor "
"trabaja con órdenes parciales y envía facturas conforme envía los productos, "
"si el proveedor envía órdenes parciales, o si solicita un depósito. En este "
"caso, es posible que varias facturas tengan la misma :guilabel:`Referencia "
"de factura`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:111
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/invoice_digitization.rst:155
msgid "Purchase order matching"
msgstr "Coincidencia de órdenes de compra"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:113
msgid ""
"Matching a purchase order (PO) with a vendor bill verifies that billed "
"quantities and prices align with the original order, ensuring payment "
"accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Cotejar una orden de compra (PO) con una factura de proveedor verifica que "
"las cantidades y los precios facturados coincidan con la orden original, lo "
"que garantiza la precisión del pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:117
msgid ""
"To display the :guilabel:`Purchase Order` column in a vendor bill, click "
"the :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` :guilabel:`(adjust settings)` icon and "
"enable :guilabel:`Purchase Order`."
msgstr ""
"Para mostrar la columna :guilabel:`Orden de compra` en una factura de "
"proveedor, haz clic en el icono :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` :guilabel:`"
"(ajustar configuración)` y habilita :guilabel:`Orden de compra`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:124
msgid "Matching to an existing PO"
msgstr "Cotejar con una orden de compra existente"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:126
msgid ""
"If a purchase order exists for the :ref:`created vendor bill <accounting/"
"vendor_bills/creation>`, use one of the following methods:"
msgstr ""
"Si existe una orden de compra para la :ref:`factura de proveedor creada "
"<accounting/vendor_bills/creation>`, usa uno de los siguientes métodos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:129
msgid ""
"To automatically fill in the bill lines using all lines from the selected "
"purchase order, click the :guilabel:`Auto-Complete` field and select the "
"relevant purchase order:"
msgstr ""
"Para completar automáticamente las líneas de la factura con todas las líneas "
"de la orden de compra seleccionada, haz clic en el campo "
":guilabel:`Autocompletar` y selecciona la orden de compra correspondiente:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:132
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:158
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:191
msgid ""
"A smart button displaying the purchase order number appears at the top of "
"the vendor bill."
msgstr ""
"En la parte superior de la factura de proveedor aparece un botón inteligente "
"que muestra el número de la orden de compra."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:133
msgid ""
"All bill lines are automatically populated to reflect the matched purchase "
"order."
msgstr ""
"Todas las líneas de la factura se completan automáticamente para reflejar la "
"orden de compra cotejada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:134
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:160
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:192
msgid ""
"The corresponding purchase order number appears in the :guilabel:`Purchase "
"Order` column of the vendor bill."
msgstr ""
"El número de la orden de compra correspondiente aparece en la columna "
":guilabel:`Orden de compra` de la factura de proveedor."

