#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:60
msgid ""
"The Argentinian localization package ensures compliance with Argentinian "
"fiscal and accounting regulations. It includes tools for managing taxes, "
"fiscal positions, reporting, and a predefined chart of accounts tailored to "
"Argentina's standards."
msgstr ""
"El paquete de localización argentina garantiza el cumplimiento de las leyes "
"fiscales y contables de Argentina. Incluye herramientas para gestionar "
"impuestos, posiciones fiscales, reportes y un plan de cuentas predefinido "
"adaptado a las normas de Argentina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:64
msgid ""
"The Argentinian localization package provides the following key features to "
"ensure compliance with local fiscal and accounting regulations:"
msgstr ""
"El paquete de localización argentina cuenta con las siguientes funciones "
"clave para garantizar el cumplimiento de las normas fiscales y contables "
"locales:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:67
msgid ""
":ref:`Chart of accounts <localizations/argentina/chart-accounts>`: a "
"predefined structure tailored to Argentinian accounting standards"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Plan de cuentas <localizations/argentina/chart-accounts>`: Una "
"estructura predefinida adaptada a las normas contables argentinas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:69
msgid ""
":ref:`Taxes <localizations/argentina/taxes>`: pre-configured tax rates, "
"including standard VAT, zero-rated, and exempt options"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Impuestos <localizations/argentina/taxes>`: Tasas impositivas "
"preconfiguradas, incluido el IVA estándar, de tasa cero y excepciones."

