#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:80
msgid ""
"Three distinct :doc:`chart of accounts <../accounting/get_started/"
"chart_of_accounts>` packages are available when :ref:`configuring the "
"Argentinian fiscal localization <fiscal_localizations/packages>`. The choice "
"of package depends on the company’s |ARCA| responsibility type and reflects "
"the different levels of fiscal complexity required:"
msgstr ""
"Hay tres paquetes distintos de :doc:`plan de cuentas <../accounting/"
"get_started/chart_of_accounts>` disponibles al :ref:`configurar la "
"localización fiscal argentina <fiscal_localizations/packages>`. La elección "
"del paquete depende del tipo de responsabilidad ante |ARCA| de la empresa y "
"refleja los distintos niveles de complejidad fiscal necesarios:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:85
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Monotributista` (227 accounts): Generic chart of accounts "
"Argentina single taxpayer / basis"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Monotributista` (227 cuentas): Plan de cuentas genérico para "
"monotributistas de Argentina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:87
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Exento` (290 accounts): Argentine generic chart of accounts for "
"exempt individuals"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Exento` (290 cuentas): Plan de cuentas genérico de Argentina para "
"personas exentas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:88
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Responsable Inscripto` (298 accounts): Argentine generic chart of "
"accounts for registered accountants."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Responsable Inscripto` (298 cuentas): Plan de cuentas genérico de "
"Argentina para responsables inscriptos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:96
msgid ""
"As part of the localization module, taxes are created automatically with "
"their related financial account and configuration, e.g., 73 taxes "
"for :guilabel:`Responsable Inscripto`."
msgstr ""
"Como parte del módulo de localización, el sistema crea los impuestos de "
"forma automática con su cuenta contable y configuración correspondientes. "
"Por ejemplo, hay 73 impuestos para :guilabel:`Responsable Inscripto`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:99
msgid "Argentina has several tax types; the most common ones are:"
msgstr "Argentina tiene varios tipos de impuestos, los más comunes son:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:101
msgid ":guilabel:`VAT`: Regular VAT with various percentages."
msgstr ":guilabel:`IVA`: IVA estándar con distintos porcentajes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:102
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Perception`: Advance payment of a tax that is applied to invoices."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Percepción`: Pago anticipado de un impuesto que se aplica a las "
"facturas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:103
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Retention`: Advance payment of a tax that is applied to payments."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Retención`: Pago anticipado de un impuesto que se aplica a los "
"pagos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:105
msgid ""
"Some Argentinian taxes are not commonly used for all companies, and are "
"therefore labeled as inactive in Odoo by default. Before creating a new tax, "
"check that the tax is not already included and labeled inactive."
msgstr ""
"Algunos impuestos argentinos no suelen aplicarse en todas las empresas y, "
"por ese motivo, Odoo los marca como inactivos de forma predeterminada. Antes "
"de crear un impuesto nuevo, verifica que el impuesto no exista ya y que Odoo "
"no lo marque como inactivo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:112
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:260
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:196
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:158
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:387
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uruguay.rst:254
msgid "Document types"
msgstr "Tipos de documentos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:114
msgid ""
"In some Latin American countries, like Argentina, accounting transactions "
"such as invoices and vendor bills are classified by document types defined "
"by the governmental fiscal authorities. In Argentina, the `ARCA <https://"
"www.arca.gob.ar/>`__ is the governmental fiscal authority that defines such "
"transactions."
msgstr ""
"En algunos países de Latinoamérica, como Argentina, las transacciones "
"contables, como las facturas de cliente y las facturas de proveedor, se "
"clasifican por tipos de documento que definen las autoridades fiscales. En "
"Argentina, `ARCA <https://www.arca.gob.ar/>`__ es la autoridad fiscal que "
"define esas transacciones."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:119
msgid ""
"The document type is an essential piece of information that must be clearly "
"displayed in printed reports, invoices, and journal entries that list "
"account moves."
msgstr ""
"El tipo de documento es un dato esencial que debe aparecer con claridad en "
"los reportes impresos, las facturas y los asientos contables que incluyen "
"movimientos contables."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:122
msgid ""
"Each document type can have a unique sequence per journal where it is "
"assigned. As part of the localization, the document type includes the "
"country where the document is applicable (this data is created automatically "
"when the localization module is installed)."
msgstr ""
"Cada tipo de documento puede tener una secuencia única por diario donde se "
"asigna. Como parte de la localización, el tipo de documento incluye el país "
"donde aplica el documento (este dato se crea de forma automática cuando "
"instalas el módulo de localización)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:126
msgid ""
"The required information about :guilabel:`Document Types` is included by "
"default, so no further configuration is necessary in the :guilabel:`Document "
"Types` view."
msgstr ""
"La información necesaria sobre los :guilabel:`tipos de documento` ya está "
"incluida de forma predeterminada, por lo que no hace falta realizar ninguna "
"configuración adicional en la vista de :guilabel:`tipos de documento`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:130
msgid ""
"The list displayed below is not exhaustive and does not include all "
"available document types."
msgstr ""
"La siguiente lista no incluye todos los tipos de documento disponibles."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:132
msgid "A list of document types in Odoo."
msgstr "Una lista de tipos de documento en Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:136
msgid ""
"Several :guilabel:`Document Types` are inactive by default, but can be "
"activated as needed."
msgstr ""
"Varios :guilabel:`tipos de documento` aparecen como inactivos de forma "
"predeterminada, pero puedes activarlos en caso de que sea necesario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:141
msgid "Letters"
msgstr "Cartas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:143
msgid ""
"For Argentina, the :guilabel:`Document Types` include a letter that helps "
"indicate the type of transaction or operation. For example, when an invoice "
"is related to a(n):"
msgstr ""
"En Argentina, los :guilabel:`tipos de documento` incluyen una letra que "
"indica el tipo de transacción u operación. Por ejemplo, cuando una factura "
"está relacionada con una:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:146
msgid ""
":guilabel:`B2B transaction`, a document type :guilabel:`A` must be used."
msgstr ""
"En una :guilabel:`transacción B2B` debes usar un tipo de "
"documento :guilabel:`A`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:147
msgid ""
":guilabel:`B2C transaction`, a document type :guilabel:`B` must be used."
msgstr ""
"En una :guilabel:`transacción B2C` debes usar un tipo de "
"documento :guilabel:`B`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:148
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Exportation Transaction`, a document type :guilabel:`E` must be "
"used."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Transacción de exportación`, se debe utilizar un tipo de "
"documento :guilabel:`E`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:150
msgid ""
"The documents included in the localization already have the correct letter "
"associated with each :guilabel:`Document Type`, and no further configuration "
"is necessary."
msgstr ""
"Los documentos incluidos en la localización ya tienen la letra correcta "
"asociada a cada :guilabel:`tipo de documento`, por lo que no hace falta que "
"hagas ninguna configuración adicional."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:156
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:276
msgid "Use on invoices"
msgstr "Uso en facturas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:158
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Document Type` on each transaction will be determined by:"
msgstr ""
"El :guilabel:`tipo de documento` de cada transacción se determinará por:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:160
msgid ""
"The journal entry related to the invoice (if the journal uses documents)."
msgstr ""
"El asiento contable relacionado con la factura (si el diario utiliza "
"documentos)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:161
msgid ""
"The conditions applied depend on the issuer and receiver types (e.g., the "
"buyer's and vendor's fiscal regime types)."
msgstr ""
"Las condiciones que aplican dependen del tipo de emisor y receptor (por "
"ejemplo, el tipo de régimen fiscal del cliente y del proveedor)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:169
msgid ""
"In the Argentinian localization, the :doc:`journal <../accounting/"
"get_started/journals>` can have a different approach depending on its usage "
"and internal type. To configure journals, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --"
"> Configuration --> Journals`."
msgstr ""
"En la localización argentina, el :doc:`diario <../accounting/get_started/"
"journals>` puede tener un enfoque distinto según su uso y su tipo interno. "
"Para configurar los diarios, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> "
"Configuración --> Diarios`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:173
msgid ""
"For sales and purchase journals, the :guilabel:`Use Documents` option can be "
"activated, enabling :ref:`Document Types <localizations/argentina/document-"
"types>` to be linked to invoices and vendor bills."
msgstr ""
"En los diarios de ventas y compras, puedes activar la opción :guilabel:`Usar "
"documentos`, lo que permite vincular los :ref:`tipos de documento "
"<localizations/argentina/document-types>` con las facturas de cliente y las "
"facturas de proveedor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:177
msgid ""
"If the sales or purchase journals do not have the :guilabel:`Use Documents` "
"option activated, they will not be able to generate fiscal invoices, "
"limiting their use case mostly to monitoring account moves related to "
"internal control processes."
msgstr ""
"Si los diarios de ventas o compras no tienen activada la "
"opción :guilabel:`Usar documentos`, no podrán generar facturas fiscales, por "
"lo que su uso quedará limitado, en la mayoría de los casos, al seguimiento "
"de los movimientos contables relacionados con procesos de control interno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:184
msgid "ARCA information (ARCA Point of Sale)"
msgstr "Información de ARCA (Punto de venta de ARCA)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:186
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`ARCA POS System` is a field that defines the type of ARCA POS "
"to be used to manage the transactions for which the journal is created."
msgstr ""
"El campo :guilabel:`Sistema de PdV de ARCA` define el tipo de punto de venta "
"de ARCA que se usa para gestionar las transacciones para las que se crea el "
"diario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:189
msgid "The ARCA POS defines the following:"
msgstr "El punto de venta de ARCA define lo siguiente:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:191
msgid "The sequences of document types related to the web service."
msgstr ""
"Las secuencias de los tipos de documento relacionadas con el web service."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:192
msgid "The structure and data of the electronic invoice file."
msgstr "La estructura y los datos del archivo de la factura electrónica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:197
msgid "Web services"
msgstr "Servicios web"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:199
msgid ""
"**Web services** help generate invoices for different purposes. Below are a "
"few options to choose from in the :guilabel:`ARCA POS System` field:"
msgstr ""
"Los **web services** ayudan a generar facturas para distintos fines. A "
"continuación encontrarás algunas opciones que puedes elegir en el "
"campo :guilabel:`Sistema de PdV de ARCA`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:202
msgid ""
":guilabel:`wsfev1: Electronic Invoice`: The most common service, used to "
"generate invoices for document types A, B, C, M, with no item detail."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`wsfev1: Factura Electrónica`: Es el servicio más común. Se usa "
"para generar facturas de los tipos de documento A, B, C y M, sin detalle de "
"ítem."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:204
msgid ""
":guilabel:`wsbfev1: Electronic Fiscal Bond`: For those who invoice capital "
"goods and wish to benefit from the `Electronic Tax Bonds <https://"
"www.argentina.gob.ar/acceder-un-bono-por-fabricar-bienes-de-capital>`_ "
"granted by the Ministry of Economy."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`wsbfev1: Bono Fiscal Electrónico`: Se usa para quienes facturan "
"bienes de capital y quieren acceder a los `Bonos de Crédito Fiscal "
"Electrónico <https://www.argentina.gob.ar/acceder-un-bono-por-fabricar-"
"bienes-de-capital>`_ que otorga el Ministerio de Economía."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:207
msgid ""
":guilabel:`wsfexv1: Export Voucher`: Used to generate invoices for "
"international customers and transactions involving export processes; the "
"related document type is type E."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`wsfexv1: Factura de Exportación`: Se usa para generar facturas "
"destinadas a clientes del exterior y transacciones relacionadas con procesos "
"de exportación. El tipo de documento asociado es el tipo E."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:210
msgid "Here are some useful fields to know when working with web services:"
msgstr ""
"Estos son algunos campos útiles que debe conocer al trabajar con servicios "
"web:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:212
msgid ""
":guilabel:`ARCA POS Number`: The number configured in |ARCA| to identify the "
"operations related to this ARCA POS."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Número del PdV de ARCA`: Es el número que configuras en |ARCA| "
"para identificar las operaciones relacionadas con este punto de venta de "
"ARCA."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:214
msgid ""
":guilabel:`ARCA POS Address`: The field related to the commercial address "
"registered for the POS, which is usually the same address as the company. "
"For example, if a company has multiple stores (fiscal locations), then |"
"ARCA| will require the company to have one ARCA POS per location. This "
"location will appear on the invoice report."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Dirección del PdV de ARCA`: Es el campo relacionado con la "
"dirección comercial registrada para el punto de venta, que suele coincidir "
"con la dirección de la empresa. Por ejemplo, si una empresa tiene varias "
"sucursales (domicilios fiscales), |ARCA| exige un punto de venta de ARCA "
"para cada ubicación. Esta dirección aparece en el reporte de la factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:219
msgid ""
"In ARCA, when configuring the electronic invoicing data, the following "
"should be configured:"
msgstr ""
"En ARCA, al configurar los datos de la facturación electrónica, debes "
"completar lo siguiente:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:221
msgid "Monotributista: Factura Electrónica – Monotributo - WebServices"
msgstr "Monotributista: Factura Electrónica – Monotributo - WebServices"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:222
msgid "Exento: Facturación Electrónica - exento en IVA - WebServices"
msgstr "Exento: Facturación Electrónica - exento en IVA - WebServices"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:223
msgid "Responsable Inscripto: RECE para aplicativo y WebServices"
msgstr "Responsable Inscripto: RECE para aplicativo y WebServices"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:228
msgid "Sequences"
msgstr "Secuencias"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:230
msgid ""
"For the first invoice, Odoo automatically synchronizes with ARCA and "
"displays the last sequence used."
msgstr ""
"Para la primera factura, Odoo sincroniza con ARCA de forma automática y "
"muestra la última secuencia usada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:234
msgid ""
"When creating :guilabel:`Purchase Journals`, specify if they are related to "
"document types. When the :guilabel:`Use Documents` option is activated, "
"there is no need to manually associate document type sequences, since the "
"vendor provides the document number."
msgstr ""
"Cuando crees :guilabel:`diarios de compras`, indica si se relacionan con "
"tipos de documento. Si activas la opción :guilabel:`Usar documentos`, no "
"hace falta asociar las secuencias de los tipos de documento de forma manual, "
"ya que el proveedor proporciona el número del documento."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:243
msgid ""
"As part of the localization installation, financial :doc:`reporting <../"
"accounting/reporting>` for Argentina is available in "
"the :guilabel:`Accounting` dashboard. To access these reports, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting`, and select the relevant report "
"in the :guilabel:`Argentinean Statements` section."
msgstr ""
"Como parte de la instalación de la localización, los :doc:`reportes <../"
"accounting/reporting>` financieros para Argentina están disponibles en el "
"tablero de :guilabel:`Contabilidad`. Para acceder a estos reportes, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Reportes` y selecciona el reporte "
"correspondiente en la sección :guilabel:`Estados contables de Argentina`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:248
msgid ""
"To access the VAT book report, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Reporting --> Tax Report`, click :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`Report:`, and "
"select :guilabel:`VAT book (AR)`."
msgstr ""
"Para acceder al reporte del libro de IVA, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad "
"--> Reportes --> Reporte de impuestos`, haz clic en :icon:`fa-"
"book` :guilabel:`Reporte:` y selecciona :guilabel:`Libro de IVA (AR)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:252
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(cog)` icon and select :guilabel:`VAT "
"Book (ZIP)` or :guilabel:`VAT Simple Report (ZIP)` to generate the VAT Book "
"or VAT Simple report ZIP file, respectively."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en el icono :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(engranaje)` y "
"selecciona :guilabel:`Libro de IVA (ZIP)` o :guilabel:`Reporte simple de IVA "
"(ZIP)` para generar el archivo ZIP del libro de IVA o del reporte simple de "
"IVA, según corresponda."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:259
msgid "VAT summary"
msgstr "Resumen de IVA"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:261
msgid ""
"This pivot table displays the monthly VAT totals. This report is for "
"internal use and is not sent to the ARCA. To access it, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> VAT Summary`."
msgstr ""
"Esta tabla dinámica muestra los totales mensuales de IVA. Este reporte es "
"para uso interno y no se envía a ARCA. Para acceder, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Reportes --> Resumen de IVA`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:267
msgid "IIBB - Sales by jurisdiction"
msgstr "IIBB - Ventas por jurisdicción"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:269
msgid ""
"This pivot table displays the gross income for each jurisdiction. It serves "
"as an affidavit for the corresponding taxes due, but is not submitted to the "
"ARCA. To access it, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> IIBB "
"Sales by jurisdiction`."
msgstr ""
"Esta tabla dinámica muestra los ingresos brutos de cada jurisdicción. Sirve "
"como declaración jurada para los impuestos correspondientes, pero no se "
"presenta ante ARCA. Para acceder, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> "
"Reportes --> IIBB de ventas por jurisdicción`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:276
msgid "IIBB - Purchases by jurisdiction"
msgstr "IIBB - Compras por jurisdicción"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:278
msgid ""
"This pivot table displays the gross purchases for each jurisdiction. It "
"serves as an affidavit for the corresponding taxes due, but is not submitted "
"to the ARCA. To access it, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --"
"> IIBB --> Purchases by jurisdiction`."
msgstr ""
"Esta tabla dinámica muestra las compras brutas de cada jurisdicción. Sirve "
"como declaración jurada para los impuestos correspondientes, pero no se "
"presenta ante ARCA. Para acceder, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> "
"Reportes --> IIBB --> Compras por jurisdicción`."

