msgid ""
"The |FCE| is rejected; then, the credit note should have the :guilabel:`FCE: "
"is Cancellation?` option enabled, or"
msgstr ""
"El |FCE| se rechaza. En ese caso, la opción :guilabel:`FCE: ¿Es una "
"cancelación?` debe estar activada, o"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:590
msgid ""
"The credit note is created to annul the |FCE| document; then, "
"the :guilabel:`FCE: is Cancellation?` option must be disabled."
msgstr ""
"La nota de crédito se crea para anular el documento |FCE|. En ese caso, la "
"opción :guilabel:`FCE: ¿Es una cancelación?` debe estar desactivada."

