msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`PDF Report` for electronic invoices validated by |ARCA| "
"includes a QR code at the bottom of the page, which represents the |CAE| "
"number. The expiration date is also displayed, as it is a legal requirement."
msgstr ""
"El :guilabel:`reporte PDF` de las facturas electrónicas validadas por |ARCA| "
"incluye un código QR en la parte inferior de la página que representa el "
"número de |CAE|. También muestra la fecha de vencimiento, ya que es un "
"requisito legal."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:602
msgid "Invoice printed report."
msgstr "Reporte de factura impreso."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:608
msgid "Troubleshooting and auditing"
msgstr "Solución de problemas y auditorías"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:610
msgid ""
"For auditing and troubleshooting purposes, detailed information can be "
"obtained for an invoice number previously sent to |ARCA|. To retrieve this "
"information, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"Con fines de auditoría y resolución de problemas, puedes obtener información "
"detallada de un número de factura que ya se envió a |ARCA|. Para obtener "
"esta información, sigue estos pasos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:614
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Accounting --> Consult Invoice in ARCA`."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Contabilidad --> Consultar factura en "
"ARCA`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:615
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Consult invoice in ARCA` window, select the "
"relevant :guilabel:`Journal`, :guilabel:`Document Type`, "
"and :guilabel:`Number`. Then, click :guilabel:`Get Invoice Detail`."
msgstr ""
"En la ventana :guilabel:`Consultar factura en ARCA`, selecciona "
"el :guilabel:`diario`, el :guilabel:`tipo de documento` y "
"el :guilabel:`número` correspondientes. Luego, haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Obtener detalle de la factura`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:618
msgid "Details of invoice consulted in ARCA."
msgstr "Detalles de la factura consultada en ARCA."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:622
msgid ""
"To retrieve the last number used in ARCA for a specific :guilabel:`Document "
"Type` and POS :guilabel:`Number` and use this reference for any potential "
"issues with the sequence synchronization between Odoo and ARCA, "
"select :guilabel:`Get Last Invoice` as the :guilabel:`Type`."
msgstr ""
"Para obtener el último número usado en ARCA para un :guilabel:`tipo de "
"documento` y un :guilabel:`número` de punto de venta específicos, y usar "
"esta referencia ante posibles problemas con la sincronización de secuencias "
"entre Odoo y ARCA, selecciona :guilabel:`Obtener última factura` "
"como :guilabel:`tipo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:632
msgid ""
"Based on the selected purchase journal for the vendor bill, "
"the :guilabel:`Document Type` field is now required. This value is auto-"
"populated based on the :ref:`ARCA Responsibility Type <localizations/"
"argentina/contact-arca>` of Issuer and Customer, but it can be changed if "
"necessary."
msgstr ""
"Según el diario de compras seleccionado para la factura de proveedor, el "
"campo :guilabel:`Tipo de documento` ahora es obligatorio. Odoo completa este "
"valor de forma automática según el :ref:`tipo de responsabilidad ante ARCA "
"<localizations/argentina/contact-arca>` del emisor y del cliente, aunque "
"puedes cambiarlo en caso de que sea necesario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:636
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Document Number` field must be entered manually, and the "
"format will be validated automatically. However, if the format is invalid, "
"an error message indicates the expected format."
msgstr ""
"Debes ingresar el campo :guilabel:`Número de documento` de forma manual y "
"Odoo validará el formato de forma automática. Si el formato no es válido, "
"aparecerá un mensaje de error que indica el formato esperado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:639
msgid ""
"The vendor bill number is structured the same way as customer invoices, "
"except that the document sequence is entered by the user in the following "
"format: `Document Prefix - Letter - Document Number`."
msgstr ""
"El número de la factura de proveedor tiene la misma estructura que el de las "
"facturas de cliente, salvo que el usuario ingresa la secuencia del documento "
"con el siguiente formato: `Prefijo del documento - Letra - Número de "
"documento`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:646
msgid "Validate vendor bill number in ARCA"
msgstr "Validar el número de la factura de proveedor en ARCA"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:648
msgid ""
"As most companies have internal controls to verify that the vendor bill is "
"related to a valid |ARCA| document, an automatic validation can be set."
msgstr ""
"Como la mayoría de las empresas aplica controles internos para verificar que "
"la factura de proveedor corresponda a un documento válido de |ARCA|, puedes "
"configurar una validación automática."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:651
msgid ""
"To do so, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`, "
"scroll down to the :guilabel:`Argentinean Localization` section, then set "
"one of the following options under :guilabel:`Verify Vendor Bills validity "
"in ARCA`:"
msgstr ""
"Para hacerlo, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> "
"Ajustes`, dirígete a la sección :guilabel:`Localización argentina` y "
"selecciona una de las siguientes opciones en :guilabel:`Verificar la validez "
"de las facturas de los proveedores en ARCA`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:655
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Not available:` No verification is performed (this is the default "
"value)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`No disponible:` No se realiza ninguna verificación (este es el "
"valor predeterminado)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:656
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Available:` Verification is performed. If the number is invalid, "
"a warning is displayed but the vendor bill can still be posted."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Disponible:` Se realiza la verificación. Si el número no es "
"válido, aparece una advertencia, pero puedes registrar la factura de "
"proveedor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:658
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Required:` Verification is performed. The vendor bill can only be "
"posted if the number is valid."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Obligatorio:` Se realiza la verificación. Solo puedes registrar "
"la factura de proveedor si el número es válido."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:664
msgid "Validate vendor bills in Odoo"
msgstr "Validar facturas de proveedor en Odoo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:666
msgid ""
"Once the :ref:`vendor bill validation settings are enabled <localizations/"
"argentina/validate-vendor-bill>`, click :guilabel:`Verify on ARCA` in "
"the :guilabel:`Authorization code` field."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que actives los :ref:`ajustes para validar facturas de proveedor "
"<localizations/argentina/validate-vendor-bill>`, haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Verificar en ARCA` en el campo :guilabel:`Código de "
"autorización`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:670
msgid ""
"If the vendor bill cannot be validated in ARCA, the status is updated "
"to :guilabel:`Rejected` in the :guilabel:`Authorization code` field, and the "
"details are recorded in the chatter."
msgstr ""
"Si ARCA no puede validar la factura de proveedor, el estado cambia "
"a :guilabel:`Rechazado` en el campo :guilabel:`Código de autorización` y "
"Odoo registra los detalles en el chatter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:681
msgid "Untaxed concepts"
msgstr "Conceptos sin impuestos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:683
msgid ""
"Some transactions include items that are not part of the VAT base amount, "
"such as fuel and gasoline invoices."
msgstr ""
"Algunas transacciones incluyen ítems que no forman parte de la base "
"imponible del IVA, como las facturas de combustible y gasolina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:686
msgid ""
"The vendor bill will be recorded using one item for each product that is "
"part of the VAT base amount, and an additional item to register the amount "
"of the exempt concept."
msgstr ""
"La factura de proveedor se registrará con un ítem por cada producto que "
"forme parte de la base imponible del IVA y un ítem adicional para registrar "
"el importe del concepto exento."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:689
msgid "VAT exempt."
msgstr "Exento de IVA."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:695
msgid "Perception taxes"
msgstr "Impuestos de percepción"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:697
msgid ""
"The vendor bill will be recorded using one item for each product that is "
"part of the VAT base amount, and the perception tax can be added to any of "
"the product lines. As a result, there will be one tax group for the VAT and "
"another for the perception. The perception default value is "
"always :guilabel:`0.10`."
msgstr ""
"La factura de proveedor se registrará con un ítem por cada producto que "
"forme parte de la base imponible del IVA, y puedes agregar el impuesto de "
"percepción a cualquiera de las líneas de producto. Como resultado, habrá un "
"grupo de impuestos para el IVA y otro para la percepción. El valor "
"predeterminado de la percepción siempre es :guilabel:`0,10`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:702
msgid ""
"To edit the VAT perception and set the correct amount, you should use "
"the :guilabel:`Pencil` icon next to the :guilabel:`Perception` amount. After "
"the VAT perception amount has been set, the invoice can be validated."
msgstr ""
"Para editar la percepción de IVA y establecer el importe correcto, usa el "
"icono :guilabel:`Lápiz` junto al importe de :guilabel:`percepción`. Una vez "
"que establezcas el importe de la percepción de IVA, puedes validar la "
"factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:706
msgid "Enter the perception amount."
msgstr "Introducir el importe de percepción."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:712
msgid "Withholding management"
msgstr "Gestión de retención"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:715
msgid ""
"Make sure the :guilabel:`Argentina Payment Withholdings` "
"(`l10n_ar_withholding`) module is :ref:`installed <general/install>`."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de que el módulo :guilabel:`Argentina - Retenciones de pago` "
"(`l10n_ar_withholding`) esté :ref:`instalado <general/install>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:718
msgid ""
"The Argentinian fiscal localization module contains the necessary "
"withholding records, which can be seen by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Taxes` and removing the "
"default :guilabel:`Sale or Purchase` filter."
msgstr ""
"El módulo de localización fiscal argentina ya incluye los registros de "
"retenciones necesarios. Puedes consultarlos si vas "
"a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Impuestos` y eliminas "
"el filtro predeterminado :guilabel:`Ventas o Compras`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:722
msgid ""
"Journal entries are *not* created when payments are posted "
"unless :ref:`outstanding accounts <accounting/journals/outstanding-"
"accounts>` are set up. Thus, for this feature to work properly, it is "
"important to verify that *all* payment methods within the bank journals have "
"an outstanding payment and receipt account set."
msgstr ""
"El sistema *no* crea asientos contables al registrar los pagos, a menos que "
"configures :ref:`cuentas pendientes <accounting/journals/outstanding-"
"accounts>`. Por lo tanto, para que esta función funcione de forma correcta, "
"es importante que verifiques que **todos** los métodos de pago en los "
"diarios bancarios tengan configuradas sus cuentas pendientes de pagos y de "
"cobros."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:727
msgid "An outstanding payment account must be set."
msgstr "Es necesario que defina una cuenta de pagos pendientes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:730
msgid ""
"This configuration is crucial for the proper accounting of withholding "
"transactions with clients and vendors."
msgstr ""
"Esta configuración es indispensable para contabilizar las transacciones de "
"retención con clientes y proveedores de forma correcta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:734
msgid ""
"In Argentina, withholdings represent the cancellation of a specific portion "
"of the total debt owed to a supplier or a reduction in the total payment to "
"be collected from a customer. Therefore, one or multiple withholdings can be "
"recorded for each payment applied to an invoice."
msgstr ""
"En Argentina, las retenciones representan la cancelación de una porción "
"específica de la deuda total que se debe a un proveedor o una reducción en "
"el pago total que se debe cobrar a un cliente. Por lo tanto, es posible "
"registrar una o varias retenciones para cada pago aplicado a una factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:743
msgid ""
"While Odoo already creates most of the required withholdings inside "
"the :guilabel:`Taxes` menu, in several cases it is necessary to apply or "
"modify configurations to correctly calculate the withholding amount on "
"vendor payments. The following withholding types are available:"
msgstr ""
"Aunque Odoo ya crea la mayoría de las retenciones necesarias en el "
"menú :guilabel:`Impuestos`, en varios casos es necesario aplicar o modificar "
"algunas configuraciones para calcular el importe de la retención en los "
"pagos a proveedores de forma correcta. Están disponibles los siguientes "
"tipos de retención:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:747
msgid ":ref:`Earnings <localizations/argentina/earnings-withholdings>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Ganancias <localizations/argentina/earnings-withholdings>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:748
msgid ""
":ref:`Earnings Scale <localizations/argentina/earnings-scale-withholdings>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Escala de ganancias <localizations/argentina/earnings-scale-"
"withholdings>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:749
msgid ""
":ref:`IIBB Total Amount <localizations/argentina/iib-total-amount-"
"withholdings>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Importe total de IIBB <localizations/argentina/iib-total-amount-"
"withholdings>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:750
msgid ""
":ref:`IIBB Non-Taxable <localizations/argentina/iib-nontax-withholdings>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`IIBB no gravado <localizations/argentina/iib-nontax-withholdings>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:755
msgid "Earnings"
msgstr "Ganancias"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:757
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Earnings` withholdings, Odoo already has a record for each "
"regime group, which is listed under the tax name and the |ARCA| code."
msgstr ""
"Para las retenciones de :guilabel:`ganancias`, Odoo ya incluye un registro "
"para cada grupo de régimen, que aparece bajo el nombre del impuesto y el "
"código de |ARCA|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:760
msgid ""
"Each of these records is ready to be used. As a best practice, the "
"configuration should be double-checked to make sure it is updated and well-"
"applied. The fields to validate are:"
msgstr ""
"Cada uno de estos registros está listo para usar. Como buena práctica, "
"revisa la configuración para asegurarte de que esté actualizada y se aplique "
"de forma correcta. Los campos que debes validar son:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:763
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Amount`: This is the percentage of the total payment amount which "
"is withheld."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Importe`: Es el porcentaje del importe total del pago que se "
"retiene."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:764
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Non-Taxable Amount`: Up to this amount, the withholding does not "
"apply."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Monto no imponible`: Hasta este importe, la retención no se "
"aplica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:765
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Minimum Withholding`: If the calculated withholding amount is "
"smaller than this value, the total withholding amount is set to `0.0`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Retención mínima`: Si el importe de la retención calculado es "
"menor que este valor, el monto total de la retención se definirá con `0.0`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:767
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Withholding Sequence`: This field automates the capture of a "
"withholding number under the payment line. If this field is not set, a "
"number is manually captured while adding a withholding to a payment."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Secuencia de retención`: Este campo automatiza la asignación de "
"un número de retención en la línea de pago. Si no configuras este campo, "
"debes ingresar el número de forma manual al agregar una retención a un pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:771
msgid "Earnings withholding type."
msgstr "Tipo de retención de ganancias."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:777
msgid "Earnings Scale"
msgstr "Escala de ganancias"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:779
msgid ""
"In this particular case, a percentage does not need to be set. Instead, this "
"withholding is calculated based on the value of the :guilabel:`Scale` field."
msgstr ""
"En este caso no es necesario establecer un porcentaje, sino que esta "
"retención se calcula de acuerdo al valor del campo :guilabel:`Escala`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:782
msgid ""
"To view, modify, or create new scales, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Earnings Scale`. By "
"default, the Argentinian localization is preconfigured with two main scales. "
"However, scales should be created and updated as necessary to suit a "
"business's needs."
msgstr ""
"Para consultar, modificar o crear nuevas escalas, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Escala de ganancias`. "
"De forma predeterminada, la localización argentina incluye dos escalas "
"principales. Sin embargo, debes crear y actualizar las escalas según las "
"necesidades de la empresa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:787
msgid ""
"Earnings scales are cumulative, which means that Odoo keeps track of the "
"different records created for a bill and automatically calculates the "
"correct withholding amount."
msgstr ""
"Las escalas de ganancias son acumulativas, lo que significa que Odoo "
"conserva el registro de los distintos movimientos creados para una factura y "
"calcula de forma automática el importe correcto de la retención."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:793
msgid "IIBB Total Amount"
msgstr "Importe total de IIBB"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:795
msgid ""
"In this case, the necessary records related to the applicable province must "
"be created. The withholding amount is calculated based on the "
"percentage :guilabel:`Amount` set on the tax configuration. Since Odoo does "
"not automatically synchronize the percentages applicable to each province, "
"this information must be manually updated."
msgstr ""
"En este caso, debes crear los registros necesarios relacionados con la "
"provincia correspondiente. El importe de la retención se calcula según el "
"porcentaje de :guilabel:`importe` establecido en la configuración del "
"impuesto. Como Odoo no sincroniza de forma automática los porcentajes "
"aplicables a cada provincia, debes actualizar esta información de forma "
"manual."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:800
msgid ""
"The recommendation, in this case, is to always duplicate and apply the "
"different configurations to each record to safeguard technical "
"configurations that allow the proper calculation and accounting of the "
"withholding."
msgstr ""
"En este caso, recomendamos duplicar siempre los registros y aplicar las "
"distintas configuraciones a cada uno para conservar las configuraciones "
"técnicas que permiten calcular y contabilizar la retención de forma correcta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:807
msgid "IIBB Untaxed"
msgstr "IIBB no gravable"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:809
msgid ""
"The configuration of non-taxable gross income withholdings is very similar "
"to that of a :ref:`total amount withholding <localizations/argentina/iib-"
"total-amount-withholdings>`, so the percentage :guilabel:`Amount` in each "
"record must be maintained. However, Odoo comes preconfigured with several "
"records that apply to different provinces. The difference, in this case, is "
"that it is not necessary to establish a non-taxable amount or minimum "
"withholding for this record type."
msgstr ""
"La configuración de las retenciones de ingresos brutos no gravados es muy "
"similar a la de una :ref:`retención sobre el importe total <localizations/"
"argentina/iib-total-amount-withholdings>`, por lo que debes mantener el "
"porcentaje de :guilabel:`importe` en cada registro. Sin embargo, Odoo ya "
"incluye varios registros configurados para distintas provincias. La "
"diferencia en este caso es que no hace falta establecer un importe no "
"gravado ni una retención mínima para este tipo de registro."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:818
msgid "Partner withholding assignation"
msgstr "Asignación de retención de contactos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:820
msgid ""
"Once the proper configuration is set on each possible withholding for "
"partners, the applicable withholdings must be assigned to each contact. To "
"do this, open the Contacts app and select the desired partner. In "
"the :guilabel:`Accounting` tab, find the :guilabel:`Purchase Withholdings` "
"table."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que configures de forma correcta todas las retenciones posibles para "
"los contactos, debes asignar las retenciones aplicables a cada contacto. "
"Para hacerlo, abre la aplicación Contactos y selecciona el contacto "
"correspondiente. En la pestaña :guilabel:`Contabilidad`, busca la tabla "
"de :guilabel:`retenciones de compras`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:825
msgid ""
"By using the additional fields :guilabel:`From Date` and :guilabel:`To "
"Date`, the applicability of multiple withholdings can be automated across "
"different date ranges. The :guilabel:`ref` field allows you to apply an "
"internal control number to each withholding line, which is just for internal "
"reference, so it does not affect any transactions and is not visible on "
"them. These fields are accessible from the :icon:`oi-settings-"
"adjust` :guilabel:`(adjust settings)` menu."
msgstr ""
"Al utilizar los campos adicionales :guilabel:`Desde la fecha` "
"y :guilabel:`Hasta la fecha` puede automatizar la aplicación de varias "
"retenciones en diferentes intervalos. El campo :guilabel:`Referencia` le "
"permite asignar un número de control interno a cada línea de retención, este "
"solo es para referencia interna y no influye en ninguna transacción ni "
"aparece en ellas. Vaya al menú :icon:`oi-settings-"
"adjust` :guilabel:`(ajustes adicionales)` para acceder a estos campos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:831
msgid ":guilabel:`From Date`: The start of the withholding date range."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Fecha desde`: La fecha de inicio del periodo de retención."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:832
msgid ":guilabel:`To Date`: The end of the withholding date range."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Fecha hasta`: Fecha de finalización del periodo de retención."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:833
msgid ""
":guilabel:`ref`: Apply an internal control number to each withholding line "
"that is only visible for internal reference and does not affect any "
"transactions."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`ref`: Aplica un número de control interno a cada línea de "
"retención que solo será visible como referencia interna y no afectará "
"ninguna transacción."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:839
msgid "Automatic withholding calculation and application per payment"
msgstr "Cálculo automático de la retención y aplicación por pago"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:841
msgid ""
"By applying new payments to vendor bills, Odoo automatically applies and "
"calculates the proper withholding into the payment. Based on the record's "
"configuration, it may be necessary to use a reference number for each "
"withholding line."
msgstr ""
"Al aplicar nuevos pagos a facturas de proveedor, Odoo calcula y aplica la "
"retención correspondiente en el pago de manera automática. Es posible que "
"deba utilizar un número de referencia para cada línea de retención, esto "
"depende de la configuración del registro."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:845
msgid ""
"More withholdings can be added, or computed withholdings can be edited if "
"necessary."
msgstr ""
"Puede agregar más retenciones o, si es necesario, editar las retenciones "
"caluladas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:847
msgid "Payment with applied withholdings."
msgstr "Pago con retenciones aplicadas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:851
msgid ""
"The amount of the debt to be cancelled equals the total payment amount. "
"However, Odoo still captures the net amount (i.e., the amount to be "
"reconciled with the bank), which will be represented as the payment amount "
"after the withholding application."
msgstr ""
"El importe de la deuda que se cancelará equivale al importe total del pago. "
"Sin embargo, Odoo conserva el importe neto (es decir, el importe que se "
"concilia con el banco), que corresponde al importe del pago después de "
"aplicar la retención."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:855
msgid "Payment registered form."
msgstr "Formulario de pago registrado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:861
msgid "Check management"
msgstr "Gestión de cheques"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:864
msgid ""
"Make sure to :ref:`install <general/install>` the :guilabel:`Third Party and "
"Deferred/Electronic Checks Management` (`l10n_latam_check`) module."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de :ref:`instalar <general/install>` el módulo :guilabel:`Gestión "
"de cheques electrónicos, diferidos y de terceros` (`l10n_latam_check`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:867
msgid ""
"This module enables the required configuration for journals and payments to:"
msgstr ""
"Este módulo activa la configuración necesaria para diarios y pagos para:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:869
msgid "Create, manage, and control your different types of checks."
msgstr "Crear, gestionar y controlar los distintos tipos de cheques."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:870
msgid "Optimize the management of *own checks* and *third-party checks*."
msgstr "Optimizar la gestión de *cheques propios* y *cheques de terceros*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:871
msgid ""
"Have an easy and effective way to manage expiration dates for your own and "
"third-party checks."
msgstr ""
"Contar con una forma fácil y eficaz de gestionar las fechas de vencimiento "
"de tus cheques propios y de terceros."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:873
msgid ""
"Once all the configurations are set for the Argentinian electronic invoice "
"flow, it is also needed to complete certain configurations for the own "
"checks and third-party checks flows."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que completes todas las configuraciones del flujo de facturación "
"electrónica argentina, también debes completar algunas configuraciones para "
"los flujos de cheques propios y de terceros."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:879
msgid "Own checks"
msgstr "Cheques propios"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:881
msgid ""
"Configure the bank journal used to create your own checks by going "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Journals`, selecting the "
"bank journal, and opening the :guilabel:`Outgoing Payments` tab."
msgstr ""
"Configure el diario bancario que se usa para crear sus cheques propios "
"en :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Diarios`, seleccione "
"el diario bancario y abra la pestaña :guilabel:`Pagos salientes`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:885
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Checks` should be available as a :guilabel:`Payment Method`. If "
"not, click :guilabel:`Add a line` and type `Checks` under :guilabel:`Payment "
"Method` to add them."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cheques` debe estar disponible como :guilabel:`método de pago`. "
"Si no es así, haz clic en :guilabel:`Agregar una línea` y escribe `Cheques` "
"en :guilabel:`Método de pago` para agregarlo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:887
msgid "Enable the :guilabel:`Use electronic and deferred checks` setting."
msgstr "Active la opción :guilabel:`Usar cheques electrónicos y diferidos`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:890
msgid "This last configuration disables the printing ability but:"
msgstr "Esta última configuración desactiva la posibilidad de imprimir, pero:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:892
msgid "allows check numbers to be entered manually"
msgstr "permite ingresar los números de los cheques de forma manual"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:893
msgid "adds a field to indicate the payment date of the check"
msgstr "agrega un campo para indicar la fecha de pago del cheque"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:898
msgid "Management of own checks"
msgstr "Gestión de cheques propios"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:900
msgid ""
"Own checks can be created directly from the vendor bill. For this process, "
"click :guilabel:`Register Payment`."
msgstr ""
"Puedes crear cheques propios directamente desde la factura de proveedor. "
"Para hacerlo, haz clic en :guilabel:`Registrar pago`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:903
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Pay` window, select the bank journal from which the "
"payment is to be made and set the :guilabel:`Check Cash-In Date` "
"and :guilabel:`Amount`."
msgstr ""
"En la ventana :guilabel:`Pagar`, selecciona el diario bancario desde el que "
"se realizará el pago y establece la :guilabel:`fecha de cobro del cheque` y "
"el :guilabel:`importe`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:907
msgid ""
"To manage current checks, the :guilabel:`Check Cash-In Date` field must be "
"left blank or filled in with the current date. To manage deferred checks, "
"the :guilabel:`Check Cash-In Date` must be set in the future."
msgstr ""
"Para gestionar cheques actuales debe dejar el campo :guilabel:`Fecha de "
"entrada de efectivo` vacío o completarlo con la fecha actual. Para gestionar "
"cheques diferidos, el campo :guilabel:`Fecha de entrada de efectivo` debe "
"tener una fecha en el futuro."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:911
msgid ""
"To manage your existing own checks, navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting --"
"> Vendors --> Own Checks`. This window displays critical information, "
"including the dates checks must be paid, the total number of checks, and the "
"total amount paid in checks."
msgstr ""
"Para gestionar tus cheques propios existentes, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Proveedores --> Cheques propios`. Esta "
"ventana muestra información importante, como las fechas en las que debes "
"pagar los cheques, el número total de cheques y el importe total pagado con "
"cheques."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:915
msgid ""
"It is important to note that the list is pre-filtered by checks that are "
"still *not reconciled* with a bank statement - that were not yet debited "
"from the bank - which can be verified with the :guilabel:`Is Matched with a "
"Bank Statement` field. If you want to see all of your own checks, delete "
"the :guilabel:`No Bank Matching` filter by clicking on the :guilabel:`X` "
"symbol."
msgstr ""
"Es importante tener en cuenta que en la lista solo aparecerán los cheques "
"que aún *no están conciliados* con un estado de cuenta bancaria, es decir, "
"aquellos que aún no han sido debitados del banco. Puede verificar con el "
"campo :guilabel:`Corresponde con un estado de cuenta bancario`. Si desea ver "
"todos sus cheques propios, haga clic en el símbolo :guilabel:`X` para "
"eliminar el filtro :guilabel:`Sin conciliación bancaria`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:923
msgid "Cancel an own check"
msgstr "Cancelar un cheque propio"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:925
msgid ""
"To cancel an own check created in Odoo, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Vendors --> Own Checks` and select the "
"check to be cancelled, then click :guilabel:`Void Check`. This breaks the "
"reconciliation between vendor bills and bank statements, leaving the check "
"marked as :guilabel:`Cancelled`."
msgstr ""
"Para cancelar un cheque propio creado en Odoo, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Proveedores --> Cheques propios`, "
"selecciona el cheque que quieres cancelar y haz clic en :guilabel:`Anular "
"cheque`. Esto altera la conciliación entre las facturas de proveedor y los "
"estados de cuenta bancarios y deja el cheque con el "
"estado :guilabel:`Cancelado`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:933
msgid "Third-party checks"
msgstr "Cheques de terceros"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:935
