msgid "Type `Third-Party Checks` as the :guilabel:`Journal Name`."
msgstr "Escribe `Cheques de terceros` en :guilabel:`Nombre del diario`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:948
msgid "Select :guilabel:`Cash` as :guilabel:`Type`."
msgstr "Selecciona :guilabel:`Efectivo` en :guilabel:`Tipo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:949
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Journal Entries` tab, set :guilabel:`Cash Account`: to "
"`1.1.1.02.010 Cheques de Terceros`, input a :guilabel:`Short Code` of your "
"choice, and select a :guilabel:`Currency`."
msgstr ""
"En la pestaña :guilabel:`Asientos contables`, define :guilabel:`Cuenta de "
"efectivo:` en `1.1.1.02.010 Cheques de Terceros`, ingresa "
"el :guilabel:`código corto` que prefieras y selecciona "
"una :guilabel:`moneda`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:952
msgid ""
"The available payment methods are listed in the :guilabel:`Payments` tab:"
msgstr ""
"Los métodos de pago disponibles aparecen en la pestaña :guilabel:`Pagos`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:954
msgid ""
"For new incoming third-party checks, click :guilabel:`Add a line` in "
"the :guilabel:`Incoming Payments` tab and select :guilabel:`New Third Party "
"Checks`. This method is used to create *new* third-party checks."
msgstr ""
"Para los nuevos cheques de terceros recibidos, haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Agregar una línea` en la pestaña :guilabel:`Pagos entrantes` y "
"selecciona :guilabel:`Nuevos cheques de terceros`. Este método se usa para "
"crear *nuevos* cheques de terceros."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:957
msgid ""
"For incoming and outgoing existing third-party checks, click :guilabel:`Add "
"a line` in the :guilabel:`Incoming Payments` tab and  "
"select :guilabel:`Existing Third Party Checks`. Repeat the same step for "
"the :guilabel:`Outgoing Payments` tab. This method is used to receive and/or "
"pay vendor bills using already *existing* checks, as well as for internal "
"transfers."
msgstr ""
"Para los cheques de terceros existentes, tanto entrantes como salientes, haz "
"clic en :guilabel:`Agregar una línea` en la pestaña :guilabel:`Pagos "
"entrantes` y selecciona :guilabel:`Cheques de terceros existentes`. Repite "
"el mismo paso en la pestaña :guilabel:`Pagos salientes`. Este método se usa "
"para recibir o pagar facturas de proveedor con cheques *existentes*, así "
"como para transferencias internas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:963
msgid ""
"You can delete pre-existing payment methods that appear by default when "
"configuring third-party check journals."
msgstr ""
"Puedes eliminar los métodos de pago que aparecen de forma predeterminada al "
"configurar los diarios de cheques de terceros."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:966
msgid ""
"The *Rejected Third-Party Checks* journal must also be created and/or "
"configured. This journal is used to manage rejected third-party checks and "
"can be used to send checks rejected at the time of collection or upon "
"receipt from vendors."
msgstr ""
"También debes crear o configurar el diario *Cheques de terceros rechazados*. "
"Este diario se usa para gestionar los cheques de terceros rechazados y "
"permite enviar cheques rechazados al momento de su cobro o al recibirlos de "
"proveedores."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:970
msgid ""
"To create the *Rejected Third-Party Checks* journal, click :guilabel:`New` "
"and configure the following:"
msgstr ""
"Para crear el diario *Cheques de terceros rechazados*, haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Nuevo` y configura lo siguiente:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:973
msgid "Type `Rejected Third Party Checks` as the :guilabel:`Journal Name`"
msgstr ""
"En el :guilabel:`Nombre del diario` escriba `Cheques rechazados de terceros`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:974
msgid "Select :guilabel:`Cash` as :guilabel:`Type`"
msgstr "En :guilabel:`Tipo` seleccione :guilabel:`Efectivo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:975
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Journal Entries` tab, set :guilabel:`Cash Account`: to "
"`1.1.1.01.002 Rejected Third Party Checks`, input a :guilabel:`Short Code` "
"of your choice, and select a :guilabel:`Currency`."
msgstr ""
"En la pestaña :guilabel:`Asientos contables`, define :guilabel:`Cuenta de "
"efectivo:` en `1.1.1.01.002 Cheques de terceros rechazados`, ingresa "
"el :guilabel:`código corto` que prefieras y selecciona "
"una :guilabel:`moneda`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:979
msgid "Use the same payment methods as the *Third-Party Checks* journal."
msgstr "Usa los mismos métodos de pago que en el diario *Cheques de terceros*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:984
msgid "New third-party checks"
msgstr "Nuevos cheques de terceros"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:986
msgid ""
"To register a *new* third-party check for a customer invoice, "
"click :guilabel:`Register Payment`. In the pop-up window, "
"select :guilabel:`Third-Party Checks` as the journal for the payment "
"registration."
msgstr ""
"Para registrar un *nuevo* cheque de terceros en una factura de cliente, haz "
"clic en :guilabel:`Registrar pago`. En la ventana emergente, "
"selecciona :guilabel:`Cheques de terceros` como diario para registrar el "
"pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:990
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`New Third Party Checks` as :guilabel:`Payment Method`, and "
"fill in the :guilabel:`Check Number`, :guilabel:`Payment Date`, "
"and :guilabel:`Check Bank`. Optionally, you can manually add "
"the :guilabel:`Check Issuer Vat`, but this field is automatically filled "
"with the customer's VAT number as it appears on the invoice."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona :guilabel:`Nuevos cheques de terceros` como :guilabel:`método de "
"pago` y completa :guilabel:`Número de cheque`, :guilabel:`Fecha de pago` "
"y :guilabel:`Banco del cheque`. De forma opcional, puedes agregar de forma "
"manual el :guilabel:`CUIT del emisor del cheque`, aunque este campo se "
"completa de forma automática con el número del cliente que aparece en la "
"factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:998
msgid "Existing third-party checks"
msgstr "Cheques de terceros existentes"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1000
msgid ""
"To pay a vendor bill with an *existing* check, click :guilabel:`Register "
"Payment`. In the pop-up window, select :guilabel:`Third Party Checks` as the "
"journal for the payment registration."
msgstr ""
"Para pagar una factura de proveedor con un cheque *existente*, haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Registrar pago`. En la ventana emergente, "
"selecciona :guilabel:`Cheques de terceros` como diario para registrar el "
"pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1003
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`Existing Third Party Checks` as :guilabel:`Payment "
"Method`, and select a check from the :guilabel:`Check` field. The field "
"shows all **available existing checks** to be used as payment for vendor "
"bills."
msgstr ""
"Seleccione :guilabel:`Cheques existentes de terceros` como :guilabel:`método "
"de pago` y seleccione un cheque del campo :guilabel:`Cheque`. El campo "
"muestra todos los **cheques existentes disponibles** para ser utilizados "
"como pago de facturas de proveedores."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1007
msgid ""
"When an **existing third-party check** is used, you can review the "
"operations related to it. For example, you can see if a third-party check "
"made to pay a customer invoice was later used as an existing third-party "
"check to pay a vendor bill."
msgstr ""
"Cuando usas un **cheque de terceros existente**, puedes consultar las "
"operaciones relacionadas con él. Por ejemplo, puedes ver si un cheque de "
"terceros que se usó para pagar una factura de cliente después se utilizó "
"como cheque de terceros existente para pagar una factura de proveedor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1011
msgid ""
"To do so, either go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Third "
"Party Checks` or :menuselection:`Accounting --> Vendors --> Own Checks`, "
"depending on the case, and click on a check. In the :guilabel:`Check Current "
"Journal` field, click on :guilabel:`=> Check Operations` to bring up the "
"check's history and movements."
msgstr ""
"Para hacerlo, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Clientes --> Cheques de "
"terceros` o a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Proveedores --> Cheques "
"propios`, según corresponda, y haz clic en un cheque. En el "
"campo :guilabel:`Diario actual del cheque`, haz clic en :guilabel:`=> "
"Operaciones del cheque` para ver el historial y los movimientos del cheque."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1016
msgid ""
"The menu also displays critical information related to these operations, "
"such as:"
msgstr ""
"El menú también muestra información importante relacionada con estas "
"operaciones, como:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1018
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Payment Type`, allowing to classify whether it is a payment "
"*sent* to a vendor or a payment *received* from a customer"
msgstr ""
"El :guilabel:`tipo de pago` que permite clasificar si se trata de un pago "
"*enviado* a un proveedor o de un pago *recibido* de un cliente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1020
msgid "The :guilabel:`Journal` in which the check is currently registered"
msgstr "El :guilabel:`diario` en el que está registrado actualmente el cheque."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1021
msgid ""
"The **partner** associated with the operation (either customer or vendor)."
msgstr "El **contacto** asociado a la operación (ya sea cliente o proveedor)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1026
msgid "Liquidity product direct sales"
msgstr "Venta directa de productos de liquidez"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1028
msgid ""
"Liquidity product direct sales are used for sales involving third parties. "
"For such sales, the seller and the proprietary company of the goods can each "
"register their corresponding sales and purchases."
msgstr ""
"Las ventas directas de productos de liquidez se utilizan para ventas que "
"involucran a terceros. En estas ventas, tanto el vendedor como la empresa "
"propietaria de los bienes pueden registrar sus respectivas ventas y compras."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1033
msgid ""
":ref:`Install <general/install>` the :guilabel:`Argentinean Electronic "
"Invoicing` module (`l10n_ar_edi`) to use this feature."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Instala <general/install>` el módulo :guilabel:`Facturación "
"electrónica de Argentina` (`l10n_ar_edi`) para usar esta función."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1044
msgid "Purchase journal"
msgstr "Diario de compra"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1046
msgid ""
"A purchase journal is needed to generate an electronic vendor bill with a "
"document type *Liquidity Product*. This journal must be synchronized with |"
"ARCA|, as it will be used to generate the electronic document for the "
"liquidity product."
msgstr ""
"Necesitas un diario de compras para generar una factura electrónica de "
"proveedor con un tipo de documento *Producto de liquidez*. Este diario debe "
"estar sincronizado con |ARCA|, ya que se usará para generar el documento "
"electrónico correspondiente al producto de liquidez."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1050
msgid ""
"To modify the existing purchase journal or create a new one, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Journals`. Then, select "
"the existing purchase journal or click :guilabel:`New`, and fill in the "
"following required information:"
msgstr ""
"Para modificar el diario de compras existente o crear uno nuevo, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Diarios`. Después, "
"selecciona el diario de compras existente o haz clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo` y "
"completa la siguiente información obligatoria:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1054
msgid ":guilabel:`Type`: Select :guilabel:`Purchase`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Tipo`: Selecciona :guilabel:`Compras`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1055
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Use Documents`: Check this field to select the electronic "
"document type."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Usar documentos`: Activa este campo para seleccionar el tipo de "
"documento electrónico."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1056
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Is ARCA POS?`: Check this field to generate electronic documents. "
"Three additional fields appear:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`¿Es PdV de ARCA?`: Activa este campo para generar documentos "
"electrónicos. Aparecen tres campos adicionales:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1059
msgid ""
":guilabel:`ARCA POS System`: Select :guilabel:`Electronic Invoice - Web "
"Service` from the drop-down menu to send the electronic document to |ARCA| "
"via web service."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Sistema de PdV de ARCA`: Selecciona :guilabel:`Factura "
"Electrónica - Web Service` en el menú desplegable para enviar el documento "
"electrónico a |ARCA| mediante el web service."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1061
msgid ""
":guilabel:`ARCA POS Number`: The number configured in |ARCA| to identify the "
"operations related to this |ARCA| POS."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Número de PdV de ARCA`: Es el número que configuras en |ARCA| "
"para identificar las operaciones relacionadas con este punto de venta de |"
"ARCA|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1063
msgid ""
":guilabel:`ARCA POS Address`: The field related to the commercial address "
"registered for the POS, which is usually the same address as the company. "
"For example, if a company has multiple stores (fiscal locations) then |ARCA| "
"will require the company to have one ARCA POS per location. This location "
"will be printed in the invoice report."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Dirección de PdV de ARCA`: Es el campo relacionado con la "
"dirección comercial registrada para el punto de venta, que suele coincidir "
"con la dirección de la empresa. Por ejemplo, si una empresa tiene varias "
"sucursales (domicilios fiscales), |ARCA| exige un punto de venta de ARCA "
"para cada ubicación. Esta dirección aparece impresa en el reporte de la "
"factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1071
msgid "Sales journal"
msgstr "Diario de ventas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1073
msgid ""
"A sales journal is needed to record the invoice when a product is sold to a "
"third party that will then sell the same product. This journal will not be "
"synced with |ARCA| as the invoice will not be electronic."
msgstr ""
"Necesitas un diario de ventas para registrar la factura cuando vendes un "
"producto a un tercero que después venderá el mismo producto. Este diario no "
"se sincronizará con |ARCA| porque la factura no será electrónica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1077
msgid ""
"To modify the existing sales journal or create a new one, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Journals`. Then, access "
"the sales journal or click :guilabel:`New`, and fill in the following "
"required information:"
msgstr ""
"Para modificar el diario de ventas existente o crear uno nuevo, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Diarios`. Luego, accede "
"al diario de ventas o haz clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo` y completa la siguiente "
"información obligatoria:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1081
msgid ":guilabel:`Type`: select :guilabel:`Sales`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Tipo`: seleccione :guilabel:`Ventas`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1082
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Use Documents`: check this field on the journal to select the "
"electronic document type (in this case, the electronic invoice)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Usar documentos`: Activa este campo en el diario para seleccionar "
"el tipo de documento electrónico (en este caso, la factura electrónica)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1088
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1496
msgid "Invoicing flow"
msgstr "Flujo de facturación"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1090
msgid ""
"Once all configurations are set, the *Liquidity Product Vendor Bill* will be "
"generated by the company selling the product on behalf of another party. For "
"example, a distributor of a specific product."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que completes todas las configuraciones, la *factura de proveedor de "
"producto de liquidez* será generada por la empresa que vende el producto en "
"nombre de otra parte. Por ejemplo, un distribuidor de un producto específico."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1097
msgid "Ecommerce electronic invoicing"
msgstr "Facturación electrónica para comercio electrónico"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1099
msgid ""
":ref:`Install <general/install>` the :guilabel:`Argentinean eCommerce` "
"(`l10n_ar_website_sale`) module to enable the following features and "
"configurations:"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Instala <general/install>` el módulo :guilabel:`Comercio electrónico "
"de Argentina` (`l10n_ar_website_sale`) para habilitar las siguientes "
"funciones y configuraciones:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1102
msgid "Allow clients to create online accounts for eCommerce purposes."
msgstr ""
"Permite que los clientes creen cuentas en línea para el comercio electrónico."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1103
msgid "Support for required fiscal fields in the eCommerce application."
msgstr ""
"Compatibilidad con los campos fiscales necesarios en la aplicación Comercio "
"electrónico."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1104
msgid "Receive payments for sale orders online."
msgstr "Reciba pagos por órdenes de venta en línea."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1105
msgid "Generate electronic documents from the eCommerce application."
msgstr ""
"Genere documentos electrónicos desde la aplicación Comercio electrónico."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1112
msgid ""
"Once all configurations for the Argentinian :ref:`electronic invoice "
"<localizations/argentina/company>` flow are complete, additional "
"configurations must be completed to integrate the eCommerce flow."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que completes todas las configuraciones del flujo "
"de :ref:`facturación electrónica <localizations/argentina/company>` "
"argentina, debes completar algunas configuraciones adicionales para integrar "
"el flujo de comercio electrónico."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1119
msgid "Client account registration"
msgstr "Registro de la cuenta del cliente"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1121
msgid ""
"To configure your website for client accounts, follow the instructions in "
"the :doc:`checkout <../../websites/ecommerce/checkout>` documentation."
msgstr ""
"Siga las instrucciones de la documentación sobre el :doc:`proceso de pago "
"<../../websites/ecommerce/checkout>` para configurar su sitio web de forma "
"adecuada y que los clientes puedan crear cuentas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1127
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:807
msgid "Automatic invoice"
msgstr "Facturación automática"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1129
msgid ""
"To generate electronic documents in the sales process, go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings` and enable "
"the :guilabel:`Automatic Invoice` option in the :guilabel:`Invoicing` "
"section to automatically generate the required electronic documents when the "
"online payment is confirmed."
msgstr ""
"Para generar documentos electrónicos durante el proceso de venta, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> Configuración --> Ajustes` y activa la "
"opción :guilabel:`Factura automática` en la sección :guilabel:`Facturación` "
"para generar de forma automática los documentos electrónicos necesarios "
"cuando se confirme el pago en línea."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1135
msgid ""
"Since an online payment must be confirmed for the :guilabel:`Automatic "
"Invoice` feature to generate the document, a :doc:`payment provider <../"
"payment_providers>` **must** be configured for the related website."
msgstr ""
"Como la función :guilabel:`Factura automática` necesita que se confirme un "
"pago en línea para generar el documento, **debes** configurar "
"un :doc:`proveedor de pago <../payment_providers>` para el sitio web "
"correspondiente."

