#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1144
msgid ""
"To allow your products to be invoiced when an online payment is confirmed, "
"navigate to the desired product from :menuselection:`Website --> eCommerce --"
"> Products`. In the :guilabel:`General Information` tab, set "
"the :guilabel:`Invoicing Policy` to :guilabel:`Ordered quantities` and "
"define the desired :guilabel:`Customer Taxes`."
msgstr ""
"Para poder facturar sus productos al confirmar un pago en línea, diríjase al "
"producto deseado desde :menuselection:`Sitio web --> Comercio electrónico --"
"> Productos`. En la pestaña :guilabel:`Información general`, "
"elija :guilabel:`Cantidades ordenadas` como :guilabel:`Política de "
"facturación` y defina los :guilabel:`Impuestos del cliente` necesarios."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1152
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:986
msgid "Invoicing flow for eCommerce"
msgstr "Flujo de facturación para Comercio electrónico"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1154
msgid ""
"Once all configurations mentioned above are set, clients can complete the "
"following required steps in the *Argentinian eCommerce* flow to enter fiscal "
"fields during checkout."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que completes todas las configuraciones anteriores, los clientes "
"podrán seguir estos pasos necesarios en el flujo de *comercio electrónico "
"argentino* para ingresar los datos fiscales durante el proceso de pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1157
msgid ""
"Fiscal fields are available for input during checkout once "
"the :guilabel:`Country` field is set to `Argentina`. Entering the fiscal "
"data enables the purchase to be recorded in the corresponding electronic "
"document."
msgstr ""
"Los campos fiscales están disponibles durante el proceso de pago una vez que "
"establezcas el campo :guilabel:`País` en `Argentina`. El ingreso de los "
"datos fiscales permite registrar la compra en el documento electrónico "
"correspondiente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1161
msgid "Fiscal required fields for electronic invoicing."
msgstr "Campos fiscales necesarios para la facturación electrónica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1164
msgid ""
"When the client makes a successful purchase and payment, the necessary "
"invoice is generated with the corresponding layout and fiscal stamps stated "
"in the :ref:`Invoice printed report <localizations/argentina/invoice-printed-"
"report>`."
msgstr ""
"Cuando el cliente realiza una compra y un pago correctos, se genera la "
"factura necesaria con el diseño y los sellos fiscales correspondientes que "
"se indican en el :ref:`reporte impreso de la factura <localizations/"
"argentina/invoice-printed-report>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1169
