#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:129
msgid "Non-deductible taxes"
msgstr "Impuestos no deducibles"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:131
msgid ""
"In Belgium, some taxes are not fully deductible, such as taxes on the "
"maintenance of cars. This means a part of these taxes is considered as "
"a :ref:`non-deductible expense <belgium/disallowed-expenses>`."
msgstr ""
"En Bélgica, algunos impuestos no son completamente deducibles, como los "
"impuestos sobre el mantenimiento de automóviles. Esto significa que una "
"parte de estos impuestos se considera un :ref:`gasto no deducible <belgium/"
"disallowed-expenses>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:135
msgid ""
"In Odoo, you can configure non-deductible taxes by creating tax rules for "
"these taxes and linking them to the corresponding accounts. This way, the "
"system automatically calculates the taxes and allocates them to the "
"appropriate accounts."
msgstr ""
"En Odoo, puede configurar impuestos no deducibles mediante la creación de "
"reglas impositivas para estos y las vincula a las cuentas correspondientes. "
"De esta manera, el sistema calcula los impuestos en automático y los asigna "
"a las cuentas apropiadas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:139
msgid ""
"To configure a new non-deductible tax, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Taxes`, and click :guilabel:`New`:"
msgstr ""
"Para configurar un nuevo impuesto no deducible, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Impuestos` y haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Nuevo`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:142
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Add a line` and select :guilabel:`Base` in the :guilabel:`Based "
"On` column;"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Agregue una línea` y seleccione :guilabel:`Base` en la "
"columna :guilabel:`Con base en`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:143
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Add a line`, then select :guilabel:`on tax` in "
"the :guilabel:`Based on` column and enter the **non-deductible** percentage "
"in the :guilabel:`%` column;"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Agregue una línea`, luego seleccione :guilabel:`en el impuesto` "
"en la columna :guilabel:`Con base en` e ingrese el porcentaje **no "
"deducible** en la columna :guilabel:`%` ."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:145
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`of tax` line, select the :guilabel:`Tax Grid(s)` related "
"to your tax;"
msgstr ""
"Seleccione las :guilabel:`tablas de impuestos` relacionadas con el mismo en "
"la línea :guilabel:`del impuesto`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:146
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Add a line` with the **deductible** percentage in "
"the :guilabel:`%` column;"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Agregue una línea` con el porcentaje **deducible** en la "
"columna :guilabel:`%`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:147
msgid "Set :guilabel:`of tax` in :guilabel:`Based On`;"
msgstr "Establezca :guilabel:`en el impuesto` en :guilabel:`Con base en`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:148
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`411000 VAT recoverable` as account, and select the related "
"tax grid."
msgstr ""
"Seleccione :guilabel:`411000 IVA recuperable` como cuenta y seleccione la "
"tabla de impuestos relacionada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:150
msgid ""
"Once you have created a non-deductible tax, you can apply it to your "
"transactions by selecting the appropriate tax during the encoding of bills "
"and credit notes. The system automatically calculates the tax amount and "
"allocates it to the corresponding accounts based on the tax rules configured."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que haya creado un impuesto no deducible, puede aplicarlo a sus "
"transacciones si selecciona el impuesto correspondiente durante la "
"codificación de facturas y notas de crédito. El sistema calcula el importe "
"del impuesto de forma automática y lo asigna a las cuentas correspondientes "
"según las reglas de impuestos configuradas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:155
msgid ""
"With the Belgian localization, the **21% car** tax is created by default "
"(50% non-deductible)."
msgstr ""
"Con la localización belga, el impuesto del **21% sobre automóviles** se crea "
"de forma predeterminada (50% no deducible)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:157
msgid "Example of not-fully deductible tax"
msgstr "Ejemplo de un impuesto no deducible en su totalidad"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:163
msgid "Vehicle tax deductibility"
msgstr "Deducibilidad fiscal de vehículos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:166
msgid ""
"To see the tax deductibility of a vehicle, the **Belgium - Disallowed "
"Expenses Fleet** (`l10n_be_account_fiscal_categories_fleet`) module must "
"be :doc:`installed <../../general/apps_modules>`."
msgstr ""
"Para ver la deducibilidad fiscal de un vehículo, el módulo **Belgium - "
"Disallowed Expenses Fleet** (`l10n_be_account_fiscal_categories_fleet`) debe "
"estar :doc:`instalado <../../general/apps_modules>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:170
msgid ""
"A vehicle's tax deductibility rate varies depending on its type (car or "
"bicycle) and several factors, such as fuel type, CO2 emissions, engine "
"power, etc."
msgstr ""
"La tasa de deducibilidad fiscal de un vehículo varía según su tipo "
"(automóvil o bicicleta) y varios factores, como el tipo de combustible, las "
"emisiones de CO2, la potencia del motor, etc."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:173
msgid ""
"To view the **tax deductibility percentage** for a specific model, open the "
"**Fleet** app, navigate to :menuselection:`Configuration --> Models`, and "
"select a vehicle model. Locate the :guilabel:`Tax Deduction` field, which is "
"found under the :guilabel:`Engine` section for cars, or "
"the :guilabel:`Vehicle Information` section for bicycles."
msgstr ""
"Para ver el **porcentaje de deducibilidad fiscal** de un modelo específico, "
"abre la aplicación **Flotilla**, navega a :menuselection:`Configuración --> "
"Modelos` y selecciona un modelo de vehículo. Localiza el "
"campo :guilabel:`Deducción fiscal`, que se encuentra en la "
"sección :guilabel:`Motor` para autos, o en la sección :guilabel:`Información "
"del vehículo` para bicicletas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:179
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Tax Deduction` field is strictly **informative** and is "
"computed automatically based on the vehicle's specifications. It is **not** "
"used for any automated calculations within the **Accounting** app and should "
"not be confused with the :ref:`tax rate deductibility <belgium/non-"
"deductible>` used on :ref:`tax grids <accounting/tax-returns/tax-grids>`. "
"Instead, your accountant can reference this field to manually apply the "
"correct deductible rate to invoices or :ref:`disallowed expenses <belgium/"
"disallowed-expenses>`."
msgstr ""
"El campo :guilabel:`Deducción fiscal` es estrictamente **informativo** y se "
"calcula automáticamente en función de las especificaciones del vehículo. "
"**No** se usa para ningún cálculo automatizado dentro de la aplicación "
"**Contabilidad** y no debe confundirse con la :ref:`deducibilidad de la tasa "
"de impuesto <belgium/non-deductible>` utilizada en las :ref:`cuadrículas "
"fiscales <accounting/tax-returns/tax-grids>`. En su lugar, tu contador puede "
"consultar este campo para aplicar manualmente la tasa deducible correcta a "
"las facturas o :ref:`gastos no deducibles <belgium/disallowed-expenses>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:187
msgid ":ref:`Vehicle models <fleet/models>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Modelos de vehículos <fleet/models>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:194
msgid "Here is the list of Belgian-specific reports available:"
msgstr "Esta es la lista de reportes específicos de Alemania disponibles:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:196
msgid "Balance sheet;"
msgstr "Balance general;"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:197
msgid "Profit & loss;"
msgstr "Estado de resultados;"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:198
msgid "Tax report;"
msgstr "Reporte de impuestos; "

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:199
msgid "Partner VAT Listing;"
msgstr "Listado de IVA del contacto,"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:200
msgid "EC Sales List;"
msgstr "Lista de ventas de la CE"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:201
msgid "Intrastat."
msgstr "Intrastat."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:203
msgid ""
"You can access Belgian-specific versions of reports by clicking on the "
"**book** icon when on a report and selecting its Belgian version: **(BE)**."
msgstr ""
"Puede acceder a las versiones para Bélgica de los reportes si hace clic en "
"el icono de **libro** de un reporte y selecciona su versión belga: **(BE)**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:206
msgid "Belgian version of reports"
msgstr "Versión para Bélgica de los reportes"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:210
msgid ":doc:`../accounting/reporting`"
msgstr ":doc:`../accounting/reporting`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:217
msgid ""
"Disallowed expenses are business costs that are not fully tax-deductible. "
"While they count as business expenses in your accounting, tax laws do not "
"allow you to use them to lower your taxable income."
msgstr ""
"Los gastos no deducibles son costos comerciales que no son completamente "
"deducibles de impuestos. Si bien cuentan como gastos comerciales en tu "
"contabilidad, las leyes fiscales no te permiten usarlos para reducir tu "
"ingreso gravable."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:221
msgid ""
"The **Fiscal Report** tracks disallowed expenses and is available by opening "
"the **Accounting** app and going to :menuselection:`Reporting --> Fiscal "
"Report`. This report provides real-time financial results and allows for "
"periodic adjustments."
msgstr ""
"El **reporte fiscal** da seguimiento a los gastos no deducibles y está "
"disponible al abrir la aplicación **Contabilidad** y acceder "
"a :menuselection:`Reportes --> Reporte fiscal`. Este reporte ofrece "
"resultados financieros en tiempo real y permite realizar ajustes periódicos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:225
msgid ""
"The report is generated based on **fiscal categories**, which can be managed "
"by opening the **Accounting** app, activating the :ref:`developer mode "
"<developer-mode>` and going to :menuselection:`Configuration --> Fiscal "
"Categories`. While several default categories are provided, you can create "
"new ones by clicking :guilabel:`New`. Categories themselves do not contain "
"rates. Instead, categories are linked to accounts via the :guilabel:`Related "
"Account(s)` field."
msgstr ""
"El reporte se genera en función de **categorías fiscales**, que se pueden "
"administrar abriendo la aplicación **Contabilidad**, activando el :ref:`modo "
"de desarrollador <developer-mode>` y yendo a :menuselection:`Configuración --"
"> Categorías fiscales`. Si bien se proporcionan varias categorías "
"predeterminadas, puedes crear nuevas haciendo clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo`. Las "
"categorías en sí no contienen tasas. En su lugar, las categorías se vinculan "
"a cuentas a través del campo :guilabel:`Cuenta(s) relacionada(s)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:232
msgid ""
"If the **Fleet** app is installed, check the :guilabel:`Requires a Vehicle` "
"box where applicable. This makes selecting a vehicle mandatory when logging "
"a vendor bill."
msgstr ""
"Si la aplicación **Flotilla** está instalada, marca la "
"casilla :guilabel:`Requiere un vehículo` donde corresponda. Esto hace "
"obligatorio seleccionar un vehículo al registrar una factura de proveedor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:234
msgid ""
"In a multi-company environment, you can restrict the category to a specific "
"company by selecting it from the :guilabel:`Company` dropdown menu."
msgstr ""
"En un entorno multiempresa, puedes restringir la categoría a una empresa "
"específica seleccionándola del menú desplegable :guilabel:`Empresa`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:239
msgid ""
"To set a rate on an account, open the **Accounting** app and go "
"to :menuselection:`Configuration --> Chart of Accounts` and open the account "
"linked in the previous step. Under the :guilabel:`Fiscal Rates` tab, "
"click :guilabel:`Add a line` and enter a :guilabel:`Start Date` "
"and :guilabel:`Fiscal Rate (%)`."
msgstr ""
"Para establecer una tasa en una cuenta, abre la aplicación **Contabilidad** "
"y ve a :menuselection:`Configuración --> Plan de cuentas` y abre la cuenta "
"vinculada en el paso anterior. En la pestaña :guilabel:`Tasas fiscales`, haz "
"clic en :guilabel:`Agregar una línea` e ingresa una :guilabel:`Fecha de "
"inicio` y una :guilabel:`Tasa fiscal (%)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:244
msgid ""
"Thereafter, whenever an expense is recorded using this account, the "
"disallowed expense amount is automatically calculated based on the rate "
"specified in the :guilabel:`Fiscal Rates` tab."
msgstr ""
"A partir de entonces, cada vez que se registre un gasto utilizando esta "
"cuenta, el monto del gasto no deducible se calcula automáticamente en "
"función de la tasa especificada en la pestaña :guilabel:`Tasas fiscales`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:248
msgid ""
"You can add multiple rates for different dates. The system will "
"automatically apply the correct rate based on the date the expense is "
"recorded."
msgstr ""
"Puedes agregar múltiples tasas para diferentes fechas. El sistema aplicará "
"automáticamente la tasa correcta en función de la fecha en que se registre "
"el gasto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:254
msgid "Restaurant expenses"
msgstr "Gastos de restaurante"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:256
msgid ""
"**Restaurant** expenses are 69% deductible. To configure this, create a "
"new :guilabel:`Fiscal Category`, specify its :guilabel:`Related Account(s)`, "
"then set the relevant :ref:`fiscal rates <belgium/set-fiscal-rate>` on the "
"respective related account(s)."
msgstr ""
"Los gastos de **Restaurante** son 69% deducibles. Para configurar esto, crea "
"una nueva :guilabel:`Categoría fiscal`, especifica "
"su(s) :guilabel:`Cuenta(s) relacionada(s)`, luego establece las :ref:`tasas "
"fiscales <belgium/set-fiscal-rate>` relevantes en la(s) cuenta(s) "
"relacionada(s) respectiva(s)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:263
msgid "Vehicle expenses: vehicle split"
msgstr "Gastos de vehículos: división de vehículos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:265
msgid ""
"The :ref:`deductibility percentage <belgium/vehicle-tax-deductibility>` "
"varies and must be defined individually for each vehicle in Odoo. To do "
"this, open the :guilabel:`Fleet` app and select a vehicle. In "
"the :guilabel:`Tax info` tab, locate the :guilabel:`Fiscality` section and "
"click :guilabel:`Add a line` under the :guilabel:`Fiscal Deductibility` "
"field. Set the :guilabel:`Start Date` to indicate when the rate takes "
"effect, and enter the corresponding :guilabel:`Non-deductible (%)`. Note "
"that, regardless of the deductibility percentage for each vehicle, expenses "
"for all cars are recorded under the same account in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"El :ref:`porcentaje de deducibilidad <belgium/vehicle-tax-deductibility>` "
"varía y debe definirse individualmente para cada vehículo en Odoo. Para "
"hacer esto, abre la aplicación :guilabel:`Flotilla` y selecciona un "
"vehículo. En la pestaña :guilabel:`Información fiscal`, localiza la "
"sección :guilabel:`Fiscalidad` y haz clic en :guilabel:`Agregar una línea` "
"en el campo :guilabel:`Deducibilidad fiscal`. Establece la :guilabel:`Fecha "
"de inicio` para indicar cuándo entra en vigor la tasa e ingresa "
"el :guilabel:`No deducible (%)` correspondiente. Ten en cuenta que, "
"independientemente del porcentaje de deducibilidad de cada vehículo, los "
"gastos de todos los autos se registran en la misma cuenta en Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:273
msgid ""
"When creating a vendor bill for vehicle expenses, you can link each expense "
"line to a specific vehicle by filling in the :guilabel:`Vehicle` column "
"(accessible by clicking the :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` :guilabel:`(slider)` "
"icon beside :guilabel:`Amount`, then selecting :guilabel:`Vehicle`). This "
"ensures the correct non-deductible percentage is applied."
msgstr ""
"Al crear una factura de proveedor para gastos de vehículos, puedes vincular "
"cada línea de gasto a un vehículo específico completando la "
"columna :guilabel:`Vehículo` (accesible haciendo clic en el ícono :icon:`oi-"
"settings-adjust` :guilabel:`(control deslizante)` junto a :guilabel:`Monto`, "
"luego seleccionando :guilabel:`Vehículo`). Esto asegura que se aplique el "
"porcentaje no deducible correcto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:278
msgid "Disallowed expenses of car bill"
msgstr "Gastos no deducibles de factura de auto"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:281
msgid ""
"To view the specific rates and disallowed amounts calculated for each "
"vehicle in the **Fiscal Report**, enable the :guilabel:`Vehicle Split` "
"filter (located under :icon:`fa-sliders` :guilabel:`Posted Entries`)."
msgstr ""
"Para ver las tasas específicas y los montos no deducibles calculados para "
"cada vehículo en el **Reporte fiscal**, habilita el "
"filtro :guilabel:`División de vehículos` (ubicado en :icon:`fa-"
"sliders` :guilabel:`Asientos contabilizados`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:285
msgid "Disallowed expenses for vehicles in fiscal report"
msgstr "Gastos no deducibles para vehículos en reporte fiscal"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:291
msgid "Fee form 281.50 and form 325"
msgstr "Formulario de impuestos 281.50 y formulario 325"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:296
msgid "Fee form 281.50"
msgstr "Formulario de impuestos 281.50"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:298
msgid ""
"Annually, a **281.50 fee form** must be reported to the fiscal authorities. "
"To do so, the tag `281.50` must be added on the **contact form** of the "
"entities concerned by the **281.50** fee. To add the tag, "
"open :menuselection:`Contacts`, select the person or company you want to "
"create a **281.50 fee form** for, and add the `281.50` tag in "
"the :guilabel:`Tags` field."
msgstr ""
"Cada año, se debe presentar un **formulario de impuestos 281.50** a las "
"autoridades fiscales. Para ello, debe agregar la etiqueta `281.50` al "
"formulario de contacto de las entidades afectadas por la tarifa **281.50**. "
"Para agregar la etiqueta, abra :menuselection:`Contactos`, seleccione la "
"persona o empresa para la que desea crear un **formulario de impuestos "
"281.50** y agregue la :guilabel:`etiqueta` `281.50` al campo correspondiente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:303
msgid "add the tag 281.50 on a contact form"
msgstr "Agregar la etiqueta 281.50 a un formulario de contacto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:307
msgid ""
"Make sure the **street, zip code, country**, and **VAT number** are also "
"informed on the **Contact form**."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrese de que la **calle, código postal, país** y el **número de "
"identificación fiscal** también estén presentes en el **formulario de "
"contacto**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:310
msgid ""
"Then, depending on the nature of the expense, add the corresponding `281.50` "
"tag on the impact accounts. To do so, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Accounting: Chart of Accounts`, and click "
"on :guilabel:`Setup` to add the corresponding `281.50` tag on the impacted "
"accounts, i.e., :guilabel:`281.50 - Commissions`, depending on the nature of "
"the expense."
msgstr ""
"Luego, según el tipo de gasto, agregue la etiqueta `281.50` correspondiente "
"a las cuentas afectadas. Ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración "
"--> Contabilidad: plan de cuentas` y haga clic en :guilabel:`Configurar` "
"para agregar la etiqueta `281.50` en las cuentas correspondientes, por "
"ejemplo: :guilabel:`281.50 - Comisiones`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:318
msgid "Form 325"
msgstr "Formulario 325"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:320
msgid ""
"You can create a **325 form** by going to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Reporting --> Belgium: Create 325 form`. A new page pops up: select the "
"right options and click :guilabel:`Generate 325 form`. To open an already "
"generated **325 form**, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> "
"Belgium: Open 325 forms`."
msgstr ""
"Puede crear un **formulario 325** desde :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> "
"Reportes --> Bélgica: crear formulario 325`. Aparecerá una nueva página, "
"seleccione las opciones correctas y haga clic en :guilabel:`Generar "
"formulario 325`. Para abrir un **formulario 325** ya generado, vaya "
"a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Reportes --> Bélgica: abrir formularios "
"325`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:325
msgid "Add the tag 281-50 on a contact form"
msgstr "Agregar la etiqueta 281-50 a un formulario de contacto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:331
msgid "CODA and SODA statements"
msgstr "Estados de cuenta CODA y SODA"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:336
msgid "CODA"
msgstr "CODA"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:338
msgid ""
"**CODA** is an electronic XML format used to import Belgian bank statements. "
"You can download CODA files from your bank and import them directly into "
"Odoo by clicking :guilabel:`Import file` from your :guilabel:`Bank` journal "
"on your dashboard."
msgstr ""
"El formato XML electrónico **CODA** se utiliza para importar extractos "
"bancarios de Bélgica. Puede descargar archivos CODA de su banco e "
"importarlos directamente a Odoo, solo debe hacer clic en :guilabel:`Importar "
"archivo` desde el diario denominado :guilabel:`banco` en su tablero."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:342
msgid "Import CODA files"
msgstr "Importar archivos CODA"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:346
msgid ":ref:`Import bank files <accounting/transactions/import>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Importar archivos bancarios <accounting/transactions/import>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:351
msgid "SODA"
msgstr "SODA"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:353
msgid ""
"**SODA** is an electronic XML format used to import accounting entries "
"related to salaries. SODA files can be imported into the journal you use to "
"record salaries by going to your Accounting **dashboard** and "
"clicking :guilabel:`Upload` in the related journal card form."
msgstr ""
"El formato XML electrónico **SODA** se utiliza para importar asientos "
"contables relacionados con los salarios. Los archivos SODA se pueden "
"importar al diario que utiliza para registrar sueldos desde su **tablero** "
"de Contabilidad, haga clic en :guilabel:`Subir` en el formulario de la "
"tarjeta del diario correspondiente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:357
msgid ""
"Once your **SODA** files are imported, the entries are created automatically "
"in your salary journal."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que se importan sus archivos **SODA**, los asientos se crean de "
"forma automática en su diario de sueldos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:359
msgid "Import SODA files"
msgstr "Importar archivos SODA"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:365
msgid "CodaBox"
msgstr "CodaBox"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:367
msgid ""
"**CodaBox** is a service that allows Belgian companies and accounting firms "
"to access bank information and statements. Odoo provides a way to import "
"such statements automatically."
msgstr ""
"**CodaBox** es un servicio que permite que las empresas y firmas contables "
"de Bélgica accedan a distinta información bancaria y estados de cuenta. Odoo "
"proporciona una forma de importar estos estados de cuenta en automático."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:375
msgid ""
"To configure and use Codabox, first :ref:`install <general/install>` "
"the :guilabel:`CodaBox` module."
msgstr ""
"Para configurar y usar CodaBox, primero :ref:`instale <general/install>` el "
"módulo :guilabel:`CodaBox`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:380
msgid "Configure the Connection"
msgstr "Configuración de la conexión"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:384
msgid "For companies"
msgstr "Para empresas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:387
msgid ""
"Make sure the :doc:`company settings </applications/general/companies>` are "
"correctly configured, i.e., the country is set to :guilabel:`Belgium` and "
"the :guilabel:`Tax ID` or :guilabel:`Company ID` field is filled."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrese de que los :doc:`ajustes de la empresa </applications/general/"
"companies>` son correctos. El país debe ser :guilabel:`Bélgica` y el "
"campo :guilabel:`Número de identificación fiscal` o :guilabel:`ID de la "
"empresa` debe estar completo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:391
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:420
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`, then go to "
"the :guilabel:`CodaBox & SODA` section."
msgstr ""
"Vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Ajustes` y luego "
"diríjase a la sección :guilabel:`CodaBox y SODA`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:393
msgid ""
"Click on :guilabel:`Manage Connection` to open the connection wizard, which "
"shows the :guilabel:`Company VAT/ID` number that will be used for the "
"connection."
msgstr ""
"Haga clic en :guilabel:`Gestionar conexión` para abrir el asistente de "
"conexión, allí aparecerá el número de :guilabel:`identificación fiscal de la "
"empresa` que se utilizará para la conexión."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:395
msgid ""
"If this is your **first connection**, click on :guilabel:`Create "
"connection`. The wizard confirms that the connection has been created on "
"**Odoo's side**. Follow the steps to validate the connection on **CodaBox's "
"side** too."
msgstr ""
"Haga clic en :guilabel:`Crear conexión` en caso de que esta sea su **primera "
"conexión**. El asistente confirmará que la conexión se creó **del lado de "
"Odoo**. Siga los pasos para validar la conexión **del lado de CodaBox**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:399
msgid ""
"If this is **not your first connection**, the :guilabel:`Password` provided "
"by Odoo during the first connection will be requested to create a new "
"connection."
msgstr ""
"Si esta **no es su primera conexión**, se le solicitará "
"la :guilabel:`contraseña` que le proporcionó Odoo durante la primera "
"conexión para crear una nueva."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:403
msgid ""
"This :guilabel:`Password` is unique to Odoo and must be stored securely on "
"your side."
msgstr ""
"Esta :guilabel:`contraseña` es única para Odoo. Almacénela de forma segura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:406
msgid "For accounting firms"
msgstr "Para firmas contables"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:408
msgid ""
"Accounting firms must manage their clients on separate databases and "
"configure them individually to avoid mixing up their data. The connection "
"must be made by an accounting firm with valid CodaBox Connect credentials. "
"In the following instructions, we will refer to your client's company as "
"*Company* and to your accounting firm as *Accounting Firm*."
msgstr ""
"Las firmas contables deben gestionar a sus clientes en distintas bases de "
"datos y configurarlas cada una de ellas para evitar mezclar sus datos. Es "
"necesario que una firma contable con credenciales válidas de CodaBox Connect "
"realice la conexión. En las siguientes instrucciones llamaremos *Empresa* a "
"la empresa de su cliente y *Firma contable* a su firma contable."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:415
msgid ""
"Make sure the :doc:`company settings </applications/general/companies>` are "
"correctly configured, i.e., the country is set to :guilabel:`Belgium`, "
"the :guilabel:`Tax ID` or :guilabel:`Company ID` and :guilabel:`Accounting "
"Firm` fields are filled, as well as the :guilabel:`Tax ID` of "
"the :guilabel:`Accounting Firm`."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrese de que los :doc:`ajustes de la empresa </applications/general/"
"companies>` son correctos. El país debe ser :guilabel:`Bélgica`, los "
"campos :guilabel:`Número de identificación fiscal` o :guilabel:`ID de la "
"empresa` y :guilabel:`Firma contable` deben estar completos, así como el "
"campo :guilabel:`Número de identificación fiscal` de la :guilabel:`firma "
"contable`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:422
msgid ""
"Click on :guilabel:`Manage Connection` to open the connection wizard, which "
"shows the :guilabel:`Accounting Firm VAT` number and the :guilabel:`Company "
"VAT/ID` number that will be used for the connection."
msgstr ""
"Haga clic en :guilabel:`Gestionar conexión` para abrir el asistente de "
"conexión, allí aparecerá el número de identificación :guilabel:`fiscal de la "
"firma contable` y el número de :guilabel:`identificación fiscal de la "
"empresa` que se utilizará para la conexión."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:425
msgid ""
"If this is your **first connection**, click on :guilabel:`Create "
"connection`. The wizard confirms that the connection has been created on "
"**Odoo's side**. Follow the steps to validate the connection on **CodaBox's "
"side**, too."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Crear conexión` en caso de que esta sea su **primera "
"conexión**. El asistente confirmará que la conexión se creó **del lado de "
"Odoo**. Siga los pasos para validar la conexión también **del lado de "
"CodaBox**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:429
msgid ""
"If this is **not your first connection**, the :guilabel:`Accounting Firm "
"Password` provided by Odoo during the first connection will be requested to "
"create a new connection."
msgstr ""
"Si esta **no es su primera conexión**, para crear una nueva conexión se le "
"solicitará la :guilabel:`contraseña de la firma contable` que le proporcionó "
"Odoo durante la primera conexión."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:433
msgid ""
"This :guilabel:`Accounting Firm Password` is unique to Odoo and must be "
"stored securely on your side."
msgstr ""
"Esta :guilabel:`contraseña de la firma contable` es única para Odoo y debe "
"encargarse de almacenarla de forma segura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:436
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Status` should have now switched to :guilabel:`Connected`."
msgstr "El :guilabel:`estado` ahora debería ser :guilabel:`Conectado`."

