#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:390
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:193
msgid "Electronic documents"
msgstr "Documentos electrónicos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:397
msgid ""
"A *series* number is linked to a sequence number range for electronic "
"invoices. To configure the series number on a sales journal, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Journals` and set it in "
"the :guilabel:`Series` field. If more than one series is needed, a new sales "
"journal must be created, and a new series number must be assigned for each "
"series."
msgstr ""
"Un número de *series* está vinculado a un rango de números de secuencia para "
"facturas electrónicas. Para configurar un número de series en un diario de "
"ventas, vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Diarios` y "
"configúrelo en el campo :guilabel:`Series`. Si necesita más de una serie, "
"deberá crear un diario de ventas nuevo y asignar un nuevo número de series "
"para cada series."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:402
msgid ""
"Enable the :guilabel:`Use Documents?` option as the :guilabel:`Series` field "
"will only be displayed if the :guilabel:`Use Documents?` option is selected "
"on the journal."
msgstr ""
"El campo :guilabel:`Series` solo se mostrará si se selecciona la "
"opción :guilabel:`¿Usar documentos?` en el diario, por lo que tendrá que "
"habilitar esta opción."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:405
msgid ""
"When issuing electronic and non-electronic invoices, the :guilabel:`Type` "
"field selects the document type used when creating the invoice."
msgstr ""
"Al emitir facturas electrónicas o no electrónicas, el campo :guilabel:`Tipo` "
"selecciona el tipo de documento que se usará al crear una factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:409
msgid ""
"When creating the journal, ensure the :guilabel:`Dedicated Credit Note "
"Sequence` field in the :guilabel:`Accounting Information` section is "
"unchecked, as in Brazil, sequences between invoices, credit notes, and debit "
"notes are shared per series number, which means per journal."
msgstr ""
"Al crear el diario, asegúrese de que el campo :guilabel:`secuencia de notas "
"de crédito dedicada` en la sección :guilabel:`Información contable` no esté "
"marcado, ya que en Brasil las secuencias entre facturas, notas de crédito y "
"notas de débito se comparten por número de series, es decir, por diario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:418
msgid ""
"To process an electronic invoice for goods (NF-e) or services (NFS-e), the "
"invoice must be confirmed and taxes must be computed by Avalara. The "
"following fields must be filled out:"
msgstr ""
"Para procesar una factura electrónica para bienes (NF-e) o servicios (NFS-"
"e), la factura debe estar confirmada y los impuestos deben estar calculados "
"con Avalara. Debe llenar los campos a continuación:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:421
msgid ":guilabel:`Customer`, with all customer information"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Cliente`, con toda la información del cliente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:422
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:550
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Payment Method: Brazil`: Specify the expected payment method."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Método de pago: Brasil`: Establece el método de pago esperado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:423
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Document Type`: Select :guilabel:`(55) Electronic Invoice (NF-e)` "
"or :guilabel:`(SE) Electronic Service Invoice (NFS-e)`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tipo de documento`: Selecciona :guilabel:`(55) Factura "
"electrónica (NF-e)` o :guilabel:`(SE) Factura de servicio electrónico (NFS-"
"e)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:426
msgid ":guilabel:`Other Info` tab:"
msgstr "Pestaña :guilabel:`Otra información`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:428
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Fiscal Position` set as :guilabel:`Automatic Tax Mapping (Avalara "
"Brazil)`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Posición fiscal` establecida como :guilabel:`asignación "
"automática de impuestos (Avalara Brasil)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:430
msgid ""
"Some optional fields depend on the nature of the transaction. These fields "
"in the :guilabel:`Other Info` tab are not required, so in most cases, "
"leaving them blank will not result in errors from the government when the "
"invoice is submitted:"
msgstr ""
"Algunos campos opcionales dependen de la naturaleza de la transacción. Estos "
"campos en la pestaña :guilabel:`Otra información` no son necesarios, por lo "
"que en la mayoría de los casos, si los deja en blanco no se generarán "
"errores de parte del gobierno al enviar la factura:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:434
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Freight Model` determines how the goods are planned to be "
"transported - domestic."
msgstr ""
"El :guilabel:`modelo de flete` determina cómo se planean los bienes para "
"transporte - doméstico."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:435
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Transporter Brazil` determines who is doing the transportation."
msgstr ""
"El :guilabel:`transportista de Brasil` determina quién se encargará del "
"transporte."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:437
msgid ""
"Then, click :guilabel:`Send`. In the pop-up window, click :guilabel:`Process "
"e-invoice` and any other options, such as :guilabel:`Download` "
"or :guilabel:`Email`. Finally, click :guilabel:`Send` to process the invoice "
"with the government."
msgstr ""
"Después, haz clic en :guilabel:`Enviar`. En la ventana emergente, haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Procesar factura electrónica` y en otras opciones "
"como :guilabel:`Descargar` o :guilabel:`Correo electrónico`. Por último, haz "
"clic en :guilabel:`Enviar` para procesar la factura con el gobierno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:442
msgid ""
"All fields available on the invoice used to issue an electronic invoice are "
"also available on the sales order, if needed. When creating the first "
"invoice, the :guilabel:`Document Number` field is displayed and allocated as "
"the first number to be used sequentially for subsequent invoices."
msgstr ""
"Todos los campos disponibles en la factura usada para emitir una factura "
"electrónica también están disponibles en la orden de ventas. Al crear la "
"primera factura, aparecerá el campo :guilabel:`Número de documento`, "
"asignado como el primer número que se utilizará de manera secuencial para "
"las facturas subsecuentes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:449
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:591
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:437
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/kenya.rst:417
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:511
msgid "Credit notes"
msgstr "Notas de crédito"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:451
msgid ""
"If a sales return needs to be registered, a :ref:`credit note can be created "
"in Odoo <accounting/credit_notes/issue-credit-note>` and sent to the "
"government for validation."
msgstr ""
"Si necesitas registrar una devolución de ventas, puedes crear una :ref:`nota "
"de crédito en Odoo <accounting/credit_notes/issue-credit-note>` y enviarla "
"al gobierno para su validación."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:455
msgid ""
"Credit notes are only available for electronic invoices for goods (NF-e)."
msgstr ""
"Las notas de crédito solo están disponibles para las facturas electrónicas "
"de bienes (NF-e)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:460
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:648
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:463
msgid "Debit notes"
msgstr "Notas de débito"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:462
msgid ""
"If additional information needs to be included or values that were not "
"accurately provided in the original invoice need to be corrected, "
"a :ref:`debit note can be issued <accounting/credit_notes/issue-debit-note>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Puede emitir una nota de débito <accounting/credit_notes/issue-debit-"
"note>` si necesita incluir información adicional o valores que no eran "
"correctos en la factura original y se deben corregir."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:467
msgid ""
"Debit notes are only available for electronic invoices for goods (NF-e)."
msgstr ""
"Las notas de débito solo están disponibles para las facturas electrónicas de "
"bienes (NF-e)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:468
msgid ""
"Only the products included in the original invoice can be included in the "
"debit note. While changes can be made to the product's unit price or "
"quantity, products **cannot** be added to the debit note. The purpose of "
"this document is only to declare the amount to be added to the original "
"invoice for the same or fewer products."
msgstr ""
"Solo los productos incluidos en la factura original pueden ser parte de la "
"nota de débito. Además, puede realizar cambios en el precio unitario del "
"producto o en las cantidades, pero **no** puede agregar productos a la nota "
"de débito. El objetivo de este documento solo es declarar el importe que "
"quiere agregar a la factura original por los mismos productos o menos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:476
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:368
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/vietnam.rst:221
msgid "Invoice cancellation"
msgstr "Cancelar facturas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:478
msgid ""
"It is possible to cancel an electronic invoice that the government validated."
msgstr ""
"Sí se puede cancelar una factura electrónica que ya haya validado el "
"gobierno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:481
msgid ""
"Check whether the electronic invoice is still within the cancellation "
"deadline, which may vary according to each state's legislation."
msgstr ""
"Revise si la factura electrónica todavía está dentro de la fecha límite de "
"cancelación, que puede variar de acuerdo con la legislación de cada estado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:489
msgid ""
"To cancel an e-invoice for goods (NF-e) in Odoo, click :guilabel:`Request "
"Cancel` and add a cancellation :guilabel:`Reason` on the pop-up that "
"appears. To send this cancellation reason to the customer via email, enable "
"the :guilabel:`E-mail` checkbox."
msgstr ""
"Para cancelar una factura electrónica para bienes (NF-e) en Odoo, haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Solicitar cancelación` y agrega un :guilabel:`motivo` para la "
"cancelación en la ventana emergente que aparece. Para enviar este motivo de "
"cancelación al cliente a través del correo electrónico, "
"habilita :guilabel:`Correo electrónico`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:494
msgid ""
"This is an electronic cancellation, which means that Odoo will send a "
"request to the government to cancel the NF-e."
msgstr ""
"Se trata de una cancelación electrónica, lo que significa que Odoo enviará "
"una solicitud al gobierno para cancelar la NF-e."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:502
msgid ""
"To cancel an e-invoice for services (NFS-e) in Odoo, "
"click :guilabel:`Request Cancel`. There is no electronic cancellation "
"process in this case, as not every city has this service available. The user "
"needs to cancel this NFS-e on the city portal manually. Once that step is "
"completed, they can request the cancellation in Odoo, which will cancel the "
"invoice."
msgstr ""
"Para cancelar una factura electrónica de servicios (NFS-e) en Odoo, debes "
"hacer clic en :guilabel:`Solicitar cancelación`. No hay un proceso de "
"cancelación electrónica, pues no todas las ciudades disponen de este "
"servicio. El usuario debe cancelar esta NFS-e de forma manual en el portal "
"de la ciudad. Después de completar este paso, puedes solicitar la "
"cancelación en Odoo para cancelar la factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:510
msgid "Correction letter"
msgstr "Carta de corrección "

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:512
msgid ""
"A correction letter can be created and linked to an electronic invoice for "
"goods (NF-e) that the government validated."
msgstr ""
"Es posible crear una carta de rectificación y vincularla a una factura "
"electrónica para bienes (NF-e) que el gobierno haya validado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:515
msgid ""
"To do so in Odoo, click :guilabel:`Correction Letter` and add a "
"correction :guilabel:`Reason` to the pop-up. To send the correction reason "
"to a customer via email, enable the :guilabel:`E-mail` checkbox."
msgstr ""
"Para hacer esto en Odoo, haz clic en  :guilabel:`Carta de corrección` y "
"agrega un :guilabel:`motivo` de corrección en la ventana emergente que "
"aparece. Para enviar este motivo de corrección por correo electrónico a un "
"cliente, selecciona la opción :guilabel:`Correo electrónico`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:520
msgid ""
"Correction letters are only available for electronic invoices for goods (NF-"
"e)."
msgstr ""
"Las cartas de rectificación solo están disponibles para las facturas "
"electrónicas de bienes (NF-e)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:525
msgid "Invoice number range invalidation"
msgstr "Invalidación del rango del número de la factura"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:527
msgid ""
"A range of sequences that are assigned to sales journals can be invalidated "
"by the government if they are not currently used **and** will not be used in "
"the future. To do so, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> "
"Journals`, open the journal, click the :icon:`fa-cog` (gear) icon, and "
"select :guilabel:`Invalidate Number Range (BR)`. On "
"the :guilabel:`Invalidate Number Range (BR)` wizard, add "
"the :guilabel:`Initial Number` and :guilabel:`End Number` of the range that "
"should be cancelled, and enter an invalidation :guilabel:`Reason`."
msgstr ""
"El gobierno puede invalidar una serie de secuencias asignadas a los diarios "
"de ventas si no están en uso **y** no se usarán en el futuro. Para hacerlo, "
"ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Diarios`, abre el "
"diario, haz clic en el icono :icon:`fa-cog` (engranaje) y "
"selecciona :guilabel:`Invalidar rango de números (BR)`. En el asistente "
"para :guilabel:`Invalidar rango de números (BR)`, agrega "
"el :guilabel:`número inicial` y el :guilabel:`número final` del rango que se "
"deba cancelar y escribe el :guilabel:`motivo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:536
msgid ""
"Invoice number range invalidation is only available for electronic invoices "
"for goods (NF-e)."
msgstr ""
"La invalidación de un rango de número de factura solo está disponible para "
"facturas electrónicas de bienes (NF-e)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:537
msgid ""
"The journal's chatter records the log of the cancelled numbers, along with "
"the XML file."
msgstr ""
"El chatter del diario lleva un registro de los números cancelados, junto con "
"el archivo XML."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:544
msgid ""
"When receiving an invoice from a supplier, encode the bill in Odoo by adding "
"all the commercial information and the same Brazilian-specific information "
"recorded on the :ref:`customer invoices <localizations/brazil/electronic-"
"documents>`."
msgstr ""
"Al recibir las facturas del proveedor, ingrésalas a Odoo. Agrega toda la "
"información comercial junto la misma información específica de Brasil "
"registrada en las :ref:`facturas de clientes <localizations/brazil/"
"electronic-documents>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:548
msgid "These Brazilian-specific fields are:"
msgstr "Los campos específicos para Brasil son:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:551
msgid ":guilabel:`Document Type`: used by the vendor"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Tipo de documento`: El que usa el proveedor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:552
msgid ":guilabel:`Document Number`: the invoice number from the supplier"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Número de documento`: El número de la factura del proveedor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:553
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Freight Model`: **NF-e specific** how goods are planned to be "
"transported - domestic"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Modelo de flete`: **específico para NF-e**. Determina cómo planea "
"transportar los bienes de forma local."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:554
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Transporter Brazil`: **NF-e specific** who is doing the "
"transportation."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Transportista de Brasil`: **específico para NF-e**. Quién se "
"encarga de la transportación."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:559
msgid "Point of sale NFC-e"
msgstr "NFC-e de Punto de venta"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:561
msgid ""
"The NFC-e is a legal document that supports selling goods or merchandise to "
"the final customer. Like the :ref:`NF-e <localizations/brazil/e-invoice-"
"goods-nf-e>`, the electronic customer invoice is also issued in XML file "
"format and has an auxiliary document (DANFC-e) known as the *NFC-e Summary*. "
"This electronic document can be issued through **Odoo Point of Sale**."
msgstr ""
"El NFC-e es un documento legal que se emite para la venta de bienes o "
"mercancía al consumidor final. Como el :ref:`NF-e <localizations/brazil/e-"
"invoice-goods-nf-e>`, la factura electrónica del cliente también se emite en "
"un archivo de formato XML e incluye un documento auxiliar (DANFC-e) conocido "
"como el *NFC-e de resumen*. Este es un documento electrónico se puede emitir "
"a través del **Punto de venta de Odoo**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:566
msgid ""
"Its legal validity is guaranteed by the digital signature and by each "
"Brazilian state's SEFAZ (Secretaria da Fazenda)."
msgstr ""
"La validez legal se garantiza con la firma digital y por la SEFAZ "
"(Secretaría de hacienda) de cada estado de Brasil."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:570
msgid ":doc:`Point of Sale <../../sales/point_of_sale>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Punto de venta <../../sales/point_of_sale>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:577
msgid ""
":ref:`Install <general/install>` the :guilabel:`Brazilian Accounting EDI for "
"POS` (`l10nbr_edi_pos`) module and make sure to activate :doc:`AvaTax <../"
"accounting/taxes/avalara>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Instala <general/install>` el módulo :guilabel:`EDI de contabilidad "
"brasileña para TPV` (`l10nbr_edi_pos`) y asegúrate de activar :doc:`AvaTax "
"<../accounting/taxes/avalara>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:583
msgid "CSC details"
msgstr "Detalles CSC"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:585
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings` and scroll "
"to the :guilabel:`Taxes` section. In the :guilabel:`NFC-e configuration` "
"section, complete the following CSC (Taxpayer Security Code) fields:"
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Ajustes` y dirígete "
"a la sección :guilabel:`Impuestos`. En la sección :guilabel:`Configuración "
"NFC-e`, completa los siguientes campos de CSC (Código de seguridad del "
"contribuyente):"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:589
msgid ""
":guilabel:`CSC ID`: The *CSC ID* or *CSC Token* is an identification of the "
"taxpayer security code, which can have 1 to 6 digits and is available on the "
"official website of your state’s Department of Finance (SEFAZ)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`CSC ID`: El *CSC ID* o *token CSC* es la identificación del "
"código de seguridad del contribuyente. Puede tener de 1 a 6 dígitos y está "
"disponible en el sitio web oficial de la Secretaría de hacienda (SEFAZ) de "
"su estado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:592
msgid ""
":guilabel:`CSC Number`: The *CSC Number* is a code of up to 36 characters "
"that only you and the Department of Finance know. It is used to generate the "
"QR Code of the NFC-e and ensure the authenticity of the DANFE."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`CSC Number` (Número CSC): El *número CSC* es un código de hasta "
"36 caracteres que solo usted y la Secretaría de hacienda conocen. Se usa "
"para generar el código QR del NFC-e y asegura la autenticidad del DANFE."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:597
msgid ""
"The information required for these fields can be generated through the SEFAZ "
"website of each Brazilian State by the company's accountant."
msgstr ""
"La información necesaria para llenar estos campos la puede generar el "
"contador de la empresa en el sitio web de la SEFAZ de cada estado de Brasil."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:605
msgid ""
"Access the relevant :doc:`product form in POS <../../sales/point_of_sale/"
"products>`, then configure the :ref:`product <localizations/brazil/"
"products>`'s :guilabel:`Brazil Accounting` fields."
msgstr ""
"Accede al :doc:`formulario del producto correspondiente en PdV <../../sales/"
"point_of_sale/products>` y configura los campos de "
"la :guilabel:`contabilidad brasileña` del :ref:`producto <localizations/"
"brazil/products>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:612
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1091
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:363
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1536
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:577
msgid "Point of sale"
msgstr "Punto de venta"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:614
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Configuration --> Settings` and make "
"sure that the relevant Point of Sale is :ref:`selected at the top of the "
"screen <pos/use/settings>`. Then, scroll to the :guilabel:`Accounting` "
"section and configure the :guilabel:`Brazilian EDI` fields:"
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Punto de venta --> Configuración --> Ajustes` y "
"asegúrate de :ref:`seleccionar el punto de venta correcto en la parte "
"superior de la pantalla <pos/use/settings>`. Después, ve a la "
"sección :guilabel:`Contabilidad` y configura los campos de :guilabel:`EDI "
"para Brasil`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:618
msgid ":guilabel:`Series`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Series`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:619
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Next number`: the next NFC-e number in the sequence to be issued, "
"for instance, if the last number issued in SEFAZ is `100`, the *Next number* "
"will be `101`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Número siguiente`: El siguiente número NFC-e que se emitirá, por "
"ejemplo, si el último número emitido es SEFAZ es `100`, el *Número "
"siguiente* será `101`."

