msgid "Workflow"
msgstr "Flujo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:630
msgid "Generating an NFC-e"
msgstr "Generar una NFC-e"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:632
msgid "To generate an NFC-e, follow these steps:"
msgstr "Para generar una NFC-e, sigue los pasos a continuación:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:634
msgid ""
":ref:`Open the relevant point of sale shop and make a sale <pos/use/open-"
"register>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Abre la tienda de punto de venta correspondiente y realiza una venta "
"<pos/use/open-register>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:635
msgid ""
"Validate the payment to calculate taxes and issue an NFC-e. The valid NFC-e "
"appears on the right side of the screen."
msgstr ""
"Valida el pago para calcular los impuestos y emite una NFC-e. La NFC-e "
"válida aparece en el lado derecho de la pantalla."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:638
msgid "NFC-e Success in the POS register."
msgstr "Éxito de NFC-e en la caja registradora del PdV."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:642
msgid ""
"It is also possible to issue an NFC-e that identifies the customer by their "
"CPF/CNPJ. To do so, click :icon:`fa-user` :guilabel:`Customer`, search for "
"the customer, or create a new one."
msgstr ""
"También es posible emitir una NFC-e en la que se identifique al cliente con "
"su CPF/CNPJ. Para hacerlo, haz clic en :icon:`fa-user` :guilabel:`Cliente` y "
"busque el cliente o cree uno nuevo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:645
msgid ""
"The following are mandatory fields to issue a CPF/CNPJ identified NFC-e:"
msgstr ""
"Los campos a continuación son obligatorio para poder emitir una NFC-e "
"identificada con CPF/CNPJ:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:648
msgid ""
":guilabel:`City` and :guilabel:`State` where the invoice is being issued"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Ciudad` y :guilabel:`Estado` donde se emite la factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:649
msgid ":guilabel:`CPF/CNPJ`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`CPF/CNPJ`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:651
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Validate`. The NFC-e appears, highlighting the customer's "
"CPF on the print."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Validar`. La NFC-e aparecerá y se resaltará el CPF "
"del cliente en la impresión."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:652
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Print` or :guilabel:`Send via e-mail` to deliver the "
"invoice to the customer."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Imprimir` o en :guilabel:`Enviar por correo "
"electrínico` para entregarle la factura al cliente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:657
msgid "NFC-e ticket print"
msgstr "Imprimir ticket NFC-e"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:659
msgid ""
"After :ref:`generating and validating the NFC-e <localizations/brazil/"
"generate-nfc-e>`, click :guilabel:`Print` to deliver the invoice."
msgstr ""
"Después de :ref:`generar y validar la NFC-e <localizations/brazil/generate-"
"nfc-e>`, haga clic en :guilabel:`Imprimir` para entregar la factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:663
msgid ""
"The Odoo NFC-e feature is compatible with any thermal printer and does not "
"require an :doc:`Odoo IoT Box <../../general/iot>`."
msgstr ""
"La función NFC-e de Odoo es compatibl con cualquier impresora térmica y no "
"requiere una :doc:`caja IoT de Odoo <../../general/iot>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:669
msgid "Re-issuing a PoS order with an NFC-e error"
msgstr "Volver a emitir una orden del PdV con error de NFC-e"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:671
msgid "If the NFC-e returns an error, follow these steps:"
msgstr "Si la NFC-e regresa un error, sigue los pasos a continuación:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:673
msgid "Correct the error."
msgstr "Corrige el error."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:674
msgid ""
"Re-issue the NFC-e by clicking the :icon:`fa-bars` :guilabel:`(menu)` icon "
"and selecting :guilabel:`Orders`."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en el icono :icon:`fa-bars` :guilabel:`(menú)` y "
"selecciona :guilabel:`Órdenes` para volver a emitir el NFC-e."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:676
msgid ""
"Filter the list to show only :guilabel:`Paid` orders and "
"click :guilabel:`Details`. The error is displayed."
msgstr ""
"Usa un filtro en la lista para que se muestren solo las "
"órdenes :guilabel:`Pagadas` y haga clic en :guilabel:`Detalles`. Se mostrará "
"el error."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:678
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Send NFC-e`."
msgstr "Haz clic en :guilabel:`Enviar NFC-e`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:681
msgid ""
"If the error has been corrected and the POS register is closed, Odoo logs "
"the tax adjustment in the chatter of the related journal entry. The journal "
"entry for the order indicates that the taxes were incorrectly calculated. In "
"this case, reprocessing the NFC-e is required."
msgstr ""
"Si corriges el error y la caja del PdV está cerrada, Odoo registra el ajuste "
"de impuestos en el chatter del asiento contable relacionado. El asiento "
"contable de la orden indica que los impuestos se calcularon de forma "
"incorrecta. En este caso deberás reprocesar la NFC-e."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:685
msgid "Point of sale order view form."
msgstr ""
"Captura de pantalla de la vista de formulario de una orden del punto de "
"venta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:691
msgid "NFC-e refunds & cancellations"
msgstr "Reembolsos y cancelaciones de NFC-e"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:693
msgid ""
":ref:`Refunds can be processed directly in Odoo <pos/use/refund>`, but "
"*cancellations* must be performed through the official government portal."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Procesa los reembolsos en Odoo <pos/use/refund>`, pero realiza las "
"*cancelaciones* desde el portal oficial del gobierno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:696
msgid ""
"When the process is finalized, the approved return NF-e is created, meaning "
"the **previous NFC-e is canceled**."
msgstr ""
"Al finalizar el proceso, se crea la devolución de NF-e aprobada, es decir "
"que **la NFC-e anterior se cancela**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:699
msgid "Return of Goods NF-e Approved."
msgstr "Captura de pantalla de una NF-e de devolución de bienes aprobada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:703
msgid ""
"SEFAZ only allows cancellation of an NFC-e **within 30 minutes** of its "
"issuance on the SEFAZ website. After this period, a manual refund must be "
"processed, along with the issuance of a *Return of Goods NF-e*."
msgstr ""
"SEFAZ solo permite la cancelación de una NFC-e **hasta 30 minutos después** "
"de su emisión en el sitio web de SEFAZ. Si se agota este tiempo, se debe "
"procesar un reembolso manual y se debe emitir una *NF-e de reembolso de "
"bienes*."

