#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:237
msgid ""
":ref:`Balance Sheet <accounting/reporting/balance-sheet>`: a \"snapshot\" of "
"a company's financial position at a specific point in time, which contains "
"an overview of a company's assets, liabilities, and equity."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Balance general <accounting/reporting/balance-sheet>`: Una "
"\"instantánea\" de la situación financiera de una empresa en un momento "
"específico. Incluye una visión general de los activos, pasivos y capital de "
"la empresa."

