#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:327
msgid "EFT - electronic transfers"
msgstr "EFT: Transferencias electrónicas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:329
msgid ""
"In Canada, Electronic Funds Transfer (EFT) refers to the digital transfer of "
"funds between different bank accounts, largely replacing traditional paper-"
"based transactions. :abbr:`EFT (Electronic Funds Transfers)` is the primary "
"system used by businesses to automate payroll, pay suppliers, and collect "
"recurring payments."
msgstr ""
"En Canadá, la transferencia electrónica de fondos (EFT) se refiere a la "
"transferencia digital de fondos entre distintas cuentas bancarias y "
"sustituye en gran medida las transacciones tradicionales en "
"papel. :abbr:`EFT (transferencias electrónicas de fondos)` es el sistema "
"principal que usan las empresas para automatizar el pago de nóminas, pagar a "
"proveedores y cobrar pagos recurrentes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:337
msgid "CPA005 file"
msgstr "Archivo CPA005"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:339
msgid ""
"CPA005 is a standardized file format used by Canadian banks to process "
"batched financial transactions, primarily for :abbr:`EFT (Electronic Funds "
"Transfers)`."
msgstr ""
"CPA005 es un formato de archivo estandarizado que usan los bancos "
"canadienses para procesar transacciones financieras por lotes, "
"principalmente para :abbr:`EFT (transferencias electrónicas de fondos)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:343
msgid ""
