#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:293
msgid ""
"For retail stores it is common to have one journal per :abbr:`POS (Point of "
"Sale)`."
msgstr ""
"Para las tiendas de venta al por menor es común tener un diario "
"por :abbr:`PdV (Punto de Venta)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:296
