#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1099
msgid ""
"The following sections cover the invoicing flows for the *Point of Sale* "
"application."
msgstr ""
"Las siguientes secciones describen los flujos de facturación de la "
"aplicación *Punto de venta*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1102
msgid "Electronic receipts: anonymous end user"
msgstr "Boletas electrónicas: cliente final anónimo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1104
msgid ""
"When making a purchase as an anonymous user that does not request an "
"electronic invoice, Odoo automatically selects :guilabel:`Consumidor Final "
"Anónimo` as the contact for the order and generates the electronic receipt."
msgstr ""
"Al realizar una compra como cliente anónimo que no solicita una factura "
"electrónica, Odoo selecciona de manera automática al :guilabel:`consumidor "
"final anónimo` como el contacto de la orden y genera la boleta electrónica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1108
msgid "Automatic contact selection of an anonymous end consumer."
msgstr "Selección automática del contacto de un consumidor final anónimo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1112
msgid ""
"If the client requests a credit note due to a return of their purchase, the "
"credit note should be made using the *Accounting* app. See the :doc:`credit "
"notes and refunds <../accounting/customer_invoices/credit_notes>` "
"documentation for detailed instructions."
msgstr ""
"Si el cliente solicita una nota de crédito debido a la devolución de su "
"compra, es necesario que elabore la nota de crédito con la aplicación "
"*Contabilidad*. Consulte la documentación sobre :doc:`notas de crédito y "
"devoluciones <../accounting/customer_invoices/credit_notes>` para obtener "
"instrucciones más detalladas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1117
msgid "Electronic receipts: specific customer"
msgstr "Boletas electrónicas: cliente específico"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1119
msgid ""
"When specific user makes a purchase that does not request an electronic "
"invoice, Odoo automatically selects the contact for the order as "
"the :guilabel:`Consumidor Final Anónimo`, and allows you to select or create "
"the required customer contact with their fiscal information for the receipt."
msgstr ""
"Cuando un cliente específico realiza una compra y no solicita una factura "
"electrónica, Odoo selecciona en automático al :guilabel:`consumidor final "
"anónimo` como el contacto de la orden y le permite seleccionar o crear el "
"contacto del cliente necesario con su información fiscal para la boleta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1123
msgid "Selection of contact for the receipt."
msgstr "Selección de un contacto para el recibo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1127
msgid ""
"If the client requests a credit note because of a return of this type of "
"purchase, the credit note and return process can be managed directly from "
"the :abbr:`POS (Point of Sale)` session."
msgstr ""
"Si el cliente solicita una nota de crédito debido a la devolución de este "
"tipo de compra, podrá gestionar la nota de crédito y el proceso de "
"devolución desde la sesión del :abbr:`PdV (Punto de venta)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1131
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:354
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:212
msgid "Electronic invoices"
msgstr "Facturas electrónicas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1133
msgid ""
"When clients request an electronic invoice, it is possible to select or "
"create the required contact with their fiscal information. When the payment "
"is being made, select the option :guilabel:`Invoice` to generate the "
"document."
msgstr ""
"Cuando los clientes solicitan una factura electrónica, podrá seleccionar o "
"crear el contacto necesario con su información fiscal. Seleccione la "
"opción :guilabel:`Factura` para generar el documento al realizar el pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1137
msgid "Selection of invoice option at payment."
msgstr "Selección de una opción de factura en el pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1141
msgid ""
"For both the electronic receipts and invoices, if the product is not "
"affected by taxes, Odoo detects this and generates the correct type of "
"document for tax-exempt sales."
msgstr ""
"Tanto para las boletas electrónicas como para las facturas electrónicas, si "
"el producto no está gravado, Odoo lo detectará y generará el tipo de "
"documento correcto para ventas exentas de impuestos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1145
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "Devoluciones"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1147
msgid ""
"For electronic receipts (not generated for the *Consumidor Final Anónimo*) "
"and electronic invoices, it is possible to manage the process to return "
"products sold in a :abbr:`POS (Point of Sale)` order by selecting "
"the :guilabel:`Refund` button."
msgstr ""
"Para las boletas electrónicas (que no fueron generadas para el *consumidor "
"final anónimo*) y las facturas electrónicas, puede gestionar el proceso de "
"devolución de productos vendidos en una orden de :abbr:`PdV (Punto de "
"venta)` si hace clic en el botón :guilabel:`Reembolso`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1151
msgid "Refund option in the POS application."
msgstr "Opción de reembolso en la aplicación Punto de venta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1154
msgid ""
"Orders can be searched by the order status or by contact, and be selected "
"for the refund to be based on the client's original order."
msgstr ""
"Puede buscar órdenes por su estado o por contacto y puede seleccionarlas "
"para realizar reembolsos basados en la orden original del cliente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1157
msgid "Selection of order for the refund process."
msgstr "Selección de la orden para el proceso del reembolso."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1160
msgid ""
"When the return payment is validated, Odoo generates the necessary credit "
"note, referencing the original receipt or invoice, partially or fully "
"cancelling the document."
msgstr ""
"Odoo genera la nota de crédito correspondiente al validar el pago del "
"reembolso, este hace referencia al recibo o factura original y anula el "
"documento de manera parcial o completa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1164
msgid ""
"`Smart tutorial - Electronic invoicing for point of sale <https://"
"www.youtube.com/watch?v=B2XuWmtlmno&t=360s>`_."
msgstr ""
"`Tutorial inteligente - Facturación electrónica para Punto de venta <https://"
"www.youtube.com/watch?v=B2XuWmtlmno&t=360s>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1170
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:675
msgid "Factoring"
msgstr "Factoraje"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1173
msgid ""
"Make sure the :guilabel:`Chile - Localization: Factoring Extension` "
"(`l10n_cl_edi_factoring`) module is :ref:`installed <general/install>`."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de que el módulo :guilabel:`Chile - Localización: Extensión para "
"factoring` (`l10n_cl_edi_factoring`) esté :ref:`instalado <general/install>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1176
msgid ""
"**Factoring** is a financial strategy where accounts receivable invoices are "
"sold to a factoring company to receive immediate liquidity (less an agreed "
"commission) before the actual due date. The **AEC (Archivo Electrónico de "
"Cesión)** is the document that formalizes and registers the assignment of a "
"DTE to a third party (Factoring company) through the SII system."
msgstr ""
"El **factoring** es una estrategia financiera en la que las facturas por "
"cobrar se venden a una empresa de factoring para obtener liquidez inmediata "
"(menos una comisión acordada) antes de la fecha de vencimiento real. El "
"**AEC (Archivo Electrónico de Cesión)** es el documento que formaliza y "
"registra la cesión de un DTE a un tercero (empresa de factoring) a través "
"del sistema del SII."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1181
msgid "**Factoring of sales invoices**:"
msgstr "**Factoring de facturas de venta**:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1183
msgid "*Does not apply to tickets (boletas)*."
msgstr "*No aplica a boletas*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1184
msgid "Can be multi-currency."
msgstr "Puede usar varias monedas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1185
msgid "Does not require :abbr:`CAFs (Folio Authorization Code)`."
msgstr "No requiere :abbr:`CAF (Código de Asignación de Folios)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1186
msgid ""
"Generates an :abbr:`AEC (Archivo Electrónico de Cesión)` for each document "
"that is factored."
msgstr ""
"Genera un :abbr:`AEC (Archivo Electrónico de Cesión)` para cada documento "
"cedido."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1189
msgid ""
"This module supports companies transferring invoice ownership to a third "
"party, not companies acquiring invoice ownership."
msgstr ""
"Este módulo es compatible con las empresas que transfieren la propiedad de "
"facturas a un tercero, no con las empresas que adquieren la propiedad de "
"facturas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1197
msgid "To set the default journal and account for factoring purposes:"
msgstr "Para configurar el diario y la cuenta predeterminados para factoring:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1200
msgid "Scroll down to the :guilabel:`Chilean Localization` section."
msgstr "Dirígete a la sección :guilabel:`Localización chilena`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1201
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Factoring Default Information` section, complete the "
"following fields :"
msgstr ""
"Completa los siguientes campos en la sección :guilabel:`Información "
"predeterminada para factoring`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1203
msgid ":guilabel:`Journal`: Select a :guilabel:`Miscellaneous` type journal."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Diario`: Selecciona un diario de tipo :guilabel:`Varios`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1204
msgid ":guilabel:`Receivable Account`: Update if necessary."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Cuenta por cobrar`: Actualízala si es necesario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1207
msgid "It's recommended to use a specific factoring account receivable."
msgstr "Te recomendamos usar una cuenta por cobrar específica para factoring."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1209
msgid ""
"Then, for each factoring partner, open the relevant :guilabel:`Contact` "
"form, and enable the :guilabel:`Factoring Company` option in "
"the :guilabel:`Electronic Invoicing` tab."
msgstr ""
"Luego, para cada empresa de factoring, abre el formulario "
"de :guilabel:`contacto` correspondiente y activa la "
"opción :guilabel:`Empresa de Factoring` en la pestaña :guilabel:`Facturación "
"electrónica`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1217
msgid "To factor an invoice, follow these steps:"
msgstr "Para ceder una factura, sigue estos pasos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1219
msgid ""
"In the Invoices list view, open a Type 33 electronic invoice that has "
"been :ref:`validated by the SII <chile/electronic-invoice-validation>`."
msgstr ""
"En la vista de lista de facturas, abre una factura electrónica de tipo "
"33 :ref:`validada por el SII <chile/electronic-invoice-validation>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1221
msgid ""
"In the invoice form, click :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Create AEC` in "
"the :guilabel:`SII DTE status` field."
msgstr ""
"En el formulario de la factura, haz clic en :icon:`oi-arrow-"
"right` :guilabel:`Crear AEC` en el campo :guilabel:`Estado del DTE en el "
"SII`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1223
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Create AEC` window, specify the :guilabel:`Factoring "
"Company` and the :guilabel:`Date Due`, and click :guilabel:`Create AEC`. A "
"yellow banner confirms that the invoice has an account entry to be yielded."
msgstr ""
"En la ventana :guilabel:`Crear AEC`, especifica la :guilabel:`empresa de "
"factoring` y la :guilabel:`fecha de vencimiento`, y haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Crear AEC`. Una cinta amarilla confirma que la factura tiene "
"un asiento contable para ceder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1226
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-share` :guilabel:`Yield Entry` smart button to open the "
"yield entry."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en el botón inteligente :icon:`fa-share` :guilabel:`Asiento de "
"Cesión` para abrir el asiento de cesión."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1229
msgid ""
"The entry is posted using the :ref:`configured receivable account and "
"journal <chile/factoring-configuration>`."
msgstr ""
"El sistema registra el asiento con la :ref:`cuenta por cobrar y el diario "
"configurados <chile/factoring-configuration>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1232
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Send now to the SII` in "
"the :guilabel:`SII DTE status` field to generate, send and get the final "
"status of the AEC."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Enviar ahora al SII` en el "
"campo :guilabel:`Estado del DTE en el SII` para generar, enviar y obtener el "
"estado final del AEC."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1235
msgid ""
"Once the assignment entry is :guilabel:`Accepted`, the original customer "
"invoice is marked as :guilabel:`Paid`, with the accepted assignment entry "
"serving as the payment reference."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que el asiento de cesión tenga el estado :guilabel:`Aceptado`, la "
"factura original del cliente se marcará como :guilabel:`pagada`, y el "
"asiento de cesión aceptado servirá como referencia de pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1239
msgid ""
"To factor multiple invoices, select them in the :guilabel:`Invoices` list "
"view, click :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions`, select :guilabel:`Create "
"AEC`, and follow the same steps. An XML file is generated for each invoice."
msgstr ""
"Para ceder varias facturas, selecciónalas en la vista de lista "
"de :guilabel:`facturas`, haz clic en :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Acciones`, "
"selecciona :guilabel:`Crear AEC` y sigue los mismos pasos. El sistema genera "
"un archivo XML para cada factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1247
msgid "Balance tributario de 8 columnas"
msgstr "Balance tributario de 8 columnas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1249
msgid ""
"This report presents the accounts in detail (with their respective "
"balances), classifying them by origin and determining the level of profit or "
"loss for the evaluated period."
msgstr ""
"Este reporte muestra las cuentas en detalle (con sus saldos "
"correspondientes), las clasifica según su origen y determina el nivel de "
"ganancia o pérdida del periodo evaluado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1252
msgid ""
"To access it, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Balance "
"Sheet`, click :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`Report:`, and "
"select :guilabel:`Chilean Fiscal Balance (8 Columns)(CL)`."
msgstr ""
"Para acceder a él, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Reportes --> "
"Balance general`, haz clic en :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`Reporte:` y "
"selecciona :guilabel:`Balance fiscal chileno (8 columnas) (CL)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1256
msgid "Propuesta F29"
msgstr "Propuesta F29"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1258
msgid ""
"The *F29* form is a new system that the :abbr:`SII (Servicio de Impuestos "
"Internos)` enabled for taxpayers and replaces the *Purchase and Sales "
"Books*. This report is integrated by the Purchase Register (CR) and the "
"Sales Register (RV). Its purpose is to support the transactions related to "
"VAT, improving its control and declaration."
msgstr ""
"El formulario *F29* es un nuevo sistema que el :abbr:`SII (Servicio de "
"Impuestos Internos)` habilitó para los contribuyentes y reemplaza los "
"*libros de compras y ventas*. Este reporte está compuesto por el registro de "
"compras (RC) y el registro de ventas (RV). Su objetivo es respaldar las "
"transacciones relacionadas con el IVA y mejorar su control y declaración."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1264
msgid ""
"The *Propuesta F29 (CL)* report in Odoo covers the basic legal requirements "
"as a first proposal for the final tax declaration."
msgstr ""
"El reporte *Propuesta F29 (CL)* en Odoo cubre los requisitos legales básicos "
"como propuesta inicial para la declaración fiscal final."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1267
msgid ""
"This record is supplied by the electronic tax documents (DTE's) that "
"the :abbr:`SII (Servicio de Impuestos Internos)` has received."
msgstr ""
"Este registro proviene de los documentos tributarios electrónicos (DTE) que "
"el :abbr:`SII (Servicio de Impuestos Internos)` ha recibido."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1270
msgid ""
"To access it, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Tax "
"Return`, click :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`Report:`, and "
"select :guilabel:`Propuesta F29 (CL)`. To manually set "
"the :guilabel:`Proposed Ratio Factor (%)` and :guilabel:`PPM rate (%)`, "
"click the :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`(pencil)` icon and add the percentage "
"for each value. Calculations are then performed automatically."
msgstr ""
"Para acceder a él, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Reportes --> "
"Declaración de impuestos`, haz clic en :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`Reporte:` "
"y selecciona :guilabel:`Propuesta F29 (CL)`. Para definir "
"el :guilabel:`factor proporcional propuesto (%)` y la :guilabel:`tasa PPM "
"(%)` de forma manual, haz clic en el icono :icon:`fa-"
"pencil` :guilabel:`(lápiz)` y agrega el porcentaje para cada valor. Luego, "
"el sistema realiza los cálculos de forma automática."

