#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:38
msgid ""
"The Chinese localization package ensures compliance with Chinese fiscal and "
"accounting regulations. It includes tools for managing taxes, fiscal "
"positions, reporting, and a predefined chart of accounts tailored to China's "
"standards."
msgstr ""
"El paquete de localización china garantiza el cumplimiento de las normativas "
"fiscales y contables de China. Incluye herramientas para gestionar "
"impuestos, posiciones fiscales, informes y un plan contable predefinido "
"adaptado a las normas de China."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:42
msgid ""
"The Chinese localization package provides the following key features to "
"ensure compliance with local fiscal and accounting regulations:"
msgstr ""
"El paquete de localización china ofrece las siguientes características clave "
"para garantizar el cumplimiento de las normativas fiscales y contables "
"locales:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:45
msgid ""
":ref:`Chart of accounts <localizations/china/chart_of_accounts>`: a "
"predefined structure tailored to Chinese accounting standards"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Plan contable <localizations/china/chart_of_accounts>`: una estructura "
"predefinida adaptada a las normas contables chinas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:47
msgid ":ref:`Reporting <localizations/china/reporting>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Informes <localizations/china/reporting>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:48
msgid ""
":ref:`Taxes <localizations/china/taxes>`: pre-configured tax rates, "
"including standard VAT, zero-rated, and exempt options"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Impuestos <localizations/china/taxes>`: tasas de impuestos "
"preconfiguradas, incluyendo opciones estándar de IVA, tasa cero y exentas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:50
msgid ""
":doc:`../accounting/taxes/fiscal_positions`: automated tax mapping based on "
"the fapiao type for domestic customers and suppliers, and a dedicated fiscal "
"position for foreign ones"
msgstr ""
":doc:`../accounting/taxes/fiscal_positions`: asignación automática de "
"impuestos según el tipo de fapiao para clientes y proveedores nacionales, y "
"una posición fiscal dedicada para los extranjeros."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:58
msgid ""
"Two independent :doc:`charts of accounts <../accounting/get_started/"
"chart_of_accounts>` are available, depending on the selected :ref:`fiscal "
"localization package <fiscal_localizations/packages>`: :guilabel:`China - "
"Accounting Standards for Business Enterprises` and :guilabel:`China - "
"Accounting Standards for Small Business Enterprises`."
msgstr ""
"Hay dos :doc:`planes de cuentas <../accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts>"
"` independientes disponibles, según el :ref:`paquete de localización fiscal "
"<fiscal_localizations/packages>` seleccionado: :guilabel:`China - Normas de "
"contabilidad para empresas` y :guilabel:`China - Normas de contabilidad para "
"pequeñas empresas`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:68
msgid ""
"Each :ref:`fiscal localization package <fiscal_localizations/packages>` "
"includes dedicated :ref:`Balance Sheet <accounting/reporting/balance-sheet>` "
"and :ref:`Profit and Loss <accounting/reporting/profit-and-loss>` reports, "
"based on the corresponding :ref:`chart of accounts <localizations/china/"
"chart_of_accounts>`."
msgstr ""
"Cada :ref:`paquete de localización fiscal <fiscal_localizations/packages>` "
"incluye informes dedicados de :ref:`balance <accounting/reporting/balance-"
"sheet>` y :ref:`pérdidas y ganancias <accounting/reporting/profit-and-loss>"
"`, basados en el :ref:`plan de cuentas <localizations/china/"
"chart_of_accounts>` correspondiente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:73
msgid ""
"To access these reports, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting` and "
"select :guilabel:`Balance Sheet` or :guilabel:`Profit and Loss`."
msgstr ""
"Para acceder a estos informes, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> "
"Informes` y selecciona :guilabel:`Balance` o :guilabel:`Pérdidas y "
"ganancias`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:81
msgid ""
"Both :ref:`packages <fiscal_localizations/packages>` share the same pre-"
"configured :doc:`taxes <../accounting/taxes>`. To view them, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Taxes`."
msgstr ""
"Ambos :ref:`paquetes <fiscal_localizations/packages>` comparten los mismos "
":doc:`impuestos <../accounting/taxes>` preconfigurados. Para verlos, ve a "
":menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Impuestos`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:85
msgid ""
"The taxes are designed to feed the :ref:`tax report <localizations/china/"
"accounting/tax_report>`. Most taxes and tax grids are assigned to a line "
"of :guilabel:`Schedule 1 - Sales Details` or :guilabel:`Schedule 2 - Input "
"Tax Details`, so that amounts are classified and totaled automatically. The "
"tables below show the schedule line for each tax."
msgstr ""
"Los impuestos están diseñados para alimentar el :ref:`informe de impuestos "
"<localizations/china/accounting/tax_report>`. La mayoría de los impuestos y "
"cuadrículas de impuestos se asignan a una línea de :guilabel:`Anexo 1 - "
"Detalles de ventas` o :guilabel:`Anexo 2 - Detalles de impuestos "
"soportados`, de modo que los importes se clasifiquen y totalicen "
"automáticamente. Las tablas a continuación muestran la línea del anexo para "
"cada impuesto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:90
msgid ""
"Each tax name follows a pattern that identifies the tax rate or treatment, "
"the type of supply or purchase, and the supporting document: a **fapiao** "
"(:dfn:`official invoice issued through the Electronic Tax Bureau`) or a "
"receipt. Understanding this pattern simplifies the search for the right tax."
msgstr ""
"El nombre de cada impuesto sigue un patrón que identifica la tasa o "
"tratamiento, el tipo de suministro o compra y el documento justificativo: un "
"**fapiao** (:dfn:`factura oficial emitida a través de la Oficina Electrónica "
"de Impuestos`) o un recibo. Entender este patrón simplifica la búsqueda del "
"impuesto correcto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:96
msgid ""
"To choose the right tax, first determine whether the transaction is a sale "
"or a purchase:"
msgstr ""
"Para elegir el impuesto correcto, primero determina si la operación es una "
"venta o una compra:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:98
msgid ""
"For a sale, identify the rate or treatment, the scope, and the fapiao type."
msgstr ""
"Para una venta, identifica la tasa o tratamiento, el ámbito y el tipo de "
"fapiao."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:99
msgid "For a purchase, identify the rate and the supporting document received."
msgstr ""
"Para una compra, identifica la tasa y el documento justificativo recibido."

