#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:541
msgid "Balance Deduction"
msgstr "Deducción de saldo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:544
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:580
msgid "Confirm the invoice."
msgstr "Confirme la factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:549
msgid "Output VAT offset entry"
msgstr "Asiento de compensación de IVA repercutido"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:551
msgid ""
"Depending on the selected :guilabel:`VAT Differential Taxation Method`, the "
"journal entries are handled automatically in two different ways:"
msgstr ""
"Según el :guilabel:`Método de tributación diferencial del IVA` seleccionado, "
"los asientos contables se gestionan automáticamente de dos maneras:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:554
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Net Amount Fapiao`: Upon confirmation, an output VAT offset entry "
"is automatically posted."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Fapiao de monto neto`: tras la confirmación, se contabiliza "
"automáticamente un asiento de compensación de IVA repercutido."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:558
msgid ""
"A :guilabel:`Net Amount Fapiao` invoice cannot be confirmed if "
"the :guilabel:`Balance Deduction` details are missing."
msgstr ""
"No puedes confirmar una factura de :guilabel:`Fapiao de monto neto` si "
"faltan los detalles de la :guilabel:`Deducción de saldo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:561
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Full Amount Fapiao`: Filling in the :guilabel:`Balance Deduction` "
"details prior to invoice confirmation is optional. The timing of the output "
"VAT offset entry depends on when these details are provided:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Fapiao de monto completo`: completar los detalles de la "
":guilabel:`Deducción de saldo` antes de confirmar la factura es opcional. El "
"momento en el que se registra el asiento de compensación de IVA repercutido "
"depende de cuándo se proporcionen estos detalles:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:565
msgid ""
"**Before confirmation:** The entry is automatically posted upon invoice "
"confirmation."
msgstr ""
"**Antes de la confirmación:** el asiento se contabiliza automáticamente al "
"confirmar la factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:566
msgid ""
"**After confirmation:** If left blank initially, the entry is automatically "
"posted upon saving the balance deduction details later."
msgstr ""
"**Después de la confirmación:** si se deja en blanco inicialmente, el "
"asiento se contabiliza automáticamente cuando guardes los detalles de la "
"deducción de saldo más tarde."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:569
msgid ""
"If the tax rate of an invoice line is 0%, no output VAT offset entry is "
"posted."
msgstr ""
"Si la tasa impositiva de una línea de factura es del 0%, no se contabiliza "
"ningún asiento de compensación de IVA repercutido."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:571
msgid ""
"Upon confirmation of a credit note, the output VAT offset entry is "
"automatically reversed."
msgstr ""
"Al confirmar una nota de crédito, el asiento de compensación de IVA "
"repercutido se revierte automáticamente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:574
msgid ""
"To ensure data alignment between the balance deduction details and the "
"posted journal entries, automatically posted output VAT offset entries "
"cannot be reset to draft or reversed directly "
"from :menuselection:`Accounting --> Accounting --> Journal Entries`."
msgstr ""
"Para garantizar la coherencia de los datos entre los detalles de deducción "
"de saldo y los asientos contables publicados, las entradas de compensación "
"de IVA repercutido publicadas automáticamente no pueden restablecerse a "
"borrador ni revertirse directamente desde :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> "
"Contabilidad --> Asientos contables`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:578
msgid ""
"To correct an entry, open the related invoice and reset the entire invoice "
"to draft (for :guilabel:`Net Amount Fapiao`), or reset the specific balance "
"deduction details to draft (for :guilabel:`Full Amount Fapiao`)."
msgstr ""
"Para corregir un asiento, abre la factura relacionada y restablece la "
"factura completa a borrador (para :guilabel:`Factura de importe neto`), o "
"restablece los detalles específicos de deducción de saldo a borrador (para "
":guilabel:`Factura de importe completo`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:585
msgid "Calculation logic"
msgstr "Lógica de cálculo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:587
msgid ""
"The output VAT offset is calculated based on the tax-exclusive amount of the "
"deduction."
msgstr ""
"La compensación del IVA repercutido se calcula según el importe de la "
"deducción excluyendo impuestos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:589
msgid "The formula applied per invoice line is:"
msgstr "La fórmula que se aplica por línea de factura es:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:591
msgid ""
"**Output VAT offset** = [Total deduction amount / (1 + Tax rate)] × Tax rate"
msgstr ""
"**Compensación de IVA repercutido** = [Importe total de deducción / (1 + "
"Tasa impositiva)] × Tasa impositiva"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:594
msgid ""
"If the total deduction amount is 113.00 and the tax rate is 13%, the output "
"VAT offset is calculated as:"
msgstr ""
"Si el importe total de deducción es de 113.00 y la tasa impositiva es del "
"13%, la compensación del IVA repercutido se calcula de la siguiente manera:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:597
msgid "[113.00 / (1 + 0.13)] × 0.13 = **13.00**"
msgstr "[113.00 / (1 + 0.13)] × 0.13 = **13.00**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:602
msgid "Balance deductions ledger"
msgstr "Libro mayor de deducciones de saldo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:604
msgid ""
"To cross-check the data between the balance deduction details and the posted "
"output VAT offset journal entries, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Reporting --> Balance Deductions`."
msgstr ""
"Para cotejar los datos entre los detalles de deducción de saldo y los "
"asientos contables de compensación de IVA repercutido, ve a "
":menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Informes --> Deducciones de saldo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:608
msgid ""
"Columns 12 to 14 of :guilabel:`Schedule 1 - Sales Details` in the :ref:`tax "
"report <localizations/china/accounting/tax_report>` are not filled in "
"automatically. Use the balance deduction data in this report to enter the "
"amounts manually, or to cross-check them with the Electronic Tax Bureau."
msgstr ""
"Las columnas 12 a 14 de :guilabel:`Anexo 1 - Detalles de ventas` en el "
":ref:`informe de impuestos <localizations/china/accounting/tax_report>` no "
"se completan de forma automática. Usa los datos de deducción de saldo de "
"este informe para introducir los importes manualmente o para cotejarlos con "
"la Oficina Tributaria Electrónica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:616
