msgid ""
"The following modules related to the Dominican Republic localization are "
"available:"
msgstr ""
"Los siguientes módulos relacionados con la localización de la República "
"Dominicana están disponibles:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:26
msgid ":guilabel:`Dominican Republic - Accounting`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`República Dominicana - Contabilidad`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:27
msgid "`l10n_do`"
msgstr "`l10n_do`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:28
msgid ""
"The default :doc:`fiscal localization package <../fiscal_localizations>`. It "
"adds accounting characteristics for the Dominican Republic localization, "
"which represent the minimum configuration required for a company to operate "
"in the Dominican Republic according to the |DGII| guidelines."
msgstr ""
"El :doc:`paquete de localización fiscal <../fiscal_localizations>` "
"predeterminado. Añade características contables para la localización de la "
"República Dominicana, las cuales representan la configuración mínima "
"requerida para que una empresa opere en la República Dominicana de acuerdo "
"con las pautas de |DGII|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:32
msgid ":guilabel:`Dominican Republic - Accounting EDI`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`República Dominicana - EDI contable`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:33
msgid "`l10n_do_edi`"
msgstr "`l10n_do_edi`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:34
msgid ""
"Includes all the technical and functional requirements to generate and "
"validate :doc:`Electronic Fiscal Receipts <../accounting/customer_invoices/"
"electronic_invoicing>` (|ECF|) with XML files, electronic numbers (eNCF), "
"and digital signatures, based on the technical documentation published by "
"the |DGII|."
msgstr ""
"Incluye todos los requisitos técnicos y funcionales para generar y validar "
":doc:`Comprobantes fiscales electrónicos <../accounting/customer_invoices/"
"electronic_invoicing>` (|ECF|) con archivos XML, números electrónicos (eNCF) "
"y firmas digitales, basados en la documentación técnica publicada por la "
"|DGII|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:38
msgid ":guilabel:`Dominican Republic - Accounting Reports`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`República Dominicana - Informes contables`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:39
msgid "`l10n_do_reports`"
msgstr "`l10n_do_reports`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:40
msgid ""
"Provides financial reports tailored to the Dominican Republic's regulatory "
"requirements."
msgstr ""
"Proporciona informes financieros adaptados a los requisitos normativos de la "
"República Dominicana."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:41
msgid ":guilabel:`Dominican Republic - Checks Layout`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`República Dominicana - Diseño de cheques`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:42
msgid "`l10n_do_check_printing`"
msgstr "`l10n_do_check_printing`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:43
msgid ""
"Enables the printing of checks formatted for Dominican Republic banking "
"standards."
msgstr ""
"Habilita la impresión de cheques con el formato de los estándares bancarios "
"de la República Dominicana."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:54
msgid ""
"The Dominican Republic localization package ensures compliance with "
"Dominican Republic fiscal and accounting regulations. It includes tools for "
"managing taxes, fiscal positions, reporting, and a predefined chart of "
"accounts tailored to the Dominican Republic’s standards."
msgstr ""
"El paquete de localización de República Dominicana garantiza el cumplimiento "
"de las normativas fiscales y contables del país. Incluye herramientas para "
"gestionar impuestos, posiciones fiscales, informes y un plan contable "
"predefinido adaptado a los estándares de la República Dominicana."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:58
msgid ""
"The Dominican Republic localization package provides the following key "
"features to ensure compliance with local fiscal and accounting regulations:"
msgstr ""
"El paquete de localización de República Dominicana ofrece las siguientes "
"funciones clave para garantizar el cumplimiento de las normativas fiscales y "
"contables locales:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:61
msgid ""
":ref:`Chart of accounts <localizations/dominican-republic/chart-of-"
"accounts>`: a predefined structure tailored to Dominican Republic accounting "
"standards."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Plan contable <localizations/dominican-republic/chart-of-accounts>`: "
"una estructura predefinida adaptada a los estándares contables de la "
"República Dominicana."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:63
msgid ""
":ref:`Taxes <localizations/dominican-republic/taxes>`: pre-configured tax "
"rates, including standard VAT, zero-rated, and exempt options."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Impuestos <localizations/dominican-republic/taxes>`: tasas impositivas "
"preconfiguradas, incluidas las opciones de IVA estándar, tasa cero y exento."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:66
msgid ""
":ref:`E-invoicing (Infile) <localizations/dominican-republic/electronic-"
"invoicing>`: integration for electronic invoicing in line with the Dominican "
"Republic's government requirements."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Facturación electrónica (Infile) <localizations/dominican-republic/"
"electronic-invoicing>`: integración para la facturación electrónica de "
"acuerdo con los requisitos del gobierno de la República Dominicana."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:74
msgid ""
"The :doc:`chart of accounts <../accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts>` "
"is installed by default as part of the data set included with the "
"localization module. Accounts are automatically mapped to taxes, default "
"accounts payable, and default accounts receivable."
msgstr ""
"El :doc:`plan contable <../accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts>` se "
"instala de forma predeterminada como parte del conjunto de datos incluido en "
"el módulo de localización. Las cuentas se asignan automáticamente a los "
"impuestos, las cuentas por pagar predeterminadas y las cuentas por cobrar "
"predeterminadas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:78
msgid ""
"Use the :ref:`predefined structure <chart-of-account/create>` or create and "
"delete accounts according to the company's needs."
msgstr ""
"Usa la :ref:`estructura predefinida <chart-of-account/create>` o crea y "
"elimina cuentas según las necesidades de la empresa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:86
msgid ""
"As part of the Dominican Republic localization module, :doc:`taxes <../"
"accounting/taxes>` are automatically created with their configuration and "
"related financial accounts. The main taxes available include:"
msgstr ""
"Como parte del módulo de localización de la República Dominicana, los "
":doc:`impuestos <../accounting/taxes>` se crean automáticamente con su "
"configuración y sus cuentas financieras relacionadas. Los principales "
"impuestos disponibles incluyen:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:90
msgid ""
":guilabel:`18% ITBIS`: Standard VAT rate applied to most goods and services "
"(sales and purchases)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`18% ITBIS`: tasa de IVA estándar aplicada a la mayoría de los "
"bienes y servicios (ventas y compras)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:91
msgid ""
":guilabel:`16% ITBIS`: Reduced |ITBIS| rate applicable to certain goods."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`16% ITBIS`: tasa reducida |ITBIS| aplicable a ciertos bienes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:92
msgid ":guilabel:`0% ITBIS`: Zero-rated |ITBIS| for certain transactions."
msgstr ":guilabel:`0% ITBIS`: tasa cero |ITBIS| para ciertas transacciones."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:93
msgid ""
":guilabel:`ITBIS Exempt`: For goods and services fully exempt from |ITBIS|."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`ITBIS exento`: para bienes y servicios totalmente exentos de "
"|ITBIS|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:94
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Withholding taxes`: |ITBIS| and ISR withholdings depending on |"
"DGII| regulations."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Retenciones de impuestos`: retenciones de |ITBIS| e ISR según las "
"normativas de |DGII|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:95
msgid ""
":guilabel:`10% Propina`: Legal tip (propina) applicable to hospitality and "
"restaurant services."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`10% Propina`: propina legal aplicable a los servicios de "
"hostelería y restaurantes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:98
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:167
msgid "Multi-currency"
msgstr "Multimoneda"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:100
msgid ""
"The Dominican Republic's official currency is the Dominican Peso (DOP), "
"symbolized as RD$. :doc:`Additional foreign currencies <../accounting/"
"get_started/multi_currency>` can also be enabled and configured, as needed."
msgstr ""
"La moneda oficial de la República Dominicana es el peso dominicano (DOP), "
"simbolizado como RD$. Las :doc:`monedas extranjeras adicionales <../"
"accounting/get_started/multi_currency>` también se pueden habilitar y "
"configurar según sea necesario."

