"específicos de la República Dominicana antes de hacer clic en "
":guilabel:`Confirmar`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:273
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Customer`: Select a customer :ref:`contact <localizations/"
"dominican-republic/company-contacts>`."
msgstr ""
