"|EDI| <localizations/dominican-republic/e-invoice-journals>`. Aparecerán dos "
"campos adicionales:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:278
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Document Type`: Select the |ECF| :ref:`type <localizations/"
"dominican-republic/e-invoice-document-types>` to generate (auto-suggested "
"based on customer profile)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tipo de documento`: selecciona el |ECF| :ref:`tipo <localizations/"
"dominican-republic/e-invoice-document-types>` a generar (sugerido "
"automáticamente según el perfil del cliente)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:281
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Income Type`: Select the income classification code that applies "
"to the transaction (e.g., :guilabel:`Operational Income`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tipo de ingreso`: selecciona el código de clasificación de "
"ingresos que corresponda a la transacción (p. ej., :guilabel:`Ingresos "
"operativos`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:285
msgid ""
"Once confirmed, the invoice is assigned an |eNCF| number (format "
"`E310000000001`), where the first two digits (`31`) represent the document "
"type code, and the remaining digits form the sequential number within the "
"authorized range."
msgstr ""
