"The XML file is processed and signed synchronously by Infile and submitted "
"to the |DGII|."
msgstr ""
"El archivo XML es procesado y firmado de forma sincrónica por Infile y "
"enviado a la |DGII|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:308
msgid ""
"The |ECF| PDF and XML files are attached to the customer's email and "
"available in the chatter for download."
msgstr ""
"Los archivos |ECF| PDF y XML se adjuntan al correo electrónico del cliente y "
"están disponibles en el chatter para su descarga."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:310
msgid ""
"To review the status assigned by the |DGII|, click :guilabel:`Request DGII "
