msgid ""
":guilabel:`Regime`: Select whether the company is in the :guilabel:`Regular "
"Regime (without additional messages in the RIDE)` or is qualified as in "
"the :guilabel:`RIMPE Regime`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Régimen`: Seleccione si la empresa está en el :guilabel:`régimen "
"general (sin mensajes adicionales en el RIDE)` o en el :guilabel:`régimen "
"RIMPE`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:203
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Special Taxpayer Number`: If the company is qualified as a "
"special taxpayer, complete this field with the company's corresponding tax "
"contributor number."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Número de contribuyente especial`: Complete este campo con el "
"número de contribuyente correspondiente en caso de que su empresa esté "
"calificada como contribuyente especial."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:205
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Forced to Keep Accounting Books`: Enable this option if needed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Obligado a llevar libros contables`: Seleccione esta opción en "
"caso de que sea necesario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:207
msgid ":guilabel:`Withholding` section:"
msgstr "Sección :guilabel:`Retención`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:209
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Consumables`: Enter the code of the default withholding tax used "
"when purchasing goods."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Consumibles`: Ingrese el código del impuesto de retención "
"predeterminado utilizado al comprar bienes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:210
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Services`: Enter the code of the default withholding tax used "
"when purchasing services."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Servicios`: Ingrese el código del impuesto de retención "
"predeterminado utilizado al comprar servicios."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:211
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Credit Card`: Enter the code of the default withholding tax used "
"when purchasing with credit cards."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tarjeta de crédito`: Ingrese el código de la retención "
"predeterminada utilizada al comprar con tarjetas de crédito."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:213
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Withhold Agent Number`: Enter the company's withholding agent "
"resolution number, if applicable."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Número de agente de retención`: En caso de que sea necesario, "
"ingrese el número de resolución del agente de retención de la empresa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:216
msgid ":guilabel:`SRI Connection` section:"
msgstr "Sección :guilabel:`Conexión SRI`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:218
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Certificate file for SRI`: Select the company's :guilabel:`SRI "
"certificate`. Click :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`SRI Certificates` to "
"upload one, if necessary."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Archivo del certificado para el SRI`: Seleccione "
"el :guilabel:`certificado del SRI` de la empresa. Haga clic en :icon:`oi-"
"arrow-right` :guilabel:`Certificados del SRI` para subir uno en caso de que "
"sea necesario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:220
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Use production servers`: Enable this option if electronic "
"documents are used in the production environment; leave it disabled if the "
"testing environment is used instead."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Usar servidores de producción`: Habilite esta opción si utiliza "
"documentos electrónicos en el entorno de producción. No la seleccione si "
"utiliza el entorno de pruebas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:223
msgid ":guilabel:`Withholding accounts` section:"
msgstr "Sección :guilabel:`Cuentas de retención`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:225
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sales Tax Base Account`: Enter the company's sales tax base "
"account."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cuenta de base del impuesto sobre las ventas`: Ingrese la cuenta "
"de base del impuesto sobre las ventas de la empresa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:226
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Purchase Tax Base Account`: Enter the company's sales tax "
"purchase account."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cuenta de base del impuesto sobre las compras`: Ingrese la cuenta "
"de base del impuesto sobre las compras de la empresa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:229
msgid "When using the testing environment, EDI data is sent to test servers."
msgstr ""
"Los datos EDI se envían a los servidores de prueba al utilizar el entorno de "
"prueba."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:232
msgid ""
"The values entered in the :guilabel:`Consumables` and :guilabel:`Services` "
"withholding fields are used as default values for domestic **only when** no "
"withholdings are set up on the *SRI Taxpayer Type*."
msgstr ""
"Los valores ingresados en los campos de retención :guilabel:`Consumibles` "
"y :guilabel:`Servicios` se usan como los valores predeterminados para las "
"operaciones nacionales **solo cuando** no hay retenciones configuradas en el "
"*tipo de contribuyente del SRI*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:235
msgid ""
"The entered :guilabel:`Credit Card` withholding value is always applied when "
"a credit or debit card SRI payment method is used."
msgstr ""
"El valor de retención ingresado en la :guilabel:`tarjeta de crédito` siempre "
"se aplica al usar un método de pago SRI de tarjeta de crédito o débito."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:241
msgid "VAT withholding"
msgstr "Retención de IVA"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:244
msgid ""
"This configuration applies only if the SRI recognizes the company as a "
"withholding agent. If not, skip this step."
msgstr ""
"Esta configuración solo se aplica si el SRI reconoce a la empresa como "
"agente de retención. De lo contrario, omita este paso."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:247
msgid ""
"To configure a VAT withholding, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Taxpayer Type SRI`. Then, configure the :guilabel:`Name` "
"of the taxpayer type, the :guilabel:`Goods VAT Withholding`, and "
"the :guilabel:`Services VAT Withholding`."
msgstr ""
"Para configurar una retención de IVA, vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --"
"> Configuración --> Tipo de contribuyente de SRI`. Configure "
"el :guilabel:`nombre` del tipo de contribuyente, la :guilabel:`retención de "
"IVA en bienes` y la :guilabel:`retención de IVA en servicios`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:252
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Taxpayer Type` is :guilabel:`Rimpe`, configure "
"the :guilabel:`Profit Withhold` percentage."
msgstr ""
"Configure el porcentaje de :guilabel:`retención de ganancias` si "
"el :guilabel:`tipo de contribuyente` es :guilabel:`Rimpe`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:258
msgid "Printer points"
msgstr "Puntos de impresión"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:260
msgid ""
"*Printer points* need to be configured for each type of electronic document "
"used, such as customer invoices, credit notes, and debit notes."
msgstr ""
"Es necesario configurar los *puntos de impresión* para cada tipo de "
"documento electrónico utilizado, como las facturas de clientes, notas de "
"crédito y de débito."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:263
msgid ""
"To configure printer points, navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Journals`. For each electronic document, "
"click :guilabel:`New`, and enter the following information on the journal "
"form:"
msgstr ""
"Para configurar puntos de impresión, vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> "
"Configuración --> Diarios`. Por cada documento electrónico, haga clic "
"en :guilabel:`Nuevo` e ingrese la siguiente información:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:267
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Journal Name`: Enter in this format: `[Emission Entity]-[Emission "
"Point] [Document Type]`, e.g., `001-001 Sales Documents`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Nombre del diario`: Debe de tener el formato `[Entidad de "
"emisión]-[Punto de emisión] [Tipo de documento]`, por ejemplo, `001-001 "
"Documentos de ventas`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:269
msgid ":guilabel:`Type`: Refers to the journal type; select :guilabel:`Sales`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tipo`: Se refiere al tipo de diario. "
"Seleccione :guilabel:`Ventas`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:271
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:563
msgid "Once the :guilabel:`Type` is selected, complete the following fields:"
msgstr ""
"Complete los siguientes campos luego de seleccionar el :guilabel:`tipo`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:273
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:566
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Use Documents?`: Enable this option if legal invoicing (invoices, "
"debit/credit notes) is used, as this is the standard configuration. If not, "
"select the option to record accounting entries unrelated to legal invoicing "
"documents, such as receipts, tax payments, or journal entries."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`¿Usar documentos?`: Seleccione esta opción si utiliza facturación "
"legal (facturas, notas de débito o crédito), ya que es la configuración "
"estándar. De lo contrario, seleccione la opción para registrar los asientos "
"contables que no están relacionados con los documentos de facturación legal, "
"como recibos, pagos de impuestos o asientos contables."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:277
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:316
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:570
msgid ":guilabel:`Emission Entity`: Enter the facility number."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Entidad de emisión`: Proporcione el número del establecimiento."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:278
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:317
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:571
msgid ":guilabel:`Emission Point`: Enter the printer point."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Punto de emisión`: Defina el punto de impresión."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:279
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:318
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:572
msgid ":guilabel:`Emission address`: Enter the address of the facility."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Dirección de emisión`: Proporcione la dirección del "
"establecimiento."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:281
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:320
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Journal Entries` tab, under the :guilabel:`Accounting "
"information` section, fill in the following fields:"
msgstr ""
"Complete los siguientes campos en la sección :guilabel:`Información "
"contable` de la pestaña :guilabel:`Asientos contables`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:284
msgid ":guilabel:`Default Income Account`: Enter the default income account."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cuenta de ingresos predeterminada`: Defina la cuenta de ingresos "
"predeterminada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:285
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Dedicated Credit Note Sequence`: Enable this option if *credit "
"notes* should be generated from this printer point (i.e., the journal)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Secuencia de notas de crédito especializada`: Seleccione esta "
"opción si es necesario generar *notas de crédito* a partir de este punto de "
"impresión (por ejemplo, el diario)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:287
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Dedicated Debit Note Sequence`: Enable this option if *debit "
"notes* should be generated from this printer point (i.e., the journal)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Secuencia de notas de débito especializada`: Seleccione esta "
"opción si es necesario generar *notas de débito* a partir de este punto de "
"impresión (por ejemplo, el diario)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:289
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Short Code`: Enter a unique 5-digit code for the accounting entry "
"sequence (e.g., VT001)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Código corto`: Ingrese un código único de 5 dígitos para la "
"secuencia de asientos contables (por ejemplo, VT001)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:292
msgid ""
"Customer invoices, credit notes, and debit notes must use the same journal "
"as the :guilabel:`Emission Point`, whereas the :guilabel:`Entity Point` "
"should be unique per journal."
msgstr ""
"Las facturas de cliente, notas de crédito y notas de débito deben usar el "
"mismo diario que el :guilabel:`punto de emisión`, mientras que "
"el :guilabel:`punto de entidad` debe ser único por diario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:295
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:327
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:576
msgid ""
"Finally, in the :guilabel:`Advanced Settings` tab, check "
"the :guilabel:`Electronic invoicing` checkbox to enable sending XML/EDI "
"invoices."
msgstr ""
"Por último, en la pestaña :guilabel:`Ajustes avanzados`, seleccione la "
"casilla :guilabel:`Facturación electrónica` para habilitar el envío de "
"facturas en formato XML/EDI."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:299
msgid ":doc:`../accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing`"
msgstr ":doc:`../accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:304
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:224
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:233
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:246
msgid "Withholding"
msgstr "Retenciones"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:306
msgid ""
"To define a *withholding journal*, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Journals`. For each withholding journal, "
"click :guilabel:`New`, and enter the following information:"
msgstr ""
"Vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Diarios` para "
"definir un *diario de retenciones*. Por cada diario de retenciones, haga "
"clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo` e ingrese la siguiente información:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:309
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Journal Name`: Enter this format: `[Emission Entity]-[Emission "
"Point] [Document Type]`, e.g.,`001-001 Withholding`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Nombre del diario`: Debe de tener el formato `[Entidad de "
"emisión]-[Punto de emisión] [Tipo de documento]`, por ejemplo, `001-001 "
"Retenciones`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:311
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Type`: Refers to the journal type. "
"Select :guilabel:`Miscellaneous`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tipo`: Se refiere al tipo de diario. "
"Seleccione :guilabel:`Varios`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:312
msgid ":guilabel:`Withhold Type`: Select :guilabel:`Purchase Withhold`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tipo de retención`: Seleccione :guilabel:`Retención de compra`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:314
msgid ""
"Once the :guilabel:`Type` and :guilabel:`Withhold Type` are selected, "
"complete the following fields:"
msgstr ""
"Complete los siguientes campos luego de seleccionar el :guilabel:`tipo` y "
"el :guilabel:`tipo de retención`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:323
msgid ":guilabel:`Default Account`: Configure the default income account."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cuenta predeterminada`: Configure la cuenta de ingresos "
"predeterminada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:324
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Short Code`: Enter a unique 5-digit code for the accounting entry "
"sequence (e.g., `WT001`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Código corto`: Ingrese un código único de 5 dígitos para la "
"secuencia de asientos contables (por ejemplo, `WT001`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:335
msgid ""
"Ecuadorian companies submit fiscal reports to the SRI, with Odoo supporting "
"two main ones: **reports 103** and **104**."
msgstr ""
"Las empresas de Ecuador envían reportes fiscales al SRI. Odoo es compatible "
"con dos principales, el **reporte 103** y **104**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:338
msgid ""
"To get these reports, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Tax "
"Return`.  Click the :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`Report:` icon and select `103 "
"(EC)` or `104 (EC)`."
msgstr ""
"Para obtener estos reportes, vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> "
"Reportes --> Declaración fiscal`. Haga clic en el icono :icon:`fa-"
"book` :guilabel:`Reporte:` y seleccione `103 (EC)` o `104 (EC)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:344
msgid "Report 103"
msgstr "Reporte 103"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:346
msgid ""
"This report details income tax withholdings in a given period and can be "
"reported monthly or semi-annually. It includes information about base, tax "
"amounts, and tax codes and can be used for SRI reporting."
msgstr ""
"Este reporte explica las retenciones fiscales sobre la renta en un periodo "
"determinado y es posible declararlo de forma mensual o semestral. Incluye "
"información sobre la base, el importe y los códigos de los impuestos. Puede "
"usarlo para declarar ante el SRI."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:353
msgid "Report 104"
msgstr "Reporte 104"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:355
msgid ""
"This report details VAT tax and VAT withholding for a given period and can "
"be generated monthly or semi-annually. It includes information about base, "
"tax amounts, and tax codes and can be used for SRI reporting."
msgstr ""
"Este reporte detalla el IVA y la retención de IVA para un periodo "
"determinado y es posible generarlo de forma mensual o semestral. Incluye "
"información sobre la base, el importe y los códigos de los impuestos. Puede "
"usarlo para declarar ante el SRI."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:362
msgid "ATS report"
msgstr "Reporte ATS"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:364
msgid ""
"To enable downloading the ATS :abbr:`ATS (Anexo Transaccional Simplificado)` "
"report in XML format, :doc:`install </applications/general/apps_modules>` "
"the *ATS Report* (`l10n_ec_reports_ats`) module."
msgstr ""
"Para habilitar la descarga del reporte :abbr:`ATS (Anexo Transaccional "
"Simplificado)` en formato XML, :doc:`instale </applications/general/"
"apps_modules>` el módulo del *Reporte ATS* (`l10n_ec_reports_ats`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:368
msgid ""
"The Ecuadorian *ATS Report* module depends on the previous installation of "
"the *Accounting* app and the *Ecuadorian EDI module*."
msgstr ""
"El módulo de *Reporte ATS* ecuatoriano depende de la instalación previa de "
"la aplicación *Contabilidad* y del *módulo EDI ecuatoriano*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:376
msgid ""
"To issue electronic documents, ensure the company is configured as explained "
"in the :ref:`electronic invoice <localizations/ecuador/company-contact>` "
"section. In the :abbr:`ATS (Anexo Transaccional Simplificado)`, every "
"document generated in Odoo, such as :ref:`invoices <localizations/ecuador/"
"customer-invoice>`, :ref:`vendor bills <localizations/ecuador/vendor-"
"bill>`, :ref:`sales <localizations/ecuador/customer-withholdings>` "
"and :ref:`purchases withholdings <localizations/ecuador/purchase-"
"withholding>`, :ref:`credit notes <localizations/ecuador/credit-notes>`, "
"and :ref:`debit notes <localizations/ecuador/debit-notes>`, is included."
msgstr ""
"Para emitir documentos electrónicos, la empresa debe estar configurada como "
"se explicó en la sección :ref:`facturación electrónica <localizations/"
"ecuador/company-contact>`. En el :abbr:`ATS (Anexo Transaccional "
"Simplificado)` se incluyen todos los documentos generados en Odoo, "
"como :ref:`facturas <localizations/ecuador/customer-"
"invoice>`, :ref:`facturas de proveedores <localizations/ecuador/vendor-"
"bill>`, retenciones de :ref:`ventas <localizations/ecuador/customer-"
"withholdings>` y :ref:`compras <localizations/ecuador/purchase-"
"withholding>`, :ref:`notas de crédito <localizations/ecuador/credit-notes>` "
"y :ref:`notas de débito <localizations/ecuador/debit-notes>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:390
msgid ""
"When generating a :ref:`vendor bill <localizations/ecuador/vendor-bill>`, "
"register the authorization number from the vendor's invoice. To do so, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Vendors --> Bills` and select the bill. "
"Then, enter the number from the vendor's invoice in "
"the :guilabel:`Authorization Number` field."
msgstr ""
"Al generar una :ref:`factura de proveedor <localizations/ecuador/vendor-"
"bill>`, es necesario que registre el número de autorización de la factura "
"del proveedor. Para ello, vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> "
"Proveedores --> Facturas`, seleccione la factura e ingrese el número de la "
"factura del proveedor en el campo :guilabel:`Número de autorización`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:398
msgid "Credit and debit notes"
msgstr "Notas de crédito y débito"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:400
msgid ""
"When creating a :ref:`credit <localizations/ecuador/credit-notes>` "
"or :ref:`debit <localizations/ecuador/debit-notes>` note manually or through "
"an import, link it to the sales invoice it modifies."
msgstr ""
"Al crear una nota de :ref:`crédito <localizations/ecuador/credit-notes>` "
"o :ref:`débito <localizations/ecuador/debit-notes>` de forma manual o "
"mediante una importación, vincúlela a la factura de venta que está "
"modificando."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:405
msgid ""
"Some information is required to the documents before downloading "
"the :abbr:`ATS (Anexo Transaccional Simplificado)` file. For example, add "
"the *Authorization Number* and the *SRI Payment Method* to documents when "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"Es necesario agregar cierta información a los documentos antes de descargar "
"el archivo del :abbr:`ATS (Anexo Transaccional Simplificado)`. Por ejemplo, "
"agregue el *número de autorización* y el *método de pago SRI* a los "
"documentos cuando sea necesario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:412
msgid "XML generation"
msgstr "Generar archivos XML"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:414
msgid ""
"To generate the :abbr:`ATS (Anexo Transaccional Simplificado)` report, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Tax Return`. Choose a period "
"for the desired :abbr:`ATS (Anexo Transaccional Simplificado)` report, then "
"click :guilabel:`ATS`. Then, upload the downloaded XML file to *DIMM "
"Formularios*."
msgstr ""
"Vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Reportes --> Declaración fiscal` "
"para generar el reporte :abbr:`ATS (Anexo Transaccional Simplificado)`. "
"Seleccione el periodo para el reporte :abbr:`ATS (Anexo Transaccional "
"Simplificado)` y luego haz clic en :guilabel:`ATS`. Después, suba el archivo "
"XML descargado a *DIMM Formularios*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:420
msgid ""
"When downloading the :abbr:`ATS (Anexo Transaccional Simplificado)` report, "
"Odoo generates a warning pop-up alerting the user if a document(s) has "
"missing or incorrect data. Nevertheless, the XML file can still be "
"downloaded."
msgstr ""
"Al descargar el reporte :abbr:`ATS (Anexo Transaccional Simplificado)`, Odoo "
"genera una advertencia emergente que le avisa al usuario si a uno o más "
"documentos les falta información o si es incorrecta. Aún así, el usuario "
"podrá descargar el archivo XML."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:432
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uruguay.rst:293
msgid "Sales documents"
msgstr "Documentos de ventas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:437
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:415
msgid "Customer invoice"
msgstr "Factura de cliente"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:439
msgid ""
"Customer invoices, electronic documents :doc:`created from sales orders or "
"manually <../accounting/customer_invoices/overview>`, must contain the "
"following data and, once validated, are sent to the SRI:"
msgstr ""
"Las facturas de clientes o documentos electrónicos :doc:`que se creen desde "
"órdenes de ventas o de forma manual <../accounting/customer_invoices/"
"overview>` deben incluir los datos a continuación. Una vez que se validen, "
"se envían al SRI:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:443
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Journal`: Select the option matching the customer invoice's "
"printer point."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Diario`: Seleccione la opción que coincida con el punto de "
"impresión de la factura del cliente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:444
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Document Type`: Type the document type in this format: `(01) "
"Invoice`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tipo de documento`: Escriba el tipo de documento con el formato "
"`(01) Factura`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:445
msgid ":guilabel:`Payment Method (SRI)`: Select how the invoice will be paid."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Método de pago (SRI)`: Seleccione cómo se pagará la factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:450
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uruguay.rst:314
msgid "Customer credit note"
msgstr "Nota de crédito del cliente"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:452
msgid ""
":doc:`Customer credit notes <../accounting/customer_invoices/credit_notes>` "
"are electronic documents sent to the SRI once validated. :ref:`Credit notes "
"<accounting/credit_notes/issue-credit-note>` can only be registered from a "
"validated (posted) invoice."
msgstr ""
"Las :doc:`notas de crédito del cliente <../accounting/customer_invoices/"
"credit_notes>` son documentos electrónicos que se envían al SRI después de "
"su validación. Es necesario tener una factura validada (registrada) para "
"poder registrar una :ref:`nota de crédito <accounting/credit_notes/issue-"
"credit-note>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:457
msgid ""
"Keep the :guilabel:`Document Type` on :guilabel:`(04) Credit Note` in "
"the :guilabel:`Credit note` window."
msgstr ""
"En la ventana :guilabel:`Nota de crédito` mantenga el :guilabel:`tipo de "
"documento` como :guilabel:`(04) Nota de crédito`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:460
msgid ""
"Filling out a credit note follows the same process as completing "
"an :ref:`invoice <accounting/invoice/creation>`."
msgstr ""
"Llenar la información de una nota de crédito sigue el mismo proceso que "
"llenar la información de la :ref:`factura <accounting/invoice/creation>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:464
msgid ""
"When creating the first credit note, select :guilabel:`Reverse` and assign "
"the first credit note number or, by default, Odoo assigns `NotCr "
"001-001-000000001` as the first credit note number."
msgstr ""
"Al crear la primera nota de crédito, seleccione :guilabel:`Revertir` y "
"asigne el número de la primera nota de crédito, de lo contrario, Odoo "
"asignará `NotCr 001-001-000000001` como el primer número de nota de crédito "
"de forma predeterminada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:470
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uruguay.rst:328
msgid "Customer debit note"
msgstr "Notas de débito del cliente"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:472
msgid ""
":ref:`Customer debit notes <accounting/credit_notes/issue-debit-note>` are "
"electronic documents sent to the SRI once validated. They can only be "
"registered from a validated (posted) invoice."
msgstr ""
"Las :ref:`notas de crédito del cliente <accounting/credit_notes/issue-debit-"
"note>` son documentos electrónicos que se envían al SRI después de su "
"validación. Se requiere una factura validada (registrada) para poder "
"registrarlas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:475
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Use Specific Journal` of the :guilabel:`Create Debit Note` "
"window, select the printer point for the credit note or leave it empty to "
"use the same journal as the original invoice."
msgstr ""
"En el campo :guilabel:`Utilizar un diario específico` de la "
"ventana :guilabel:`Crear nota de débito`, seleccione el punto de impresión "
"para la nota de crédito o déjelo en blanco para usar el mismo diario que la "
"factura original."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:482
msgid "Customer withholding"
msgstr "Retención de cliente"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:484
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Customer withholdings` are non-electronic documents issued by the "
"client to apply a withholding to a sale. They can only be registered from a "
"validated (posted) invoice."
msgstr ""
"La :guilabel:`retención del cliente` es un documento no electrónico que "
"emite el cliente para aplicar una retención a una venta. Para poder "
"registrarlo se requiere tener una factura validada (registrada)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:487
msgid ""
"On the invoice, click :guilabel:`Add Withhold` and complete the following "
"information in the :guilabel:`Customer withholding` window:"
msgstr ""
"En la factura, haga clic en :guilabel:`Agregar retención` y complete la "
"información a continuación en la ventana :guilabel:`Retención del cliente`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:490
msgid ":guilabel:`Document Number`: Enter the withholding number."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Número de documento`: Escriba el número de la retención."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:491
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Withhold Lines`: Select the taxes that the customer is "
"withholding."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Líneas de retención`: Seleccione los impuestos que el cliente "
"está reteniendo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:493
msgid ""
"Before validating the withholding, review that the amounts for each tax are "
"the same as the original document."
msgstr ""
"Antes de validar la retención, verifique que los importes para cada impuesto "
"sean los mismos que en el documento original."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:499
msgid "Purchase documents"
msgstr "Documentos de compra"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:504
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania.rst:134
msgid "Vendor bill"
msgstr "Factura de proveedor"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:506
msgid ""
":doc:`Vendor bills <../accounting/vendor_bills>`, non-electronic documents "
"created from purchase orders or manually, require a specific :ref:`vendor "
"bill journal <localizations/ecuador/vendor-bills-journal>`."
msgstr ""
"Las :doc:`facturas de proveedor <../accounting/vendor_bills>` son los "
"documentos no electrónicos que se crean mediante órdenes de compra o de "
"forma manual y requieren un :ref:`diario de facturas de proveedor "
"<localizations/ecuador/vendor-bills-journal>` específico."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:513
msgid "Vendor bills journal"
msgstr "Diario de facturas de proveedor"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:515
msgid "Use the following configuration to set up the vendor bills journal:"
msgstr ""
"Use la configuración a continuación para configurar el diario de facturas de "
"proveedor:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:517
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:649
msgid "Select :guilabel:`Purchase` as the :guilabel:`Type`."
msgstr "Seleccione :guilabel:`Compras` como :guilabel:`tipo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:518
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:650
msgid "**Do not** tick the :guilabel:`Purchase Liquidations` checkbox."
msgstr "**No** marque la casilla :guilabel:`Liquidaciones de compra`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:519
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:651
msgid "Add a :guilabel:`Default Expense Account`."
msgstr "Agregue una :guilabel:`Cuenta de gastos predeterminada`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:521
msgid ""
"To configure a vendor bill, make sure also to complete the following Ecuador-"
"specific fields:"
msgstr ""
"Para configurar una factura de proveedor, también asegúrese de completar los "
"siguientes campos específicos de Ecuador:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:523
msgid ":guilabel:`Document Type`: Enter this document type: `(01) Invoice`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tipo de documento`: Elija el tipo de documento `(01) Factura`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:524
msgid ":guilabel:`Document number`: Enter the document number."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Número de documento`: Escriba el número de documento."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:525
msgid ":guilabel:`Payment Method (SRI)`: Select how to pay the vendor bill."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Método de pago (SRI)`: Seleccione cómo pagar la factura de "
"proveedor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:528
msgid ""
"When creating the purchase withholding, verify that the bases (base amounts) "
"are correct. If the amount of the tax in the :guilabel:`Vendor bill` needs "
"to be edited, click :guilabel:`Edit`. Or, from the :guilabel:`Journal Items` "
"tab, click :guilabel:`Edit` and set the adjustment as desired."
msgstr ""
"Al crear la retención de compra, verifique que las bases (importes base) "
"sean correctas. Si necesita editar el importe del impuesto en "
"la :guilabel:`factura del proveedor`, haga clic en :guilabel:`Editar`, o "
"haga clic en :guilabel:`Editar` en la pestaña :guilabel:`Apuntes contables` "
"y haga el ajuste necesario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:535
msgid "Purchase liquidation"
msgstr "Liquidación de compra"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:537
msgid ""
"*Purchase liquidations* are electronic documents sent to the SRI once "
"they're validated. Companies issue them when they make a purchase, but the "
"vendor does not provide an invoice due to one or more of the following "
"reasons:"
msgstr ""
"Las *liquidaciones de compras* son documentos electrónicos que se envían al "
"SRI después de validarse. Las empresas emiten este tipo de documentos cuando "
"realizan una compra y los proveedores no les emiten una factura por alguno "
"de los siguientes motivos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:541
msgid "Non-residents of Ecuador provided services."
msgstr "Personas no residentes de Ecuador brindaron los servicios."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:542
msgid ""
"Foreign companies provided services without residency or facility in Ecuador."
msgstr ""
"Empresas extranjeras sin residencia ni establecimiento en Ecuador "
"proporcionaron los servicios."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:543
msgid ""
"Purchase of goods or services from natural persons not registered with a "
"RUC, who cannot issue sales receipts or customer invoices."
msgstr ""
"Compra de bienes o servicios a personas naturales que no están registradas "
"en el RUC, que no pueden emitir comprobantes de venta ni facturas de cliente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:545
msgid ""
"Reimbursement for purchasing goods or services must be given to employees in "
"a dependency relationship (full-time employee)."
msgstr ""
"Es necesario reembolsar a los empleados por la compra de bienes o servicios "
"debido a que se encuentran en una relación de dependencia (son empleados de "
"tiempo completo)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:547
msgid ""
"Members of collegiate bodies have provided services in the exercise of their "
"function."
msgstr ""
"Los miembros de los órganos colegiados proporcionaron sus servicios con el "
"propósito de ejercer sus funciones."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:549
msgid ""
"In these cases, a :ref:`purchase liquidation journal <localizations/ecuador/"
"purchase-liquidation-journal>` must be created."
msgstr ""
"En estos casos, se debe crear un :ref:`diario de liquidación de compras "
"<localizations/ecuador/purchase-liquidation-journal>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:555
msgid "Create a purchase liquidation journal"
msgstr "Crear un diario de liquidación de compra"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:557
msgid ""
"To create a *purchase liquidations* journal, enter the following information:"
msgstr ""
"Para crear un diario de *liquidación de compras*, ingrese la información a "
"continuación:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:559
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Journal Name`: Enter this format: `[Emission Entity]-[Emission "
"Point] [Document Type]`, e.g., `001-001 Purchase Liquidations`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Nombre del diario`: Debe de tener el formato `[Entidad de "
"emisión]-[Punto de emisión] [Tipo de documento]`, por ejemplo, `001-001 "
"Liquidaciones`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:561
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Type`: Refers to the journal type. Select :guilabel:`Purchase`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tipo`: Se refiere al tipo de diario. "
"Seleccione :guilabel:`Compras`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:565
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Purchase Liquidations`: Tick this checkbox to enable purchase "
"liquidations."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Liquidaciones de compra`: Seleccione esta casilla para habilitar "
"las liquidaciones de compra."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:573
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Short Code`: Enter a unique 5-digit code for the accounting entry "
"sequence (e.g., `PT001`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Código corto`: Ingrese un código único de 5 dígitos para la "
"secuencia de asientos contables (por ejemplo, `PT001`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:582
msgid "Create a purchase liquidation"
msgstr "Crear una liquidación de compra"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:584
msgid ""
"Purchase liquidations, created from *purchase orders* or manually from "
"*vendor bills*, must contain the following data:"
msgstr ""
"Las liquidaciones de venta que se creen de *órdenes de compra* o de forma "
"manual mediante *facturas de proveedor* deben contener la información a "
"continuación:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:588
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Journal`: Select the :guilabel:`Purchase Liquidation` journal "
"with the correct printer point."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Diario`: Seleccione el diario de :guilabel:`liquidación de "
"compra` con el punto de impresión correcto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:590
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Document Type`: Enter this document type: `(03) Purchase "
"Liquidation`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tipo de documento`: Elija el tipo de documento `(03) Liquidación "
"de compra`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:591
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Document number`: Enter the document number (sequence). This must "
"only be entered once, and the sequence will automatically be assigned to the "
"subsequent documents."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Número de documento`: Escriba el número de documento (secuencia). "
"Solo deberá hacerlo una vez, después la secuencia se asignará a los "
"siguientes documentos de forma automática."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:593
msgid ":guilabel:`Payment Method (SRI)`: Select how to pay the invoice."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Método de pago (SRI)`: Seleccione cómo pagar la factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:594
msgid ":guilabel:`Products`: Specify the product with the correct taxes."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Productos`: Especifique el producto con los impuestos correctos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:596
msgid "Then, validate the :guilabel:`Purchase Liquidation`."
msgstr "Después, valide la :guilabel:`liquidación de compra`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:601
msgid "Purchase withholding"
msgstr "Retención de compra"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:603
msgid ""
"*Purchase withholdings* are electronic documents sent to the SRI once "
"they're validated. They can only be registered from a validated (posted) "
"invoice."
msgstr ""
"Las *retenciones de compra* son documentos electrónicos que se envían al SRI "
"después de su validación. Solo se pueden registrar a partir de una factura "
"validada (registrada)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:606
msgid ""
"On the invoice, click :guilabel:`Add Withhold` and complete the following "
"fields in the :guilabel:`Withhold` window:"
msgstr ""
"En la factura, haga clic en :guilabel:`Agregar retención` y complete los "
"campos a continuación en la ventana :guilabel:`Retención`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:609
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Document number`: Enter the document number (sequence). This must "
"only be entered once, and the sequence will automatically be assigned for "
"the next documents."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Número de documento`: Escriba el número de documento (secuencia). "
"Solo deberá hacerlo una vez, después la secuencia se asignará a los próximos "
"documentos de forma automática."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:611
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Withhold lines`: The taxes appear automatically according to the "
"configuration of products and vendors. Review if the taxes and tax support "
"are correct. If not, edit and select the correct taxes and tax support."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Líneas de retención`: Los impuestos aparecen de forma automática "
"según la configuración de los productos y proveedores. Revise si los "
"impuestos y el soporte tributario son correctos, o edítelos y seleccione los "
"adecuados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:615
msgid "Then, validate the :guilabel:`Withholding`."
msgstr "Después, valide la :guilabel:`retención`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:618
msgid ""
"Tax support types must be configured on the :guilabel:`Vendor Bill`. To do "
"so, go to the tax applied on the :guilabel:`Vendor Bill` and change "
"the :guilabel:`Tax Support` there."
msgstr ""
"Es necesario configurar los tipos de soporte tributario en "
"la :guilabel:`factura del proveedor`. Para hacerlo, vaya al impuesto "
"aplicado en la :guilabel:`factura del proveedor` y modifique "
"el :guilabel:`soporte tributario`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:621
msgid ""
"A withholding tax can be divided into two or more lines, depending on "
"whether two or more withholding percentages apply."
msgstr ""
"Una retención de impuestos puede dividirse en dos o más líneas, dependiendo "
"de si se aplican dos o más porcentajes de retención."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:625
msgid ""
"Odoo suggests a VAT withholding of 30% with tax support 01. VAT withholding "
"of 70% can be added to a new line with the same tax support. Odoo allows it "
"if the base total matches the :guilabel:`Vendor Bill`'s total."
msgstr ""
"Odoo sugiere una retención de IVA del 30% con el soporte tributario 01. Es "
"posible agregar una retención de IVA del 70% en una nueva línea con el mismo "
"soporte tributario. Odoo le permitirá hacerlo si el total de la base "
"coincide con el total de la :guilabel:`factura del proveedor`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:632
msgid "Expense reimbursement"
msgstr "Reembolso de gastos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:634
msgid "Expense reimbursements apply to the following cases:"
msgstr "Los reembolsos de gastos se aplican a los siguientes casos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:636
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Individual`: reimbursement to an employee for miscellaneous "
"expenses (e.g., purchase liquidations)"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Persona natural`: Reembolso a un empleado por gastos misceláneos "
"(por ejemplo, las liquidaciones de compras)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:638
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Legal Entity`: reimbursement for incurred expenses, such as "
"representation expenses (e.g., hiring a lawyer)"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Personas jurídicas`: Reembolso por los gastos efectuados, como "
"gastos de representación (por ejemplo, la contratación de un abogado)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:641
