msgid "100%"
msgstr "100 %"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:834
msgid ""
"The journal :guilabel:`type` would be :guilabel:`bank`, because the bank's "
"move percentage (75%) exceeds the threshold (70%)."
msgstr ""
"El :guilabel:`tipo` de diario sería :guilabel:`banco`, ya que el porcentaje "
"de movimientos bancarios (75%) excede el límite (70%)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:842
msgid ""
"Each contact keeps its :guilabel:`Reference` from the :guilabel:`CompAuxNum` "
"field."
msgstr ""
"Cada contacto conserva su :guilabel:`referencia` del "
"campo :guilabel:`CompAuxNum`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:845
msgid ""
"These fields are searchable based on previous FEC imports for fiscal/audit "
"purposes."
msgstr ""
"Es posible buscar en estos campos en base a importaciones anteriores de los "
"FEC para fines fiscales y de auditoría."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:848
msgid ""
"Similar and potential duplicate contacts can be merged using the Data "
"Cleaning App."
msgstr ""
"La aplicación Limpieza de datos permite fusionar contactos similares que "
"podrían estar duplicados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:855
msgid ""
"Entries are posted and reconciled immediately upon submission, with "
"the :guilabel:`EcritureLet` field used to match the entries."
msgstr ""
"Los asientos se registran y se concilian luego de su envío. El "
"campo :guilabel:`EcritureLet` se utiliza para su conciliación."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:858
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`EcritureNum` field represents the name of the moves, but it "
"may sometimes be left empty. In such cases, the :guilabel:`PieceRef` field "
"is used instead."
msgstr ""
"El campo :guilabel:`EcritureNum` representa el nombre de los movimientos, "
"pero a veces puede estar vacío. Cuando eso ocurre, el "
"campo :guilabel:`PieceRef` es el que se utiliza."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:864
msgid "Rounding issues"
msgstr "Problemas de redondeo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:866
msgid ""
"A rounding tolerance is applied based on currency precision for debit and "
"credit amounts (i.e., 0.01 for EUR). If the difference falls under this "
"tolerance, a new line is added to the move, called :guilabel:`Import "
"rounding difference`, targeting the following accounts:"
msgstr ""
"La tolerancia de redondeo se aplica para los importes de débito y crédito "
"(por ejemplo, 0.01 para EUR) según la precisión monetaria. Si la diferencia "
"está por debajo de esta tolerancia, entonces se agrega una nueva línea al "
"movimiento llamada :guilabel:`Diferencia de redondeo del importe` a las "
"siguientes cuentas:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:870
msgid "`658000` Charges diverses de gestion courante, for added debits"
msgstr ""
"`658000` \"Charges diverses de gestion courante\", para débitos agregados"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:871
msgid "`758000` Produits divers de gestion courante, for added credits"
msgstr ""
"`758000` \"Produits divers de gestion courante\", para créditos agregados"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:876
msgid "Missing move name"
msgstr "Nombre de movimiento faltante"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:878
msgid ""
"If the the :guilabel:`EcritureNum` field is not filled out "
"and :guilabel:`PieceRef` field is not suited to determine the move name (it "
"may be used as an accounting move line reference), it becomes impossible to "
"identify which lines should be grouped into a single move, and effectively "
"preventing the creation of balanced moves."
msgstr ""
"Si el campo :guilabel:`EcritureNum` está vacío y el "
"campo :guilabel:`PieceRef` no puede determinar el nombre del asiento "
"contable (puede usarse como la referencia de la línea del asiento), no será "
"posible identificar qué líneas se deben agrupar en un solo movimiento, lo "
"que impide la correcta creación de movimientos balanceados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:883
msgid ""
"In such cases, a final attempt is made to group all lines by the same "
"journal and date (:guilabel:`JournalLib`, :guilabel:`EcritureDate`). If this "
"grouping generates balanced moves (sum(credit) - sum(debit) = 0), then each "
"different combination of journal and date creates a new move."
msgstr ""
"En esos casos ocurre el último intento de agrupar todas las líneas por el "
"mismo diario y fecha (:guilabel:`JournalLib`, :guilabel:`EcritureDate`). Si "
"este agrupamiento genera movimientos balanceados (sum(credit) - sum(debit) = "
"0), entonces cada combinación distinta de diario y fecha genera un nuevo "
"movimiento."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:889
msgid ""
"`ACH` + `2021/05/01` --> new move on journal `ACH` with name `20210501`."
msgstr ""
"`ACH` + `2021/05/01` --> nuevo movimiento en el diario `ACH` con el nombre "
"`20210501`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:891
msgid ""
"If this attempt fails, an error message is displayed, listing all the move "
"lines that are considered unbalanced."
msgstr ""
"Aparecerá un mensaje de error si ocurre un error durante este intento e "
"incluirá todas las líneas de los movimientos que se consideran que no están "
"balanceados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:897
msgid "Contact information"
msgstr "Información de contacto"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:899
msgid ""
"If a line includes contact information, it is copied to the accounting move "
"itself, provided the targeted journal is of type :guilabel:`payable` "
"or :guilabel:`receivable`."
msgstr ""
"Si una línea incluye la información del contacto, esta se copia al "
"movimiento contable correspondiente, siempre que el diario de destino sea de "
"tipo :guilabel:`por pagar` o :guilabel:`por cobrar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:905
msgid "FEC Export"
msgstr "Exportar FEC"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:907
msgid ""
"To download the FEC, in the **Accounting** app, go "
"to :menuselection:`Reporting --> General Ledger`. Click the :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` icon and select :guilabel:`FEC`. In "
"the :guilabel:`FEC File Generation` window, fill in the following fields:"
msgstr ""
