#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1118
msgid "Odoo certification"
msgstr "Certificación de Odoo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1120
msgid ""
"The tax administration requires all companies to provide a certificate of "
"conformity confirming that their software complies with anti-fraud "
"legislation. In case of non-compliance, a €7,500 fine may be imposed."
msgstr ""
"La administración tributaria exige que todas las empresas presenten un "
"certificado de conformidad que confirme que su software cumple con la "
"legislación antifraude. En caso de incumplimiento, las empresas pueden "
"recibir una multa de 7,500 euros."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1125
msgid ""
"This `certificate <https://www.odoo.com/my/contract/french-certification/>`_ "
"is granted by Odoo SA to Odoo Enterprise users with a subscription number."
msgstr ""
"Odoo SA otorga este `certificado <https://www.odoo.com/my/contract/french-"
"certification/>`_ a los usuarios de Odoo Enterprise que tienen un número de "
"suscripción."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1128
msgid "To get the certification, follow these steps:"
msgstr "Siga estos pasos para obtener la certificación:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1130
msgid ""
":doc:`Install </applications/general/apps_modules>` the :guilabel:`France - "
"VAT Anti-Fraud Certification for Point of Sale (CGI 286 I-3 bis)` "
