msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Número`: Es obligatorio para confirmar una factura electrónica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:201
msgid ""
"To automatically include a specific phrase in the XML and PDF of every "
"electronic invoice for a contact, select it in :guilabel:`Phrases` field in "
"the :guilabel:`Sales & purchase` tab of the contact form."
msgstr ""
"Para incluir una frase específica en el XML o PDF de todas las facturas "
"electrónicas de un contacto, selecciónala en el campo :guilabel:`Frases` en "
"la pestaña :guilabel:`Ventas y compras` del formulario de contacto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:208
msgid ""
"As part of the Guatemala localization module, taxes are automatically "
"created with their configuration and related financial accounts."
msgstr ""
"Como parte del módulo de localización de Guatemala, los impuestos se crean "
"de forma automática con su configuración y cuentas financieras relacionadas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:214
msgid ""
"Once the database has been configured successfully, electronic documents can "
"be created and sent."
msgstr ""
"Cuando termines de configurar bien la base de datos, podrás crear y enviar "
"documentos electrónicos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:216
msgid ""
"Once :doc:`customer invoices <../accounting/customer_invoices>` are "
"validated, they can be sent electronically to |SAT| via Infile, provided the "
"following fields are completed:"
msgstr ""
"Cuando se validen las :doc:`facturas de los clientes <../accounting/"
"customer_invoices>`, se pueden enviar de forma electrónica a la SAT a través "
"de Infile, cuando se llenen los próximos campos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:219
msgid ":guilabel:`Customer`: Type the customer's information."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Cliente`: Escribe la información del cliente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:220
msgid ""
":guilabel:`GT Document Type`: Select the type of document you want to "
"create, i.e., :guilabel:`FACT - Factura Electrónica` or :guilabel:`FCAM - "
"Factura Cambiara`. By default, the document type is set to :guilabel:`FACT`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tipo de documento GT`: Selecciona el tipo de documento que "
"quieres crear, como :guilabel:`FACT - Factura Electrónica` o :guilabel:`FCAM "
"- Factura Cambiara`. Por defecto, el tipo de documento es :guilabel:`FACT`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:223
msgid ":guilabel:`Due date`: To compute if the invoice is due now or later."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Fecha de vencimiento`: Para calcular si la factura vence ahora o "
"después."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:224
msgid ":guilabel:`Journal`: Select the sales journal."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Diario`: Selecciona el diario de ventas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:225
msgid ":guilabel:`Products`: Specify the product(s) with the correct taxes."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Productos`: Especifica los productos con los impuestos correctos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:230
msgid ""
"If you need to add a specific phrase based on the transaction, go to "
"the :guilabel:`Other Info` tab and add the corresponding phrase "
"in :guilabel:`GT Phrases`. These phrases are used in the XML and PDF "
"documents."
msgstr ""
"Si necesitas agregar una frase específica según la transacción, ve a la "
"pestaña :guilabel:`Otra información` y agrega la frase correspondiente "
"en :guilabel:`Frases GT`. Estas frases se usan en los documentos XML y PDF."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:235
msgid ""
"If you need to add an addendum to the invoice, you can do so in "
"the :guilabel:`Terms and Conditions` field. The addendum will be included in "
"the XML document and can be used to provide additional information or notes "
"related to the invoice."
msgstr ""
"Si necesitas agregar un adenda a la factura, lo puedes hacer en el "
"campo :guilabel:`Términos y condiciones`. La addenda se incluirá en el "
"documento XML y se puede usar para brindar información adicional o notas "
"relacionadas a la factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:239
msgid ""
"After the invoice confirmation, click :guilabel:`Send`. In the wizard that "
"appears, make sure to enable the :guilabel:`Send to SAT` and :guilabel:`by "
"Email` checkboxes to send the XML to the |SAT| through Infile's web service "
"and the validated invoice to the client's email, and click :guilabel:`Send`. "
"Then, the following occurs:"
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Enviar` después de confirmar la factura. Aparecerá un "
"asistente en el que deberás habilitar las opciones :guilabel:`Enviar a la "
"SAT` y :guilabel:`Por correo` para enviar el XML a la |SAT| a través del "
"servicio web de Infile y la factura validada al correo del cliente. Después, "
"haz clic en :guilabel:`Enviar` y ocurrirá lo siguiente:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:245
msgid "The |UUID| is generated."
msgstr "Se genera el UUID."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:246
msgid "The XML is processed synchronously by Infile."
msgstr "Infile procesa el XML de manera sincrónica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:248
msgid ""
"If accepted, the file is displayed in the chatter, and the email to the "
"client with the corresponding :file:`pdf` and :file:`xml` file is sent."
msgstr ""
"Si se acepta, el archivo se muestra en el chatter y el correo se le envía al "
"cliente con el :file:`pdf` y :file:`xml` correspondientes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:250
msgid ""
"If the file contains errors, a warning message displays the reason(s) and "
"the email is not sent."
msgstr ""
"Si el archivo contiene errores, aparecerá un mensaje de advertencia con los "
"motivos y el correo tampoco se enviará."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:255
msgid "The :guilabel:`SAT` tab then displays the following:"
msgstr "Entonces, en la pestaña :guilabel:`SAT` verás:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:257
msgid ":guilabel:`Datetime`: Timestamp recorded of the XML creation."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Fecha y hora`: Etiqueta de tiempo que registra cuándo se creó el "
"XML."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:258
msgid ""
":guilabel:`GT Status`: Status result obtained in the |SAT| response. If the "
"file contains errors, a warning message displays the reason(s) and the email "
"is not sent."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Estado GT`: El estado que se obtuvo en la respuesta de la SAT. Si "
"el archivo contiene errores, aparecerá un mensaje de advertencia con el o "
"los motivos por los que no se envió el correo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:260
msgid ""
":guilabel:`UUID`: The unique identifier assigned by the |SAT| to the "
"electronic document."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`UUID`: El identificador único que la SAT al documento electrónico."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:261
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Download Certificate`: To download the sent XML file, even if the "
"|SAT| result was rejected."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Descarga el certificado`: Para descargar el archivo XML enviado, "
"incluso si lo rechazó la SAT."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:264
msgid "EDI document record available in SAT tab."
msgstr "Registro de documento EDI disponible en la pestaña SAT."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:272
msgid ""
"To send a debit or credit note to Infile, first create the :ref:`debit "
"<accounting/credit_notes/issue-debit-note>` or :ref:`credit note <accounting/"
"credit_notes/issue-credit-note>`."
msgstr ""
"Para enviar una nota de débito o crédito a Infile, primero crea "
"la :ref:`nota de débito <accounting/credit_notes/issue-debit-note>` "
"o :ref:`crédito <accounting/credit_notes/issue-credit-note>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:276
msgid ""
"Then, in the :guilabel:`Send` window, click :guilabel:`Send to SAT "
"(Guatemalan EDI)` to submit it for real-time validation. Upon successful "
"validation, the QR code from Infile is embedded in the debit or credit note "
"PDF."
msgstr ""
"Después, en la ventana :guilabel:`Enviar`, haz clic en :guilabel:`Enviar a "
"la SAT (EDI de Guatemala)` para enviarla para una validación en tiempo real. "
"Al obtener la validación, el código QR de Infile se incrusta en el PDF de la "
"nota de débito o crédito."

