#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:40
msgid ""
"The Hungarian localization package offers key features and integration "
"capabilities that ensure compliance with local fiscal and accounting "
"regulations. The package includes tools for managing taxes, fiscal "
"positions, reporting, and a predefined chart of accounts tailored to "
"Hungarian authorities' standards."
msgstr ""
"El paquete de localización húngara cuenta con funciones clave y capacidades "
"de integración que garantizan el cumplimiento de las leyes fiscales y "
"contables locales. El paquete incluye herramientas para gestionar los "
"impuestos, posiciones fiscales, reportes y un plan de cuentas predefinido "
"adaptado a las normas de las autoridades húngaras."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:45
msgid ""
":doc:`../accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts`: a predefined structure "
"tailored to Hungarian accounting standards."
msgstr ""
":doc:`../accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts`: Una estructura "
"predefinida adaptada a las normas contables húngaras."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:47
msgid ""
":ref:`localizations/hungary/taxes`: pre-configured tax rates, including "
"standard VAT, compensatory surcharge, zero-rated, and exempt options."
msgstr ""
":ref:`localizations/hungary/taxes`: Tasas de impuestos preconfiguradas, que "
"incluyen IVA estándar, recargo compensatorio, opciones con tasa cero y "
"exentas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:49
msgid ""
":doc:`../accounting/taxes/fiscal_positions`: automated tax adjustments based "
"on customer or supplier registration status."
msgstr ""
":doc:`../accounting/taxes/fiscal_positions`: Ajustes automáticos de "
"impuestos según el estado de registro del cliente o proveedor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:51
msgid ""
":ref:`localizations/hungary/tax-reporting`: detailed overview of your net "
"tax liability."
msgstr ""
":ref:`localizations/hungary/tax-reporting`: Una vista detallada de tu "
"obligación tributaria neta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:52
msgid ""
":ref:`e-Invoicing <localizations/hungary/e-invoicing>`: integration for "
"electronic invoicing using NAV 3.0 (Online Számlá) in line with the National "
"Tax and Customs Administrations' requirements."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Facturación electrónica <localizations/hungary/e-invoicing>`: "
"Integración para facturación electrónica mediante NAV 3.0 (Online Számlá) de "
"acuerdo con los requisitos de la Administración Nacional de Impuestos y "
"Aduanas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:60
msgid ""
"The following :doc:`taxes <../accounting/taxes>` are available by default "
"with the Hungarian localization package:"
msgstr ""
"Los siguientes :doc:`impuestos <../accounting/taxes>` están disponibles de "
"forma predeterminada con el paquete de localización húngara:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:63
msgid ""
"Standard and Reduced VAT: standard sales tax (27%) and reduced rates (18% "
"and 5%) applied to goods and services in Hungary."
msgstr ""
"IVA estándar y reducido: Impuesto sobre las ventas estándar (27%) y tasas "
"reducidas (18% y 5%) aplicadas a bienes y servicios en Hungría."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:65
msgid ""
"Agricultural Compensation Surcharge (7% or 12%): applied to specific "
"agricultural and livestock products."
msgstr ""
"Recargo compensatorio agrícola (7% o 12%): Se aplica a productos agrícolas y "
"ganaderos específicos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:67
msgid ""
"Intra-Community and Trade taxes: zero-rated (0%) and tax-exempt options "
"applied to EU intra-community sales, exports outside the EU, and domestic "
"exemptions."
msgstr ""
"Impuestos intracomunitarios y comerciales: Opciones con tasa cero (0%) y "
"exentas que se aplican a ventas intracomunitarias dentro de la Unión "
"Europea, exportaciones fuera de la Unión Europea y exenciones nacionales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:73
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/jordan.rst:73
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/luxembourg.rst:84
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:163
msgid "Tax reporting"
msgstr "Reportes fiscales"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:75
msgid ""
"The :doc:`VAT summary <../accounting/reporting/tax_returns>` provides a "
"detailed breakdown of taxable, zero-rated, and exempt transactions. Like "
"other :doc:`financial reports <../accounting/reporting>`, the VAT summary "
"can be filtered by period, compared against other periods, and exported in "
"Excel and PDF formats, ensuring compliance with Hungarian tax laws."
msgstr ""
"El :doc:`resumen de IVA <../accounting/reporting/tax_returns>` proporciona "
"un desglose detallado de las transacciones gravadas, con tasa cero y "
"exentas. Al igual que otros :doc:`reportes financieros <../accounting/"
"reporting>`, puedes filtrar el resumen de IVA por periodo, compararlo con "
"otros periodos y exportarlo como archivos Excel y PDF para cumplir con las "
"leyes fiscales húngaras."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:83
msgid "e-Invoicing with NAV 3.0"
msgstr "Facturación electrónica con NAV 3.0"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:85
msgid ""
"NAV 3.0 e-Invoicing is integrated within Odoo, allowing you to generate "
"compliant electronic invoices, submit invoices in real time for validation, "
"and track invoice statuses directly within Odoo."
msgstr ""
"La facturación electrónica NAV 3.0 se integra con Odoo, lo que te permite "
"generar facturas electrónicas que cumplan con la ley, enviar facturas en "
"tiempo real para su validación y rastrear el estado de las facturas "
"directamente desde Odoo."

