#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/jordan.rst:145
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:94
msgid "Company and customers"
msgstr "Empresa y clientes"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:134
msgid ""
"The NAV 3.0 invoicing workflow requires address information related to the "
"company that sends the invoices and the customers who receive them:"
msgstr ""
"El flujo de facturación de NAV 3.0 requiere información de dirección "
"relacionada con la empresa que envía las facturas y los clientes que las "
"reciben:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:137
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Users & Companies --> Companies` and "
"select the company that will use NAV 3.0."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Ajustes --> Usuarios y empresas --> Empresas` y "
"selecciona la empresa que utilizará NAV 3.0."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:139
msgid ""
"Enter the :guilabel:`Company Name` that matches the name registered with the "
"National Tax and Customs Administration. Then, fill in the :guilabel:`VAT` "
"(TIN), and set the :guilabel:`Country` to :guilabel:`Hungary`. In addition, "
"NAV 3.0 requires a valid :guilabel:`City`, :guilabel:`Street`, "
"and :guilabel:`Zip`."
msgstr ""
"Ingresa el :guilabel:`nombre de la empresa` que coincida con el nombre "
"registrado ante la Administración Nacional de Impuestos y Aduanas. Después, "
"completa el campo :guilabel:`Número de identificación fiscal` (TIN) y "
"configura :guilabel:`Hungría` como :guilabel:`país`. Además, NAV 3.0 "
"requiere una :guilabel:`ciudad`, :guilabel:`calle` y :guilabel:`Código "
"postal` válidos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:145
msgid "The :guilabel:`VAT` must be a Hungarian TIN number."
msgstr ""
"El campo :guilabel:`Número de identificación fiscal` debe contener un número "
"TIN húngaro."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:146
msgid ""
"The company's :guilabel:`Currency` can be set to either :guilabel:`HUF` "
"or :guilabel:`EUR`."
msgstr ""
"La :guilabel:`moneda` de la empresa puede ser :guilabel:`HUF` "
"o :guilabel:`EUR`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:148
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/jordan.rst:163
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Customers`."
