msgid ""
"For each customer whose invoices will be sent using NAV 3.0, click on the "
"customer to open the form view and complete the :guilabel:`Country` "
"and :guilabel:`Tax ID` fields. If desired, fill in additional optional "
"fields such as :guilabel:`Street`, :guilabel:`City`, :guilabel:`State`, "
"and :guilabel:`ZIP`."
msgstr ""
"Para cada cliente cuyas facturas se enviarán mediante NAV 3.0, haz clic en "
"el cliente para abrir la vista de formulario y completa los "
"campos :guilabel:`País` e :guilabel:`Identificación fiscal`. Si lo deseas, "
"completa campos opcionales adicionales "
"como :guilabel:`Calle`, :guilabel:`Ciudad`, :guilabel:`Estado` "
"y :guilabel:`Código postal`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:155
msgid "Sending invoices to NAV 3.0 via Odoo"
msgstr "Enviar facturas a NAV 3.0 mediante Odoo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:157
msgid ""
"Once the company has been :ref:`linked with NAV 3.0 <localizations/hungary/"
"link-nav>` and the :ref:`company and customers have been properly configured "
"<localizations/hungary/company-and-contacts>`, invoices can be sent to NAV "
