#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:183
msgid "Credit notes and Storno"
msgstr "Notas de crédito y Storno"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:185
msgid "Hungarian tax authorities distinguish between two types of corrections:"
msgstr ""
"Las autoridades fiscales húngaras distinguen entre dos tipos de correcciones:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:187
msgid ""
"**Credit note**: a document that partially modifies the amounts or items of "
"an original invoice."
msgstr ""
"**Nota de crédito**: Un documento que modifica de forma parcial los importes "
"o conceptos de una factura original."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:188
msgid ""
"**Storno**: a document that fully cancels an original invoice, effectively "
"bringing the balance to zero."
msgstr ""
"**Storno**: Un documento que cancela por completo una factura original y "
"deja el saldo en cero."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:191
msgid ""
"Odoo handles both cases automatically. When a credit note is created that "
"brings the total outstanding amount of the original invoice to **0.00**, "
"Odoo identifies this as a Storno operation. This classification is then "
"automatically communicated in the electronic reporting to NAV 3.0, ensuring "
"compliance without manual intervention."
msgstr ""
"Odoo gestiona ambos casos de forma automática. Cuando creas una nota de "
"crédito que reduce el importe pendiente total de la factura original a "
"**0.00**, Odoo identifica esta acción como una operación Storno. Luego, "
"comunica esta clasificación de forma automática en el reporte electrónico a "
"NAV 3.0, lo que garantiza el cumplimiento sin intervención manual."

