msgid "To create an E-way bill:"
msgstr "Para crear una guía de embarque electrónica:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:419
msgid ""
"A delivery order must be in the :guilabel:`Done` state (i.e., validated)"
msgstr ""
"La orden de entrega debe de estar en estado :guilabel:`Hecho` (es decir, "
"validada)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:420
msgid "A receipt must have the :guilabel:`Ready` or :guilabel:`Done` state."
msgstr ""
"La recepción debe estar en estado :guilabel:`Listo` o :guilabel:`Hecho`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:422
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Generate e-Waybill` to validate the E-Way bill and send it "
"to the NIC E-Way bill portal."
msgstr ""
"Haga clic en :guilabel:`Generar guía de embarque electrónica` para validar "
"la guía y enviarla al portal del NIC."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:426
msgid ""
"To use the E-Way bill as a challan for goods deliveries without sending it "
"to the NIC E-Waybill portal, click :guilabel:`Use as Challan`."
msgstr ""
"Haga clic en :guilabel:`Usar como albarán` para usar la guía de embarque "
"electrónica como albarán para la entrega de bienes sin enviarla al portal "
"del NIC."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:429
msgid ""
"To print the E-waybill or the challan, click the :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` icon and select :icon:`fa-"
"print` :guilabel:`Ewaybill / Delivery Challan`."
msgstr ""
"Para imprimir la guía de embarque electrónica o el albarán, haga clic en el "
"icono :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(engranaje)` y seleccione :icon:`fa-"
"print` :guilabel:`Guía de embarque electrónica / Albarán de entrega`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:435
msgid "Indian Check GSTIN Status"
msgstr "Comprobar el estado del número de GST"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:437
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Indian - Check GST Number Status` allows you to verify the "
"status of a :abbr:`GSTIN (Goods and Services Tax Identification Number)` "
"directly from Odoo."
msgstr ""
"El módulo :guilabel:`India - Comprobar el estado del número de GST` permite "
"verificar el estado de un :abbr:`GSTIN (Número de identificación del "
"impuesto sobre bienes y servicios)` directamente desde Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:440
msgid ""
"To verify the status of a contact's GST number, access the customer's/"
"vendor's form and click :guilabel:`Check GSTIN Status` next to "
"the :guilabel:`GSTIN` field."
msgstr ""
"Para verificar el estado del número de GST de un contacto, abra el "
"formulario del cliente o proveedor y haga clic en :guilabel:`Comprobar el "
"estado del GSTIN` que se encuentra junto al campo :guilabel:`GSTIN`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:443
msgid ""
"To verify the status of a GST number entered on an invoice/bill, access the "
"invoice/bill and click the :icon:`fa-refresh` (:guilabel:`refresh`) button "
"next to the :guilabel:`GST Status` field."
msgstr ""
"Para verificar el estado de un número de GST ingresado en una factura, "
"ábrala y haga clic en el botón :icon:`fa-refresh` (:guilabel:`actualizar`) "
"que se encuentra junto al campo :guilabel:`Estado del GST`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:446
msgid "Check GSTIN status of an invoice"
msgstr "Comprobar el estado GSTIN de una factura"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:449
msgid ""
"A notification is displayed to confirm the status update and the GSTIN "
"status and verification date are logged in the contact's chatter."
msgstr ""
"Aparece una notificación para confirmar la actualización del estado. El "
"estado del GSTIN y la fecha de verificación se registran en el chatter del "
"contacto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:455
msgid "Indian GST Return filing"
msgstr "Declaración de impuestos GST en la India"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:460
msgid "Enable API access"
msgstr "Habilitar acceso a la API"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:462
msgid ""
"To file GST Returns in Odoo, you must first enable API access on the GST "
"portal."
msgstr ""
"Antes de presentar declaraciones de impuestos GST en Odoo, debe habilitar el "
"acceso a la API en el portal GST."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:464
msgid ""
"Log into the `GST portal <https://services.gst.gov.in/services/login>`_ by "
"entering your :guilabel:`Username` and :guilabel:`Password`, and go "
"to :guilabel:`My Profile` on your **profile menu**;"
msgstr ""
"Inicie sesión en el `portal GST <https://services.gst.gov.in/services/"
"login>`_ con su :guilabel:`usuario` y :guilabel:`contraseña`, vaya "
"a :guilabel:`Mi perfil` (My profile) en su **menú de perfil**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:468
msgid "Click On the My Profile from profile"
msgstr "Haz clic en Mi perfil desde el perfil"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:471
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`Manage API Access`, and click :guilabel:`Yes` to enable "
"API access;"
msgstr ""
"Seleccione :guilabel:`Administrar el acceso a la API` (Manage API Access) y "
"haga clic en :guilabel:`Sí` (Yes) para habilitar el acceso."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:473
msgid "Click Yes"
msgstr "Hacer clic en sí"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:477
msgid ""
"It is recommended to set the :guilabel:`Duration` to :guilabel:`30 days` to "
"avoid the need for frequent token reauthentication."
msgstr ""
"Le recomendamos que la :guilabel:`duración` sea :guilabel:`30 días`, así no "
"será necesario volver a autenticar tokens con frecuencia."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:480
msgid ""
"Doing so enables a :guilabel:`Duration` drop-down menu. Select "
"the :guilabel:`Duration` of your preference, and click :guilabel:`Confirm`."
msgstr ""
"Esta acción habilitará un menú desplegable de :guilabel:`duración` "
"(Duration). Seleccione la :guilabel:`duración` de su preferencia y haga clic "
"en :guilabel:`confirmar` (Confirm). "

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:486
msgid "Indian GST Service In Odoo"
msgstr "Servicio GST de la India en Odoo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:488
msgid ""
"Once you have enabled the :ref:`API access <india/gstr_api>` on the GST "
"portal, :ref:`activate <india/indian-configuration>` the :guilabel:`GST E-"
"Filing & Matching Feature` to start using GST Service. Then, in "
"the :guilabel:`Registered Under GST` section, fill in the "
"required :guilabel:`GST Username`."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que hayas habilitado el :ref:`acceso API <india/gstr_api>` en el "
"portal de GST, :ref:`activa <india/indian-configuration>` la "
"función :guilabel:`Declaración electrónica y conciliación de GST` para "
"empezar a usar el servicio GST. Luego, en la sección :guilabel:`Registrado "
"bajo GST`, completa el :guilabel:`nombre de usuario de GST` requerido."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:493
msgid "Please enter your GST portal Username as Username"
msgstr "Introduzca su nombre de usuario del portal GST como usuario"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:502
msgid "File-in GST Return"
msgstr "Presentar declaraciones GST"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:504
msgid ""
"To file a GST return, make sure the :ref:`GST E-Filing & Matching Feature "
"<india/indian-configuration>` is enabled. Then, go to the Accounting "
"dashboard and click :guilabel:`Tax Returns` on the :guilabel:`Tax Returns` "
"journal. In the :guilabel:`Accounting Periods` window, fill in the following "
"fields."
msgstr ""
"Para presentar una declaración GST, asegúrate de que la "
"función :ref:`Declaración electrónica y conciliación de GST <india/indian-"
"configuration>` esté habilitada. Luego, ve al tablero de Contabilidad y haz "
"clic en :guilabel:`Declaración fiscal` en el diario :guilabel:`Declaración "
"fiscal`. Completa los siguientes campos en la ventana :guilabel:`Periodos "
"contables`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:509
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Opening Date`: Starting date from which tax return periods are "
"created."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Fecha de apertura`: Fecha de inicio desde la cual se crean los "
"periodos de declaración fiscal."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:510
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Fiscal Year End`: End date of the fiscal year "
"(e.g., :guilabel:`31 March`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Fin del ejercicio fiscal`: Fecha de cierre del ejercicio fiscal "
"(por ejemplo, :guilabel:`31 de marzo`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:511
msgid ""
":guilabel:`GSTIN Periodicity`: Frequency of return filing "
"(e.g., :guilabel:`Monthly`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Periodicidad del GSTIN`: La frecuencia del envío de la "
"declaración (por ejemplo, :guilabel:`Mensual`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:514
msgid ""
"Alternatively, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Tax "
"Report`, click :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`Report:` and "
"select :guilabel:`GSTR-1 (IN)`. Then, click :guilabel:`Returns` to file the "
"return."
msgstr ""
"Como alternativa, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Reportes --> Reporte "
"fiscal`, haz clic en :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`Reporte:` y "
"selecciona :guilabel:`GSTR-1 (IN)`. Luego, haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Declaraciones` para presentar la declaración."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:519
msgid ""
"To reconcile vendor bills with GST portal data, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Tax Report`, click :icon:`fa-"
"book` :guilabel:`Report:` and select :guilabel:`GSTR-2B`, and "
"click :guilabel:`Reconcile`."
msgstr ""
"Para conciliar las facturas de los proveedores con los datos del portal de "
"GST, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Reportes --> Reporte fiscal`, haz "
"clic en :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`Reporte:` y "
"selecciona :guilabel:`GSTR-2B`, luego haz clic en :guilabel:`Conciliar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:526
msgid "Filing GSTR-1 tax return"
msgstr "Presentación de la declaración de impuestos GSTR-1"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:528
msgid "To file a GSTR-1 tax return, follow these steps:"
msgstr "Sigue estos pasos para presentar una declaración GSTR-1:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:530
msgid ""
"Click the suitable :guilabel:`GSTR-1` report for the desired period to open "
"the filing view."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en el reporte :guilabel:`GSTR-1` correspondiente al periodo deseado "
"para abrir la vista de presentación."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:532
msgid "GSTR-1 filing view"
msgstr "Vista de presentación de GSTR-1"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:536
msgid ""
"It is recommended to file the return **five days before the filing date** to "
"avoid any penalties."
msgstr ""
"Te recomendamos presentar la declaración **cinco días antes de la fecha "
"límite** para evitar multas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:539
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically performs validation checks before submission to ensure "
"compliance with GST portal requirements that must be addressed before filing."
msgstr ""
"Odoo realiza las revisiones de validación de forma automática antes del "
"envío para asegurar el cumplimiento con los requisitos del portal GST que "
"debes corregir antes de presentar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:543
msgid "The following types of validation issues can be raised:"
msgstr "Pueden ocurrir los siguientes tipos de problemas de validación:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:545
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Apply Appropriate Tax`: :guilabel:`IGST` is not applicable for "
"intra-state transactions."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Aplicar impuesto adecuado`: El :guilabel:`IGST` no es aplicable "
"para transacciones intraestatales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:547
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Wrong CGST/SGST on Inter-State Transactions`: :guilabel:`CGST/"
"SGST` cannot be applied on inter-state transactions."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`CGST/SGST incorrecto en transacciones "
"interestatales`: :guilabel:`CGST/SGST` no se puede aplicar en transacciones "
"interestatales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:549
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Fiscal Year Reversed Move`: Credit Notes for invoices issued in a "
"given financial year should not be included in GSTR-1 after **November "
"30th**; remove tax from these lines."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Movimiento de año fiscal revertido`: Las notas de crédito de "
"facturas emitidas en cierto año fiscal no deben estar incluidas en el GSTR-1 "
"después del **30 de noviembre**. Elimina el impuesto de estas líneas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:551
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Invalid HSN Codes`: - For products (non-services), HSN codes must "
"not begin with `99`. - For services, HSN codes must begin with `99`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Códigos HSN inválidos`: - Para productos (no servicios), los "
"códigos HSN no deben comenzar con `99`. - Para servicios, los códigos HSN "
"deben comenzar con `99`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:554
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Missing HSN Codes`: Some product lines do not have HSN codes for "
"journal items."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Faltan los códigos HSN`: Algunas líneas de productos no tienen "
"códigos HSN en los apuntes contables."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:556
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Invalid UQC Codes`: The Unit Quantity Code (UQC) must comply with "
"Indian GST standards."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Códigos UQC inválidos`: El código de unidad de cantidad (UQC, por "
"sus siglas en inglés) debe cumplir con las normas de GST de India."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:558
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Missing Document Summary`: Document summary lines are mandatory "
"for GSTR-1. This check is always marked as :guilabel:`Anomaly` initially. "
"After reviewing the summary by clicking the relevant check, it changes "
"to :guilabel:`Reviewed`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Falta el resumen del documento`: Las líneas de resumen de "
"documentos son obligatorias para GSTR-1. Esta revisión siempre se marca "
"inicialmente como :guilabel:`Anomalía`. Después de revisar el resumen "
"haciendo clic en la verificación correspondiente, cambia "
"a :guilabel:`Revisado`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:561
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Missing E-Invoice`: Some invoices are not linked to an e-invoice."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Falta la factura electrónica`: Algunas facturas no están "
"vinculadas a una factura electrónica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:562
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Unlinked Unregistered Credit Notes`: Credit Notes have been "
"issued without referencing an invoice."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Notas de crédito sin registrar ni vincular`: Hay notas de crédito "
"emitidas sin referenciar una factura electrónica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:565
msgid "Validation checks have four stages:"
msgstr "Las revisiones de validación tienen cuatro etapas:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:567
msgid ":guilabel:`To Review`: Check requires review."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Por revisar`: La verificación requiere revisión."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:568
msgid ":guilabel:`Reviewed`: Check has been reviewed."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Revisado`: La verificación ha sido revisada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:569
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Supervised`: Check is supervised, and a supervisor is assigned."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Supervisado`: La verificación está supervisada y se asignó un "
"supervisor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:570
msgid ":guilabel:`Anomaly`: Check has failed."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Anomalía`: La verificación ha fallado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:572
msgid ""
"Click on any individual check to view and resolve the corresponding issue."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en cualquier revisión individual para ver y resolver el problema "
"correspondiente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:575
msgid ""
"A tax return can only be validated when all checks are in "
"the :guilabel:`Reviewed` or :guilabel:`Supervised` stage."
msgstr ""
"Una declaración solo se puede validar cuando todas las verificaciones están "
"en las etapas :guilabel:`Revisado` o :guilabel:`Supervisado`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:578
msgid ""
"After reviewing the checks, click :guilabel:`Validate`. "
"The :guilabel:`Review` stage appears in green then."
msgstr ""
"Después de revisar las verificaciones, haz clic en :guilabel:`Validar`. La "
"etapa :guilabel:`Revisión` aparecerá en verde."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:581
msgid "Click :guilabel:`GSTR-1 (IN)` to review the report."
msgstr "Haz clic en :guilabel:`GSTR-1 (IN)` para revisar el reporte."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:583
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Submit`, and click :guilabel:`Push Data` in "
"the :guilabel:`Submission Instructions` window to send the report to the GST "
"portal."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Enviar` y luego en :guilabel:`Enviar datos` en la "
"ventana :guilabel:`Instrucciones de envío` para enviar el reporte al portal "
"de la GST."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:586
msgid ""
"During this step, GST portal credentials must be verified. As the data is "
"being sent, the :guilabel:`Send` stage in the progress bar appears orange. "
"Once the GST portal confirms receipt, the stage turns green. If an error "
"occurs, the :guilabel:`Send` stage changes to red."
msgstr ""
"Durante este paso, es necesario revisar las credenciales del portal de la "
"GST. Mientras se envían los datos, la etapa :guilabel:`Enviar` en la barra "
"de progreso aparece en naranja. Una vez que el portal de la GST confirma la "
"recepción, la etapa cambia a verde. Si ocurre un error, la "
"etapa :guilabel:`Enviar` cambia a rojo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:591
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(ellipsis)` icon on the "
"relevant :guilabel:`GSTR-1` line to display additional options:"
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en el icono :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(tres puntos "
"verticales)` en la línea correspondiente a :guilabel:`GSTR-1` para mostrar "
"algunas opciones adicionales:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:594
msgid ":guilabel:`Generate XLSX`: Download the GSTR-1 report as an XLSX file."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Generar XLSX`: Descarga el reporte GSTR-1 como archivo XLSX."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:595
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Reset`: Clear the current state and revert the return to the "
"initial stage."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Restablecer`: Limpia el estado actual y regresa la declaración a "
"la etapa inicial."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:597
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Check Status` to retrieve the current status from the GST "
"portal. Once the confirmation is received, the :guilabel:`Review` stage in "
"the progress bar turns green. Then, click :guilabel:`Mark as Filed` to "
"finalize and submit the return as filed."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Verificar estado` para obtener el estado actual desde "
"el portal de la GST. Una vez que hayas recibido la confirmación, la "
"etapa :guilabel:`Revisión` en la barra de progreso cambia a color verde. "
"Luego, haz clic en :guilabel:`Marcar como presentada` para finalizar y "
"enviar la declaración como presentada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:602
msgid ""
"Once a return is marked as **Filed**, it cannot be reset or filed again."
msgstr ""
"Luego de marcar una declaración como **Presentada** no podrás restablecerla "
"ni volver a presentarla."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:607
msgid "Receive GSTR-2B tax reconciliation"
msgstr "Recibir la conciliación fiscal GSTR-2B"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:609
msgid ""
"Select the relevant :guilabel:`GSTR-2B` report for the desired period that "
"needs to be reconciled."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona el :guilabel:`reporte GSTR-2B` correspondiente para el periodo "
"deseado que necesita conciliación."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:612
msgid ""
"In the validation checks view, click :guilabel:`Fetch E-Invoice` to retrieve "
"vendor e-invoice data for the reconciliation period. The check is initially "
"marked as :guilabel:`Anomaly` and changes to :guilabel:`Reviewed` after "
"fetching. Then, click :guilabel:`Validate` to confirm and mark "
"the :guilabel:`Review` stage as green."
msgstr ""
"En la vista de verificaciones, haz clic en :guilabel:`Obtener factura "
"electrónica` para recuperar los datos de las facturas electrónicas de los "
"proveedores del periodo de conciliación. La verificación se marca "
"inicialmente como :guilabel:`Anomalía` y cambia a :guilabel:`Revisado` "
"después de obtener los datos. Luego, haz clic en :guilabel:`Validar` para "
"confirmar y marcar la etapa :guilabel:`Revisión` en verde."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:618
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Fetch E-Invoice` check only turns green if the e-invoice data "
"is fetched **two days after the end of the last month's reconciliation "
"period**."
msgstr ""
"La verificación :guilabel:`Obtener factura electrónica` solo cambia a verde "
"si los datos de las facturas electrónicas se obtienen **dos días después del "
"fin del periodo de conciliación del mes anterior**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:621
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Fetch GSTR-2B` to retrieve all invoices from the GST "
"portal. Once the data is fetched, the :guilabel:`Fetch` stage in the "
"progress bar turns green. To view the raw report data, "
"click :guilabel:`GSTR-2B (IN)`."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Obtener GSTR-2B` para recuperar todas las facturas "
"del portal de la GST. Una vez obtenidos los datos, la "
"etapa :guilabel:`Obtener` en la barra de progreso cambia a verde. Haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`GSTR-2B (IN)` para ver los datos sin procesar del reporte."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:625
msgid ""
"The fetched invoices are automatically matched with the E-invoices. "
"Click :guilabel:`View Bills` to see detailed matching results."
msgstr ""
"Las facturas obtenidas se comparan de forma automática con las facturas "
"electrónicas. Haz clic en :guilabel:`Ver facturas` para ver los resultados "
"detallados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:629
msgid "The :guilabel:`Match` stage indicates the reconciliation status:"
msgstr "La etapa :guilabel:`Conciliar` indica el estado de la conciliación:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:631
msgid "Orange: Partially matched (some bills require correction)."
msgstr ""
"Naranja: Parcialmente conciliado (algunas facturas requieren corrección)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:632
msgid "Green: Fully matched (all bills reconciled)."
msgstr "Verde: Totalmente conciliado (todas las facturas están conciliadas)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:634
msgid ""
"In case of mismatches, correct the affected bills, then click the :icon:`fa-"
"ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(ellipsis)` icon to access additional options:"
msgstr ""
"En caso de que haya discrepancias, corrige las facturas afectadas y luego "
"haz clic en el icono :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(tres puntos "
"verticales)` para acceder a otras opciones:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:637
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Re-Match`: Re-run the matching process after making corrections."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Reconciliar`: Vuelve a ejecutar el proceso de conciliación "
"después de hacer correcciones."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:638
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Reset`: Reset the reconciliation to the :guilabel:`Match` stage."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Restablecer`: Restablece la conciliación a la "
"etapa :guilabel:`Conciliar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:640
msgid ""
"After all bills are fully matched, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-"
"v` :guilabel:`(ellipsis)` icon and select :guilabel:`Mark as Complete`. "
"The :guilabel:`Complete` stage in the progress bar turns green, finalizing "
"the bill reconciliation."
msgstr ""
"Después de que todas las facturas estén totalmente conciliadas, haz clic en "
"el icono :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(tres puntos verticales)` y "
"selecciona :guilabel:`Marcar como completo`. La etapa :guilabel:`Completo` "
"en la barra de progreso cambia a verde y esto finaliza la conciliación de "
"facturas."

