#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:39
msgid ""
"Open the :guilabel:`Settings` app, go to the :doc:`Companies <../../general/"
"companies>` section, and click :ref:`Update Info <general/companies/"
"company>`. Ensure the :guilabel:`NPWP` field contains the **Tax "
"Identification Number**, as an e-Faktur cannot be generated from an invoice "
"otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Abre :guilabel:`Ajustes`, ve a la sección :doc:`Empresas <../../general/"
"companies>` y haz clic en :ref:`Actualizar información <general/companies/"
"company>`. Asegúrate de que el campo :guilabel:`NPWP` contenga el **número "
"de identificación fiscal**, ya que de lo contrario no podrás generar un e-"
"Faktur desde una factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:49
msgid ""
"To configure a partner for e-Faktur, go to their :doc:`contact <../../"
"essentials/contacts>` form and fill in the following Indonesian-specific "
"fields:"
msgstr ""
"Para configurar un contacto para e-Faktur, ve a su formulario "
"de :doc:`contacto <../../essentials/contacts>` y completa los siguientes "
"campos específicos de Indonesia:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:52
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Is PKP`: Check this box to allow e-Faktur generation for the "
"partner."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Es PKP`: Selecciona esta casilla para permitir la generación de e-"
"Faktur para el contacto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:53
msgid ":guilabel:`NPWP`: Enter the partner's Tax Identification Number."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`NPWP`: Ingresa el número de identificación fiscal del contacto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:54
msgid ""
":guilabel:`NIK`: If the partner does not have an :guilabel:`NPWP`, enter "
"the :guilabel:`NIK` in the :guilabel:`Accounting` tab "
"under :guilabel:`Indonesian taxes`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`NIK`: Si el contacto no tiene un :guilabel:`NPWP`, ingresa "
"el :guilabel:`NIK` en la pestaña :guilabel:`Contabilidad` "
"de :guilabel:`Impuestos de Indonesia`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:62
msgid ""
"To set a product's E-Faktur product code, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --"
"> Customers --> Products` and access the desired product form. In "
"the :guilabel:`Indonesian Localization` section, select a code in "
"the :guilabel:`E-Faktur Product code` field. By default, the code is set "
"to :guilabel:`000000 - Barang`."
msgstr ""
"Para definir el código de E-Faktur de un producto, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Clientes --> Productos` y abre el "
"formulario del producto deseado. En la sección :guilabel:`Localización de "
"Indonesia`, selecciona un código en el campo :guilabel:`Código de producto E-"
"Faktur`. El código está configurado como :guilabel:`000000 - Barang` de "
"forma predeterminada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:67
msgid "Product with the E-Faktur Product Code."
msgstr "Producto con código de producto E-Faktur."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:71
msgid ""
":guilabel:`E-Faktur product codes` are pre-generated by Odoo and cannot be "
"edited. Select a code from the available options."
msgstr ""
"Los :guilabel:`códigos de producto E-Faktur` los genera Odoo y no podrás "
"editarlos. Selecciona un código de las opciones disponibles."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:77
msgid "E-Faktur UoM Code"
msgstr "Código de UdM de E-Faktur"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:80
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Settings` to make sure "
"the :guilabel:`Units of Measure` option has been enabled."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Inventario --> Configuración --> Ajustes` y asegúrate "
"de que la opción :guilabel:`Unidades de medida` esté habilitada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:83
msgid ""
"To configure the :guilabel:`E-Faktur UoM code`, go "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> UoM Categories`. Open a "
"category and select the appropriate :guilabel:`E-Faktur UoM Code` from the "
"options."
msgstr ""
"Para configurar el :guilabel:`Código de UdM de E-Faktur`, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Inventario --> Configuración --> Categorías de UdM`. Abre "
"una categoría y selecciona el :guilabel:`código de UdM de E-Faktur` correcto "
"de las opciones."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:87
msgid "E-Faktur UoM."
msgstr "UdM de E-Faktur."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:104
msgid "Generate an E-Faktur XML"
msgstr "Generar un XML de E-Faktur"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:106
msgid ""
"An e-Faktur can be created for an invoice if the customer's country is "
"Indonesia and the :guilabel:`Is PKP` checkbox is enabled on "
"their  :ref:`contact <localizations/indonesia/configuration-contacts>` form."
msgstr ""
"Puedes crear un e-Faktur para una factura si el país del cliente es "
"Indonesia y la casilla :guilabel:`Es PKP` está seleccionada en su formulario "
"de :ref:`contacto <localizations/indonesia/configuration-contacts>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:110
msgid "To generate an e-Faktur XML:"
msgstr "Para generar un XML de e-Faktur:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:112
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Invoices` "
"and :ref:`create an invoice <accounting/invoice/creation>`."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Clientes --> Facturas` y :ref:`crea "
"una factura <accounting/invoice/creation>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:115
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Other Info` tab, under the :guilabel:`Electronic Tax` "
"section, select a :guilabel:`Kode Transaksi` code."
msgstr ""
"En la pestaña :guilabel:`Otra información`, busca la "
"sección :guilabel:`Impuesto electrónico` y selecciona un "
"código :guilabel:`Kode Transaksi`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:119
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Kode Transaksi` codes are pre-generated by Odoo and cannot be "
"edited."
msgstr ""
"Odoo genera los códigos :guilabel:`Kode Transaksi` y no podrás editarlos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:121
msgid ""
"After confirming the invoice, click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` "
"icon and select :guilabel:`Download e-faktur`."
msgstr ""
"Después de confirmar la factura, haz clic en el icono :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`(Acciones)` y selecciona :guilabel:`Descargar e-Faktur`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:124
msgid ""
"The downloaded XML file can then be uploaded to the Coretax system. After "
"the file is generated, the :guilabel:`e-Faktur Document (Coretax)` field in "
"the invoice's :guilabel:`Electronic Tax` section is populated automatically."
msgstr ""
"Podrás subir al sistema Coretax el archivo XML que descargues. Una vez que "
"hayas generado el archivo, el campo :guilabel:`Documento e-Faktur (Coretax)` "
"en la sección :guilabel:`Impuesto electrónico` de la factura se completa en "
"automático."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:128
msgid "Invoice with E-Faktur Document."
msgstr "Factura con documento E-Faktur."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:132
msgid ""
"To create a batch XML file for several invoices, select them in the invoice "
"list view and choose :guilabel:`Download e-faktur` from "
"the :guilabel:`Actions` menu."
msgstr ""
"Para crear un archivo XML por lote de varias facturas, selecciónalas en la "
"vista de lista de facturas y elige :guilabel:`Descargar e-Faktur` en el "
"menú :guilabel:`Acciones`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:136
msgid "The tax invoice number is generated by the Coretax system, not by Odoo."
msgstr "El número de factura fiscal lo genera el sistema Coretax, no Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:137
msgid ""
"Once an e-Faktur XML file has been downloaded, it cannot be changed. Any "
"subsequent download will retrieve the original file."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que descargues un archivo XML de e-Faktur, no podrás cambiarlo. "
"Cualquier descarga posterior recuperará el archivo original."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:143
msgid "QRIS QR code on invoices"
msgstr "Código QR QRIS en las facturas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:145
msgid ""
"`QRIS <https://qris.online/homepage/>`_ is a digital payment system that "
"allows customers to make payments by scanning the QR code from their "
"preferred e-wallet."
msgstr ""
"`QRIS <https://qris.online/homepage/>`_ es un sistema de pago digital que "
"permite que los clientes paguen con la billetera electrónica de su elección "
"al escanear un código QR."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:149
msgid ""
"According to the `QRIS API documentation <https://qris.online/api-doc/create-"
"invoice.php>`_, QRIS expires after 30 minutes. Due to this restriction, the "
"QR code is not included in reports sent to customers and is only available "
"on the customer portal."
msgstr ""
"De acuerdo con la `documentación de la API de QRIS <https://qris.online/api-"
"doc/create-invoice.php>`_, QRIS expira luego de 30 minutos. Por este motivo "
"el código QR no aparece en los reportes enviados a los clientes y solo está "
"disponible en el portal del cliente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:158
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/singapore.rst:16
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`. Under "
"the :guilabel:`Customer Payments` section, activate the :guilabel:`QR Codes` "
"feature."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Ajustes`. En la "
"sección :guilabel:`Pagos del cliente`, active la opción :guilabel:`Códigos "
"QR`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:164
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:173
msgid "QRIS bank account configuration"
msgstr "Configuración de la cuenta bancaria para QRIS"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:166
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Contacts --> Configuration --> Bank Accounts` and "
"select the bank account for which you want to activate QRIS. Set "
"the :guilabel:`QRIS API Key` and :guilabel:`QRIS Merchant ID` based on the "
"information provided by QRIS."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Contactos --> Configuración --> Cuentas bancarias` y "
"seleccione la cuenta bancaria en la que desea activar QRIS. Escriba "
"la :guilabel:`clave API de QRIS` y el :guilabel:`ID de comerciante de QRIS`, "
"esta información debe ser la que le proporcionó QRIS."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:171
msgid ""
"The account holder's country must be set to `Indonesia` on its contact form."
msgstr ""
"El país del titular de la cuenta debe ser `Indonesia` en el formulario de "
"contacto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:184
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/singapore.rst:41
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Journals`, open the "
"bank journal, then fill out the :guilabel:`Account Number` "
"and :guilabel:`Bank` under the :guilabel:`Journal Entries` tab."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Diarios`, abra el "
"diario bancario y complete el :guilabel:`número de cuenta` y "
"el :guilabel:`banco` en la pestaña :guilabel:`Asientos contables`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:193
msgid "Issue invoices with QRIS QR codes"
msgstr "Emitir facturas con códigos QR QRIS"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:195
msgid ""
"When creating a new invoice, open the :guilabel:`Other Info` tab and set "
"the :guilabel:`Payment QR-code` option to :guilabel:`QRIS`."
msgstr ""
"Al crear una nueva factura, abre la pestaña :guilabel:`Otra información` y "
"elige :guilabel:`QRIS` en la opción :guilabel:`Código QR de pago`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:198
msgid "Select QRIS QR-code option"
msgstr "Seleccionar la opción de código QR QRIS"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:201
msgid ""
"Ensure that the :guilabel:`Recipient Bank` is the one you configured, as "
"Odoo uses this field to generate the QRIS QR code."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrese de que el :guilabel:`banco destinatario` sea el que usted "
"configuró, pues Odoo usa este campo para generar el código QR QRIS."

