#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:110
msgid ""
"If you need to use a different kind of exoneration, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Taxes`, select a similar "
"tax, then click on the cog icon and select :guilabel:`Duplicate`. In "
"the :guilabel:`Advanced Options` tab, add the :guilabel:`Exoneration` "
"and :guilabel:`Law Reference`. To confirm click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Si necesitas usar otro tipo de exención, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --"
"> Configuración --> Impuestos`, elige un impuesto similar, haz clic en el "
"icono de engranaje y selecciona :guilabel:`Duplicar`. En la "
"pestaña :guilabel:`Opciones avanzadas`, agrega la :guilabel:`exención` y "
"la :guilabel:`referencia legal`. Para confirmar, haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Guardar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:116
msgid ""
"**Rename** your taxes in the :guilabel:`Name` field according to "
"their :guilabel:`Exoneration` to differentiate them easily."
msgstr ""
"**Renombre** sus impuestos en el campo :guilabel:`Nombre` según "
"su :guilabel:`Exoneración` para diferenciarlos con facilidad."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:122
msgid "Reverse charge"
msgstr "Revertir un cargo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:124
msgid ""
"The **reverse charge** mechanism is a VAT rule that shifts the liability to "
"pay VAT from the supplier to the customer. The customers pay the VAT "
"*themselves* to the |AdE| instead. There are different types:"
msgstr ""
"El mecanismo de **inversión del sujeto pasivo** es una regla de IVA que "
"traslada la obligación de pagar el IVA del proveedor al cliente. El cliente "
"paga el IVA *por su cuenta* a la |AdE|. Existen distintos tipos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Internal Reverse Charge` (for domestic sales)"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Revertir un cargo interno` (para ventas nacionales)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:0
msgid ""
"The VAT responsibility is shifted to the buyer for certain categories of "
"products and services."
msgstr ""
"La responsabilidad de IVA cambia al comprador para ciertas categorías de "
"productos y servicios."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`External Reverse Charge` (for intra-EU sales)"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Revertir un cargo externo` (para ventas dentro de la UE)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:0
msgid ""
"VAT is due in the country of the delivery or in the country where the "
"service is performed. When the buyer is itself an Italian business, then the "
"EU offers a mechanism that allows the seller to transfer his responsibility "
"to the buyer."
msgstr ""
"El IVA se debe pagar en el país de la entrega o en el país donde se realiza "
"el servicio. Cuando el comprador es una empresa italiana, entonces la UE "
"ofrece un mecanismo que permite que el vendedor transfiera la "
"responsabilidad al comprador."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:140
msgid ""
"**Reverse-charged** customer invoices show no VAT amount, but the |AdE| "
"requires the seller to specify the :guilabel:`Tax Exemption` reason and "
"the :guilabel:`Law Reference` that enable the reverse-charge mechanism. Odoo "
"provides a set of special 0% taxes that can be assigned to each reverse-"
"charged invoice lines, representing the most commonly used configurations."
msgstr ""
"Las facturas de cliente con **inversión del sujeto pasivo** no muestran "
"importe del IVA, pero la |AdE| exige que el vendedor indique el motivo "
"de :guilabel:`exención de impuestos` y la :guilabel:`referencia legal` que "
"habilitan este mecanismo. Odoo incluye un conjunto de impuestos especiales "
"al 0% que puedes asignar a cada línea de factura con inversión del sujeto "
"pasivo y que representan las configuraciones más comunes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:150
msgid ""
"Italian companies subject to **reverse charge** must send bill details to "
"the |AdE|."
msgstr ""
"Las empresas italianas sujetas a la **inversión del sujeto pasivo** deben "
"enviar los detalles de las facturas a la |AdE|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:153
msgid ""
"Self-reported VAT XML files must be issued and sent to the |AdE| for "
"**reverse charged** bills."
msgstr ""
"Debes emitir y enviar los archivos XML de IVA autoliquidado para las "
"facturas con **inversión del sujeto pasivo** a la |AdE| ."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:155
msgid ""
"When creating a vendor bill, **reverse charge** taxes are available to be "
"added in the :guilabel:`Taxes` field. You can check which taxes are "
"available by going to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> "
"Taxes`, you can see that the 10% Goods and 22% Services taxes are activated, "
"among others. Due to the automated configuration of the Italian fiscal "
"position, these are automatically activated in the tax list."
msgstr ""
"Al crear una factura de proveedor podrá agregar los impuestos de **cargo "
"revertido** al campo :guilabel:`Impuestos`. Puede revisar qué impuestos "
"están disponibles si va a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> "
"Impuestos`. Allí verá que los impuestos del 10% para bienes y del 22 % para "
"servicios están activados, entre otros. Debido a la configuración automática "
"de la posición fiscal italiana, estos se activan en automático en la lista "
"de impuestos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:166
msgid ""
"The Italian localization has a specific :ref:`tax grid <accounting/tax-"
"returns/tax-grids>` section for **reverse charge** taxes. These tax grids "
"are identifiable by the :guilabel:`VJ` tag, and can be found by going "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Tax Return`."
msgstr ""
"La localización italiana incluye una sección específica de :ref:`tablas de "
"impuestos <accounting/tax-returns/tax-grids>` para impuestos de **inversión "
"del sujeto pasivo**. Estas tablas tienen asignada la etiqueta :guilabel:`VJ` "
"y están en :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Reportes --> Declaración fiscal`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:170
msgid "Reverse charge tax grid from the VJ section of the Tax Declaration"
msgstr ""
"Tablas de impuestos de cargo revertido de la sección VJ de la declaración "
"fiscal"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:179
msgid ""
"Make sure all the Italian-specific e-invoicing :ref:`modules <localizations/"
"italy/modules>` are :ref:`installed <general/install>`."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de que todos los :ref:`módulos <localizations/italy/modules>` "
"italianos de facturación electrónica estén :ref:`instalados <general/"
"install>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:182
msgid ""
"The |SdI| is the :doc:`electronic invoicing <../accounting/customer_invoices/"
"electronic_invoicing>` system used in Italy. It enables the sending and "
"receiving of electronic invoices to and from customers. The documents must "
"be in an XML :abbr:`EDI (Electronic Data Interchange)` format called "
"**FatturaPA** and formally validated by the system before being delivered."
msgstr ""
"El |SdI| es el sistema de :doc:`facturación electrónica <../accounting/"
"customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing>` utilizado en Italia. Permite enviar "
"y recibir facturas electrónicas a (y de) tus clientes. Los documentos deben "
"estar en formato XML :abbr:`EDI (Intercambio electrónico de datos)` llamado "
"**FatturaPA** y el sistema debe validarlos antes de entregarlos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:187
msgid ""
"To be able to receive invoices and notifications, the |SdI| service must be "
"notified that the user's files need to be sent to Odoo and processed on "
"their behalf. To do so, you must set up Odoo's :guilabel:`Destination Code` "
"on the |AdE| portal."
msgstr ""
"Para poder recibir facturas y notificaciones debes informar al servicio del |"
"SdI| que envíe tus archivos a Odoo y que los procese en tu nombre. Para "
"ello, configura el :guilabel:`código de destino` de Odoo en el portal de la |"
"AdE|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:191
msgid ""
"Go to the `Italian authorities portal <https://"
"ivaservizi.agenziaentrate.gov.it/portale>`_ and authenticate."
msgstr ""
"Ve al `portal de las autoridades italianas <https://"
"ivaservizi.agenziaentrate.gov.it/portale>`_ e inicia sesión."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:193
msgid "Go to the :guilabel:`Fatture e Corrispettivi` section."
msgstr "Ve a la sección :guilabel:`Fatture e Corrispettivi`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:194
msgid ""
"Set the user as Legal Party for the VAT number you wish to configure the "
"electronic address."
msgstr ""
"Configura al usuario como representante legal del número de identificación "
"fiscal al que deseas asignar la dirección electrónica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:195
msgid ""
"In :menuselection:`Servizi Disponibili --> Fatturazione Elettronica --> "
"Registrazione dell’indirizzo telematico dove ricevere tutte le fatture "
"elettroniche`, insert Odoo's :guilabel:`Destination Code` `K95IV18`, and "
"confirm."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Servizi Disponibili --> Fatturazione Elettronica --> "
"Registrazione dell’indirizzo telematico dove ricevere tutte le fatture "
"elettroniche`, escriba el :guilabel:`Codice Destinatario` `K95IV18` de Odoo "
"y confirme."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:202
msgid "Demo and production modes"
msgstr "Modo de demostración y modo de producción"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:205
msgid ""
"Demo mode is enabled by default and remains active until the "
"option :guilabel:`By checking this box, I authorize Odoo to send and receive "
"my invoices through the Sistema di Interscambio (SDI)` is enabled in "
"the :guilabel:`Fattura Electronica (FatturaPA)` section. Once this option is "
"activated, production mode is enabled and cannot be disabled."
msgstr ""
"El modo de demostración está activo de forma predeterminada y permanece así "
"hasta que habilites la opción :guilabel:`Al marcar esta casilla, autorizo a "
"Odoo a enviar y recibir mis facturas a través del Sistema di Interscambio "
"(SDI)` en la sección :guilabel:`Fattura Electronica (FatturaPA)`. Una vez "
"que activas esta opción, el modo de producción queda habilitado y ya no "
"podrás desactivarlo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:209
msgid ""
"Demo mode simulates an environment in which invoices are sent to the "
"government. In this mode, invoices must be *manually* downloaded as XML "
"files and uploaded to the |AdE|'s website."
msgstr ""
"El modo de demostración simula un entorno en el que ocurre el envío de "
"facturas al gobierno. En este modo es necesario que descargues los archivos "
"XML *de forma manual* y los subas al sitio web de la |AdE|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:212
msgid ""
"Since files are transmitted through Odoo's server before being sent to the |"
"SdI| or received by your database, authorization is required for Odoo to "
"process them. To activate production mode and enable transmission to the |"
"SdI|, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"Como Odoo transmite los archivos a través de su servidor antes de enviarlos "
"al |SdI| o de recibirlos en tu base de datos, es necesario que autorices a "
"Odoo para que los procese. Sigue estos pasos para activar el modo de "
"producción y habilitar el envío al |SdI|:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:216
msgid ""
"Make sure the :guilabel:`Codice Fiscale` field is completed in "
"the :ref:`Company information <localizations/italy/company>`."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de completar el campo :guilabel:`Codice Fiscale` en "
"la :ref:`información de la empresa <localizations/italy/company>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:218
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings` and scroll "
"to the :guilabel:`Italian Electronic Invoicing` section."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Ajustes` y dirígete "
"a la sección :guilabel:`Facturación electrónica italiana`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:220
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Fattura Electronica (FatturaPA)` section, enable the "
"option :guilabel:`By checking this box, I authorize Odoo to send and receive "
"my invoices through the Sistema di Interscambio (SDI)`."
msgstr ""
"En la sección :guilabel:`Fattura Electronica (FatturaPA)`, habilita la "
"opción :guilabel:`Al marcar esta casilla, autorizo a Odoo a enviar y recibir "
"mis facturas a través del Sistema di Interscambio (SDI)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:228
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:655
msgid "Process"
msgstr "Procesar"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:230
msgid ""
"The submission of invoices to the |SdI| for Italy is an electronic process "
"used for the mandatory transmission of tax documents in XML format between "
"companies and the |AdE| to reduce errors and verify the correctness of "
"operations."
msgstr ""
"El envío de facturas al |SdI| en Italia es un proceso electrónico "
"obligatorio para compartir los documentos fiscales en formato XML entre "
"empresas y la |AdE|. Este proceso reduce errores y valida la corrección de "
"las operaciones."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:235
msgid ""
"You can check the current status of an invoice by the :guilabel:`SdI State` "
"field. The XML file is attached to the invoice."
msgstr ""
"Puede verificar el estado actual de una factura en el campo :guilabel:`SdI "
"State`. El archivo XML se adjunta a la factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:238
msgid "EDI system architecture"
msgstr "Arquitectura del sistema EDI"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:244
msgid "XML documents creation"
msgstr "Creación de documentos XML"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:246
msgid ""
"Odoo generates the required XML files as attachments to invoices in the "
"`FatturaPA` format required by the :abbr:`AdE (Agenzia delle Entrate)`. Once "
"the invoices needed are selected, click the :guilabel:`Send` button."
msgstr ""
"Odoo genera los archivos XML necesarios como archivos adjuntos de las "
"facturas en formato `FatturaPA`, tal como lo solicita la :abbr:`AdE (Agenzia "
"delle Entrate)`. Una vez que selecciones las facturas necesarias, haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Enviar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:250
msgid ""
"When the pop-up window opens there is a selection of actions that can be "
"taken. :guilabel:`Generate XML File` generates the attachments."
msgstr ""
"Cuando la ventana emergente se abre hay una selección de acciones que puede "
"realizar. :guilabel:`Generar archivo XML` genera los archivos adjuntos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:253
msgid ""
"The XML file as well as the PDF once can be found attached to the invoice."
msgstr ""
"Tanto el archivo XML como el PDF pueden encontrarse como archivos en la "
"factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:255
msgid "EDI Attachments"
msgstr "Archivos adjuntos EDI"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:258
msgid "After choosing the desired actions, click :guilabel:`Send`."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Enviar` después de elegir las acciones que quieres."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:263
msgid "Submission to SDI"
msgstr "Enviar a SDI"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:265
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Send to Tax Agency` option in the :guilabel:`Send and Print` "
"dialog sends the attachment to the :guilabel:`Proxy Server`, which gathers "
"all requests and then forwards them via a WebServices channel to the |SdI|. "
"Check the sending status of the invoice through the :guilabel:`Check "
"Sending` button at the top of the invoice's view."
msgstr ""
"La opción :guilabel:`Enviar a la agencia tributaria` en el "
"cuadro :guilabel:`Enviar e imprimir` envía el archivo adjunto "
"al :guilabel:`servidor proxy`, que recopila todas las solicitudes y luego "
"las transmite al |SdI| mediante WebServices. Revisa el estado de envío con "
"el botón :guilabel:`Verificar envío` que se encuentra en la parte superior "
"de la factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:273
msgid "Processing by SDI"
msgstr "Procesamiento con SDI"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:275
msgid ""
"The |SdI| receives the document and verifies for any errors. At this stage, "
"the invoice is in the :guilabel:`SdI Processing` state, as shown on the "
"invoice. The invoice also gets assigned a :guilabel:`FatturaPA Transaction` "
"number that is shown in the :guilabel:`Electronic Invoicing` tab. The checks "
"may take variable time, ranging from a few seconds up to a day, depending on "
"the queue of invoices sent throughout Italy."
msgstr ""
"El |SdI| recibe el documento y verifica si existen errores. En esta etapa, "
"la factura está en el estado :guilabel:`En proceso en SdI` y esto también "
"aparece en ella. Además, recibe un número de :guilabel:`Transacción "
"FatturaPA` que podrás visualizar en la pestaña :guilabel:`Facturación "
"electrónica`. El proceso puede tardar desde unos segundos hasta un día, "
"según la cantidad de facturas enviadas en Italia."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:281
msgid "Check Sending button and Sdi Processing state"
msgstr "Botón para enviar cheques y el estado de procesamiento de Sdi"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:287
msgid "Acceptance"
msgstr "Aceptación"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:289
msgid ""
"If the document is valid, it is recorded and considered fiscally valid by "
"the |AdE|, which will proceed with archiving in :guilabel:`Substitute "
"Storage (Conservazione Sostitutiva)` if explicitly requested on the Agency's "
"portal."
msgstr ""
"Si el documento es válido, la |AdE| lo registra y lo considera fiscalmente "
"válido. Luego procede con el archivo en :guilabel:`conservación sustitutiva "
"(Conservazione Sostitutiva)` si lo solicitaste de forma expresa en el portal "
"de la agencia."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:294
msgid ""
"Odoo does not offer the `Conservazione Sostitutiva <https://www.agid.gov.it/"
"index.php/it/piattaforme/conservazione>`_ requirements. Other providers and |"
"AdE| supply free and certified storage to meet the specifications requested "
"by law."
msgstr ""
"Odoo no ofrece el servicio de `conservación sustitutiva <https://"
"www.agid.gov.it/index.php/it/piattaforme/conservazione>`_. Otros proveedores "
"y la |AdE| ofrecen almacenamiento gratuito y certificado que cumple con los "
"requisitos legales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:299
msgid ""
"The |SdI| :guilabel:`Destination Code` attempts to forward the invoice to "
"the customer at the provided address, whether it is a `PEC` email address or "
"a |SdI| :guilabel:`Destination Code` for their ERP's WebServices channels. A "
"maximum of 6 attempts are made every 12 hours, so even if unsuccessful, this "
"process can take up to three days. The invoice status is :guilabel:`Accepted "
"by SDI, Forwarding to Partner`."
msgstr ""
"El :guilabel:`código de destino` del |SdI| intenta reenviar la factura al "
"cliente en la dirección proporcionada, ya sea un correo `PEC` o "
"un :guilabel:`código de destino` del |SdI| para los canales WebServices de "
"su ERP. El sistema realiza hasta 6 intentos cada 12 horas, por lo que el "
"proceso puede tardar hasta tres días. En este caso, la factura muestra el "
"estado :guilabel:`Aceptada por el SDI, en envío al cliente`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:308
msgid "Possible rejection"
msgstr "Posible rechazo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:310
msgid ""
"The |SdI| may find inaccuracies in the compilation, possibly even formal "
"ones. In this case, the invoice is in the :guilabel:`SDI Rejected` state. "
"The |SdI|'s observations are inserted at the top of the Invoice tab. To "
"resolve the issue, it is sufficient to delete the attachments of the "
"invoice, return the invoice to :guilabel:`Draft`, and fix the errors. Once "
"the invoice is ready, it can be resent."
msgstr ""
"El |SdI| puede detectar errores en la información, incluso formales. En este "
"caso, la factura muestra el estado :guilabel:`Rechazada por SDI`. El sistema "
"muestra las observaciones del |SdI| en la parte superior de la pestaña de la "
"factura. Para resolverlo, elimina los archivos adjuntos, cambia la factura "
"a :guilabel:`Borrador` y corrige los errores, después podrás volver a "
"enviarla."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:317
msgid ""
"To regenerate the XML, both the XML attachment and the PDF report must be "
"deleted, so that they are then regenerated together. This ensures that both "
"always contain the same data."
msgstr ""
"Para volver a generar el XML, es necesario eliminar el XML adjunto y el "
"reporte PDF para que estos se vuelvan a generar juntos. Esto garantiza que "
"ambos contengan siempre la misma información."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:320
msgid "EDI Rejected State"
msgstr "Estado de rechazo EDI"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:326
msgid "Forwarding completed"
msgstr "Envío completo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:328
msgid ""
"The invoice has been delivered to the customer; however, you can still send "
"a copy to the customer in PDF via email or post. Its status "
"is :guilabel:`Accepted by SDI, Delivered to Partner`."
msgstr ""
"La factura se le entregó al cliente, sin embargo, todavía puede enviar una "
"copia al cliente en PDF por correo electrónico o postal. Este estado "
"es :guilabel:`Aceptado por SDI, entregado al cliente`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:331
msgid ""
"If the |SdI| cannot contact your customer, they may not be registered on the "
"|AdE| portal. In this case, just make sure to send the invoice in PDF via "
"email or by mail. The invoice is then in the :guilabel:`Accepted by SDI, "
"Partner Delivery Failed` state."
msgstr ""
"Si el |SdI| no logra contactar a tu cliente, es posible que no esté "
"registrado en el portal de la |AdE|. En este caso, envía la factura en PDF "
"por correo electrónico o postal. La factura muestra el "
"estado :guilabel:`Aceptada por SDI, entrega fallida al cliente`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:338
msgid "Tax integration"
msgstr "Integración de impuestos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:340
msgid ""
"When you receive a vendor bill, either from |SdI|, from paper or from an "
"imported XML file, the Tax Agency might request that you send some tax "
"information integration back to the |SdI|. It happens when a transaction "
"that was tax exempt becomes taxable for any reason."
msgstr ""
"Cuando recibes una factura de proveedor, ya sea desde el |SdI|, en papel o "
"mediante un archivo XML importado, la agencia tributaria puede pedirte que "
"envíes una integración de información fiscal al |SdI|. Esto ocurre cuando "
"una operación exenta, por algún motivo, pasa a estar sujeta a impuestos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:345
msgid "For a vendor bill to be uploaded correctly:"
msgstr "Para subir una factura de proveedor de forma correcta:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:347
msgid ""
"The contact in the XML file must have a corresponding :doc:`contact record "
"<../../essentials/contacts>` in Odoo with matching:"
msgstr ""
"El contacto del archivo XML debe tener un :doc:`registro de contacto <../../"
"essentials/contacts>` correspondiente en Odoo con información coincidente:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:350
msgid ":guilabel:`VAT` number"
msgstr "Número de :guilabel:`identificación fiscal`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:351
msgid ":guilabel:`Codice Fiscale`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Codice Fiscale`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:353
msgid ""
"The taxes in the XML file must have corresponding :ref:`tax records "
"<localizations/italy/taxes>` in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Los impuestos del archivo XML deben tener :ref:`registros de impuestos "
"<localizations/italy/taxes>` correspondientes en Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:357
msgid "Here is a non-exhaustive list:"
msgstr "Aquí tiene una lista no exhaustiva:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:0
msgid ":ref:`localizations/italy/reverse-charge`"
msgstr ":ref:`localizations/italy/reverse-charge`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:0
msgid ""
"As a buyer, you have to pay taxes on what you buy and integrate tax "
"information. :guilabel:`Reverse Charge` taxes."
msgstr ""
"Como comprador, debe pagar impuestos sobre lo que compra e integrar la "
"información fiscal. Impuestos de :guilabel:`revertir cargo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:0
msgid ":ref:`localizations/italy/split-payment`"
msgstr ":ref:`localizations/italy/split-payment`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:0
msgid ""
"As a |PA| business buyer, you have to pay taxes and integrate tax "
"information. Be sure that you replace the :guilabel:`0% Sale Taxes` on the "
"vendor bill you received with the correct :guilabel:`Split Payment` taxes."
msgstr ""
"Como comprador de una empresa de administración pública, es necesario que "
"pagues tus impuestos e integres la información fiscal. Reemplaza "
"los :guilabel:`impuestos de venta al 0%` en la factura de proveedor que "
"recibiste con los :guilabel:`pagos divididos` correctos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Self Consumption`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Consumo propio`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:0
msgid ""
"When, as a business owner, you use an asset that you bought for business for "
"personal reasons instead, you have to pay those taxes you originally "
"deducted as a business cost for it."
msgstr ""
"Como dueño de una empresa si usa un activo que compró para motivos "
"personales y no de negocio, debe pagar esos impuestos que había deducido "
"como costo empresarial."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:370
msgid ""
"Odoo may detect that your vendor bill can be interpreted as a document of a "
"type that needs tax integration, as detailed in the :ref:`localizations/"
"italy/document-types` section."
msgstr ""
"Odoo puede detectar que tu factura de proveedor corresponde a un tipo de "
"documento que requiere integración fiscal, como se detalla en la "
"sección :ref:`localizations/italy/document-types`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:374
msgid ""
"Be sure that you replace the :guilabel:`0% Sale Taxes` on the vendor bill "
"you received with the ones you're supposed to pay to the |AdE|. A button "
"then appears on the top of the single vendor bill form to send them."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de reemplazar los :guilabel:`impuestos de venta al 0%` en la "
"factura de proveedor que recibiste por los impuestos que debes pagar a la |"
"AdE|. Después de eso aparecerá un botón en la parte superior del formulario "
"de la factura de proveedor para enviarla."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:378
msgid ""
"When clicking on the :guilabel:`Send Tax Integration` button, an XML file of "
"the appropriate :guilabel:`Document Type` is generated, attached to the "
"bill, and sent as for invoices."
msgstr ""
"Al hacer clic en el botón :guilabel:`Enviar integración fiscal`, se generará "
"un archivo XML con el :guilabel:`Tipo de documento` adecuado se genera, se "
"adjunta a la factura y se envía a facturas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:381
msgid "EDI Send Tax Integration button"
msgstr "Botón de enviar integración fiscal EDI"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:389
msgid ""
"The |SdI| requires businesses to send customer invoices and other documents "
"through the :abbr:`EDI (Electronic Data Interchange)`."
msgstr ""
"El |SdI| exige que las empresas envíen las facturas de clientes y otros "
"documentos a través del :abbr:`EDI (Intercambio electrónico de datos)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:392
msgid ""
"The following :guilabel:`Document Type` codes all technically identify "
"different business use cases."
msgstr ""
"Los siguientes códigos de :guilabel:`Tipos de documentos` identifican "
"diferentes usos de caso empresariales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:397
msgid "TD01 - invoices"
msgstr "TD01 - Facturas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:399
msgid ""
"This represents the standard **domestic** scenario for all invoices "
"exchanged through the |SdI|. Any invoice that doesn't fall into one of the "
"specific special cases is categorized as a regular invoice, identified by "
"the :guilabel:`Document Type` `TD01`."
msgstr ""
"Este representa el caso estándar **nacional** para todas las facturas que se "
"intercambian a través del |SdI|. Cualquier factura que no esté en uno de los "
"casos especiales será clasificada como una factura regular, identificada por "
"el :guilabel:`tipo de documento` `TD01`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:406
msgid "TD02 - down payments"
msgstr "TD02 - Anticipos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:408
msgid ""
"**Down payment** invoices are imported/exported with a "
"different :guilabel:`Document Type` code `TDO2` than regular invoices. Upon "
"import of the invoice, a regular vendor bill is created."
msgstr ""
"Las facturas de **anticipo** se importan y exportan con un código `TDO2` "
"de :guilabel:`tipo de documento` distinto a las facturas regulares. Al "
"importar la factura se crea una factura de proveedor regular."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:411
msgid ""
"Odoo exports transactions as `TD02` if the following conditions are met:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo exporta las transacciones como `TD18` si se cumplen las siguientes "
"condiciones: "

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:413
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:553
msgid "It is an invoice."
msgstr "Es una factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:414
msgid "All invoice lines are related to down payment sales order lines."
msgstr ""
"Todas las líneas de la factura están relacionadas con las líneas de la orden "
"de venta del anticipo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:419
msgid "TD04 - credit notes"
msgstr "TD04 - Notas de crédito"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:421
msgid ""
"It is the standard scenario for all **credit notes** issued to **domestic** "
"clients, when we need to formally acknowledge that the seller is reducing or "
"cancelling a previously issued invoice, for example, in case of overbilling, "
"incorrect items, or overpayment. Just like invoices, they must be sent to "
"the |SdI|, their :guilabel:`Document Type` `TD04`"
msgstr ""
"Este es el caso estándar para todas las **notas de crédito** emitidas a "
"clientes **nacionales** cuando es necesario reconocer de manera oficial que "
"el vendedor reduce o cancela una factura emitida con anterioridad, por "
"ejemplo, en caso de sobrefacturación, artículos incorrectos o pago en "
"exceso. Al igual que las facturas, es necesario enviarlas al |SdI| con "
"el :guilabel:`tipo de documento` `TD04`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:429
msgid "TD07, TD08, TD09 - simplified invoicing"
msgstr "TD07, TD08, TD09 - Facturación simplificada"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:431
msgid ""
"Simplified invoices (`TD07`), credit notes (`TD08`), and debit notes "
"(`TD09`) can be used to certify domestic transactions under 400 EUR (VAT "
"included). Its status is the same as that of a regular invoice, but with "
"fewer information requirements."
msgstr ""
"Las facturas simplificadas(`TD07`), las notas de crédito (`TD08`) y las "
"notas de débito (`TD09`) se pueden utilizar para certificar **transacciones "
"nacionales** menores a 400 euros (IVA incluido). Su estado es el mismo que "
"el de una factura normal, pero con menos requisitos de información."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:435
msgid "For a simplified invoice to be established, it must include:"
msgstr ""
"Para establecer una factura simplificada, debe incluir los siguientes datos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:437
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Customer Invoice` reference: **unique** numbering sequence with "
"**no gaps**."
msgstr ""
"Referencia de la :guilabel:`factura del cliente`: Una secuencia de "
"numeración **única y sin espacios**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:438
msgid ":guilabel:`Invoice Date`: issue **date** of the invoice."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Fecha de la factura`: La **fecha** de emisión de la factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:439
msgid ""
":ref:`Company Info <general/companies/company>`: the **seller**'s full "
"credentials (VAT/TIN number, name, full address)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Información de la empresa <general/companies/company>`: Los datos "
"completos del **vendedor** (número de identificación fiscal, nombre, "
"dirección completa)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:441
msgid ":guilabel:`VAT`: the **buyer**'s VAT/TIN number (on the partner form)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`NIF`: El NIF/TIN del **comprador** (en el formulario del "
"contacto)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:442
msgid ":guilabel:`Total`: the total **amount** (VAT included) of the invoice."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Total`: el **importe** total (con IVA incluido) de la factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:444
msgid ""
"In the :abbr:`EDI (Electronic Data Interchange)`, Odoo exports invoices as "
"simplified if:"
msgstr ""
"In the :abbr:`EDI (Intercambio electrónico de datos)`, Odoo exporta facturas "
"de forma simplificada si:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:446
msgid "It is a domestic transaction (i.e., the partner is from Italy)."
msgstr "Es una transacción nacional (es decir, el contacto es de Italia)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:447
msgid ""
"Your company's **required fields** (:guilabel:`VAT Number` "
"or :guilabel:`Codice Fiscale`, :guilabel:`Fiscal Regime`, and full "
"**address**) are provided."
msgstr ""
"Completas los **campos obligatorios** de tu empresa (:guilabel:`Número de "
"identificación fiscal` o :guilabel:`Codice Fiscale`, :guilabel:`Régimen "
"fiscal` y **dirección** completa)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:449
msgid ""
"The partner's address is not fully specified (i.e., it misses the City or "
"the ZipCode)."
msgstr ""
"La dirección del contacto no está completa (por ejemplo, falta la ciudad o "
"el código postal)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:450
msgid "The total amount of VAT included is **less** than **400 EUR**."
msgstr "El importe total de IVA incluido es **menos** que **400 EUR**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:453
msgid ""
"The 400 EUR threshold was defined in `the decree of the 10th of May 2019 in "
"the Gazzetta Ufficiale <https://www.gazzettaufficiale.it/eli/id/"
"2019/05/24/19A03271/sg>`_. We advise you to check the current official value."
msgstr ""
"El límite de 400 euros se definió en `el decreto del 10 de mayo de 2019 de "
"la Gazzetta Ufficiale <https://www.gazzettaufficiale.it/eli/id/"
"2019/05/24/19A03271/sg>`_. Recomendamos que verifique el valor oficial "
"actual."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:460
msgid "TD16 - internal reverse charge"
msgstr "TD16 - Cargo revertido interno"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:462
msgid ""
"Internal **reverse charge** transactions (see :ref:`localizations/italy/tax-"
"exemption` and :ref:`localizations/italy/reverse-charge`) are exported as "
"`TD16` if the following conditions are met:"
msgstr ""
"Las transacciones internas con **inversión del sujeto pasivo** "
"(consulta :ref:`localizations/italy/tax-exemption` y :ref:`localizations/"
"italy/reverse-charge`) se exportan como `TD16` si se cumplen las siguientes "
"condiciones:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:466
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:485
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:501
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:522
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:588
msgid "It is a vendor bill."
msgstr "Es una factura de proveedor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:467
msgid ""
"It has at least **one tax** on the invoice lines that targets one of "
"these :ref:`tax grids <localizations/italy/grids>`: `VJ6`, `VJ7`, `VJ8`, "
"`VJ12`, `VJ13`, `VJ14`, `VJ15`, `VJ16`, `VJ17`"
msgstr ""
"Tienen al menos **un impuesto** en las líneas de la factura que apunta a una "
"de estas :ref:`tablas fiscales <localizations/italy/grids>`: `VJ6`, `VJ7`, "
"`VJ8`, `VJ12`, `VJ13`, `VJ14`, `VJ15`, `VJ16`, `VJ17`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:473
msgid "TD17 - buying services from abroad"
msgstr "TD17 - Compra de servicios extranjeros"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:475
msgid ""
"When buying **services** from **EU** and **non-EU** countries, the foreign "
"*seller* invoices a service with a **VAT-excluded** price, as it is not "
"taxable in Italy. The VAT is paid by the *buyer* in Italy."
msgstr ""
"Al comprar **servicios** de países de la **Unión Europea** y **fuera de la "
"Unión Europea**, el *vendedor* extranjero factura un servicio con un precio "
"**sin IVA** ya que no es imponible en el país. El IVA lo paga el *comprador* "
"en Italia."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:479
msgid ""
"Within the EU: the *buyer* integrates the invoice received with the **VAT "
"information** due in Italy (i.e., **vendor bill tax integration**)."
msgstr ""
"Dentro de la UE: El *comprador* integra la factura recibida con la "
"**información de IVA** que corresponde en Italia (es decir, **integración de "
"impuestos en la factura de proveedor**)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:481
msgid ""
