#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:531
msgid "TD24 - deferred invoices"
msgstr "TD24 - Facturas diferidas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:533
msgid ""
"The **deferred invoice** is an invoice that is **issued at a later time** "
"than the sale of goods or the provision of services. A **deferred invoice** "
"has to be issued at the latest within the **15th day** of the month "
"following the delivery covered by the document."
msgstr ""
"La **factura diferida** es una factura **emitida después** de la venta de "
"bienes o la prestación de servicios. Una **factura diferida** deberá "
"emitirse a más tardar el **quinceavo día** del mes siguiente a la entrega "
"cubierta por el documento."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:537
msgid ""
"It usually is a **summary invoice** containing a list of multiple sales of "
"goods or services carried out in the month. The business is allowed to "
"**group** the sales into **one invoice**, generally issued at the **end of "
"the month** for accounting purposes. Deferred invoices are default for "
"**wholesalers** having recurrent clients."
msgstr ""
"Suele ser una **factura recapitulativa** que incluye una lista de varias "
"ventas de bienes o servicios realizadas en el mes. La empresa puede "
"**agrupar** las ventas en **una factura** y por lo general se emite al "
"**final del mes** a efectos contables. Las facturas diferidas son, de forma "
"predeterminada, para el **distribuidor** que tiene clientes recurrentes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:542
msgid ""
"If the goods are transported by a **carrier**, every delivery has an "
"associated **Documento di Transporto (DDT)**, or **Transport Document**. The "
"deferred invoice **must** indicate the details of all the **DDTs** "
"information for better tracing."
msgstr ""
"Si un **transportista** se encarga del traslado de los bienes, cada entrega "
"tiene un **Documento di Transporto (DDT)** o **documento de transporte**. La "
"factura diferida **debe** indicar los detalles de toda la información del "
"**DDT** para tener un mejor seguimiento."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:547
msgid ""
"E-invoicing of deferred invoices requires the "
"`l10n_it_stock_ddt` :ref:`module <localizations/italy/modules>`. In this "
"case, a dedicated :guilabel:`Document Type` `TD24` is used in the e-invoice."
msgstr ""
"La facturación electrónica de facturas diferidas requiere el :ref:`módulo "
"<localizations/italy/modules>` `l10n_it_stock_ddt`. En este caso se usa "
"un :guilabel:`tipo de documento` específico `TD24` en la factura electrónica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:551
msgid ""
"Odoo exports transactions as `TD24` if the following conditions are met:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo exporta las transacciones como `TD24` si se cumplen las siguientes "
"condiciones: "

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:554
msgid ""
"It is associated with deliveries whose **DDTs** have a **different** date "
"than the issue date of the invoice."
msgstr ""
"Está asociada a entregas cuyos **DDT** tienen una fecha **distinta** a la "
"fecha de emisión de la factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:560
msgid "TD28 - San Marino"
msgstr "TD28 - San Marino"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:567
msgid ""
"San Marino and Italy have special agreements on e-invoicing operations. As "
"such, **invoices** follow the regular **reverse charge** rules. You can use "
"the proper :guilabel:`Document Type` depending on the invoice type: `TD01`, "
"`TD04`, `TD05`, `TD24`, `TD25`. Additional requirements are not enforced by "
"Odoo. However, the user is requested by the **State** to:"
msgstr ""
"San Marino e Italia tienen acuerdos especiales con respecto a las "
"operaciones de facturación electrónica. Las **facturas** siguen las reglas "
"habituales de **cobro revertido**. Puede usar el :guilabel:`Tipo de "
"documento` dependiendo del tipo de factura: `TD01`, `TD04`, `TD05`, `TD24`, "
"`TD25`. Odoo no aplica los requisitos adicionales, sin embargo, el "
"**Estado** le pide al usuario que:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:572
msgid "Select a tax with the :guilabel:`Tax Exemption Kind` set to `N3.3`."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona un impuesto con el :guilabel:`tipo de exención fiscal` "
"configurado con la opción `N3.3`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:573
msgid "Use the generic |SdI| :guilabel:`Destination Code` `2R4GTO8`."
msgstr ""
"Usa el :guilabel:`código de destino` genérico del |SdI|, que es `2R4GTO8`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:575
msgid ""
"The invoice is then routed by a dedicated office in San Marino to the "
"correct business."
msgstr ""
"A continuación, una oficina especializada de San Marino envía la factura a "
"la empresa correspondiente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:582
msgid ""
"When a **paper bill** is received from San Marino, any Italian company "
"**must** submit that invoice to the |AdE| by indicating the e-"
"invoice's :guilabel:`Document Type` field with the special value `TD28`."
msgstr ""
"Al recibir una **factura física** de San Marino, cualquier empresa italiana "
"**debe** enviar esa factura a la |AdE| e indicar el valor especial `TD28` en "
"el campo :guilabel:`Tipo de documento` de la factura electrónica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:586
msgid ""
"Odoo exports a transaction as `TD28` if the following conditions are met:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo exporta la transacción como `TD28` si se cumplen las siguientes "
"condiciones: "

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:589
msgid ""
"It has at least one tax on the invoice lines that targets the tax "
"grids :ref:`VJ <localizations/italy/grids>`."
msgstr ""
"Tienen al menos un impuesto en las líneas de la factura que apunta a las "
"tablas fiscales :ref:`VJ <localizations/italy/grids>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:591
msgid "The **country** of the partner is **San Marino**."
msgstr "El **país** del contacto es **San Marino**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:596
msgid "Public administration businesses (B2G)"
msgstr "Empresas de administración pública (B2G)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:598
msgid ""
"|PA| businesses are subjected to more control than private businesses as "
"they handle public money coming from taxpayers. The :abbr:`EDI (Electronic "
"Data Interchange)` process adds some steps to the :ref:`regular one "
"<localizations/italy/e-invoicing-process>`, as |PA| businesses can "
"**accept** or **refuse** invoices."
msgstr ""
"Las empresas de administración pública están sujetas a más controles que las "
"empresas privadas porque gestionan fondos públicos que provienen de los "
"contribuyentes. El proceso de :abbr:`EDI (Intercambio electrónico de datos)` "
"agrega pasos al :ref:`proceso regular <localizations/italy/e-invoicing-"
"process>`, ya que las empresas de administración pública pueden **aceptar** "
"o **rechazar** las facturas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:604
msgid ""
"|PA| businesses have a 6-digit long :guilabel:`Destination Code`, also "
"called :abbr:`CUU (Codice Univoco Ufficio)`, that is **mandatory**, **PEC** "
"address cannot be used in this case."
msgstr ""
"Las empresas de administración pública cuentan con un :guilabel:`código de "
"destino` de 6 dígitos, también llamado :abbr:`CUU (Codice Univoco Ufficio)`, "
"que es **obligatorio**. En este caso no es posible usar la dirección **PEC**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:608
msgid ""
"`Complete list of businesses that belong to the Public Administration along "
"with their Destination Code <https://www.agenziaentrate.gov.it/portale/web/"
"guest/aree-tematiche/fatturazione-elettronica>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Lista completa de empresas que perteneces a la administración pública junto "
"con su Código Destino <https://www.agenziaentrate.gov.it/portale/web/guest/"
"aree-tematiche/fatturazione-elettronica>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:614
msgid "CIG, CUP, DatiOrdineAcquisto"
msgstr "CIG, CUP, DatiOrdineAcquisto"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:616
msgid ""
"To ensure the effective traceability of payments by public administrations, "
"electronic invoices issued to public administrations must contain:"
msgstr ""
"Para garantizar el seguimiento correcto de los pagos de las administraciones "
"públicas, las facturas electrónicas que se les expiden deben contener:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:619
msgid ""
"The :abbr:`CIG (Codice Identificativo Gara)`, except in cases of exclusion "
"from traceability obligations provided by law n. 136 of August 13, 2010."
msgstr ""
"El :abbr:`CIG (Codice Identificativo Gara)`, excepto en los casos de "
"exclusión de las obligaciones de seguimiento establecidas por la ley número "
"136 del 13 de agosto de 2010."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:621
msgid ""
"The :abbr:`CUP (Codice Unico di Progetto)`, in case of invoices related to "
"public works."
msgstr ""
"El :abbr:`CUP (Codice Unico di Progetto)` en el caso de las facturas "
"relacionadas con obras públicas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:623
msgid ""
"If the XML file requires it, the |AdE| can *only* proceed payments of "
"electronic invoices when the XML file contains a :abbr:`CIG (Codice "
"Identificativo Gara)` and :abbr:`CUP (Codice Unico di Progetto)`."
msgstr ""
"Si el archivo XML lo requiere, la |AdE| *solo* puede procesar el pago de "
"facturas electrónicas cuando el archivo XML incluye un :abbr:`CIG (Codice "
"Identificativo Gara)` y un :abbr:`CUP (Codice Unico di Progetto)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:628
msgid ""
"The :abbr:`CUP (Codice Unico di Progetto)` and the :abbr:`CIG (Codice "
"Identificativo Gara)` must be included in one of the `DatiOrdineAcquisto`, "
"`DatiContratto`, `DatiConvenzione`, `DateRicezione`, or "
"`DatiFattureCollegate` XML tags."
msgstr ""
"El :abbr:`CUP (Codice Unico di Progetto)` y el :abbr:`CIG (Codice "
"Identificativo Gara)` deben incluirse en una de las etiquetas XML "
"`PurchaseOrderData`, `ContractData`, `ConventionData`, `ReceiptDate` o "
"`InvoiceData`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:632
msgid ""
"These correspond to the elements named :guilabel:`CodiceCUP` "
"and :guilabel:`CodiceCIG` of the electronic invoice XML file, whose table "
"can be found on the government `website <http://www.fatturapa.gov.it/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Estos corresponden a elementos llamados :guilabel:`CodiceCUP` "
"y :guilabel:`CodiceCIG` del archivo XML de la factura electrónica, cuya "
"tabla se puede encontrar en el `sitio web <http://www.fatturapa.gov.it/>`_ "
"del gobierno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:639
msgid "Split payment"
msgstr "Pago dividido"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:641
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Split Payment` mechanism behaves much "
"like :ref:`localizations/italy/reverse-charge`."
msgstr ""
"El mecanismo de :guilabel:`pago dividido` funciona de forma similar "
"al :ref:`localizations/italy/reverse-charge`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:644
msgid ""
"When an Italian company bills a |PA| business - for example, cleaning "
"services for a public building - the |PA| business self-reports the VAT to "
"the Tax Agency themselves, and the vendor just has to select the appropriate "
"tax with the right :guilabel:`Tax Exemption` for their invoice lines."
msgstr ""
"Cuando una empresa italiana factura a una empresa de administración pública "
"(por ejemplo, servicios de limpieza para un edificio público), la empresa de "
"administración pública deberá declarar el IVA ante la agencia tributaria por "
"su cuenta, y el proveedor solo debe seleccionar el impuesto adecuado con "
"la :guilabel:`exención de impuesto` correcta en las líneas de la factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:649
msgid ""
"The specific :guilabel:`Scissione dei Pagamenti` fiscal position is "
"available to deal with partners belonging to the |PA|."
msgstr ""
"La posición fiscal específica :guilabel:`Scissione dei Pagamenti` está "
"disponible para que puedas gestionar los contactos que pertenecen a la "
"administración pública."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:660
msgid "Qualified electronic signature"
msgstr "Firma electrónica calificada"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:662
msgid ""
"Invoices and bills intended for the |PA| must include a **qualified "
"electronic signature** when submitted through the |SdI|. This signature is "
"automatically applied in the :abbr:`XAdES (XML Advanced Electronic "
"Signature)` format when the invoice's partner has a 6-digit "
"long :guilabel:`Destination Code` (which indicates a |PA| business)."
msgstr ""
"Las facturas y facturas de proveedor destinadas a la administración pública "
"deben incluir una **firma electrónica calificada** cuando las envías a "
"través del |SdI|. El sistema aplica esta firma en formato :abbr:`XAdES "
"(Firma electrónica avanzada XML)` de forma automática cuando el contacto de "
"la factura tiene un :guilabel:`código de destino` de 6 dígitos (lo que "
"indica que pertenece a una empresa de administración pública)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:668
msgid ""
"When such an invoice is transmitted to the Tax Agency, the generated `.xml` "
"file is signed on the Odoo servers, returned to the database, and attached "
"to the invoice automatically."
msgstr ""
"Al enviar una factura así a la Agencia Tributaria, el archivo `.xml` "
"generado se firma en los servidores de Odoo, se devuelve a la base de datos "
"y se adjunta en automático a la factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:674
msgid "Acceptance or refusal"
msgstr "Aceptación o rechazo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:676
msgid ""
"After receiving the invoice through the |SdI|, the |PA| business has 15 days "
"to accept the invoice. If it does, then the process ends here. If the |PA| "
"business refuses the invoice, it is still considered valid once it is "
"accepted by the |SdI|. You then have to issue a credit note to compensate "
"and send it to the |SdI|."
msgstr ""
"Después de recibir la factura a través del |SdI|, la empresa de "
"administración pública tiene 15 días para aceptarla y, de hacerlo, el "
"proceso finaliza aquí. Por el contrario, si la rechaza, la factura sigue "
"siendo válida una vez que el |SdI| la acepta. Luego es necesario emitir una "
"nota de crédito para compensar y enviarla al |SdI|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:684
msgid "Expired terms"
msgstr "Plazos vencidos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:686
msgid ""
"If the |PA| business doesn't reply within 15 days, you need to contact the |"
"PA| business directly, sending them both the invoice and the received "
"deadline notification by email. You can make an arrangement with them and "
"manually set the correct :guilabel:`SdI State` on your invoice."
msgstr ""
"Si la empresa de administración pública no responde dentro de un plazo de 15 "
"días, entonces debes contactarla de forma directa y enviarle por correo "
"electrónico tanto la factura como la notificación de vencimiento. Pueden "
"llegar a un acuerdo para establecer el :guilabel:`estado del SdI` correcto "
"en tu factura de forma manual."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:693
msgid "Point of sale fiscal printers"
msgstr "Impresoras fiscales del punto de venta"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:696
msgid ""
"Fiscal printers are distinct from :doc:`ePOS printers </applications/sales/"
"point_of_sale/hardware_network/receipt_printers>`. The IP address for a "
"fiscal printer should not be entered in the ePOS IP address settings."
msgstr ""
"Las impresoras fiscales son distintas de las :doc:`impresoras ePOS </"
"applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/receipt_printers>`. No "
"escribas la dirección IP de una impresora fiscal en los ajustes de la "
"dirección IP de ePOS."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:700
msgid ""
"Fiscal regulations mandate using certified RT devices, such as RT printers "
"or RT servers, to ensure compliant sales receipts and secure communication "
"with the Tax Authority. These devices automatically transmit fiscal data "
"daily. RT printers, designed for individual POS terminals, handle "
"transactions, print receipts, and report to the authorities, ensuring data "
"integrity and compliance."
msgstr ""
"Las regulaciones fiscales exigen el uso de dispositivos RT certificados, "
"como impresoras RT o servidores RT, para garantizar que los recibos de venta "
"cumplan con las normas establecidas y que la comunicación con la Agenzia "
"delle Entrate sea segura. Estos dispositivos envían los datos fiscales a "
"diario de manera automática. Las impresoras RT están diseñadas para las "
"terminales de punto de venta y se encargan de gestionar las transacciones, "
"imprimir los recibos y reportar a las autoridades con la finalidad de "
"asegurar la integridad de los datos y el cumplimiento normativo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:708
msgid "Simulation mode"
msgstr "Modo de prueba"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:711
msgid ""
"Since the simulation mode sends data to the authorities, it should only be "
"enabled at the very start of the printer's configuration process. Once the "
"printer is switched to the production mode, it cannot be reverted to the "
"simulation mode."
msgstr ""
