#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:737
msgid "Setting up the printer to work with Odoo"
msgstr "Configurar la impresora para que funcione con Odoo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:739
msgid ""
"Fiscal printers are meant to work only in the local network. This means the "
"printer and the device running :doc:`Odoo Point of Sale </applications/sales/"
"point_of_sale>` must be connected to the same network."
msgstr ""
"Las impresoras fiscales están diseñadas para funcionar solo en la red local. "
"Es decir, la impresora y el dispositivo con :doc:`Punto de venta </"
"applications/sales/point_of_sale>` deben estar conectados a la misma red."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:743
msgid ""
"Fiscal printers are typically configured to use HTTP by default. To ensure "
"compatibility with Odoo, the settings must be updated to enable HTTPS "
"support on the printer. This can be done using either the EpsonFPWizard "
"configuration software or the keyboard connected to the printer."
msgstr ""
"Por lo general, las impresoras fiscales están configuradas para usar HTTP de "
"forma predeterminada. Para garantizar la compatibilidad con Odoo, es "
"necesario que actualice los ajustes para habilitar la compatibilidad HTTPS "
"en la impresora, esto puede hacerlo con el software de configuración "
"EpsonFPWizard o con el teclado conectado a la impresora."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:747
msgid "To set up the fiscal printer using the keyboard, follow these steps:"
msgstr "Siga estos pasos para configurar la impresora fiscal con el teclado:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:753
msgid "Type `34`. The screen displays :guilabel:`Web Server`."
msgstr "Escriba `34`. En la pantalla aparecerá :guilabel:`Web Server`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:754
msgid ""
"Press :guilabel:`Contante` 3 times until the screen displays :guilabel:`Web "
"Server: SSL`."
msgstr ""
"Presione :guilabel:`Contante` 3 (tres) veces hasta que "
"aparezca :guilabel:`Web Server: SSL` en la pantalla."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:755
msgid "To turn the value `0` into a `1`, press :guilabel:`X`."
msgstr "Presione :guilabel:`X` para cambiar el `0` por un `1`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:756
msgid "To confirm, press :guilabel:`Contante` 3 times."
msgstr "Presione :guilabel:`Contante` 3 (tres) veces para confirmar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:759
msgid ""
"Then, log in to the printer with the device that runs :doc:`Odoo Point of "
"Sale </applications/sales/point_of_sale>` so it recognizes the printer's "
"certificate."
msgstr ""
"Inicie sesión en la impresora con el dispositivo que ejecuta :doc:`Punto de "
"venta </applications/sales/point_of_sale>` para que reconozca el certificado "
"de la impresora."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:762
msgid "To approve and install the printer's certificate, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"Siga estos pasos para aprobar e instalar el certificado de la impresora:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:764
msgid ""
"Access the printer by opening a web browser and entering `https://<ip-of-"
"your-printer>` in the address bar. A :guilabel:`Warning: Potential Security "
"Risk Ahead` security message appears."
msgstr ""
"Acceda a la impresora. Abra un navegador web y escriba `https://<ip-of-your-"
"printer>` en la barra de direcciones. Aparecerá el "
"mensaje :guilabel:`Advertencia: Riesgo potencial de seguridad`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:766
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Advanced` to show the certificate approval options."
msgstr ""
"Haga clic en :guilabel:`Avanzado` para visualizar las opciones de aprobación "
"del certificado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:767
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Proceed` to validate the certificate."
msgstr "Haga clic en :guilabel:`Continuar` para validar el certificado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:769
msgid ""
"Then, to ensure :doc:`Odoo Point of Sale </applications/sales/"
"point_of_sale>` is configured with the fiscal printer, go "
"to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Configuration --> Settings`. In "
"the :guilabel:`Connected Devices` section, add the IP address in "
"the :guilabel:`Italian Fiscal Printer IP address` and enable :guilabel:`Use "
"HTTPS`."
msgstr ""
"Para garantizar que la aplicación :doc:`Punto de venta</applications/sales/"
"point_of_sale>` está configurada con la impresora fiscal, vaya "
"a :menuselection:`Punto de venta --> Configuración --> Ajustes`. En la "
"sección :guilabel:`Dispositivos conectados` agregue la dirección IP en el "
"campo :guilabel:`Dirección IP de la impresora fiscal italiana` y seleccione "
"la opción :guilabel:`Usar HTTPS`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:777
msgid "Ri.Ba. (Ricevuta Bancaria)"
msgstr "Ri.Ba. (Ricevuta Bancaria)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:779
msgid ""
"|Ri.Ba.| is a payment method widely used in Italy where vendors request "
"payments through their bank, which forwards the request to the customer's "
"own bank and takes responsibility for the collection. This enables payment "
"automation and reduces risks for the vendor."
msgstr ""
"|Ri.Ba.| es un método de pago que se usa en Italia donde el proveedor "
"solicita el pago a través de su banco, que envía la solicitud al banco del "
"cliente y asume la responsabilidad del cobro. Esto permite automatizar el "
"pago y reducir riesgos para el proveedor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:783
msgid ""
"The vendor generally uploads a fixed-format text file with the list of "
"payments to the bank's web portal."
msgstr ""
"El proveedor suele cargar un archivo de texto en formato fijo con la lista "
"de pagos en el portal web del banco."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:787
msgid ""
"|Ri.Ba.| are exclusively for **domestic payments** in Italy. For recurring "
"international payments, please use `SEPA Direct Debt (SDD) <../accounting/"
"payments/batch_sdd>`_"
msgstr ""
"|Ri.Ba.| solo se usa para realizar **pagos nacionales** en Italia. Para los "
"pagos internacionales recurrentes deberás utilizar la `domiciliación "
"bancaria SEPA (SDD) <../accounting/payments/batch_sdd>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:795
msgid ""
"Check that the `l10n_it_riba` module is :ref:`installed <general/install>`."
msgstr ""
"Verifique que el módulo `l10n_it_riba` está :ref:`instalado <general/"
"install>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:796
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Users & Companies --> Companies` and "
"select the company that will use |Ri.Ba.|."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Ajustes --> Usuarios y empresas --> Empresas` y "
"selecciona la empresa que usará |Ri.Ba.|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:798
msgid "Fill out the required :guilabel:`SIA Code`."
msgstr "Complete el :guilabel:`código SIA` necesario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:800
msgid "The company's SIA code"
msgstr "El código SIA de la empresa"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:804
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`SIA Code` identifies businesses within the Italian banking "
"network and is used to receive money through specific payment methods. It "
"consists of one letter and four digits (e.g., T1234) and can usually be "
"found on the bank's portal or obtained by contacting the bank."
msgstr ""
"El :guilabel:`código SIA` identifica a las empresas dentro de la red "
"bancaria italiana y se utiliza para recibir dinero mediante métodos de pago "
"específicos. Consta de una letra y cuatro dígitos (por ejemplo, T1234) y por "
"lo general podrá encontrarlo en su portal bancario o puede comunicarse con "
"su banco para solicitarlo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:809
msgid "Ensure the Company's bank account has an Italian IBAN."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrese de que la cuenta bancaria de la empresa tiene un IBAN italiano."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:812
msgid "How to configure :doc:`Bank Accounts <../accounting/bank>`"
msgstr "Cómo configurar :doc:`cuentas bancarias <../accounting/bank>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:817
msgid "Accept Ri.Ba. for your invoices"
msgstr "Aceptar Ri.Ba. para sus facturas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:819
msgid ""
"Payments of type |Ri.Ba.| can be registered from the :guilabel:`Invoices` "
"(:menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Invoices`)."
msgstr ""
"Puedes registrar pagos de tipo |Ri.Ba.| desde :guilabel:`Facturas` "
"(:menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Clientes --> Facturas`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:823
msgid ""
"Make sure that your invoice involves a Partner that has a bank account with "
"an Italian IBAN."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrese de que su factura sea de un contacto que tiene una cuenta bancaria "
"con un IBAN italiano."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:825
msgid "Then, all Payments must be grouped in a **Batch Payment**."
msgstr "Después, agrupe todos los pagos en un **pago por lotes**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:828
msgid ":doc:`Batch Payments <../accounting/payments>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Pagos por lote <../accounting/payments>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:829
msgid ":doc:`Create a Batch Payment <../accounting/payments/batch>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Crear un pago por lote <../accounting/payments/batch>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:831
msgid ""
"Once you press the :guilabel:`Validate` button for the Batch Payment, the |"
"Ri.Ba.| file is generated and attached to the Batch Payment, so you can "
"download it and upload it through your bank's web portal."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que presiones el botón :guilabel:`Validar` en el pago por lotes, el "
"sistema generará el archivo |Ri.Ba.| y lo adjuntará al pago por lotes para "
"que puedas descargarlo y subirlo a través del portal web de tu banco."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:835
msgid "The Ri.Ba. file attached"
msgstr "El archivo Ri.Ba. adjunto"

