#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:60
msgid ""
"The Netherlands localization package ensures compliance with Dutch fiscal "
"and accounting regulations. It includes tools for managing taxes, fiscal "
"positions, reporting, and a predefined chart of accounts tailored to Dutch "
"standards."
msgstr ""
"El paquete de localización de Países Bajos garantiza el cumplimiento de las "
"leyes fiscales y contables neerlandesas. Incluye herramientas para gestionar "
"impuestos, posiciones fiscales y reportes, así como un plan de cuentas "
"predefinido adaptado a las normas neerlandesas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:64
msgid "The Dutch localization package provides the following key features:"
msgstr ""
"El paquete de localización de Países Bajos ofrece las siguientes funciones "
"principales:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:66
msgid ""
":ref:`Chart of accounts <localizations/netherlands/chart-of-accounts>`: a "
"predefined structure tailored to Dutch accounting standards."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Plan de cuentas <localizations/netherlands/chart-of-accounts>`: Una "
"estructura predefinida que se adapta a las normas contables neerlandesas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:68
msgid ""
":ref:`Taxes <localizations/netherlands/taxes>`: pre-configured tax rates, "
"including standard VAT, zero-rated, and exempt options."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Impuestos <localizations/netherlands/taxes>`: Tasas impositivas "
"preconfiguradas, incluido el IVA estándar, de tasa cero y excepciones."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:70
msgid ""
":doc:`Fiscal positions (tax and account mapping) <../accounting/taxes/"
"fiscal_positions>`: automated tax adjustments based on customer or supplier "
"registration status."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Posiciones fiscales (asignación de impuestos y cuentas) <../accounting/"
"taxes/fiscal_positions>`: Ajustes automatizados de impuestos según el estado "
"de registro de los clientes o proveedores."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:72
msgid ""
":ref:`Electronic document solutions <localizations/netherlands/sbr>`: "
"integration with SBR reporting to meet electronic document regulations."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Soluciones para documentos electrónicos <localizations/netherlands/"
"sbr>`: Integración con los reportes SBR para cumplir con las normas sobre "
"documentos electrónicos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:80
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:83
msgid ""
"In the :doc:`chart of accounts <../accounting/get_started/"
"chart_of_accounts>`, accounts are automatically mapped to their "
"corresponding taxes and default accounts payable and accounts receivable "
"fields."
msgstr ""
"En el :doc:`plan de cuentas <../accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts>`, "
"el sistema vincula las cuentas de forma automática con sus respectivos "
"impuestos y con los campos de cuentas por pagar y cuentas por cobrar de "
"forma predeterminada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:89
msgid ""
":ref:`Taxes <localizations/netherlands/taxes>` are automatically created and "
"configured when the Netherlands localization is installed."
msgstr ""
"El sistema crea y configura los :ref:`impuestos <localizations/netherlands/"
"taxes>` de forma automática cuando instalas la localización de Países Bajos."

