#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:121
msgid ""
":abbr:`SBR (Standard Business Reporting)` electronic reporting is integrated "
"within Odoo and allows you to send your reports directly to the Dutch tax "
"authorities. To use SBR reporting, ensure that the :ref:`Netherlands - SBR "
"<localizations/netherlands/modules>` module is installed."
msgstr ""
"Los reportes electrónicos mediante :abbr:`SBR (Standard Business Reporting)` "
"están integrados en Odoo y te permiten enviar tus reportes de forma directa "
"a las autoridades fiscales neerlandesas. Para usar los reportes SBR, "
"asegúrate de que el módulo :ref:`Países Bajos - SBR <localizations/"
"netherlands/modules>` esté instalado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:125
msgid ""
"To set up SBR reporting, open the **Accounting** app, go "
"to :menuselection:`Configuration --> Settings`, and scroll down to "
"the :guilabel:`Dutch Localization` section. Click the :guilabel:`Digipoort "
"Certificate` field, enter a name for the certificate, and "
"click :guilabel:`Create and edit...`. In the pop-up window, fill out the "
"following fields:"
msgstr ""
"Para configurar los reportes SBR, abre la aplicación **Contabilidad**, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Configuración --> Ajustes` y dirígete a la "
"sección :guilabel:`Localización neerlandesa`. Haz clic en el "
"campo :guilabel:`Certificado de Digipoort`, escribe un nombre para el "
"certificado y haz clic en :guilabel:`Crear y editar...`. En la ventana "
"emergente, completa los siguientes campos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:130
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Name`: enter the name previously specified (you can modify it if "
"desired)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Nombre`: Escribe el nombre que especificaste antes (puedes "
"modificarlo si quieres)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:131
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Certificate`: click :guilabel:`Upload your file` to upload the "
"certificate file."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Certificado`: Haz clic en :guilabel:`Sube tu archivo` para subir "
"el archivo del certificado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:132
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Certificate Password`: enter the password for your certificate "
"file."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Contraseña del certificado`: Escribe la contraseña del archivo "
"del certificado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:133
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Save & Close`."
msgstr "Haz clic en :guilabel:`Guardar y cerrar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:140
msgid ""
"Once :ref:`enabled <localizations/netherlands/sbr-configuration>`, you can "
"establish an XBRL connection with the Dutch tax authorities by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Reporting --> Tax Report` in the **Accounting** app, "
"clicking the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` icon, and "
"selecting :guilabel:`XBRL`."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que lo :ref:`actives <localizations/netherlands/sbr-configuration>`, "
"puedes establecer una conexión XBRL con las autoridades fiscales "
"neerlandesas. Para ello, ve a :menuselection:`Reportes --> Reporte fiscal` "
"en la aplicación **Contabilidad**, haz clic en el icono :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`(engranaje)` y selecciona :guilabel:`XBRL`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:145
msgid "In the pop-up window, fill out the following fields:"
msgstr "En la ventana emergente, completa los siguientes campos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:147
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Contact Initials`: The initials of the contact person creating "
"the SBR file."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Iniciales del contacto`: Las iniciales de la persona de contacto "
"que crea el archivo SBR."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:148
msgid ":guilabel:`Contact Last Name`: The last name of the contact person."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Apellidos del contacto`: Los apellidos de la persona de contacto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:149
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Contact Name Infix`: The prefix or middle name of the contact "
"person."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Infijo del nombre del contacto`: El prefijo o segundo nombre de "
"la persona de contacto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:150
msgid ":guilabel:`Contact Phone`: The phone number of the contact person."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Teléfono del contacto`: El número de teléfono de la persona de "
"contacto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:151
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Contact Type`: Select :guilabel:`Taxpayer (BPL)` if you are "
"filing the turnover tax return for your own business, "
"or :guilabel:`Intermediary (INT)` if the return is filed by a tax "
"professional."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tipo de contacto`: Selecciona :guilabel:`Contribuyente (BPL)` si "
"presentas la declaración del impuesto sobre el volumen de negocios de tu "
"propia empresa o :guilabel:`Intermediario (INT)` si una persona profesional "
"de impuestos presenta la declaración."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:154
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tax Consultant Number`: If you selected :guilabel:`Intermediary "
"(INT)`, enter the 6-digit tax advisor registration number (*Beconnummer*)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Número de asesor fiscal`: Si "
"seleccionaste :guilabel:`Intermediario (INT)`, escribe el número de registro "
"de 6 dígitos del asesor fiscal (*Beconnummer*)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:156
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tax Consultant Order`: If applicable, enter the membership or "
"registration number for your professional tax association (e.g., NOB, RB, "
"NBA, etc.)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Número de registro del asesor fiscal`: Si corresponde, escribe el "
"número de afiliación o registro del colegio profesional de asesores fiscales "
"(por ejemplo, NOB, RB, NBA, etc.)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:158
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Is Test`: Tick this box to submit the file to a pre-production "
"environment. A valid PKIoverheid certificate is required, "
"and :doc:`developer mode <../../general/developer_mode>` must be enabled."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Es de prueba`: Selecciona esta casilla para enviar el archivo a "
"un entorno de preproducción. Necesitas un certificado PKIoverheid válido y "
"debes activar el :doc:`modo de desarrollador <../../general/developer_mode>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:162
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Download` to save the `.XBRL` file to your computer, or "
"click :guilabel:`Send` to transmit the SBR tax report directly to the Dutch "
"tax authorities."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Descargar` para guardar el archivo `.XBRL` en tu "
"computadora, o haz clic en :guilabel:`Enviar` para compartir el reporte "
"fiscal SBR de forma directa a las autoridades fiscales neerlandesas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:168
msgid "XAF Export"
msgstr "Exportar en XAF"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:170
msgid ""
"To export accounting entries in XAF format, open the **Accounting** app and "
"go to :menuselection:`Reporting --> General Ledger`. Use the filters to "
"select the range of entries to export, click the :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` icon, and then click :guilabel:`XAF`."
msgstr ""
"Para exportar los asientos contables en formato XAF, abre la aplicación "
"**Contabilidad** y ve a :menuselection:`Reportes --> Libro mayor`. Usa los "
"filtros para seleccionar el rango de asientos que quieres exportar, haz clic "
"en el icono :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(engranaje)` y después "
"en :guilabel:`XAF`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/netherlands.rst:179
msgid ""
"To enable SEPA Credit Transfer as a payment method, follow :ref:`these steps "
"<accounting/sepa_payments/sct>` and enter `Belastingdienst` as "
"the :guilabel:`Issuer`."
msgstr ""
"Para activar la transferencia de crédito SEPA como método de pago, "
"sigue :ref:`estos pasos <accounting/sepa_payments/sct>` y escribe "
"`Belastingdienst` en el campo :guilabel:`Emisor`."

