#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/new_zealand.rst:205
msgid "EFT batch payments"
msgstr "Pago por lotes EFT"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/new_zealand.rst:207
msgid ""
"An :abbr:`EFT (electronic funds transfer)` batch file is a digital format "
"used to facilitate bulk payment processing for businesses. It allows "
"companies to consolidate multiple inbound and outbound payments into a "
"single electronic file. This process is commonly used by businesses handling "
"multiple payments at once, such as payroll or payments to multiple suppliers."
msgstr ""
"Archivo de :abbr:`EFT (transferencia electrónica de fondos)` por lotes es un "
"formato digital que se usa para facilitar el procesamiento de pagos por lote "
"para negocios. Permite que las empresas consoliden varios pagos entrantes y "
"salientes en un único archivo electrónico. Este proceso comúnmente lo usan "
"empresas que gestionan varios pagos al mismo tiempo, como pagos de nómina o "
"a muchos proveedores."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/new_zealand.rst:219
msgid ""
":ref:`Install <general/install>` the :guilabel:`EFT Batch Payment` module "
"(`l10n_nz_eft`)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Instale <general/install>` el módulo de :guilabel:`Pago por lotes EFT` "
"(`l10n_nz_eft`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/new_zealand.rst:220
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`. In "
"the :guilabel:`Customer Payments` section, enable :guilabel:`Batch Payments`."
msgstr ""
"Vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Ajustes`. En la "
"sección :guilabel:`Pagos del cliente`, active la opción :guilabel:`Pagos por "
"lote`."

