"localización de Omán:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:19
msgid ":guilabel:`Oman - Accounting`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Omán - Contabilidad`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:20
msgid "`l10n_om`"
msgstr "`l10n_om`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:21
msgid ""
"Omani :ref:`fiscal localization package <fiscal_localizations/packages>`, "
"complete with the local chart of accounts, taxes, tax report, and fiscal "
"positions."
msgstr ""
"El :ref:`paquete de localización fiscal <fiscal_localizations/packages>` de "
"Omán que incluye el plan de cuentas, los impuestos, la declaración fiscal y "
"las posiciones fiscales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:23
msgid ":guilabel:`Oman - Accounting Reports`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Omán - Reportes contables`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:24
msgid "`l10n_om_reports`"
msgstr "`l10n_om_reports`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:25
msgid "Accounting reports for Oman."
msgstr "Reportes contables para Omán."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:28
msgid ""
"The module automatically installs core configurations. A manual :doc:`update "
"</applications/general/apps_modules>` may be required for missing elements "
"or updates."
msgstr ""
"El módulo instala las configuraciones principales de forma automática. Es "
"posible que necesites realizar una :doc:`actualización </applications/"
"general/apps_modules>` manual para agregar los elementos faltantes o aplicar "
"las actualizaciones."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:36
msgid ""
"The Omani localization package provides the necessary accounting setup for "
"companies operating in Oman, including a pre-configured chart of accounts, "
"taxes, fiscal positions, and a standard tax report format. It ensures "
"alignment with Oman VAT regulations and Royal Decree requirements."
msgstr ""
"El paquete de localización de Omán ofrece la configuración contable "
"necesaria para las empresas que operan en Omán, incluyendo un plan de "
"cuentas, impuestos, posiciones fiscales y un formato estándar de declaración "
"fiscal ya configurados. Garantiza el cumplimiento de las normativas del IVA "
"de Omán y de los requisitos del Real Decreto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:40
msgid ""
"The Omani localization package provides the following key features to ensure "
"compliance with local fiscal and accounting regulations:"
msgstr ""
"El paquete de localización de Omán incluye las siguientes funciones clave "
"para que cumplas con las normas fiscales y contables locales:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:43
msgid ""
":ref:`Chart of Accounts <localizations/oman/chart-of-accounts>`: based on "
"Omani standards, with mapped account groups and default account mappings."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Plan de cuentas <localizations/oman/chart-of-accounts>`: Según los "
"estándares omaníes, con grupos de cuentas asignados y cuentas "
"predeterminadas asignadas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:45
msgid ""
":ref:`Taxes <localizations/oman/taxes>`: standard 5% VAT, zero-rated "
"domestic as well as exports, exempt, imports, and reverse charge taxes."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Impuestos <localizations/oman/taxes>`: El IVA estándar del 5%, tasa "
"cero para operaciones nacionales y exportaciones, exenciones, importaciones "
"e impuestos de inversión del sujeto pasivo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:47
msgid ""
":doc:`Fiscal Positions <../accounting/taxes/fiscal_positions>`: automated "
"tax adjustments based on customer or supplier registration status."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Posiciones fiscales <../accounting/taxes/fiscal_positions>`: Ajustes "
"automáticos de impuestos según el estado de registro del cliente o proveedor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:49
msgid ""
":ref:`Tax Report <localizations/oman/tax-report>`: structured according to "
"the Oman VAT return format, as issued by the Tax Authority."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Reporte fiscal <localizations/oman/tax-report>`: Estructurado según el "
"formato de declaración del IVA de Omán emitido por la Autoridad Fiscal."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:57
msgid ""
"The Omani :doc:`chart of accounts <../accounting/get_started/"
"chart_of_accounts>` is based on the local rules and regulations. This "
"includes pre-configured account groups and mapped default accounts. Use "
"the :ref:`predefined structure <chart-of-account/create>` or create new "
"accounts, as needed."
msgstr ""
"El :doc:`plan de cuentas <../accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts>` de "
"Omán está basado en las normas y regulaciones locales. Incluye grupos de "
"cuentas preconfigurados y cuentas predeterminadas asignadas. Usa "
"la :ref:`estructura predefinida <chart-of-account/create>` o crea nuevas "
"cuentas según tus necesidades."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:63
msgid ""
"Accounts are grouped under relevant categories such as assets, liabilities, "
"income, and expenses in line with local standards."
msgstr ""
"Las cuentas se agrupan en categorías relevantes, como activos, pasivos, "
"ingresos y gastos, en cumplimiento con los estándares locales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:71
msgid ""
"The following :doc:`Taxes <../accounting/taxes>`, included in the Omani VAT "
"system, are available by default with the Omani localization package:"
msgstr ""
"Los siguientes :doc:`impuestos <../accounting/taxes>`, incluidos en el "
"sistema de IVA de Omán, están disponibles de forma predeterminada con el "
"paquete de localización omaní:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:74
msgid ""
"Standard Rate 5%: Applies to the sale of most goods and services within Oman."
msgstr ""
"Tasa estándar del 5%: Aplica a la venta de la mayoría de los bienes y "
"servicios dentro de Omán."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:75
msgid ""
"Zero-Rated Supplies (0%): Applies to essential supplies where the seller can "
"still reclaim input VAT."
msgstr ""
"Suministros con tasa cero (0%): Aplica a los suministros esenciales en los "
"que el vendedor aún puede recuperar el IVA soportado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:77
msgid ""
"Exports (0%): Applies to the supply of goods and services that are exported "
"outside Oman."
msgstr ""
"Exportaciones (0%): Aplica al suministro de bienes y servicios que se "
"exportan fuera de Omán."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:78
msgid ""
"Exempt Supplies: Applies to supplies that are not subject to VAT, and for "
"which the supplier cannot reclaim input VAT on related purchases."
msgstr ""
"Suministros exentos: Aplica a los suministros que no están sujetos a IVA y "
"para los que el proveedor no puede reclamar el IVA soportado en compras "
"relacionadas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:80
msgid ""
"Reverse Charge Mechanism (RCM): Applies to taxable businesses in Oman "
"receiving services or goods from non-resident suppliers not registered for "
"VAT in Oman."
msgstr ""
"Mecanismo de reversión de cobro (RCM): Aplica a las empresas sujetas a "
"impuestos en Omán que reciben servicios o bienes de proveedores no "
"residentes que no están registrados a efectos del IVA en Omán."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:82
msgid ""
"Import VAT (5%): Applies to the importation of most goods into Oman, charged "
"at the customs point of entry."
msgstr ""
"IVA de importación (5%): Aplica a la importación de la mayoría de los bienes "
"en Omán, se cobra en aduana al momento de la entrada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:90
msgid ""
"The :ref:`VAT return <accounting/tax-returns/report>` provides a "
"consolidated overview of the taxable sales and purchases, VAT collected and "
"paid, and the total amount owed or refundable for the reporting period."
msgstr ""
"La :ref:`declaración <accounting/tax-returns/report>` otorga un resumen "
"consolidado de las ventas y compras imponibles, el IVA cobrado y pagado y el "
"monto total debido o reembolsable para el periodo del reporte."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:95
msgid ""
"The tax return aligns with official declarations required by `Oman's Tax "
"Authority <https://tms.taxoman.gov.om/portal/web/taxportal/home>`_."
msgstr ""
"La declaración fiscal coincide con las declaraciones oficiales exigidas por "
"la `Autoridad Fiscal de Omán <https://tms.taxoman.gov.om/portal/web/"
"taxportal/home>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:97
msgid ""
"`VAT Taxpayer Guide <https://tms.taxoman.gov.om/portal/documents/"
"20126/1414820/VAT+Taxpayer+Guide+-+VAT+Return+Filing.pdf/fae31d0c-"
"e7e7-0014-9f28-a4c506b36614?t=1733169613409>`_."
msgstr ""
"`Guía para contribuyentes del IVA <https://tms.taxoman.gov.om/portal/"
"documents/20126/1414820/VAT+Taxpayer+Guide+-+VAT+Return+Filing.pdf/fae31d0c-"
"e7e7-0014-9f28-a4c506b36614?t=1733169613409>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:101
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:223
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:242
msgid "Invoicing language"
msgstr "Idioma de facturación"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:103
msgid ""
"Invoices and receipts can be issued in different languages according to your "
"customer or business needs. By default, billing documents are sent to "
"customers or vendors in the language set on their :doc:`contact form <../../"
"essentials/contacts>`."
msgstr ""
"Las facturas y recibos pueden emitirse en diferentes idiomas según las "
"necesidades de tus clientes o del negocio. Por defecto, los documentos de "
"facturación se envían a clientes o proveedores en el idioma establecido en "
"su :doc:`formulario de contacto <../../essentials/contacts>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:107
msgid ""
"It is also possible to add Arabic as a second language to your company's "
"billing documents if desired or required. To do so, go "
"to :menuselection:`Configuration --> Settings` in the **Accounting** app, "
"then, in the :guilabel:`Customer Invoices` section, enable :guilabel:`Gulf "
"Cooperation Council Format`."
msgstr ""
"También es posible agregar árabe como segundo idioma en los documentos de "
"facturación de tu empresa si lo deseas o es necesario. Para hacerlo, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Configuración --> Ajustes` en la aplicación de "
"**Contabilidad**, luego, en la sección :guilabel:`Facturas de clientes`, "
"activa :guilabel:`Formato del Consejo de Cooperación del Golfo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:112
msgid ""
"For point of sale receipts, go to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, navigate to the :guilabel:`Bills & Receipts` "
"section, and enable :guilabel:`Gulf Cooperation Council Format`."
msgstr ""
"Para recibos de punto de venta, ve a :menuselection:`Punto de venta --> "
"Configuración --> Ajustes`, navega a la sección :guilabel:`Facturas y "
"recibos` y habilita :guilabel:`Formato del Consejo de Cooperación del Golfo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:116
msgid ""
"When enabled, all invoices, credit/debit notes, vendor bills, refund bills, "
"and receipts feature both the language set on your customer or vendor "
"contact form and an Arabic translation."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está habilitado, todas las facturas, notas de crédito/débito, "
"facturas de proveedor, facturas de reembolso y recibos incluyen tanto el "
"idioma configurado en tu formulario de contacto del cliente o proveedor como "
"una traducción al árabe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/oman.rst:120
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Preview` after confirming an invoice to see exactly how the "
"invoice will appear to the customer or vendor."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Vista previa` después de confirmar una factura para "
"ver exactamente cómo aparecerá la factura para el cliente o proveedor."

