"y selecciona :guilabel:`Incluir importaciones`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:152
msgid ""
"The generated file is based on the specific **period** selected in the "
"calendar report filter. For example, while the **2550Q** is a quarterly "
"report, `.DAT` files are submitted monthly. Make sure to filter "
"by :guilabel:`Month` and select the appropriate month before exporting."
msgstr ""
"El archivo generado está basado en el **periodo** seleccionado en el filtro "
"del calendario del reporte. Por ejemplo, aunque el **2550Q** es un reporte "
"trimestral, los archivos `.DAT` se envían de forma mensual. Asegúrate de "
"filtrar por :guilabel:`mes` y seleccionar el mes correcto antes de exportar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:156
msgid ""
"SLS and SLP reports can be exported in `.DAT` format, which is compatible "
"with the :abbr:`ReLiEf (Reconciliation of Listings for Enforcement)` module. "
"To do so, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"Es posible exportar los reportes SLS y SLP en formato `.DAT`, que es "
"compatible con el módulo :abbr:`ReLiEf (Reconciliation of Listings for "
"Enforcement)`. Sigue estos pasos para hacerlo:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:160
msgid ""
"On the report page, click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` icon and "
"select :guilabel:`Export SLSP`."
msgstr ""
"En la página del reporte, haz clic en el icono :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`(engranaje)` y selecciona :guilabel:`Exportar SLSP`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:162
msgid "In the :guilabel:`DAT Export Options` window, click :guilabel:`Export`."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Exportar` en la ventana :guilabel:`Opciones de "
"exportación de DAT`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:167
msgid "BIR 2306 & 2307"
msgstr "BIR 2306 y 2307"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:169
msgid ""
"Odoo supports the generation of **BIR Form 2306** (Certificate of Final Tax "
"Withheld at Source) and **BIR Form 2307** (Certificate of Creditable Tax "
"Withheld at Source) in latest BIR PDF format."
msgstr ""
"Odoo admite la generación del **Formulario BIR 2306** (Certificado de "
"impuesto final retenido en la fuente) y el **Formulario BIR 2307** "
"(Certificado de impuesto acreditable retenido en la fuente) en el formato "
"PDF más reciente del BIR."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:172
msgid ""
"To access them, navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Tax "
"Report`, click :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`Report`, and "
"select :guilabel:`2306 & 2307`."
msgstr ""
"Para acceder a ellos, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Informes --> "
"Informe fiscal`, haz clic en :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`Informe` y "
"selecciona :guilabel:`2306 y 2307`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:175
msgid ""
"Based on the period filtered, Odoo displays the transactions subject to "
"each :abbr:`EWHT (Expanded Withholding Tax)` and :abbr:`FWHT (Final "
"Withholding Tax)` grouped by ATC code per partner level."
msgstr ""
"Según el periodo filtrado, Odoo muestra las transacciones sujetas a cada "
":abbr:`EWHT (Impuesto de retención expandido)` y :abbr:`FWHT (Impuesto de "
"retención final)` agrupadas por código ATC por nivel de partner."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:178
msgid "To export the certificates into PDF:"
msgstr "Para exportar los certificados a PDF:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:180
msgid ""
"Make sure to filter by the appropriate **Month** or **Quarter** using the "
"calendar filter."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de filtrar por el **Mes** o **Trimestre** correspondiente usando "
"el filtro de calendario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:181
msgid ""
"By default, Odoo exports certificates for all the partners. To select a "
"partner, use the :guilabel:`Partners` filter."
msgstr ""
"De forma predeterminada, Odoo exporta certificados para todos los partners. "
