#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:50
msgid "E-invoicing with KSeF"
msgstr "Facturación electrónica con KSeF"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:52
msgid ""
"`KSeF <https://ksef.podatki.gov.pl/>`_ is Poland's mandatory, centralized "
"electronic invoicing system used to issue, transmit, and store electronic "
"invoices according to national regulations."
msgstr ""
"`KSeF <https://ksef.podatki.gov.pl/>`_ es el sistema centralizado y "
"obligatorio de facturación electrónica de Polonia que se utiliza para "
"emitir, transmitir y almacenar facturas electrónicas de acuerdo con las "
"leyes nacionales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:58
msgid ""
"`KSeF platform video tutorials of the Polish Ministry of Finance <https://"
"www.youtube.com/watch?"
"v=V6E1fGUFPw4&list=PLGj5OAFBHLKX0cEVGjcGplnbX6LpDFF38&index=1>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Videotutoriales de la plataforma KSeF del Ministerio de Finanzas de Polonia "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?"
"v=V6E1fGUFPw4&list=PLGj5OAFBHLKX0cEVGjcGplnbX6LpDFF38&index=1>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:63
msgid ""
"To use KSeF e-Invoicing with Odoo, first `create a KSeF account <https://"
"ap.ksef.mf.gov.pl/web/>`_ or log in using your company's NIP if you already "
"have credentials. Next, request a certificate and ensure you save the "
"password created during this process, as it will be required later."
msgstr ""
"Para usar la facturación electrónica KSeF con Odoo, primero `crea una cuenta "
"de KSeF <https://ap.ksef.mf.gov.pl/web/>`_ o inicia sesión con el NIP de tu "
"empresa si ya tienes credenciales. Luego, solicita un certificado y "
"asegúrate de guardar la contraseña que creas durante este proceso, ya que la "
"necesitarás más adelante."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:67
msgid ""
"Once the certificate request is complete, download the `.pem` **certificate "
"file** and save the **private key** issued by KSeF. You will need both to "
"complete the Odoo integration."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que completes la solicitud del certificado, descarga el **archivo de "
"certificado** `.pem` y guarda la **clave privada** que emite KSeF. "
"Necesitarás ambos para completar la integración con Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:73
msgid "Link Odoo to KSeF"
msgstr "Vincular Odoo con KSeF"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:76
msgid ""
"`KSeF test and pre-production environments <https://ksef.podatki.gov.pl/"
"aplikacja-podatnika-ksef-20/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Entornos de prueba y preproducción de KSeF <https://ksef.podatki.gov.pl/"
"aplikacja-podatnika-ksef-20/>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:79
msgid ""
"Scroll down to the :guilabel:`Polish Localization` section and "
"enable :guilabel:`Allow KSeF integration`."
msgstr ""
"Dirígete a la sección :guilabel:`Localización polaca` y "
"activa :guilabel:`Permitir integración con KSeF`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:81
msgid ""
"Enter a name for your KSeF certificate in the newly enabled field, then "
"select :guilabel:`Create and edit...` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Ingresa un nombre para tu certificado KSeF en el campo que se habilita y "
"después selecciona :guilabel:`Crear y editar...` en el menú desplegable."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:83
msgid ""
"In the pop-up window, click :guilabel:`Upload your file` and select your "
"**certificate** (`.pem`). In the :guilabel:`Certificate Password` field, "
"enter the password created during the certificate application on the KSeF "
"platform."
msgstr ""
"En la ventana emergente, haz clic en :guilabel:`Sube tu archivo` y "
"selecciona tu **certificado** (`.pem`). En el campo :guilabel:`Contraseña "
"del certificado`, ingresa la contraseña que creaste durante la solicitud del "
"certificado en la plataforma KSeF."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:86
msgid ""
"Once the certificate is uploaded, the :guilabel:`Private Key` field appears. "
"Click the empty field, select :guilabel:`Create` from the drop-down menu, "
"and enter your **private key**. The **public key** is embedded within the "
"`.pem` file and is automatically filled in."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que subas el certificado, aparecerá el campo :guilabel:`Clave "
"privada`. Haz clic en el campo vacío, selecciona :guilabel:`Crear` en el "
"menú desplegable e ingresa tu **clave privada**. La **clave pública** se "
"encuentra dentro del archivo `.pem` y el sistema la completa de forma "
"automática."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:89
msgid "Finally, click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr "Por último, haz clic en :guilabel:`Guardar`."

