"Go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Users & Companies --> Companies` and "
"select the company that will use KSeF."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Ajustes --> Usuarios y empresas --> Empresas` y "
"selecciona la empresa que utilizará KSeF."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:101
msgid ""
"Fill in the :guilabel:`Company Name`, :guilabel:`VAT` (Tax ID), "
"and :guilabel:`Country`. If desired, fill in additional optional fields such "
"as :guilabel:`Street`, :guilabel:`City`, :guilabel:`State`, "
"and :guilabel:`ZIP`."
msgstr ""
"Completa los campos :guilabel:`Nombre de la empresa`, :guilabel:`Número de "
"identificación fiscal` (identificación fiscal) y :guilabel:`País`. Si lo "
"deseas, completa otros campos opcionales "
