#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:51
msgid ""
"The Saudi Arabian localization package ensures compliance with Saudi Arabian "
"fiscal and accounting regulations. It includes tools for managing taxes, "
"fiscal positions, reporting, and a predefined chart of accounts tailored to "
"Saudi Arabia's standards."
msgstr ""
"El paquete de localización de Arabia Saudita garantiza el cumplimiento de "
"las normativas fiscales y contables de Arabia Saudita. Incluye herramientas "
"para gestionar impuestos, posiciones fiscales, reportes y un plan de cuentas "
"predefinido adaptado a los estándares de Arabia Saudita."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:55
msgid ""
"The Saudi Arabian localization package provides the following key features "
"to ensure compliance with local fiscal and accounting regulations:"
msgstr ""
"El paquete de localización de Arabia Saudita ofrece las siguientes funciones "
"clave para garantizar el cumplimiento de las normativas fiscales y contables "
"locales:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:58
msgid ""
":doc:`../accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts`: a predefined structure "
"aligned with Saudi Arabian regulations"
msgstr ""
":doc:`../accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts`: Una estructura "
"predefinida alineada con las normativas de Arabia Saudita."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:60
msgid ""
":ref:`localizations/saudi-arabia/taxes`: preconfigured tax rates, including "
"standard 15% VAT, zero-rated, and exempt options"
msgstr ""
":ref:`localizations/saudi-arabia/taxes`: Tasas de impuestos preconfiguradas, "
"que incluyen el IVA estándar del 15%, tasa cero y opciones exentas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:64
msgid ""
":ref:`Withholding taxes <localizations/saudi-arabia/withholding-taxes>`: "
"predefined withholding tax rules for applicable service categories"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Impuestos de retención <localizations/saudi-arabia/withholding-"
"taxes>`: Reglas de retención predefinidas para categorías de servicios "
"aplicables."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:66
msgid ":ref:`localizations/saudi-arabia/tax-reporting`: automated tax reports"
msgstr ""
":ref:`localizations/saudi-arabia/tax-reporting`: Reportes de impuestos "
"automatizados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:67
msgid ""
":ref:`E-invoicing (ZATCA) <localizations/saudi-arabia/zatca>`: integration "
"for electronic invoicing in line with Saudi Arabian government requirements"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Facturación electrónica (ZATCA) <localizations/saudi-arabia/zatca>`: "
"Integración para facturación electrónica según los requisitos del gobierno "
"de Arabia Saudita."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:75
msgid ""
"The Saudi Arabian localization includes preconfigured sales, purchase, and "
"withholding :doc:`taxes <../accounting/taxes>`:"
msgstr ""
"La localización de Arabia Saudita incluye :doc:`impuestos <../accounting/"
"taxes>` de venta, compra y retención preconfigurados:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:0
msgid ""
"Standard VAT (15%): The prevailing rate applied to the majority of goods and "
"services supplied within the Kingdom."
msgstr ""
"IVA estándar (15%): La tasa vigente que se aplica a la mayoría de los bienes "
"y servicios que se suministran dentro del Reino de Arabia Saudita."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:0
msgid ""
"The supplier charges 15% VAT on the sale (Output VAT) and is generally "
"entitled to deduct the VAT paid on its business purchases (Input VAT)."
msgstr ""
"El proveedor cobra un 15% de IVA en la venta (IVA repercutido) y, por lo "
"general, puede deducir el IVA que paga en sus compras empresariales (IVA "
"soportado)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:84
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:87
msgid ""
"Most commercial sales, retail goods, telecommunication services, non-exempt "
"private education, and non-exempt private healthcare."
msgstr ""
"La mayoría de las ventas comerciales, bienes minoristas, servicios de "
"telecomunicaciones, educación privada no exenta y atención médica privada no "
"exenta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:0
msgid ""
"Zero-rated VAT (0%): These are taxable supplies where the rate of tax "
"applied is 0%."
msgstr ""
"IVA con tasa cero (0%): Estos son suministros gravados donde la tasa "
"aplicada es del 0%."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:0
msgid ""
"The supplier charges no VAT on the sale, but, critically, is fully entitled "
"to recover the input VAT paid on costs related to making those supplies."
msgstr ""
"El proveedor no cobra IVA en la venta, pero tiene completo derecho a "
"recuperar el IVA soportado que paga en los costos relacionados con esos "
"suministros."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:92
msgid ""
"Exports: Supplies of goods and services to a non-:abbr:`GCC (Gulf "
"Cooperation Council)` resident or for consumption outside the Kingdom."
msgstr ""
"Exportaciones: Suministros de bienes y servicios a un residente fuera "
"del :abbr:`GCC (Consejo de Cooperación del Golfo)` o para consumo fuera del "
"Reino de Arabia Saudita."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:94
msgid ""
"International transport: Services for the international transport of "
"passengers and goods, and related services."
msgstr ""
"Transporte internacional: Servicios de transporte internacional de pasajeros "
"y bienes, y servicios relacionados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:96
msgid ""
"Specific goods: Supplies of qualifying medicines and qualifying medical "
"equipment, as specified by ZATCA/Ministry of Health."
msgstr ""
"Bienes específicos: Suministros de medicamentos y equipos médicos que "
"califican, según lo que define ZATCA y el Ministerio de Salud."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:98
msgid ""
"Residential property: First supply of a new residential building/property to "
"a Saudi citizen, up to a value of SAR 1,000,000 (subject to specific "
"conditions)."
msgstr ""
"Propiedad residencial: Primer suministro de un edificio o propiedad "
"residencial nueva a un ciudadano saudí, hasta un valor de 1,000,000 riyales "
"(sujeto a condiciones específicas)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:100
msgid ""
"Investment metals: Qualifying gold, silver, and platinum of 99% purity or "
"higher (supplied for investment)."
msgstr ""
"Metales de inversión: Oro, plata y platino que califican, con una pureza del "
"99% o superior (suministrados para inversión)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:0
msgid ""
"Exempt transactions: These transactions fall outside the scope of VAT, "
"meaning they are not subject to the tax."
msgstr ""
"Transacciones exentas: Estas transacciones quedan fuera del alcance del IVA, "
"por lo que no están sujetas al impuesto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:0
msgid ""
"The supplier does not charge any VAT on the sale and is not entitled to "
"recover the input VAT paid on costs related to making these supplies "
"(resulting in an unrecoverable cost)."
msgstr ""
"El proveedor no cobra IVA en la venta y no puede recuperar el IVA soportado "
"que paga en los costos relacionados con estos suministros (lo que genera un "
"costo no recuperable)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:109
msgid ""
"Financial services: interest on loans, provision of credit, operations of "
"current/deposit/savings accounts, issuance or transfer of money or "
"securities, and life insurance."
msgstr ""
"Servicios financieros: Intereses sobre préstamos, otorgamiento de crédito, "
"operaciones de cuentas corrientes, de depósito o de ahorro, emisión o "
"transferencia de dinero o valores, y seguros de vida."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:112
msgid "Real estate: bare rental (leasing) of residential property."
msgstr "Bienes raíces: Alquiler simple de propiedad residencial."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:0
msgid ""
"Import VAT: VAT is levied on goods brought into the Kingdom from a "
"non-:abbr:`GCC (Gulf Cooperation Council)` country."
msgstr ""
"IVA de importación: El IVA se aplica a los bienes que ingresan al Reino "
"desde un país fuera del :abbr:`GCC (Consejo de Cooperación del Golfo)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:0
msgid ""
"VAT is typically calculated at the standard rate (15%) and is paid to the "
"Customs Authority at the point of importation."
msgstr ""
"El IVA se calcula, por lo general, a la tasa estándar (del 15%) y se paga a "
"la Autoridad de Aduanas en el momento de la importación."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:120
msgid ""
"When assigning :doc:`discounts <../../sales/sales/products_prices/prices/"
"discounts>` to invoices, assign a 15% tax on the line containing a global "
"discount to comply with ZATCA rules."
msgstr ""
"Al asignar :doc:`descuentos <../../sales/sales/products_prices/prices/"
"discounts>` a las facturas, asigna un impuesto del 15% a la línea que "
"contiene un descuento global para cumplir con las normas de ZATCA."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:124
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:128
msgid "Reverse charge mechanism (RCM)"
msgstr "Mecanismo de inversión del sujeto pasivo (RCM)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:126
msgid ""
"Description: Mechanism that shifts the responsibility for accounting for VAT "
"from the non-resident supplier to the resident recipient of the goods or "
"services."
msgstr ""
"Descripción: Mecanismo que traslada la responsabilidad de contabilizar el "
"IVA del proveedor no residente al receptor residente de los bienes o "
"servicios."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:128
msgid ""
"Mechanism: The VAT-registered recipient must calculate and account for the "
"VAT (as both output VAT and input VAT) in their :ref:`VAT return <accounting/"
"tax-returns/vat-report>`. This typically results in a net zero effect on the "
"VAT return, provided the input tax is fully deductible."
msgstr ""
"Mecanismo: El receptor registrado en IVA debe calcular y contabilizar el IVA "
"(como IVA repercutido y como IVA soportado) en su :ref:`declaración de IVA "
"<accounting/tax-returns/vat-report>`. Esto suele generar un efecto neto cero "
"en la declaración de IVA, siempre que el impuesto soportado sea totalmente "
"deducible."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:131
msgid ""
"Application: Primarily used for B2B supplies of services from a non-resident "
"supplier to a VAT-registered business in Saudi Arabia."
msgstr ""
"Uso: Se usa, sobre todo, para suministros B2B de servicios de un proveedor "
"no residente a una empresa registrada en Arabia Saudita."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:139
msgid ""
"There are two available methods for calculating withholding tax: gross and "
"deducted."
msgstr ""
"Existen dos métodos disponibles para calcular la retención de impuestos: "
"bruto y deducido."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:141
msgid ""
"Gross withholding: This is the primary configuration, where the withholding "
"amount is calculated in addition to the bill total. For example, if the "
"total bill is entered as 115 SAR, the system calculates the base plus "
"Withholding Tax (WHT) without reducing the payment amount."
msgstr ""
"Retención bruta: Esta es la configuración principal, donde el importe de la "
"retención se calcula además del total de la factura. Por ejemplo, si "
"ingresas un total de factura de 115 riyales, el sistema calcula la base más "
"la retención sin reducir el importe del pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:144
msgid ""
"Deducted withholding: It reduces the payable amount by the withholding "
"amount directly, meaning the total payment reflects the deduction upfront. "
"This affects how the accounting entries and payable lines are booked."
msgstr ""
"Retención deducida: Reduce el importe por pagar con el monto de la retención "
"de forma directa, lo que hace que el pago total ya refleje la deducción. "
"Esto influye en la forma en que se registran los asientos contables y las "
"líneas por pagar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:149
msgid ""
"Deducted withholding taxes are not enabled by default. To activate it, go to "
"Accounting --> Configuration --> Taxes and enable the relevant withholding "
"tax."
msgstr ""
"Las retenciones deducidas no vienen habilitadas de forma predeterminada. "
"Para activarlas, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> "
"Impuestos` y habilita el impuesto de retención correspondiente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:152
msgid ""
"The following Withholding Tax (WHT) configurations are preloaded and "
"available for use:"
msgstr ""
"Las siguientes configuraciones de retención de impuestos (WHT) vienen "
"precargadas y están disponibles:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:154
msgid ""
"5% Withholding Tax: Applied on payments for rent, dividends, technical and "
"consulting services, air and maritime freight, as well as interest, "
"insurance, and reinsurance premiums."
msgstr ""
"Retención del 5%: Aplica a pagos por alquiler, dividendos, servicios "
"técnicos y de consultoría, flete aéreo y marítimo, así como a primas de "
"intereses, seguros y reaseguros."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:156
msgid ""
"15% Withholding Tax: Applies to royalties and other general service payments "
"made to non-residents."
msgstr ""
"Retención del 15%: Aplica a regalías y otros pagos generales por servicios a "
"no residentes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:158
msgid ""
"20% Withholding Tax: Reserved for management fees and specific high-value "
"service payments."
msgstr ""
"Retención del 20%: Reservada para honorarios de gestión y pagos por "
"servicios específicos de alto valor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:165
msgid ""
"The :ref:`VAT and Withholding Return <accounting/tax-returns/vat-report>` "
"provide a detailed breakdown of taxable, zero-rated, exempt, and withholding "
"transactions. Like other financial reports, the :guilabel:`VAT` "
"and :guilabel:`Withholding Return` can be filtered by period, compared "
"against other periods, and exported in Excel and PDF formats, ensuring "
"compliance with Saudi Arabia tax laws."
msgstr ""
"Los reportes :ref:`de IVA y de retención <accounting/tax-returns/vat-"
"report>` ofrecen un desglose detallado de las transacciones gravadas, con "
"tasa cero, exentas y con retención. Como otros reportes financieros, los "
"de :guilabel:`IVA` y :guilabel:`declaración de retención` permiten filtrar "
"por periodo, comparar con otros periodos y exportar en formatos Excel y PDF, "
"lo que garantiza el cumplimiento de las leyes fiscales de Arabia Saudita."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:176
msgid ""
"To ensure proper integration with :ref:`ZATCA <localizations/saudi-arabia/"
"zatca>`, the following fields are required on the :ref:`company record "
"<general/companies/company>`:"
msgstr ""
"Los siguientes campos deben estar completos en el :ref:`registro de la "
"empresa <general/companies/company>` para poder garantizar una integración "
"correcta con :ref:`ZATCA <localizations/saudi-arabia/zatca>`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:179
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company Name`, limited to a maximum of 63 characters to comply "
"with ZATCA requirements."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Nombre de la empresa`, con un máximo de 63 caracteres para "
"cumplir con los requisitos de ZATCA."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:181
msgid ""
"All relevant :guilabel:`Address` fields, including "
"the :guilabel:`District`, :guilabel:`Building Number`, and :guilabel:`Plot "
"Identification`"
msgstr ""
"Todos los campos relevantes de :guilabel:`dirección`, que "
"incluyen :guilabel:`Distrito`, :guilabel:`Número de edificio` "
"e :guilabel:`Identificación del lote`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:183
msgid ":guilabel:`Identification Scheme`"
