msgid "Branches configuration"
msgstr "Configuración de sucursales"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:207
msgid ""
"Set up your company :ref:`branches <general/branches>` in compliance "
"with :ref:`ZATCA rules <localizations/saudi-arabia/company-contacts>`."
msgstr ""
"Configura las :ref:`sucursales <general/branches>` de tu empresa según "
"las :ref:`reglas de ZATCA <localizations/saudi-arabia/company-contacts>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:211
msgid ""
"On the branch contact form, enter the same :guilabel:`VAT Number` as the "
"parent company and enter the branch :guilabel:`Commercial Registration "
"Number (CRN)` in the :guilabel:`Identification Scheme` field."
msgstr ""
"En el formulario de contacto de la sucursal, ingresa el "
"mismo :guilabel:`número de identificación fiscal` que la empresa principal e "
"ingresa el :guilabel:`número de registro comercial (CRN)` de la sucursal en "
"el campo :guilabel:`Esquema de identificación`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:216
msgid ""
"Either use the parent company’s sales journal to follow a centralized "
"billing system model, or onboard a new branch-specific journal to set up a "
"multi-threaded system with parallel invoice processing."
msgstr ""
"Usa el diario de ventas de la empresa principal para seguir un modelo de "
"facturación centralizada o incorpora un nuevo diario específico de la "
"sucursal para configurar un sistema de varios flujos con procesamiento de "
"facturas en paralelo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:225
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:244
msgid ""
"Invoices can be issued in different languages to meet regional or customer-"
"specific requirements at two levels:"
msgstr ""
"Puedes emitir facturas en distintos idiomas para cumplir los requisitos "
"regionales o específicos del cliente en dos niveles:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:228
msgid ""
"Customer level: To assign a preferred language to a customer, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Customers` "
"or :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Orders --> Customers`, and open the "
"relevant customer form.  In the :guilabel:`Language` field, update the "
"language. All documents are then automatically generated in the selected "
"language for that customer."
msgstr ""
"Nivel del cliente: Para asignar un idioma preferido a un cliente, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Clientes --> Clientes` o "
"a :menuselection:`Punto de venta --> Órdenes --> Clientes` y abre el "
"formulario del cliente correspondiente. Actualiza el idioma en el "
"campo :guilabel:`Idioma`. El sistema generará todos los documentos de forma "
"automática en el idioma seleccionado para ese cliente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:234
msgid ""
"Saudi Arabia's VAT regulations require :guilabel:`Tax Invoices` "
"and :guilabel:`Simplified Tax Invoices` (along with corresponding credit "
"notes or debit notes) to be in Arabic, mandatorily. Invoices can be "
"bilingual, including English."
msgstr ""
"Las regulaciones de IVA de Arabia Saudita exigen que las :guilabel:`facturas "
"fiscales` y las :guilabel:`facturas fiscales simplificadas` (junto con las "
"notas de crédito o débito correspondientes) estén en árabe de forma "
"obligatoria. Las facturas pueden ser bilingües e incluir inglés."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:238
msgid ""
"Company level: To add Arabic as a secondary language to meet Saudi Arabia "
"VAT regulations:"
msgstr ""
"Nivel de empresa: Para agregar árabe como idioma secundario y cumplir con "
"las regulaciones de IVA de Arabia Saudita:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:240
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:253
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Tax Invoices`: Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, in the :guilabel:`Customer Invoices` section."
msgstr ""
"Para :guilabel:`facturas fiscales`: Ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> "
"Configuración --> Ajustes` y dirígete a la sección :guilabel:`Facturas de "
"cliente`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:242
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:255
msgid ""
"For Point of Sale receipts: Go to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, and navigate to the :guilabel:`Bills & "
"Receipts` section."
msgstr ""
"Para recibos del punto de venta: Ve a :menuselection:`Punto de venta --> "
"Configuración --> Ajustes` y dirígete a la sección :guilabel:`Facturas y "
"recibos`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:245
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:258
msgid ""
"Then, enable the :guilabel:`Gulf Cooperation Council Format` option, "
"and :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Después, activa la opción :guilabel:`Formato del Consejo de Cooperación del "
"Golfo` y haz clic en :guilabel:`Guardar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:250
msgid "Electronic invoicing with ZATCA"
msgstr "Facturación electrónica con ZATCA"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:252
msgid ""
"The ZATCA e-invoicing system is designed to streamline and digitize the "
"invoicing process for businesses operating in Saudi Arabia."
msgstr ""
"El sistema de facturas electrónicas ZATCA esta diseñado para optimizar y "
"digitalizar el proceso de facturación para empresas que operan en Arabia "
"Saudita.  "

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:255
msgid ""
"ZATCA Phase 2 employs a clearance e-invoicing model for Business-to-Business "
"(B2B) transactions. Conversely, for Business-to-Consumer (B2C) transactions, "
"Odoo generates a QR code and subsequently reports these transactions to the "
"Fatoora reporting endpoint."
msgstr ""
"ZATCA Fase 2 usa un modelo de facturación electrónica con autorización "
"previa para las transacciones de empresa a empresa (B2B). En cambio, para "
"las transacciones de empresa a consumidor (B2C), Odoo genera un código QR y "
"luego reporta estas transacciones al punto de conexión de reportes de "
"Fatoora."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:259
msgid ""
"In a B2B scenario, a :guilabel:`Tax Invoice` is issued, whereas in a B2C "
"scenario, a :guilabel:`Simplified Tax Invoice` is generated."
msgstr ""
"En un escenario B2B es necesario emitir una :guilabel:`factura fiscal`, "
"mientras que en un escenario B2C hay que generar una :guilabel:`factura "
"fiscal simplificada`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:263
msgid ""
"`ZATCA e-invoicing page <https://zatca.gov.sa/en/E-Invoicing/Pages/"
"default.aspx>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Página web de facturación electrónica ZATCA <https://zatca.gov.sa/en/E-"
"Invoicing/Pages/default.aspx>`_"

