msgstr ":guilabel:`429 – Demasiadas solicitudes (Factura no recibida)`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:428
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:430
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:432
