"If you wish to have any amount input in the :guilabel:`II` section (from "
"boxes :guilabel:`[08]` to :guilabel:`[11]`), you must change the "
"**industry** of the corresponding contact to :guilabel:`Agriculture`:"
msgstr ""
"Si desea ingresar cualquier monto en la sección :guilabel:`II` (de la "
"casilla :guilabel:`[08]` a la casilla :guilabel:`[11]`) debe cambiar la "
"**industria** del contacto correspondiente a :guilabel:`Agricultura`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:179
msgid ""
"Go to the contact form (:menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> "
"Customers` or :menuselection:`Accounting --> Vendors --> Vendors`, for "
"example), and select a contact."
msgstr ""
"Vaya al formulario de contacto (:menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Clientes --"
"> Clientes` o :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Proveedores --> Proveedores`, "
"por ejemplo) y seleccione un contacto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:181
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Sales & Purchase` tab, set the :guilabel:`Industry` field "
"to :guilabel:`Agriculture`."
msgstr ""
"Configura el campo :guilabel:`Industria` de la pestaña :guilabel:`Ventas y "
"compras` con la opción :guilabel:`Agricultura`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:184
msgid ""
"Repeat this operation for all contacts related to the **agriculture** "
"industry."
msgstr ""
"Repita esta operación para todos los contactos relacionados con la industria "
"**agrícola**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:189
msgid "Veri*Factu"
msgstr "Veri*Factu"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:192
msgid ""
"Producers of Veri*Factu billing systems must self-certify their compliance "
"with the regulations. :download:`Download Odoo's \"declaración "
"responsable\"<spain/declaracion_responsable.pdf>`"
msgstr ""
"Los productores de los sistemas de facturación de Veri*Factu deben "
"certificar por cuenta propia que están cumpliendo con las "
"regulaciones. :download:`Descarga la \"declaración responsable\" de Odoo "
"<spain/declaracion_responsable.pdf>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:195
msgid ""
"**Veri*Factu** is the Spanish Tax Agency's verifiable invoice issuance "
"system. It is mandatory for most taxpayers in Spain, except for those who "
"use the SII system or are under a regional tax regime (i.e., TicketBai)."
msgstr ""
"**Veri*Factu** es el sistema de emisión de facturas verificables de la "
"Agencia Tributaria española. Es obligatorio para la mayoría de los "
"contribuyentes en España, excepto para aquellos que usan el sistema SII o "
"están bajo un régimen fiscal regional (es decir, TicketBai)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:199
msgid ""
"Odoo allows :ref:`invoices <localizations/spain/veri-factu-invoices>` and "
"Point of Sale :ref:`orders <localizations/spain/veri-factu-orders>` to be "
"automatically sent to the tax authorities."
msgstr ""
"Odoo permite que las :ref:`facturas <localizations/spain/veri-factu-"
"invoices>` y las :ref:`órdenes <localizations/spain/veri-factu-orders>` del "
"Punto de venta se envíen de forma automática a las autoridades fiscales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:207
msgid "To enable **Veri\\*Factu**, follow these steps:"
msgstr "Para activar **Veri\\*Factu**, sigue los pasos a continuación:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:209
msgid ""
"Open the Settings app to make sure your company's :guilabel:`Country` "
"and :guilabel:`Tax ID` are correctly set in the :ref:`Companies <general/"
"companies/company>` section."
msgstr ""
"Abre la aplicación Ajustes para asegurarte de que el :guilabel:`País` "
"y :guilabel:`número de identificación fiscal` de tu empresa sean correctos "
"en la sección :ref:`Empresas <general/companies/company>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:211
msgid ""
":ref:`Install <general/install>` the :guilabel:`Spain - Veri*Factu` "
"(`l10n_es_edi_verifactu`) module."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Instala <general/install>` el módulo :guilabel:`España - Veri*Factu` "
"(`l10n_es_edi_verifactu`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:213
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings` "
"or :menuselection:`Invoicing --> Configuration --> Settings`, scroll to "
"the :guilabel:`Veri\\*Factu` section, check the :guilabel:`Enable "
"Veri*Factu` option, and click :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Manage "
"certificates` to add a certificate."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Ajustes` "
"o :menuselection:`Facturación --> Configuración --> Ajustes`, desplázate "
"hasta la sección :guilabel:`Veri\\*Factu`, marca la "
"opción :guilabel:`Habilitar Veri*Factu` y haz clic en :icon:`oi-arrow-"
"right` :guilabel:`Administrar certificados` para agregar un certificado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:217
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Certificates for Veri\\*Factu` list view, "
"click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"En la vista de lista :guilabel:`Certificados para Veri\\*Factu` haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Nuevo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:218
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Upload your file`, then select a certificate file and enter "
"the :guilabel:`Password` needed to open the certificate (if there is one)."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Subir tu archivo`, después selecciona un archivo de "
"certificado e ingresa la :guilabel:`Contraseña` necesaria para abrir el "
"certificado (si es que hay una)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:222
msgid "At least one certificate has to be uploaded."
msgstr "Debes subir al menos un certificado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:223
msgid ""
"By default, Veri*Factu is in testing mode. The data is sent to test servers "
"and is not considered official. When official data can be sent to the "
"production servers, go to the :guilabel:`Veri\\*Factu` section in "
"the :guilabel:`Settings` and disable :guilabel:`Test Environment`."
msgstr ""
"Por defecto, Veri*Factu está en modo de prueba. Los datos se envían a "
"servidores de prueba y no se consideran oficiales. Cuando los datos "
"oficiales puedan enviarse a los servidores de producción, ve a la "
"sección :guilabel:`Veri\\*Factu` en los :guilabel:`Ajustes` y "
"deshabilita :guilabel:`Entorno de prueba`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:233
msgid ""
"Once an :doc:`invoice <../../finance/accounting/customer_invoices>` is "
"confirmed, it can be :ref:`sent <accounting/invoice/sending>`. In "
"the :guilabel:`Send` window, the Veri*Factu option is available if "
"Veri*Factu has been enabled."
msgstr ""
"Después de confirmar la :doc:`factura <../../finance/accounting/"
"customer_invoices>` podrás :ref:`enviarla <accounting/invoice/sending>`. Si "
"habilidateste Veri*Factu tendrás disponible esa opción en la "
"ventana :guilabel:`Enviar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:237
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Send` to generate a JSON file containing the invoice "
"details. This file is stored as a Veri*Factu document. In "
"the :guilabel:`Veri*Factu` tab, all corresponding documents are listed by "
"their creation date and current status."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Enviar` para generar un archivo JSON que contenga los "
"detalles de la factura. Este archivo se guarda como un documento de "
"Veri*Factu. En la pestaña :guilabel:`Veri*Factu`, todos los documentos "
"correspondientes se muestran con su fecha de creación y estado actual."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:242
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:267
msgid ""
"To download a JSON file, click on its document in the :guilabel:`Veri*Factu` "
"tab. Then, in the :guilabel:`Open: Veri*Factu Documents` window, click the "
"link in the :guilabel:`JSON` field."
msgstr ""
"Para descargar un archivo JSON, haz clic en su documento en la "
"pestaña :guilabel:`Veri*Factu`. Después, en la ventana :guilabel:`Abrir: "
"Documentos de Veri*Factu`, haz clic en el enlace del campo :guilabel:`JSON`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:246
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:271
msgid ""
"The document should be sent to the :abbr:`AEAT (Agencia Estatal de "
"Administración Tributaria)` immediately. However, it may be delayed due to "
"mandatory waiting periods between submissions required by the :abbr:`AEAT "
"(Agencia Estatal de Administración Tributaria)`. In such cases, the document "
"is automatically sent the next time a scheduled action runs."
msgstr ""
"El documento se enviará de forma inmediata a la :abbr:`AEAT (Agencia Estatal "
"de Administración Tributaria)`. Sin embargo, es posible que se retrase por "
"los tiempos de espera obligatorios entre envíos que requiere la :abbr:`AEAT "
"(Agencia Estatal de Administración Tributaria)`. En estos casos, el "
"documento se envía de forma automática la próxima vez que se ejecuta una "
"acción programada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:250
msgid ""
"A Veri\\*Factu **QR code** appears on the invoice PDF. Scan this code to "
"verify that the invoice has been received and recognized by the :abbr:`AEAT "
"(Agencia Estatal de Administración Tributaria)`."
msgstr ""
"En el PDF aparecerá un **Código QR** de Veri\\*Factu. Escanéalo para "
"verificar que la factura se recibió y la reconoció la :abbr:`AEAT (Agencia "
"Estatal de Administración Tributaria)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:257
msgid "Point of sale orders"
msgstr "Órdenes del Punto de venta"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:259
msgid ""
"Once an order has been :ref:`paid <pos/use/sell>`, a JSON file containing "
"the order details is generated. This file is stored as a Veri*Factu document."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que una orden haya sido :ref:`pagada <pos/use/sell>`, el sistema "
"generará un archivo JSON con los detalles de la orden y lo almacenará como "
"un documento Veri*Factu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:262
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Orders --> Orders`. In "
"the :guilabel:`Orders` list view, select the relevant order. In "
"the :guilabel:`Veri*Factu` tab, all the corresponding documents are listed "
"by their creation date and current status."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Punto de venta --> Órdenes --> Órdenes`. En la vista de "
"lista de :guilabel:`Órdenes` selecciona la que necesites. En la "
"pestaña :guilabel:`Veri*Factu`, todos los documentos correspondientes se "
"muestran por fecha de creación y estado actual."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:276
msgid ""
"If an invoice is generated for an order during the payment process, the "
"Veri*Factu document is :ref:`created and sent for the invoice <localizations/"
"spain/veri-factu-invoices>` instead."
msgstr ""
"Si se genera una factura para una orden durante el proceso de pago, el "
"documento de Veri*Factu se :ref:`crea y se envía para la factura "
"<localizations/spain/veri-factu-invoices>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:280
msgid ""
"A Veri\\*Factu **QR code** appears on the order receipt, even if an invoice "
"is created for the order. Scan this code to verify that the invoice has been "
"received and recognized by the :abbr:`AEAT (Agencia Estatal de "
"Administración Tributaria)`"
msgstr ""
"En el recibo de la orden aparece un **Código QR** de Veri\\*Factu, incluso "
"si se crea una factura para la orden. Escanea este código para verificar que "
"la factura se recibió y la reconoció la :abbr:`AEAT (Agencia Estatal de "
"Administración Tributaria)`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:287
msgid "TicketBAI"
msgstr "TicketBAI"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:289
msgid ""
"`Ticket BAI <https://www.gipuzkoa.eus/es/web/ogasuna/ticketbai>`_ or "
"**TBAI** is an e-Invoicing system used by the Basque government and its "
"three provincial councils (Álava, Biscay, and Gipuzkoa). Odoo supports the "
"**TicketBAI (TBAI)** electronic invoicing format for all three regions of "
"the **Basque Country**."
msgstr ""
"`Ticket BAI <https://www.gipuzkoa.eus/es/web/ogasuna/ticketbai>`_ o **TBAI** "
"es un sistema de facturación electrónica utilizado por el gobierno vasco y "
"sus tres diputaciones forales (Álava, Vizcaya y Guipúzcoa). Odoo admite el "
"formato de facturación electrónica **TicketBAI (TBAI)** para las tres "
"regiones del **País Vasco**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:295
msgid "To use TicketBAI, make sure:"
msgstr "Para usar TicketBAI, asegúrate de que:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:297
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Country` and :guilabel:`Tax ID` fields on the :doc:`company "
"record <../../general/companies>` are filled in."
msgstr ""
"Los campos :guilabel:`País` e :guilabel:`ID fiscal` en el :doc:`registro de "
"la empresa <../../general/companies>` estén completados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:299
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Spain -TicketBAI` (`l10n_es_edi_TBAI`) module is :ref:`installed "
"<general/install>`."
msgstr ""
"El módulo :guilabel:`España -TicketBAI` (`l10n_es_edi_TBAI`) "
"esté :ref:`instalado <general/install>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:301
msgid "To configure TicketBAI, follow these steps:"
msgstr "Para configurar TicketBAI, sigue estos pasos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:303
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings` and scroll "
"down to the :guilabel:`Spain Localization` section."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Ajustes` y "
"desplázate hacia abajo hasta la sección :guilabel:`Localización española`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:305
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Registro de Libros connection TicketBAI` section, select a "
"region in the :guilabel:`Tax Agency for TBAI` field and :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"En la sección :guilabel:`Conexión del Registro de Libros TicketBAI`, "
"selecciona una región en el campo :guilabel:`Agencia tributaria para TBAI` y "
"haz clic en :guilabel:`Guardar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:307
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Manage certificates (TicketBAI)`."
msgstr "Haz clic en :guilabel:`Administrar certificados (TicketBAI)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:308
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Certificates for EDI TicketBAI invoices on Spain` view, "
"click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"En la vista :guilabel:`Certificados para facturas EDI TicketBAI en España`, "
"haz clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:309
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Upload your file` to upload the certificate, enter "
"the :guilabel:`Certificate Password` provided by the tax agency, and "
"select :guilabel:`TBAI` in the :guilabel:`Certificate scope` field."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Sube tu archivo` para cargar el certificado, ingresa "
"la :guilabel:`Contraseña del certificado` proporcionada por la agencia "
"tributaria y selecciona :guilabel:`TBAI` en el campo :guilabel:`Alcance del "
"certificado`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:314
msgid ""
"To test certificates, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> "
"Settings` and, in the :guilabel:`Spain Localization` section, "
"enable :guilabel:`TBAI Test Mode`."
msgstr ""
"Para probar los certificados, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> "
"Configuración --> Ajustes` y, en la sección :guilabel:`Localización "
"española`, habilita :guilabel:`Modo de prueba TBAI`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:320
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:362
msgid "Use case"
msgstr "Caso de uso"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:322
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:364
msgid ""
"Once an invoice is :ref:`created <accounting/invoice/creation>` "
"and :ref:`confirmed <accounting/invoice/confirmation>`, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"Una vez que una factura está :ref:`creada <accounting/invoice/creation>` "
"y :ref:`confirmada <accounting/invoice/confirmation>`, sigue estos pasos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:326
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Print & Send` window, make sure the :guilabel:`TicketBAI` "
"option is enabled and click :guilabel:`Send`"
msgstr ""
"En la ventana :guilabel:`Imprimir y enviar`, asegúrate de que la "
"opción :guilabel:`TicketBAI` esté habilitada y haz clic en :guilabel:`Enviar`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:328
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`TicketBAI` invoice tab, the :guilabel:`TicketBAI status` "
"is updated to :guilabel:`Sent`, and the XML file is available in "
"the :guilabel:`TicketBAI Post File` field."
msgstr ""
"En la pestaña de factura :guilabel:`TicketBAI`, el :guilabel:`Estado de "
"TicketBAI` se actualiza a :guilabel:`Enviado`, y el archivo XML está "
"disponible en el campo :guilabel:`Archivo de publicación de TicketBAI`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:332
msgid "The TBAI **QR code** is displayed on the invoice PDF."
msgstr "El **código QR** de TBAI aparece en el PDF de la factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:334
msgid "QR code of the TicketBAI on the invoice."
msgstr "Código QR de TicketBAI en la factura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:340
msgid "FACe"
msgstr "FACe"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:343
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:389
msgid ""
"Make sure the :guilabel:`Spain - Facturae EDI` (`l10n_es_edi_facturae`) "
"module is :ref:`installed <general/install>`."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de que el módulo :guilabel:`España - Facturae EDI` "
"(`l10n_es_edi_facturae`) esté :ref:`instalado <general/install>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:346
msgid ""
"`FACe <https://face.gob.es/en>`_ is the e-Invoicing platform used by the "
"public administrations in Spain to send electronic invoices."
msgstr ""
"`FACe <https://face.gob.es/en>`_ es la plataforma de facturación electrónica "
"utilizada por las administraciones públicas en España para el envío de "
"facturas electrónicas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:349
msgid "To configure FACe, follow these steps:"
msgstr "Siga los siguientes pasos para configurar FACe:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:351
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration` "
"or :menuselection:`Invoicing --> Configuration`, and "
"select :guilabel:`Certificates` in the :guilabel:`Spain Facturae EDI` "
"section."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración` "
"o :menuselection:`Facturación --> Configuración`, y "
"selecciona :guilabel:`Certificados` en la sección :guilabel:`España Facturae "
"EDI`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:354
msgid "Click :guilabel:`New` to create a new certificate."
msgstr "Haga clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo` para crear un certificado nuevo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:355
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Upload your file` to upload the certificate, enter "
"the :guilabel:`Certificate Password` provided by the tax agency, and "
"select :guilabel:`Facturae` in the :guilabel:`Certificate scope` field."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Cargar tu archivo` para subir el certificado, ingresa "
"la :guilabel:`Contraseña del certificado` proporcionada por la agencia "
"tributaria, y selecciona :guilabel:`Facturae` en el campo :guilabel:`Alcance "
"del certificado`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:367
msgid ""
"Make sure the customer has a valid VAT number and that their country is set "
"to `Spain`."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de que el cliente tenga un número de IVA válido y que su país esté "
"establecido como `España`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:369
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Print & Send` window, make sure the :guilabel:`Factura-e` "
"option is enabled and click :guilabel:`Send`."
msgstr ""
"En la ventana :guilabel:`Imprimir y enviar`, asegúrate de que la "
"opción :guilabel:`Factura-e` esté habilitada y haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Enviar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:371
msgid ""
"The generated XML file, available in the **chatter**, must then be sent "
"manually."
msgstr ""
"El archivo XML generado, disponible en el **chatter**, debe enviarse "
"manualmente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:374
msgid "The XML file is **NOT** sent automatically."
msgstr "El archivo XML **NO** se envía automáticamente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:377
msgid ""
"**FACe** XML files can be sent in batch through `the governmental portal "
"<https://www.facturae.gob.es/formato/Paginas/descarga-aplicacion-"
"escritorio.aspx>`_."
msgstr ""
"Los archivos XML de **FACe** se pueden enviar en lote a través de `el portal "
"gubernamental <https://www.facturae.gob.es/formato/Paginas/descarga-"
"aplicacion-escritorio.aspx>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:383
msgid "Administrative centers"
msgstr "Centros administrativos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:385
msgid ""
"For **FACe** to work with **administrative centers**, the invoice *must* "
"include specific data about the centers."
msgstr ""
"Para que **FACe** funcione con **centros administrativos**, la factura "
"*debe* incluir datos específicos sobre los centros."

