#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/switzerland.rst:3
msgid "Switzerland"
msgstr "Suiza"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/switzerland.rst:6
msgid "ISR (In-payment Slip with Reference number)"
msgstr "ISR (recibo de pago con número de referencia)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/switzerland.rst:8
msgid ""
"The ISRs are payment slips used in Switzerland. You can print them directly "
"from Odoo. On the customer invoices, there is a new button called *Print "
"ISR*."
msgstr ""
"Los ISR son recibos de pago que se utilizan en Suiza. Puede imprimirlos "
"directamente desde Odoo. En las facturas de cliente hay un botón nuevo que "
"se llama *Imprimir ISR*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/switzerland.rst:16
msgid ""
"The button *Print ISR* only appears there is well a bank account defined on "
"the invoice. You can use CH6309000000250097798 as bank account number and "
"010391391 as CHF ISR reference."
msgstr ""
"El botón *Imprimir ISR* solo aparece cuando hay una cuenta bancaria definida "
"en la factura. Puede usar CH6309000000250097798 como número de cuenta "
"bancario y 010391391 como referencia ISR en CHF."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/switzerland.rst:23
msgid "Then you open a pdf with the ISR."
msgstr "Luego abra un PDF con el ISR."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/switzerland.rst:28
msgid ""
"There exists two layouts for ISR: one with, and one without the bank "
"coordinates. To choose which one to use, there is an option to print the "
"bank information on the ISR. To activate it, go "
"in :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings --> Customer "
"Invoices` and enable **Print bank on ISR**:"
msgstr ""
"Hay dos diseños para el ISR: uno con las coordenadas bancarias y uno sin "
"ellas. Para elegir cuál usar, hay una opción para imprimir la información "
"bancaria en el ISR. Para activarlo, vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> "
"Configuración --> Ajustes --> Facturas de clientes` y habilite la función "
"**Imprimir banco en el ISR**:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/switzerland.rst:38
msgid "ISR reference on invoices"
msgstr "Referencia ISR en las facturas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/switzerland.rst:40
msgid ""
"To ease the reconciliation process, you can add your ISR reference as "
"**Payment Reference** on your invoices."
msgstr ""
"Para facilitar el proceso de conciliación, puede agregar su referencia ISR "
"como **referencia de pago** en sus facturas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/switzerland.rst:43
msgid ""
"To do so, you need to configure the Journal you usually use to issue "
"invoices. Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Journals`, "
"open the Journal you want to modify (By default, the Journal is named "
"*Customer Invoices*), click en *Edit*, and open the *Advanced Settings* tab. "
"In the **Communication Standard** field, select *Switzerland*, and click on "
"*Save*."
msgstr ""
"Para hacerlo, debe configurar el diario que usualmente usa para emitir "
"facturas. Ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Diarios`, "
"abra el diario que desea modificar (de forma predeterminada, el nombre del "
"diario es *Facturas de clientes*), haga clic en *Editar* y abra la pestaña "
"de *Ajustes avanzados*. En el campo de **comunicación estándar**, seleccione "
"*Suiza* y haga clic en *Guardar*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/switzerland.rst:48
msgid ""
"Configure your Journal to display your ISR as payment reference on your "
"invoices in Odoo"
msgstr ""
"Configuración de diario para mostrar el ISR como referencia de pago en las "
"facturas en Odoo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/switzerland.rst:53
msgid "Currency Rate Live Update"
msgstr "Actualización en vivo de la tasa de cambio"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/switzerland.rst:55
msgid ""
"You can update automatically your currencies rates based on the Federal Tax "
"Administration from Switzerland. For this, go in :menuselection:`Accounting "
"--> Settings`, activate the multi-currencies setting and choose the service "
"you want."
msgstr ""
"Puede actualizar automáticamente sus tasas de cambio de divisas con base en "
"la Administración Federal de Impuestos de Suiza. Para esto, vaya "
"a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Ajustes`, active los ajustes multidivisa "
"y elija el servicio que desea."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/switzerland.rst:64
msgid "Updated VAT for January 2025"
msgstr "IVA actualizado para enero de 2025"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/switzerland.rst:66
msgid ""
"Starting from the 1st January 2025, new increased VAT rates are applied in "
"Switzerland. The normal 8.0% rate switched to 8.1% and the specific rate for "
"the hotel sector switched to 3.8%. Basic needs goods have a reduced rate of "
"2.6% applied."
msgstr ""
"A partir del 1 de enero de 2025, se aplican nuevas tasas de IVA "
"incrementadas en Suiza. La tasa normal del 8.0% pasó al 8.1% y la tasa "
"específica para el sector hotelero pasó a 3.8%. Los productos de primera "
"necesidad tienen una tasa reducida del 2.6%."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/switzerland.rst:73
msgid "ISO 20022 and SEPA pain versions"
msgstr "Versiones ISO 20022 y SEPA pain"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/switzerland.rst:75
msgid ""
"Switzerland uses a specific, localized version of the :ref:`ISO 20022 "
"<accounting/sepa_payments/iso20022>` format. To configure the appropriate "
"Swiss format, open the **Accounting** app, go "
"to :menuselection:`Configuration --> Journals`, and open your **bank** "
"journal. Click the :guilabel:`Outgoing Payments` tab, then "
"click :guilabel:`Add a line`, and select :guilabel:`Swiss ISO20022`."
msgstr ""
"Suiza utiliza una versión específica y localizada del formato :ref:`ISO "
"20022 <accounting/sepa_payments/iso20022>`. Para configurar el formato suizo "
"apropiado, abre la aplicación **Contabilidad**, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Configuración --> Diarios`, y abre tu diario **bancario**. "
"Haz clic en la pestaña :guilabel:`Pagos salientes`, luego haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Agregar una línea`, y selecciona :guilabel:`ISO20022 suizo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/switzerland.rst:81
msgid ""
"If you need to make :doc:`SEPA payments <../accounting/payments/"
"sepa_payments>`, you can configure a specific PAIN version. Go "
"to :menuselection:`Configuration --> Journals` and open "
"your :guilabel:`Bank` journal. Depending on your configuration needs:"
msgstr ""
"Si necesitas hacer :doc:`pagos SEPA <../accounting/payments/sepa_payments>`, "
"puedes configurar una versión PAIN específica. Ve "
"a :menuselection:`Configuración --> Diarios` y abre tu "
"diario :guilabel:`Bancario`. Dependiendo de tus necesidades de configuración:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/switzerland.rst:85
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Incoming Payments` tab, click :guilabel:`Add a line`, "
"select a SEPA payment method, and choose a version from the :guilabel:`SEPA "
"Pain Version` field."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en la pestaña :guilabel:`Pagos entrantes`, haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Agregar una línea`, selecciona un método de pago SEPA, y elige "
"una versión del campo :guilabel:`Versión SEPA Pain`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/switzerland.rst:87
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Outgoing Payments` tab, click :guilabel:`Add a line`, "
"select a SEPA payment method, and choose a version from the :guilabel:`XML "
"Format` field."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en la pestaña :guilabel:`Pagos salientes`, haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Agregar una línea`, selecciona un método de pago SEPA y elige "
"una versión desde el campo :guilabel:`Formato XML`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/switzerland.rst:96
msgid ""
"To set the **PAIN** version used for XML exports, refer to "
"this :ref:`section <switzerland/iso20022>`."
msgstr ""
"Para configurar la versión **PAIN** utilizada para las exportaciones XML, "
"consulta esta :ref:`sección <switzerland/iso20022>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/switzerland.rst:103
msgid ""
"On the **batch payment creation** screen, before "
"clicking :guilabel:`Validate`, you can define which parties will bear the "
"charges through the :guilabel:`Charge Bearer` field."
msgstr ""
"En la pantalla de **creación de lote de pagos**, antes de hacer clic "
"en :guilabel:`Validar`, puedes definir qué partes asumirán los cargos a "
"través del campo :guilabel:`Responsable de los cargos`."

