#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/taiwan.rst:78
msgid ""
"To manage the distinction between :abbr:`B2C (Business-to-Consumer)` "
"and :abbr:`B2B (Business-to-Business)` invoices, configure the following "
"fields in their :doc:`contact <../../essentials/contacts>` form:"
msgstr ""
"Para gestionar la diferencia entre las facturas :abbr:`B2C (Empresa a "
"consumidor)` y :abbr:`B2B (Empresa a empresa)`, configura los siguientes "
"campos en su formulario de :doc:`contacto <../../essentials/contacts>`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/taiwan.rst:82
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Individual` (B2C): Fill in the individual's :guilabel:`name` and "
"provide the :guilabel:`Email` or :guilabel:`Phone` number."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Particular` (B2C): completa el :guilabel:`nombre` del particular "
"y proporciona el :guilabel:`correo electrónico` o el número de "
":guilabel:`teléfono`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/taiwan.rst:84
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company` (B2B): Fill in the company :guilabel:`name`, enter "
"the :guilabel:`Tax ID`, and provide the :guilabel:`Email` "
"or :guilabel:`Phone` number."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Empresa` (B2B): completa el :guilabel:`nombre` de la empresa, "
"ingresa el :guilabel:`NIF` y proporciona el :guilabel:`correo electrónico` o "
"el número de :guilabel:`teléfono`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/taiwan.rst:88
msgid ""
"Invoices sent to individuals not linked to a :guilabel:`Company` contact are "
"treated as a **B2C invoice**."
msgstr ""
"Las facturas enviadas a las personas que no están vinculadas a un contacto "
"de :guilabel:`Empresa` se tratan como **facturas B2C**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/taiwan.rst:90
msgid ""
"Invoices sent to individuals belonging to a :guilabel:`Company` contact are "
"treated as a **B2B invoice** (to the parent Company)."
msgstr ""
"Las facturas enviadas a las personas que pertenecen a un contacto "
"de :guilabel:`empresa` se tratan como **facturas B2B** (a la empresa matriz)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/taiwan.rst:101
