msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Credit Note` on the relevant invoice and enter "
"the :guilabel:`Reason displayed on Credit Note`."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Nota de crédito` en la factura correspondiente y "
"escribe el :guilabel:`motivo que aparece en la nota de crédito`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/taiwan.rst:247
msgid ""
"Select the :guilabel:`Agreement Type` and the :guilabel:`Allowance Notify "
"Way`, and click :guilabel:`Reverse`."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona el :guilabel:`tipo de acuerdo` y el :guilabel:`método de "
"notificación de la bonificación`, y haz clic en :guilabel:`Revertir`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/taiwan.rst:249
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/taiwan.rst:267
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Confirm`, then :guilabel:`Send`, ensuring :guilabel:`Send "
"to Ecpay (Issue Allowance)` is selected."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Confirmar` y después en :guilabel:`Enviar`. Asegúrate "
