#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/taiwan.rst:252
msgid ""
"Then, The :guilabel:`Refund State` updates to :guilabel:`Agreed` "
"(for :guilabel:`Offline agreements`) or :guilabel:`To be agreed` "
"(for :guilabel:`Online agreements`). Additionally, the :guilabel:`Refund "
"Invoice Number`, :guilabel:`Refund invoice Agreement Type` "
"and :guilabel:`Allowance Notify Way` updates accordingly in "
"the :guilabel:`Ecpay` tab."
msgstr ""
"Después, el :guilabel:`estado del reembolso` cambia a :guilabel:`Acordado` "
"(para los :guilabel:`acuerdos fuera de línea`) o :guilabel:`Por acordar` "
"(para los :guilabel:`acuerdos en línea`). Además, el :guilabel:`número de "
"factura de reembolso`, el :guilabel:`tipo de acuerdo de factura de "
"reembolso` y el :guilabel:`método de notificación de la bonificación` se "
"actualizan en la pestaña :guilabel:`ECPay`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/taiwan.rst:261
msgid "B2B credit notes"
