#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:3
msgid "Thailand"
msgstr "Tailandia"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:10
msgid ""
":ref:`Install <general/install>` the following modules to get all the "
"features of the Thai localization:"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Instala <general/install>` los siguientes módulos para obtener todas "
"las funciones de la localización tailandesa:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:19
msgid ":guilabel:`Thailand - Accounting`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Tailandia - Contabilidad`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:20
msgid "`l10n_th`"
msgstr "`l10n_th`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:23
msgid ":guilabel:`Thailand - Accounting Reports`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Tailandia - Reportes contables`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:24
msgid "`l10n_th_reports`"
msgstr "`l10n_th_reports`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:25
msgid "This module includes the accounting reports for Thailand."
msgstr "Este módulo incluye los informes contables para Tailandia."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:32
msgid ""
"The Thai localization package ensures compliance with Thailand's fiscal and "
"accounting regulations. It includes tools for managing taxes, withholding "
"taxes, reporting, and a predefined chart of accounts tailored to Thai "
"standards."
msgstr ""
"El paquete de localización tailandesa garantiza el cumplimiento de las "
"normativas fiscales y contables de Tailandia. Incluye herramientas para "
"gestionar impuestos, retenciones de impuestos, informes y un plan contable "
"predefinido adaptado a los estándares tailandeses."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:41
msgid ""
"Installing the :guilabel:`Thailand - Accounting` (`l10n_th`) "
"and :guilabel:`Thailand - Accounting Reports` (`l10n_th_reports`) modules "
"automatically creates default :doc:`taxes <../accounting/taxes>` "
"for :ref:`tax reports <localizations/thailand/tax_reports>` generation. The "
"package includes the following taxes:"
msgstr ""
"La instalación de los módulos :guilabel:`Tailandia - Contabilidad` "
"(`l10n_th`) y :guilabel:`Tailandia - Informes contables` (`l10n_th_reports`) "
"crea automáticamente :doc:`impuestos <../accounting/taxes>` predeterminados "
"para la generación de :ref:`informes fiscales <localizations/thailand/"
"tax_reports>`. El paquete incluye los siguientes impuestos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:46
msgid "**VAT 7%**: For goods where VAT is recognized upon invoicing."
msgstr "**IVA 7%**: para bienes en los que el IVA se reconoce al facturar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:47
msgid "**VAT 7% S**: For services where VAT is recognized upon payment."
msgstr "**IVA 7% S**: para servicios en los que el IVA se reconoce al pagar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:48
msgid ""
"**VAT 0%**: For taxable goods or services charged at a zero rate, usually "
"exports."
msgstr ""
"**IVA 0%**: para bienes o servicios imponibles gravados a una tasa del cero "
"por ciento, generalmente exportaciones."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:49
msgid ""
"**VAT-exempted**: For specific goods or services completely exempted from "
"collection or payment of VAT."
msgstr ""
"**Exento de IVA**: para bienes o servicios específicos totalmente exentos "
"del cobro o pago de IVA."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:51
msgid ""
":doc:`../../finance/accounting/taxes/retention`: For payments where tax must "
"be deducted at the source by the payer."
msgstr ""
":doc:`../../finance/accounting/taxes/retention`: para pagos donde el pagador "
"debe retener el impuesto en la fuente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:56
msgid "Income tax type (Under section 40)"
msgstr "Tipo de impuesto sobre la renta (bajo la sección 40)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:58
msgid ""
"Income tax types are essential for generating **Withholding tax certificates "
"(50 Tawi)** and **P.N.D. 3 & 53** reports and ensuring compliance with "
"regulatory requirements."
msgstr ""
"Los tipos de impuestos sobre la renta son esenciales para generar informes "
"de **Certificados de retención de impuestos (50 Tawi)** y **P.N.D. 3 y 53** "
"y garantizar el cumplimiento de los requisitos reglamentarios."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:61
msgid ""
"To configure income tax types, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Taxes`. For taxes with the :guilabel:`Purchase` tax type "
"and :guilabel:`Withhold On Payment` enabled, select the "
"appropriate :guilabel:`Income Tax Type`."
msgstr ""
"Para configurar los tipos de impuesto sobre la renta, ve a "
":menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Impuestos`. Para los "
"impuestos con el tipo de impuesto :guilabel:`Compra` y :guilabel:`Retención "
"en el pago` habilitado, selecciona el :guilabel:`Tipo de impuesto sobre la "
"renta` adecuado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:70
msgid ""
"The relevant VAT and WHT reports can be generated and exported as `CSV` "
"files compatible with RD Prep (:dfn:`Thai Revenue Department's official "
"software used to format tax data for e-Filing.`)."
msgstr ""
"Los informes pertinentes de IVA y retenciones pueden generarse y exportarse "
"como archivos `CSV` compatibles con RD Prep (:dfn:`Software oficial del "
"Departamento de Ingresos de Tailandia utilizado para dar formato a los datos "
"fiscales para la declaración electrónica.`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:76
msgid "P.P. 30 - VAT report"
msgstr "P.P. 30 - Informe de IVA"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:78
msgid ""
"The **P.P. 30** is a monthly value-added tax (VAT) return report required by "
"the Revenue Department of Thailand. It summarizes the output and input VAT "
"for the period."
msgstr ""
"El **P.P. 30** es un informe mensual de declaración del impuesto sobre el "
"valor añadido (IVA) requerido por el Departamento de Ingresos de Tailandia. "
"Resume el IVA repercutido y soportado del periodo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:81
msgid ""
"The P.P. 30 report can be exported in `CSV` format, compatible with the **RD "
"Prep**. To do so, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"El informe P.P. 30 se puede exportar en formato `CSV`, compatible con el "
"**RD Prep**. Para hacerlo, sigue estos pasos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:84
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Tax Report`, "
"click :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`Report`, and select :guilabel:`P.P.30 - VAT "
"Report`."
msgstr ""
"Navega a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Informes --> Informe fiscal`, haz "
"clic en :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`Informe` y selecciona :guilabel:`P.P.30 - "
"Informe de IVA`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:86
msgid "Make sure to filter by the appropriate date or date range."
msgstr "Asegúrate de filtrar por la fecha o el rango de fechas adecuado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:87
msgid ""
"On the report page, click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` icon and "
"select :guilabel:`Export for RD Prep (CSV)`."
msgstr ""
"En la página del informe, haz clic en el icono :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`"
"(engranaje)` y selecciona :guilabel:`Exportar para RD Prep (CSV)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:93
msgid "Sales and purchase tax reports"
msgstr "Informes de impuestos de ventas y compras"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:95
msgid ""
"The sales and purchase tax reports detail all input and output VAT "
"transactions for a specific period, serving as mandatory compliance document "
"that VAT-registered businesses must maintain for record-keeping and present "
"to the Revenue Department during tax audits."
msgstr ""
"Los informes de impuestos de ventas y compras detallan todas las "
"transacciones de IVA soportado y repercutido durante un periodo específico, "
"sirviendo como un documento de cumplimiento obligatorio que las empresas "
"registradas en IVA deben mantener para sus registros y presentar al "
"Departamento de Ingresos durante las auditorías fiscales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:99
msgid ""
"The sales and purchase tax reports can be exported as `XLSX` files. To do "
"so, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"Los informes de impuestos de ventas y compras se pueden exportar como "
"archivos `XLSX`. Para hacerlo, sigue estos pasos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:102
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` icon and select :guilabel:`Sales "
"Tax Report (xlsx)` or :guilabel:`Purchase Tax Report (xlsx)`."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en el icono :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(engranaje)` y selecciona "
":guilabel:`Informe de impuesto sobre ventas (xlsx)` o :guilabel:`Informe de "
"impuesto sobre compras (xlsx)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:108
msgid "P.N.D. 3 & 53 - WHT report"
msgstr "P.N.D. 3 y 53 - Informe de retenciones"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:110
msgid ""
"The **P.N.D. 3** and **P.N.D. 53** reports list all the transactions within "
"the period subject to the withholding of income tax from vendor bills. This "
"applies when a company makes payments for services received (such as rental, "
"hiring, transportation, insurance, management fees, or consulting) and is "
"required to withhold \"Personal (PND3)\" or \"Corporate (PND53)\" income tax."
msgstr ""
"Los informes **P.N.D. 3** y **P.N.D. 53** listan todas las transacciones "
"dentro del periodo sujetas a la retención de impuesto sobre la renta de "
"facturas de proveedores. Esto aplica cuando una empresa realiza pagos por "
"servicios recibidos (como alquiler, contratación, transporte, seguros, "
"honorarios de gestión o consultoría) y está obligada a retener el impuesto "
"sobre la renta \"Personal (PND3)\" o \"Corporativo (PND53)\"."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:115
msgid ""
"To access them, navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Tax "
"Report`, click :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`Report`, and "
"select :guilabel:`P.N.D. 3 & 53 - WHT Report (TH)`."
msgstr ""
"Para acceder a ellos, navega a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Informes --> "
"Informe fiscal`, haz clic en :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`Informe` y "
"selecciona :guilabel:`P.N.D. 3 y 53 - Informe de retenciones (TH)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:118
msgid ""
"Both P.N.D. 3 and P.N.D. 53 reports can be exported in `CSV` format, which "
"is compatible with the **RD Prep** application. To do so, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"Tanto los informes P.N.D. 3 como P.N.D. 53 se pueden exportar en formato "
"`CSV`, el cual es compatible con la aplicación **RD Prep**. Para hacerlo, "
"sigue estos pasos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:122
msgid ""
"On the report page, click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` icon and "
"select :guilabel:`PND3 - Export for RD Prep (CSV)` or :guilabel:`PND 53 - "
"Export for RD Prep (CSV)`."
msgstr ""
"En la página del informe, haz clic en el icono :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`"
"(engranaje)` y selecciona :guilabel:`PND3 - Exportar para RD Prep (CSV)` o "
":guilabel:`PND 53 - Exportar para RD Prep (CSV)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:125
msgid ""
"This generates the :file:`Tax Report PND 3.csv` and :file:`Tax Report PND "
"53.csv` files that list all the vendor bill lines with the applicable "
"withholding tax."
msgstr ""
"Esto genera los archivos :file:`Tax Report PND 3.csv` y :file:`Tax Report "
"PND 53.csv` que listan todas las líneas de factura de proveedor con la "
"retención de impuestos aplicable."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:131
msgid "Withholding tax certificate (50 Tawi)"
msgstr "Certificado de retención de impuestos (50 Tawi)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:133
msgid ""
"The **50 Tawi**, or *Withholding Tax Certificate*, is a certificate issued "
"by a payer to a payee as official proof that tax has been withheld from a "
"payment for remittance to the Revenue Department."
msgstr ""
"El **50 Tawi**, o *Certificado de retención de impuestos*, es un certificado "
"que el pagador emite al beneficiario como prueba oficial de que se ha "
"retenido un impuesto de un pago para remitirlo al Departamento de Ingresos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:137
msgid "To generate a `PDF` file of a withholding tax certificate:"
msgstr ""
"Para generar un archivo `PDF` de un certificado de retención de impuestos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:139
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Vendors --> Payments` and select the "
"payment subject to withholding tax."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Proveedores --> Pagos` y selecciona el "
"pago sujeto a retención de impuestos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:141
msgid "Click the :guilabel:`Print 50 Tawi` button."
msgstr "Haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Imprimir 50 Tawi`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:148
msgid ""
"The Thai localization utilizes specific fields :doc:`/applications/"
"essentials/contacts` to generate Revenue Department reports and files used "
"for submission."
msgstr ""
"La localización tailandesa utiliza campos específicos :doc:`/applications/"
"essentials/contacts` para generar informes del Departamento de Ingresos y "
"archivos que se utilizan para la presentación."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:154
msgid "Branch number"
msgstr "Número de la sucursal"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:156
msgid ""
"You can specify a company's branch number directly in the **Contacts** app. "
"Open the company's contact form, and click the :icon:`fa-"
"plus` :guilabel:`(plus)` icon next to the :guilabel:`Tax ID` field to add "
"the :guilabel:`Branch Code`:"
msgstr ""
"Puedes especificar el número de sucursal de una empresa directamente en la "
"aplicación **Contactos**. Abre el formulario de contacto de la empresa y haz "
"clic en el icono :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`(más)` junto al campo "
":guilabel:`ID fiscal` para añadir el :guilabel:`Código de sucursal`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:160
msgid ""
"If the contact is identified as a branch, input the Branch number in "
"the :guilabel:`Branch Code` field."
msgstr ""
"Si el contacto se identifica como una sucursal, introduce el número de "
"sucursal en el campo :guilabel:`Código de sucursal`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:162
msgid ""
"If the contact is a Headquarters, leave the :guilabel:`Branch Code` field "
"blank."
msgstr ""
"Si el contacto es una sede central, deja el campo :guilabel:`Código de "
"sucursal` en blanco."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:165
msgid ""
"Only companies set in :guilabel:`Thailand` feature the :guilabel:`Branch "
"Code` field."
msgstr ""
"Solo las empresas configuradas en :guilabel:`Tailandia` cuentan con el campo "
":guilabel:`Código de sucursal`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:175
msgid "Tax invoice"
msgstr "Factura impositiva "

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:177
msgid ""
"To print a tax invoice, follow the steps to :ref:`create an invoice "
"<accounting/invoice/creation>` and click :guilabel:`Print` to download the "
"PDF tax invoice."
msgstr ""
"Para imprimir una factura fiscal, sigue los pasos para :ref:`crear una "
"factura <accounting/invoice/creation>` y haz clic en :guilabel:`Imprimir` "
"para descargar la factura fiscal en PDF."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:180
msgid ""
"To print commercial invoices, click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` "
"icon, click :guilabel:`Print`, then select :guilabel:`Commercial Invoice`."
msgstr ""
"Para imprimir facturas comerciales, haz clic en el icono :icon:`fa-cog` "
":guilabel:`(engranaje)`, haz clic en :guilabel:`Imprimir` y selecciona "
":guilabel:`Factura comercial`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:188
msgid "PromptPay QR code on invoices"
msgstr "Código QR de PromptPay en facturas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:190
msgid ""
"The PromptPay QR code can be added to invoices to allow customers to pay "
"their bills using the PromptPay-supported bank mobile application. The QR "
"code is generated based on the invoice amount and one of the following "
"merchant information:"
msgstr ""
"El código QR de PromptPay puede añadirse a las facturas para permitir que "
"los clientes paguen sus cuentas mediante la aplicación móvil bancaria "
"compatible con PromptPay. El código QR se genera según el importe de la "
"factura y una de la siguiente información del comerciante:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:194
msgid "Ewallet ID"
msgstr "ID de la billetera electrónica"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:195
msgid "Merchant Tax ID"
msgstr "Número de contribuyente del comerciante"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:196
msgid "Mobile Number"
msgstr "Número de teléfono"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:198
msgid ""
"To activate PromptPay QR codes on invoices, go to :menuselection:`Accounting "
"--> Configuration --> Settings` and enable the :guilabel:`Add QR-code Link "
"on PDF` feature under the :guilabel:`Invoice Online Payment` option."
msgstr ""
"Para activar los códigos QR de PromptPay en las facturas, ve a "
":menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Ajustes` y habilita la "
"función :guilabel:`Añadir enlace de código QR en PDF` en la opción "
":guilabel:`Pago de facturas en línea`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:205
msgid "Bank account configuration"
msgstr "Configuración de la cuenta bancaria"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:207
msgid ""
"To configure the bank account for PromptPay QR codes, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Journals`, and open the "
"journal linked to the relevant bank account."
msgstr ""
"Para configurar la cuenta bancaria para los códigos QR de PromptPay, ve a "
":menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Diarios`, y abre el "
"diario vinculado a la cuenta bancaria correspondiente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:210
msgid "Under :guilabel:`Journal Entries` tab, fill in the bank account number:"
msgstr ""
"Debajo de la pestaña :guilabel:`Asientos contables`, introduce el número de "
"cuenta bancaria:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:212
msgid ""
"For an existing account: Hover over the account number and click "
"the :icon:`oi-arrow-right` icon."
msgstr ""
"Para una cuenta existente: pasa el cursor sobre el número de cuenta y haz "
"clic en el icono :icon:`oi-arrow-right`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:213
msgid ""
"For a new account: Type the account number and click :guilabel:`Create`."
msgstr ""
"Para una cuenta nueva: escribe el número de cuenta y haz clic en "
":guilabel:`Crear`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:215
msgid ""
"In the bank account form view, go to the :guilabel:`EMV QR Settings` tab. "
"Select the relevant :guilabel:`Proxy Type` and enter the "
"corresponding :guilabel:`Proxy Value`."
msgstr ""
"En la vista de formulario de la cuenta bancaria, ve a la pestaña "
":guilabel:`Configuración de QR EMV`. Selecciona el :guilabel:`Tipo de proxy` "
"correspondiente e introduce el :guilabel:`Valor del proxy`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:219
msgid "PromptPay bank account configuration"
msgstr "Configuración de la cuenta bancaria para el código PromptPay"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:223
msgid ":doc:`../../finance/accounting/bank`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../finance/accounting/bank`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:228
msgid "Issue invoices with PromptPay QR code"
msgstr "Emitir facturas con códigos QR de Prompt Pay"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:230
msgid ""
"When creating a new invoice, open the :guilabel:`Other Info` tab and "
"select :guilabel:`Recipient Bank` with the account that has :ref:`PromptPay "
"QR configured <localizations/thailand/configureqr>`."
msgstr ""
"Al crear una nueva factura, abre la pestaña :guilabel:`Otra información` y "
"selecciona el :guilabel:`Banco receptor` con la cuenta que tiene :ref:`el "
"código QR de PromptPay configurado <localizations/thailand/configureqr>`."

