#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:63
msgid ""
"The Turkish localization package ensures compliance with Turkish fiscal and "
"accounting regulations. It includes tools for managing taxes, fiscal "
"positions, reporting, and a predefined chart of accounts tailored to "
"Türkiye's standards."
msgstr ""
"El paquete de localización de Turquía garantiza el cumplimiento de las leyes "
"fiscales y contables turcas. Incluye herramientas para gestionar impuestos, "
"posiciones fiscales, reportes y un plan de cuentas predefinido adaptado a "
"las normas de Turquía."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:67
msgid ""
"The Turkish localization package provides the following key features to "
"ensure compliance with local fiscal and accounting regulations:"
msgstr ""
"El paquete de localización turca ofrece las siguientes funciones clave para "
"garantizar el cumplimiento de las normativas fiscales y contables locales:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:70
msgid ""
":doc:`../accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts`: a predefined structure "
"tailored to Turkish accounting standards"
msgstr ""
":doc:`../accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts`: Una estructura "
"predefinida adaptada a las normas contables turcas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:72
msgid ""
":ref:`localizations/turkiye/taxes`: pre-configured tax rates, including "
"standard VAT, zero-rated, and exempt options"
msgstr ""
":ref:`localizations/turkiye/taxes`: Tasas impositivas preconfiguradas, "
"incluido el IVA estándar, de tasa cero y excepciones."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:76
msgid ""
":ref:`localizations/turkiye/eds`: integration with Nilvera to meet "
"electronic document regulations"
msgstr ""
":ref:`localizations/turkiye/eds`: Integración con Nilvera para cumplir con "
"las normativas de los documentos electrónicos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:88
msgid ""
"The Türkiye chart of accounts is based on the Turkish Revenue "
"Administration's (Gelir İdaresi Başkanlığı's (GİB)) 7/A accounts, which "
"provide a baseline of the necessary accounts. 7/B accounts are archived and "
"can be unarchived if required."
msgstr ""
"El plan de cuentas de Turquía está basado en las cuentas 7/A de la "
"Administración Tributaria de Turquía (Gelir İdaresi Başkanlığı (GİB)), que "
"ofrecen una base de las cuentas necesarias. Las cuentas 7/B están archivadas "
"y puedes desarchivarlas en caso de que las necesites."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:97
msgid ""
":doc:`Taxes <../accounting/taxes>` are automatically created and configured "
