"corporativos. El reporte está disponible en :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> "
"Reportes --> Reporte de impuestos corporativos` e incluye:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:162
msgid "Net profit"
msgstr "Ganancias netas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:163
msgid "Exempt income"
msgstr "Ingresos exentos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:164
msgid "Allowable deductions"
msgstr "Deducciones permitidas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:165
msgid "Adjustments for non-deductible (disallowed) expenses"
msgstr "Ajustes por gastos no deducibles (rechazados)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:166
msgid "Corporate tax amount"
msgstr "Importe del impuesto corporativo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:168
msgid ""
"As part of this report, users can set :ref:`exempt income <localizations/uae/"
"exempt-income-accounts>`, :ref:`allowable deductions <localizations/uae/"
"allowable-deductions-accounts>`, and :ref:`disallowed expenses accounts "
"<localizations/uae/disallowed-expenses>`."
msgstr ""
"Como parte de este reporte, los usuarios pueden definir :ref:`ingresos "
"exentos <localizations/uae/exempt-income-accounts>`, :ref:`deducciones "
"permitidas <localizations/uae/allowable-deductions-accounts>` "
"y :ref:`cuentas de gastos no deducibles <localizations/uae/disallowed-"
"expenses>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:174
msgid ""
"No default fiscal categories, disallowed expenses, allowable deduction "
"accounts, or exempt income accounts are configured. Users must classify them "
"manually according to their tax situation."
msgstr ""
"No existen categorías fiscales, gastos no deducibles, cuentas de deducciones "
"permitidas ni cuentas de ingresos exentos configuradas de forma "
"predeterminada. Es necesario clasificarlas de manera manual según la "
"situación fiscal."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:180
msgid "Exempt income accounts"
msgstr "Cuentas de ingresos exentos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:182
msgid ""
"Exempt income generally refers to revenue that is not subject to corporate "
"tax under UAE rules. Examples may include:"
msgstr ""
"Los ingresos exentos se refieren, por lo general, a ingresos que no están "
"sujetos al impuesto corporativo según las normas de los Emiratos Árabes "
