"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Customers` "
"or :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Orders --> Customers`, and open the "
"relevant customer form.  In the :guilabel:`Language` field, update the "
"language preference. All documents for that customer are then automatically "
"generated in the selected language."
msgstr ""
"Nivel de cliente: Para asignar un idioma preferido a un cliente, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Clientes --> Clientes` o "
"a :menuselection:`Punto de venta --> Órdenes --> Clientes` y abre el "
"formulario del cliente correspondiente. Actualiza la preferencia de idioma "
"en el campo :guilabel:`Idioma`. El sistema generará todos los documentos de "
"ese cliente en el idioma seleccionado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:251
msgid ""
"Company level: To add Arabic as a secondary language to meet business needs:"
msgstr ""
"Nivel de empresa: Para agregar árabe como idioma secundario y cubrir las "
"necesidades de la empresa:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:263
msgid "Invoice types"
msgstr "Tipos de factura"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:265
msgid "The type of invoice to be issued depends on the following criteria:"
msgstr "El tipo de factura a emitir depende de los siguientes criterios:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:267
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tax Invoices (B2B)`: A :guilabel:`Tax Invoice`, used for business-"
"to-business transactions, contains all the details required for VAT "
"recovery, including the supplier and customer legal names, "
"addresses, :abbr:`TRN (Tax Registration Number)` numbers (where applicable), "
"itemized VAT amounts, and total amounts. This is the standard document "
"required when a customer intends to reclaim VAT."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Facturas fiscales (B2B)`: Una :guilabel:`factura fiscal`, que se "
"usa en transacciones entre empresas, incluye todos los datos necesarios para "
"la recuperación del IVA, como los nombres legales del proveedor y del "
"cliente, las direcciones, los números de :abbr:`TRN (Número de registro "
"fiscal)` cuando corresponde, los importes de IVA desglosados y los importes "
"totales. Este documento es el estándar cuando el cliente busca recuperar el "
"IVA."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:272
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Simplified Tax Invoices (B2C)`: A :guilabel:`Simplified Tax "
"Invoice` is primarily used for business-to-consumer (B2C) transactions, "
"where the customer is not expected to reclaim VAT. It contains reduced "
"customer information (customer :abbr:`TRN (Tax Registration Number)` is not "
"required), focusing instead on supplier details, VAT charged, and the total "
"amount payable."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Facturas fiscales simplificadas (B2C)`: Una :guilabel:`factura "
"fiscal simplificada` se usa sobre todo en transacciones de empresa a "
"consumidor, donde el cliente no busca recuperar el IVA. Incluye información "
"reducida del cliente, ya que no requiere el :abbr:`TRN (Número de registro "
"fiscal)` del cliente, y se enfoca en los datos del proveedor, el IVA cobrado "
"y el importe total por pagar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:278
msgid ""
"To create a :guilabel:`Tax Invoice` for a customer, fill in "
"the :guilabel:`TRN` field on the customer contact form. If this field is "
"left empty, a :guilabel:`Simplified Tax Invoice` is generated instead."
msgstr ""
"Para crear una :guilabel:`factura de impuestos` para un cliente, completa el "
"campo :guilabel:`TRN` en el formulario de contacto del cliente. Si este "
"campo se deja vacío, se genera una :guilabel:`factura de impuestos "
"simplificada` en su lugar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:281
msgid ""
"If the customer's :abbr:`TRN (Tax Registration Number)` is not available, "
"and a :guilabel:`Tax Invoice` is required, enter `N/A` in "
"the :guilabel:`TRN` field on the contact form."
msgstr ""
"Si el :abbr:`TRN (número de registro fiscal)` del cliente no está disponible "
"y se requiere una :guilabel:`factura de impuestos`, escribe `N/A` en el "
"campo :guilabel:`TRN` en el formulario de contacto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:285
msgid ""
"A :guilabel:`Simplified Tax Invoice` is still a legally valid tax invoice "
"under VAT law."
msgstr ""
"Una :guilabel:`factura fiscal simplificada` sigue siendo una factura fiscal "
"válida desde el punto de vista legal según la normativa de IVA."

