"en la parte superior de la página."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:772
msgid ""
"Wise offers a `Sandbox environment <https://wise-sandbox.com>`_ for testing "
"features and integrations."
msgstr ""
"Wise ofrece un `Entorno sandbox <https://wise-sandbox.com>`_ para probar "
"funciones e integraciones."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:775
msgid ""
"Select the appropriate environment to ensure accurate results (*sandbox* for "
"testing, *production* for real transactions)."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona el entorno adecuado para obtener resultados precisos (*pruebas* o "
"de lo contrario *producción* para realizar transacciones reales)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:779
msgid "Pay vendor bills with direct deposit"
msgstr "Pagar facturas de proveedores mediante depósito directo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:781
msgid ""
"After configuring direct deposit in both Wise and Odoo, vendor payments can "
"be created individually in the Odoo database, batched for transfer, and then "
"paid in Wise."
msgstr ""
"Después de configurar el depósito directo tanto en Wise como en Odoo puedes "
"crear pagos a proveedores por separado en la base de datos de Odoo, "
"agruparlos para la transferencia y luego pagarlos en Wise."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:784
msgid ":ref:`Create vendor bills <accounting/vendor_bills/creation>`."
msgstr ":ref:`Crea facturas de proveedor <accounting/vendor_bills/creation>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:785
msgid ""
":doc:`Pay the vendor bills <../accounting/payments>` using :guilabel:`U.S. "
"Direct Deposit` as the :guilabel:`Payment Method` for the transaction."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Paga las facturas de proveedor <../accounting/payments>` al "
"seleccionar :guilabel:`Depósito directo en EE. UU.` como "
"el :guilabel:`método de pago` de la transacción."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:787
msgid ""
":doc:`Create a batch payment <../accounting/payments/batch>`. Batch payments "
"can include payments from multiple vendors."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Crea un pago por lote <../accounting/payments/batch>`. Los pagos por "
"lote pueden incluir pagos para varios proveedores."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:789
msgid ""
"Confirm the :guilabel:`Batch Type` is :guilabel:`Outbound`, and "
"click :guilabel:`Initiate payment`. Odoo will redirect to Wise."
msgstr ""
"Confirma que el :guilabel:`tipo de lote` sea :guilabel:`Saliente` y haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Iniciar pago`. Odoo te redirigirá a Wise."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:792
msgid ""
"Sign into the Wise account if needed, and see all the pending transactions."
msgstr ""
"Inicia sesión en la cuenta de Wise si es necesario y revisa todas las "
"transacciones pendientes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:794
msgid ""
"Review the details and confirm the batch number is the same in Odoo and Wise."
msgstr ""
"Revisa los detalles y confirma que el número de lote sea el mismo en Odoo y "
"en Wise."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:795
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Pay for this batch` or :guilabel:`I've now paid` to pay for "
"the entire batch."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Pagar este lote` o en :guilabel:`Ya realicé el pago` "
"para pagar todo el lote."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:798
msgid ""
"If pop-ups are blocked in the browser settings, Odoo can't redirect to Wise. "
"Instead, Odoo displays a message stating:"
msgstr ""
"Si las ventanas emergentes están bloqueadas en la configuración del "
"navegador, Odoo no podrá redirigirte a Wise. En su lugar, mostrará el "
"siguiente mensaje:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:801
msgid ""
"`\"A popup window has been blocked. You may need to change your browser "
"settings to allow popup windows for this page.\"`"
msgstr ""
"`\"Se bloqueó una ventana emergente. Es posible que debas cambiar la "
"configuración de tu navegador para permitir ventanas emergentes en esta "
"página\".`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:804
msgid ""
"The payment record is still created in Wise, and can be accessed by "
"clicking :guilabel:`View Batch` on the batch payment."
msgstr ""
"El registro del pago se crea de todas formas en Wise y puedes acceder a él "
"al hacer clic en :guilabel:`Ver lote` en el pago por lote."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:808
msgid "Cancel a batch payment"
msgstr "Cancelar un pago por lotes"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:810
msgid "To cancel a batch payment, follow these steps:"
msgstr "Sigue estos pasos para cancelar un pago por lotes:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:812
msgid "Navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Vendors --> Batch Payments`."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Proveedores --> Pagos por lotes`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:813
msgid ""
"Select the batch payment to cancel, then click :guilabel:`View Batch`. Odoo "
"will redirect to the batch in Wise. Sign into the Wise account if needed."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona el pago por lotes a cancelar, luego haz clic en :guilabel:`Ver "
"lote`. Odoo redirigirá al lote en Wise. Inicia sesión en la cuenta de Wise "
"si es necesario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:815
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Cancel batch` in Wise."
msgstr "Haz clic en :guilabel:`Cancelar lote` en Wise."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:820
msgid ""
"ISO 20022 is a global standard for sending financial information between "
"banks and payment systems using XML files. It can be thought of as a "
"universal language for money messages."
msgstr ""
"ISO 20022 es un estándar global para enviar información financiera entre "
"bancos y sistemas de pago con archivos XML. Puedes verlo como un lenguaje "
"universal para mensajes de dinero."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:823
msgid ""
"This standard helps banks all over the world talk to each other in the same "
"way, or *language*, so information is transferred correctly, making sending "
"and receiving money faster, clearer, and safer."
msgstr ""
"Este estándar ayuda a que los bancos de todo el mundo se comuniquen de la "
"misma forma o con el mismo *idioma* para transferir la información sin "
"errores. Esto hace que enviar y recibir dinero sea más rápido, claro y "
"seguro."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:826
msgid ""
"In Odoo, ISO 20022 files are generated from :ref:`batch payments <l10n_us/"
"batch-payment>`."
msgstr ""
"En Odoo, los archivos ISO 20022 se generan desde los :ref:`pagos por lotes "
"<l10n_us/batch-payment>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:829
msgid "Configurations"
msgstr "Configuraciones"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:831
msgid ""
"Before creating ISO 20022 records, several configurations must be made, "
"including :ref:`general settings <l10n_us/settings>`, contact information "
"for the :ref:`company <l10n_us/contact-info-company>`, and contact and "
"banking information for all :ref:`recipients <l10n_us/contact-info-"
"recipient>`."
msgstr ""
"Antes de crear registros ISO 20022 es necesario configurar varias cosas, "
"como los :ref:`ajustes generales <l10n_us/settings>`, la información de "
"contacto de la :ref:`empresa <l10n_us/contact-info-company>` y la "
"información de contacto y bancaria de todos los :ref:`destinatarios <l10n_us/"
"contact-info-recipient>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:839
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Ajustes"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:841
msgid ""
"First, navigate to :menuselection:`Acounting app --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`, scroll to the :guilabel:`Customer Payment` section, and enable "
"the :guilabel:`Batch Payments` option."
msgstr ""
"Primero, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Ajustes`, "
"dirígete a a la sección :guilabel:`Pago de cliente` y activa la "
"función :guilabel:`Pagos por lote`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:844
msgid ""
"Then scroll to the :guilabel:`Vendor Payments` section and enable "
"the :guilabel:`SEPA Credit Transfer / ISO20022` option. Once Enabled, three "
"fields appear: :guilabel:`Your Company`, :guilabel:`Name Identification`, "
"and :guilabel:`Issuer`. Enter the information for these fields. The "
"information entered is required by the bank to identify the account, and is "
"added to the XML file."
msgstr ""
"Después ve a la sección :guilabel:`Pagos de proveedor` y activa la "
"función :guilabel:`Transferencia de crédito SEPA / ISO20022`. Al activarla "
"aparecen tres campos: :guilabel:`Tu empresa`, :guilabel:`Identificación del "
"nombre` y :guilabel:`Emisor`. Ingresa la información en estos campos, ya que "
"el banco la necesita para identificar la cuenta y será parte del archivo XML."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:849
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Save` after making changes."
msgstr "Haz clic en :guilabel:`Guardar` después de hacer cambios."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:851
msgid ""
"The settings configured for the ISO 20022 in the Accounting app settings "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Los ajustes configurados para ISO 20022 en la página de ajustes de la "
"aplicación Contabilidad."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:855
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Name Identification` and :guilabel:`Issuer` information are "
"typically provided by the bank."
msgstr ""
"La información de :guilabel:`Identificación del nombre` y :guilabel:`Emisor` "
"suele proporcionarla el banco."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:863
msgid ""
"Ensure the company's address information is correct, as the XML files "
"generated include the company address. Navigate to "
"the :menuselection:`Settings app --> Users & Companies --> Companies`, and "
"click on the desired company to open the company form. Ensure "
"the :guilabel:`Address` fields are fully configured in "
"the :guilabel:`General Information` tab."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de que la dirección de la empresa sea correcta, ya que los "
"archivos XML generados incluyen la dirección. Ve a :menuselection:`Ajustes --"
"> Usuarios y empresas --> Empresas` y haz clic en la empresa para abrir su "
"formulario. Verifica que los campos de la sección :guilabel:`Dirección` de "
"la pestaña :guilabel:`Información general` sean correctos y estén completos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:868
msgid "The company record with address information completed."
msgstr "El registro de la empresa con los datos de la dirección completos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:874
msgid "Recipient information"
msgstr "Información del destinatario"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:876
msgid ""
"The XML file generated contains the address and banking information for "
"*all* recipients. Open the **Contacts** app and ensure every contact record "
"that receives payments, both persons and companies, includes "
"complete :guilabel:`Address` information in the top-half of the contact form."
msgstr ""
"El archivo XML generado incluye la dirección y la información bancaria de "
"*todos* los destinatarios. Abre la aplicación **Contactos** y asegúrate de "
"que cada registro de contacto que recibe pagos, tanto personas como "
"empresas, tenga la información completa en los campos de la "
"sección :guilabel:`Dirección` en la parte superior del formulario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:880
msgid "The contact record for a company with address information completed."
msgstr ""
"El registro de contacto de una empresa con la información de dirección "
"completa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:883
msgid ""
"Next, click into the :guilabel:`Accounting` tab, and ensure at least one "
"trusted bank account populates the :guilabel:`Banks` field. If no bank is "
"listed, add a :ref:`new bank account <l10n_us/add-bank>`."
msgstr ""
"Después, haz clic en la pestaña :guilabel:`Contabilidad` y asegúrate de que "
"haya al menos una cuenta bancaria confiable en el campo :guilabel:`Bancos`. "
"Si no aparece ninguna, agrega una :ref:`nueva cuenta bancaria <l10n_us/add-"
"bank>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:890
msgid "Add a bank account"
msgstr "Agregar una cuenta bancaria"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:892
msgid ""
"To add a bank account on a contact record, open the **Contacts** app and "
"click on the contact record, and click into the :guilabel:`Accounting` tab. "
"Click into the blank field next to :guilabel:`Banks`, "
"click :guilabel:`Create...`, and a :guilabel:`Create Banks` pop-up window "
"loads. Fill out the following fields on the form, then "
"click :guilabel:`Save`:"
msgstr ""
"Para agregar una cuenta bancaria a un registro de contacto, abre la "
"aplicación **Contactos**, haz clic en el contacto y luego ve a la "
"pestaña :guilabel:`Contabilidad`. Haz clic en el campo vacío junto "
"a :guilabel:`Bancos`, haz clic en :guilabel:`Crear...` y aparecerá una "
"ventana emergente llamada :guilabel:`Crear bancos`. Completa los siguientes "
"campos del formulario y luego haz clic en :guilabel:`Guardar`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:897
msgid ":guilabel:`Account Number`: Enter the bank account number."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Número de cuenta`: Ingresa el número de cuenta bancaria."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:898
msgid ""
":guilabel:`ABA/Routing Number`: Enter the ABA or routing number for the "
"account."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Número ABA / de ruta`: Ingresa el número ABA o de ruta de la "
"cuenta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:899
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Account Holder`: Using the drop-down menu, select the owner of "
"the bank account. The contact name (person or company) populates this field "
"by default."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Titular de la cuenta`: Usa el menú desplegable para seleccionar a "
"la persona titular de la cuenta. Este campo incluye el nombre del contacto "
"(persona o empresa) de forma predeterminada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:901
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bank`: Using the drop-down menu, select the bank for the account. "
"If the bank does not appear in the list, add a new bank by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Search more...` then click :guilabel:`New`, and fill out "
"the :guilabel:`Create Bank` form."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Banco`: Usa el menú desplegable para seleccionar el banco de la "
"cuenta. Si el banco no aparece en la lista, crea uno nuevo "
"con :guilabel:`Buscar más...`, luego haz clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo` y "
"completa el formulario :guilabel:`Crear banco`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:904
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Send Money`: Ensure this slider is set to :guilabel:`Trusted`. "
"The slider and text appears green if the bank account is trusted. If this is "
"**not** set to trusted, an error appears when attempting to make a payment "
"to the contact."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Enviar dinero`: Asegúrate de que este botón tenga la "
"opción :guilabel:`Confiable` activa. El botón y el texto serán de color "
"verde si la cuenta bancaria es confiable. Si **no** la marcas como confiable "
"aparecerá un error cuando intentes pagarle al contacto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:908
msgid "Bank information on the Create Banks form."
msgstr "Información bancaria en el formulario Crear bancos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:912
msgid ""
"Trusted bank accounts appear in green in the :guilabel:`Accounting` tab."
msgstr ""
"Las cuentas bancarias confiables aparecen de color verde en la "
"pestaña :guilabel:`Contabilidad`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:914
msgid "A trusted bank account on a contact form."
msgstr "Una cuenta bancaria confiable en un formulario de contacto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:918
msgid "Bank journal settings"
msgstr "Ajustes del diario bancario"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:920
msgid ""
"Ensure the ISO payment methods appear in the bank journal, and are "
"configured correctly. Navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting app --> "
"Configurations --> Journals` and click on the journal :guilabel:`Bank`. "
"Click into the :guilabel:`Outgoing Payments` tab, and ensure that in "
"the :guilabel:`Payment Method` column, both `ISO20022` and `U.S. ISO20022` "
"appear."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de que los métodos de pago ISO aparezcan en el diario bancario y "
"que estén configurados de forma correcta. Ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad "
"--> Configuración --> Diarios` y haz clic en el diario :guilabel:`Banco`. "
"Haz clic en la pestaña :guilabel:`Pagos salientes` y confirma que en la "
"columna :guilabel:`Método de pago` aparezcan `ISO20022` y `U.S. ISO20022`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:925
msgid ""
"Next, ensure all entries listed have the :guilabel:`101404 Outstanding "
"Payments` account selected in the :guilabel:`Outstanding Payments accounts` "
"column. This allows Odoo to create journal entries for payments."
msgstr ""
"Luego confirma que todas las entradas tengan la cuenta :guilabel:`101404 "
"Pagos pendientes` en la columna :guilabel:`Cuentas de pagos pendientes`. "
"Esto permite que Odoo cree asientos contables para los pagos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:930
msgid "ISO20022 vs U.S. ISO20022"
msgstr "ISO20022 y U.S. ISO20022"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:932
msgid ""
"The U.S. ISO20022 is similar to the ISO standard, with some U.S.-specific "
"rules and formatting."
msgstr ""
"U.S. ISO20022 funciona igual que la norma ISO, con reglas y formato "
"específicos de Estados Unidos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:935
msgid ""
"The U.S. ISO20022 uses ABA routing numbers, which are specific to the U.S., "
"while the generic ISO20022 uses IBAN numbers."
msgstr ""
"U.S. ISO20022 usa números de ruta ABA, exclusivos de Estados Unidos, "
"mientras que el ISO20022 genérico usa números IBAN."

