#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:954
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "Ejemplos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:955
msgid "SEPA Credit Transfer (Europe), SWIFT MX messages"
msgstr "Transferencia de crédito SEPA (Europa), mensajes SWIFT MX"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:956
msgid "Fedwire ISO 20022, CHIPS ISO 20022"
msgstr "Fedwire ISO 20022, CHIPS ISO 20022"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:957
msgid "Differences"
msgstr "Diferencias"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:958
msgid "Global fields and formats"
msgstr "Campos y formatos globales"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:959
msgid ""
"Trimmed or modified to fit U.S. needs (e.g., ABA routing numbers instead of "
"IBANs)"
msgstr ""
"Versión adaptada para las necesidades de Estados Unidos (por ejemplo, "
"números de ruta ABA en lugar de IBAN)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:962
msgid ""
"It is recommended to use the generic ISO20022 for *international* transfers, "
"and use the U.S. ISO20022 for *domestic* transfers."
msgstr ""
"Lo más recomendable es usar el ISO20022 genérico para las transferencias "
"*internacionales* y U.S. ISO20022 para transferencias *nacionales*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:968
msgid ""
"First, :ref:`create <accounting/vendor_bills/creation>` and :ref:`confirm "
"<accounting/vendor_bills/bill-confirmation>` a vendor bill. Then, click "
"the :guilabel:`Pay` button, and a :guilabel:`Pay` pop-up window loads. Using "
"the drop-down menu, select :guilabel:`ISO20022` in the :guilabel:`Payment "
"Method` field, then click :guilabel:`Create Payment`."
msgstr ""
"Primero :ref:`crea <accounting/vendor_bills/creation>` y :ref:`confirma "
"<accounting/vendor_bills/bill-confirmation>` una factura de proveedor, luego "
"haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Pagar` para abrir la ventana "
"emergente :guilabel:`Pagar`. Con el menú desplegable "
"selecciona :guilabel:`ISO20022` en el campo :guilabel:`Método de pago` y haz "
"clic en :guilabel:`Crear pago`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:973
msgid "The Pay pop-up window configured for ISO20022."
msgstr "La ventana emergente Pagar configurada para ISO20022."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:976
msgid ""
"A green :guilabel:`In Payment` banner now appears on the vendor bill. Next, "
"navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Vendors --> Payments`, and tick "
"the checkbox next to the payment that was paid using ISO20022 file to select "
"it. Click :guilabel:`Create Batch`, then click :guilabel:`Validate` on the "
"batch form. Once validated, the batch payment moves to the :guilabel:`Sent` "
"stage, and the U.S. ISO20022 XML file is created and added to the chatter. "
"The XML file can be downloaded and used to initiate a bank payment."
msgstr ""
"Ahora aparecerá la cinta verde :guilabel:`En proceso de pago` en la factura "
"de proveedor. Después, ve a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Proveedores --> "
"Pagos` y selecciona la casilla junto al pago realizado con el archivo "
"ISO20022 para elegirlo. Haz clic en :guilabel:`Crear lote` y luego haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Validar` en el formulario del lote. Una vez validado, el pago "
"por lote pasará a la etapa :guilabel:`Enviado` y el sistema creará el "
"archivo XML U.S. ISO20022 y lo agregará al chatter. Puedes descargar el "
"archivo XML y usarlo para iniciar un pago bancario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:983
msgid "A batch payment with the XML file in the chatter."
msgstr "Un pago por lote con el archivo XML en el chatter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:986
msgid ""
"Once the XML file is created, the following steps occur **outside** of the "
"Odoo database."
msgstr ""
"Después de crear el archivo XML, los siguientes pasos ocurren **fuera** de "
"la base de datos de Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:988
msgid ""
"Log into the bank's online portal or payment system. Most banks that support "
"ISO 20022 have a special section for `file uploads` or `import payments`. "
"Upload the XML ISO 20022 file created by Odoo (ending in `.xml`) and upload "
"it to the bank system."
msgstr ""
"Ingresa al portal en línea o al sistema de pagos del banco. La mayoría de "
"los bancos que aceptan ISO 20022 tienen una sección especial para `cargar "
"archivos` o `importar pagos`. Sube el archivo XML de ISO 20022 que creó Odoo "
"(termina en `.xml`) y cárgalo al sistema del banco."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:992
msgid ""
"The bank checks the XML file by reading the file and making sure all details "
"(accounts, amounts, etc.) are valid. The list of payments appears inside the "
"file. Review and confirm the information, then click `Approve` or `Submit`."
msgstr ""
"El banco revisa el archivo XML y confirma que todos los detalles (cuentas, "
"importes y más) sean válidos. La lista de pagos aparece dentro del archivo. "
"Revisa y confirma la información y luego haz clic en `Aprobar` o `Enviar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:996
msgid ""
"The bank processes each payment in the file and transfers the funds to the "
"recipients."
msgstr ""
"El banco procesa cada pago del archivo y transfiere los fondos a los "
"destinatarios."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uruguay.rst:3
msgid "Uruguay"
msgstr "Uruguay"

