msgid ""
"The following modules are installed automatically with the Uzbek "
"localization:"
msgstr ""
"Los siguientes módulos se instalan de forma automática con la localización "
"uzbeka:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:21
msgid "Uzbekistan - Accounting"
msgstr "Uzbekistán - Contabilidad"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:22
msgid "l10n_uz"
msgstr "l10n_uz"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:23
msgid ""
"Default fiscal localization package for Uzbekistan. Includes the chart of "
"accounts and core accounting configuration aligned with local requirements."
msgstr ""
"Paquete de localización fiscal predeterminado para Uzbekistán. Incluye el "
"plan de cuentas y la configuración contable básica alineada con los "
"requisitos locales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:25
msgid "Uzbekistan - Accounting Reports"
msgstr "Uzbekistán - Reportes de contabilidad"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:26
msgid "l10n_uz_reports"
msgstr "l10n_uz_reports"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:27
msgid ""
"Provides localized financial reports, including the balance sheet and profit "
"and loss statement based on an |IFRS|-style structure."
msgstr ""
"Proporciona reportes financieros localizados, incluido el balance general y "
"el estado de resultados basado en una estructura estilo |IFRS|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:35
msgid ""
"The Uzbekistan localization assists companies in meeting local accounting "
"requirements by providing a structured and compliant accounting setup. It "
"contains the following core components:"
msgstr ""
"La localización de Uzbekistán ayuda a las empresas a cumplir con los "
"requisitos contables locales al proporcionar una configuración contable "
"estructurada y conforme. Contiene los siguientes componentes principales:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:38
msgid ""
":ref:`Taxes <localizations/uz/taxes>`: preconfigured tax rates, including "
"standard 12% VAT, zero-rated export, and exempt options"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Impuestos <localizations/uz/taxes>`: tasas de impuestos "
"preconfiguradas, incluido el IVA estándar del 12%, exportaciones con tasa "
"cero y opciones exentas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:40
msgid ""
":ref:`Chart of accounts <localizations/uz/coa>`: preconfigured structure "
"aligned with Uzbek standards"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Plan de cuentas <localizations/uz/coa>`: estructura preconfigurada "
"alineada con los estándares uzbekos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:42
msgid ""
":ref:`Financial reports <localizations/uz/taxes>`: |IFRS|-style balance "
"sheet and profit and loss reports with a tag-based linking of accounts to "
"report lines"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Reportes financieros <localizations/uz/taxes>`: balance general y "
"reportes de pérdidas y ganancias estilo |IFRS| con vinculación basada en "
"etiquetas de cuentas a líneas de reporte"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:50
msgid "The Uzbek localization includes preconfigured sales and purchase taxes:"
msgstr ""
"La localización uzbeka incluye impuestos de compra y venta preconfigurados:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:52
msgid ""
"**Standard VAT (12%):** This standard VAT is applied to most goods and "
"services. The supplier charges 12% VAT on the sale (VAT output) and is "
"generally entitled to deduct the VAT paid on business purchases (VAT input)."
msgstr ""
"**IVA estándar (12%):** este IVA estándar se aplica a la mayoría de bienes y "
"servicios. El proveedor cobra un 12% de IVA en la venta (IVA repercutido) y "
"generalmente tiene derecho a deducir el IVA pagado en las compras "
"comerciales (IVA soportado)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:57
msgid ""
"Most commercial sales and general supply of goods and services within "
"Uzbekistan use the **Standard VAT (12%)** tax."
msgstr ""
"La mayoría de las ventas comerciales y el suministro general de bienes y "
"servicios dentro de Uzbekistán utilizan el impuesto de **IVA estándar "
"(12%)**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:60
msgid ""
"**Export VAT (0%):** The export tax is applied on taxable supplies where the "
"VAT rate applied is 0%. The supplier does not charge VAT on the sale."
msgstr ""
"**IVA de exportación (0%):** El impuesto de exportación se aplica a "
"suministros gravables donde la tasa de IVA aplicada es del 0%. El proveedor "
"no cobra IVA en la venta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:64
msgid ""
"Exports of goods and services to customers outside Uzbekistan use the "
"**Export VAT (0%)** tax."
msgstr ""
"Las exportaciones de bienes y servicios a clientes fuera de Uzbekistán usan "
"el impuesto **IVA de exportación (0%)**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:66
msgid ""
"**Exempt transactions (0%):** The exempt tax applies to transactions that "
"fall outside the scope of VAT and are not subject to tax."
msgstr ""
"**Transacciones exentas (0%):** El impuesto exento se aplica a transacciones "
"que quedan fuera del alcance del IVA y no están sujetas a impuestos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:70
msgid ""
"Transactions that are legally exempt from VAT under local regulations, such "
"as essential food products (meat, fish, potatoes, rice), pharmaceuticals, "
"and financial/insurance services, use the **Exempt transactions (0%)** tax."
msgstr ""
"Las transacciones que están legalmente exentas de IVA bajo las regulaciones "
"locales, como productos alimenticios esenciales (carne, pescado, papas, "
"arroz), productos farmacéuticos y servicios financieros/de seguros, usan el "
"impuesto **Transacciones exentas (0%)**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:79
msgid ""
"The Uzbek :doc:`chart of accounts <../accounting/get_started/"
"chart_of_accounts>` is preconfigured according to Uzbek accounting standards "
"and requirements. When :ref:`creating new accounts <chart-of-account/"
"create>`, it is important to use :ref:`account tags <localizations/uz/tags>`."
msgstr ""
"El :doc:`plan de cuentas <../accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts>` "
"uzbeko está preconfigurado según los estándares y requisitos contables "
"uzbekos. Al :ref:`crear nuevas cuentas <chart-of-account/create>`, es "
"importante usar :ref:`etiquetas de cuentas <localizations/uz/tags>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:86
msgid "Account tags"
msgstr "Etiquetas de cuentas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:88
msgid ""
"The Uzbek localization uses account tags to determine where accounts appear "
"in :ref:`financial reports <localizations/uz/financial-reports>`. Each tag "
"links the account to a specific report line."
msgstr ""
"La localización de Uzbekistán usa etiquetas de cuenta para determinar dónde "
"aparecen las cuentas en los :ref:`reportes financieros <localizations/uz/"
"financial-reports>`. Cada etiqueta vincula la cuenta con una línea "
"específica del reporte."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:92
msgid ""
"Accounts that use the tag :guilabel:`BS Line 0120: Right-of-Use Assets` "
"appear on the balance sheet on the :guilabel:`[0120] - Right-of-Use Assets` "
"line."
msgstr ""
"Las cuentas que usan la etiqueta :guilabel:`BS Line 0120: Right-of-Use "
"Assets` aparecen en el balance general en la línea :guilabel:`[0120] - Right-"
"of-Use Assets`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:96
msgid ""
"If no tag is assigned, the account behaves as an off-balance sheet account "
"and does not appear on the balance sheet or the profit and loss statement."
msgstr ""
"Si no se asigna ninguna etiqueta, la cuenta se comporta como una cuenta "
"fuera del balance general y no aparece en el balance general ni en el estado "
"de resultados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uzbekistan.rst:104
msgid ""
"The following reports have been tailored to meet the needs of businesses "
