"`Create an Authorize.net account <https://www.authorize.net/sign-up/"
"pricing>`_ if necessary and `log in to the Authorize.net merchant portal "
"<https://login.authorize.net>`_."
msgstr ""
"`Cree una cuenta de Authorize.net <https://www.authorize.net/sign-up/pricing>"
"`_ si es necesario e `inicie sesión en el portal para comerciantes de "
"Authorize.net <https://login.authorize.net>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/authorize.rst:18
msgid ""
"On the merchant portal homepage, go to :menuselection:`Account --> Account "
"and API Settings`."
msgstr ""
"En la página de inicio del portal para comerciantes, vaya a "
":menuselection:`Cuenta --> Cuenta y configuración de API`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/authorize.rst:19
msgid "Click :guilabel:`API Credentials and Keys`."
msgstr "Haga clic en :guilabel:`Credenciales y claves de API`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/authorize.rst:20
msgid ""
"Copy the :guilabel:`API Login ID` and save it for "
"the :ref:`payment_providers/authorize/odoo-configuration` step."
msgstr ""
"Copie el :guilabel:`ID de inicio de sesión de API` y guárdelo para el paso "
":ref:`payment_providers/authorize/odoo-configuration`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/authorize.rst:22
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Generate new transaction key`, then :guilabel:`Generate new "
"signature key` and save the keys for the :ref:`payment_providers/authorize/"
"odoo-configuration` step."
msgstr ""
"Haga clic en :guilabel:`Generar nueva clave de transacción`, luego en "
":guilabel:`Generar nueva clave de firma` y guarde las claves para el paso "
":ref:`payment_providers/authorize/odoo-configuration`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/authorize.rst:28
msgid "ACH payments (USA only)"
msgstr "Pagos ACH (solo para Estados Unidos)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/authorize.rst:30
msgid ""
":abbr:`ACH (automated clearing house)` is an electronic funds transfer "
"system used between bank accounts in the United States. To enable this "
"payment method for your Authorize.net account, `apply for the eCheck service "
"on Authorize.net <https://support.authorize.net/knowledgebase/"
"Knowledgearticle/?code=KA-04421>`_."
msgstr ""
":abbr:`ACH (cámara de compensación automatizada)` es un sistema electrónico "
"de transferencia de fondos que se utiliza entre cuentas bancarias en los "
"Estados Unidos. Para habilitar este método de pago para su cuenta de "
"Authorize.net, `solicite el servicio eCheck en Authorize.net <https://"
"support.authorize.net/knowledgebase/Knowledgearticle/?code=KA-04421>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/authorize.rst:36
