#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/worldline.rst:5
msgid "Worldline"
msgstr "Worldline"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/worldline.rst:7
msgid ""
"`Worldline <https://worldline.com/>`_ is a France-based company and the "
"world's fourth largest payment provider."
msgstr ""
"`Worldline <https://worldline.com/>`_ es una empresa francesa y el cuarto "
"proveedor de pagos más grande del mundo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/worldline.rst:11
msgid "Settings in Worldline"
msgstr "Configuración en Worldline"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/worldline.rst:16
msgid "Create an API user"
msgstr "Cree un usuario API "

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/worldline.rst:18
msgid ""
"It is recommended to set up an **API user** to create transactions from Odoo "
"to ensure that your Worldline configuration remains safe even if credentials "
"are compromised. Additionally, API users do not require frequent password "
"updates like regular accounts."
msgstr ""
"Le recomendamos que configure un **usuario API** para crear transacciones "
"desde Odoo, esto garantizará que su configuración de Worldline permanezca "
"segura incluso si sus credenciales están comprometidas. Además, no es "
"necesario que los usuarios API actualicen sus contraseñas con tanta "
"frecuencia como las cuentas regulares."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/worldline.rst:22
msgid "To create an **API user**, proceed as follows:"
msgstr "Siga estas instrucciones para crear un **usuario API**:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/worldline.rst:24
msgid ""
"Log into your `Worldline Merchant Portal <https://merchant-portal.worldline-"
"solutions.com/>`_, click the :icon:`fa-th` (:guilabel:`menu`) icon, and "
"select :guilabel:`Back Office`."
msgstr ""
"Inicia sesión en tu `portal de comerciante de Worldline <https://merchant-"
"portal.worldline-solutions.com/>`_, haz clic en el icono :icon:`fa-th` "
"(:guilabel:`menú`) y selecciona :guilabel:`Back Office` (trastienda)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/worldline.rst:26
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Configuration --> Users` and click on :guilabel:`New "
"User`."
msgstr ""
"Vaya a :menuselection:`Configuración --> Usuarios` y haga clic "
"en :guilabel:`Nuevo usuario`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/worldline.rst:27
msgid "Configure the following fields:"
msgstr "Configure los siguientes campos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/worldline.rst:29
msgid ""
"Specify a :guilabel:`UserID`, :guilabel:`User's name`, :guilabel:`E-mail "
"address`, and :guilabel:`Timezone` of your choice."
msgstr ""
"Especifique un :guilabel:`ID de usuario`, :guilabel:`nombre de "
"usuario`, :guilabel:`dirección de correo electrónico` y :guilabel:`zona "
"horaria` de su elección."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/worldline.rst:31
msgid "Set the :guilabel:`Profile` field to :guilabel:`Admin`."
msgstr "El campo :guilabel:`Perfil` debe ser :guilabel:`Admin`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/worldline.rst:32
msgid "Enable :guilabel:`Special user for API`."
msgstr "Seleccione la opción :guilabel:`Usuario especial para API`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/worldline.rst:35
msgid ""
"If you have already set up a user, make sure it is activated without any "
"error."
msgstr ""
"Si ya configuró un usuario, asegúrese de que está activado sin errores."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/worldline.rst:36
msgid ""
"To test the payment flow with Worldline, use their `test environment "
"<https://merchant-portal.preprod.worldline-solutions.com/>`_ together with "
"the :ref:`test mode <payment_providers/test-mode>`."
msgstr ""
"Para probar el proceso de pago con Worldline, usa su `entorno de prueba "
"<https://merchant-portal.preprod.worldline-solutions.com/>`_ junto con "
"el :ref:`módulo de prueba <payment_providers/test-mode>`."

