msgstr "Worldline debe estar configurado para aceptar pagos de Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/worldline.rst:47
msgid ""
"From your merchant portal, go to :menuselection:`Developer --> Payment API` "
"and click on :guilabel:`Generate API key`. Copy the :guilabel:`API key ID` "
"and the :guilabel:`Secret API key` and save them for :ref:`later <wordline/"
"odoo-configuration>`."
msgstr ""
"Desde su merchant portal vaya a :menuselection:`Desarrollador --> API de "
"pagos` y haga clic en :guilabel:`Generar clave API`. Copie el :guilabel:`ID "
"de la clave API` y el :guilabel:`secreto de la clave API`, guárdelos "
"para :ref:`después <wordline/odoo-configuration>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/worldline.rst:50
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Developer --> Webhooks` and click "
"on :guilabel:`Generate webhook keys`. Copy the :guilabel:`Webhook ID` and "
"the associated :guilabel:`Secret webhook key` and save them for :ref:`later "
