#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/xendit.rst:5
msgid "Xendit"
msgstr "Xendit"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/xendit.rst:7
msgid ""
"`Xendit <https://www.xendit.co>`_ is an Indonesian-based payment solution "
"provider that covers several Southeast Asian countries. It allows businesses "
"to accept credit cards as well as several local payment methods."
msgstr ""
"`Xendit <https://www.xendit.co>`_ es un proveedor de soluciones de pago con "
"sede en Indonesia que abarca varios países del sudeste asiático. Este "
"proveedor permite que las empresas acepten tarjetas de crédito, así como "
"otros métodos de pago locales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/xendit.rst:12
msgid ""
"Credit card payments are processed through Odoo, while all other payment "
"methods are handled via Xendit's website."
msgstr ""
"Los pagos con tarjeta de crédito se procesan a través de Odoo, mientras que "
"el resto se gestionan mediante el sitio web de Xendit."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/xendit.rst:14
msgid ""
"Xendit supports card payment tokenization, provided the customer has "
"requested Merchant Initiated Transaction (MIT) from `Xendit Support <https://"
"www.xendit.co/en/contact/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Xendit es compatible con la tokenización de pagos, siempre y cuando el "
"cliente haya pedido una Transacción iniciada por el comerciante (MIT, por "
"sus siglas en inglés) en el `soporte de Xendit <https://www.xendit.co/en/"
"contact/>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/xendit.rst:20
msgid "Configuration on the Xendit Dashboard"
msgstr "Configuración en el tablero de Xendit"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/xendit.rst:22
msgid ""
"`Create a Xendit account <https://dashboard.xendit.co/register/1?"
"referral_code=odooid&countr_code=ID>`_ if necessary and log in to the "
"`Xendit Dashboard <https://dashboard.xendit.co>`_."
msgstr ""
"`Cree una cuenta de Xendit <https://dashboard.xendit.co/register/1?"
"referral_code=odooid&countr_code=ID>`_ en caso de que sea necesario, inicie "
"sesión y vaya al `tablero de Xendit <https://dashboard.xendit.co>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/xendit.rst:25
msgid ""
"Check your account mode in the top left corner of the page. Use "
"the :guilabel:`Test Mode` to try the integration without charging your "
"customers. Switch to :guilabel:`Live Mode` once you are ready to accept "
"payments."
msgstr ""
"Verifique el modo de su cuenta, este se ubica en la esquina superior "
"izquierda de la página. Utilice el :guilabel:`Modo de prueba` para probar la "
"integración sin realizar cobros a sus clientes. Cambie al :guilabel:`Modo en "
"directo` una vez que todo esté listo para aceptar pagos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/xendit.rst:28
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Configuration: Settings` in the left part of the "
"application page. In the :guilabel:`Developers` section, click `API Keys "
"<https://dashboard.xendit.co/settings/developers#api-keys>`_."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Configuración: Ajustes` en la parte izquierda de la "
"página de la aplicación. Haga clic en `Claves API <https://"
"dashboard.xendit.co/settings/developers#api-keys>`_ en la "
"sección :guilabel:`Desarrolladores`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/xendit.rst:31
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Generate Secret Key`. In the popup box, enter "
"any :guilabel:`API key name`, select :guilabel:`Write` for "
"the :guilabel:`Money-in Products` permission and :guilabel:`None` for all "
"other permissions then click :guilabel:`Generate key`."
msgstr ""
"Haga clic en :guilabel:`Generar clave secreta`. En el cuadro emergente "
"escriba cualquier :guilabel:`nombre de clave API`, "
"seleccione :guilabel:`Escribir` en el permiso :guilabel:`Productos de "
"entrada de dinero` y :guilabel:`Ninguno` para todos los demás permisos, haga "
"clic en :guilabel:`Generar clave`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/xendit.rst:34
msgid ""
"Confirm your password to display your API key. Copy or download the key and "
"**save this information securely for later**. This is the only time the API "
"key can be viewed or downloaded."
msgstr ""
"Confirme su contraseña para visualizar su clave API. Copie o descargue la "
"clave y **almacene esta información de forma segura para después**. Esta es "
"la única vez que podrá visualizar o descargar la clave API."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/xendit.rst:37
msgid ""
"Once completed, scroll down the page to the `Webhooks <https://"
"dashboard.xendit.co/settings/developers#webhooks>`_ section to generate the "
"webhook token."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que haya terminado, vaya a la parte inferior de la página y busque "
"la sección `Webhooks <https://dashboard.xendit.co/settings/"
"developers#webhooks>`_ para generar el token del webhook."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/xendit.rst:40
msgid ""
"Under :guilabel:`Webhook verification token`, click :guilabel:`View Webhook "
"Verification Token`, then confirm your password to display the token. Save "
"it for later."
msgstr ""
"En :guilabel:`Token de verificación del webhook`, haga clic "
"en :guilabel:`Ver token de verificación del webhook` y después confirme su "
"contraseña para consultar el token. Guárdelo para usarlo después."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/xendit.rst:42
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Webhook URL` section, configure the webhook fields as "
"described in :ref:`payment_providers/xendit/configure_webhooks` below."
msgstr ""
"En la sección :guilabel:`URL del webhook`, configura los campos de webhook "
"como se describe a continuación en :ref:`payment_providers/xendit/"
"configure_webhooks`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/xendit.rst:44
msgid ""
"To allow recurring payments for credit cards, go "
"to :menuselection:`Configuration: Payment Channels` in the left part of the "
"application page. Then, hover your mouse over the :guilabel:`Visa, "
"Mastercard, JCB, Amex` channel, click :guilabel:`View Details`, and "
"enable :guilabel:`Recurring Payments` by toggling the related switch."
msgstr ""
"Para permitir pagos recurrentes con tarjetas de crédito, vaya "
"a :menuselection:`Configuración: Canales de pago` en la parte izquierda de "
"la página de la aplicación. Después, pase el cursor sobre el "
"canal :guilabel:`Visa, Mastercard, JCB, Amex`, haga clic en :guilabel:`Ver "
"detalles` y habilite la opción :guilabel:`Pagos recurrentes` con el botón "
"correspondiente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/xendit.rst:52
msgid "Webhook configuration"
msgstr "Configuración del webhook"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/xendit.rst:55
msgid ""
"Xendit replaced its previous single, per-event webhook field with separate "
"v3 event groups. If your Xendit account was connected to Odoo before this "
"change, **successful payments and saved cards may no longer update "
"automatically** until the new fields described below are configured."
msgstr ""
"Xendit reemplazó su campo único anterior de webhook por evento con grupos de "
"eventos v3 independientes. Si tu cuenta de Xendit estaba conectada a Odoo "
"antes de este cambio, **es posible que los pagos exitosos y las tarjetas "
"guardadas ya no se actualicen de forma automática** hasta que configures los "
"nuevos campos descritos a continuación."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/xendit.rst:59
msgid ""
"Log in to the `Xendit Dashboard <https://dashboard.xendit.co>`_ and navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Configuration: Settings`."
msgstr ""
"Inicia sesión en el `Tablero de Xendit <https://dashboard.xendit.co>`_ y ve "
"a :menuselection:`Configuración: Ajustes`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/xendit.rst:61
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Developers` section, click `Webhooks <https://"
"dashboard.xendit.co/settings/developers#webhooks>`_."
msgstr ""
"En la sección :guilabel:`Desarrolladores`, haz clic en `Webhooks <https://"
"dashboard.xendit.co/settings/developers#webhooks>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/xendit.rst:63
msgid ""
"Enter your Odoo database's URL, followed by `/payment/xendit/webhook` (e.g., "
"`https://example.odoo.com/payment/xendit/webhook`), in the following fields:"
msgstr ""
"Ingresa la URL de tu base de datos de Odoo, seguida de `/payment/xendit/"
"webhook` (por ejemplo, `https://example.odoo.com/payment/xendit/webhook`), "
"en los siguientes campos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/xendit.rst:66
msgid ":guilabel:`Payment Status`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Estado del pago`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/xendit.rst:67
msgid ":guilabel:`Payment Token Status`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Estado del token de pago`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/xendit.rst:69
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Test and save` next to each of those fields."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Probar y guardar` junto a cada uno de esos campos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/xendit.rst:72
msgid ""
"Both fields must point to the same webhook URL: Odoo uses a single endpoint "
"to process notifications for both token and payment status updates."
msgstr ""
"Ambos campos deben apuntar a la misma URL de webhook: Odoo utiliza un solo "
"punto de conexión para procesar las notificaciones de las actualizaciones de "
"estado tanto del token como del pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/xendit.rst:78
msgid ""
":ref:`Navigate to the payment provider Xendit <payment_providers/add_new>` "
"and change its state to :guilabel:`Enabled`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Vaya al proveedor de pago Xendit <payment_providers/add_new>` y cambie "
"su estado a :guilabel:`Habilitado`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/xendit.rst:80
